�脢id�0240f8f6051c�body�٫金星被浓厚的二氧化碳大气包裹，产生强烈的温室效应，把热量牢牢锁住。其表面温度约465摄氏度，比离太阳更近的水星还要热。��Venus is wrapped in a thick carbon-dioxide atmosphere that produces a runaway greenhouse effect, trapping heat efficiently. Its surface reaches about 465 degrees Celsius, hotter than Mercury even though Mercury is closer to the Sun.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�04a20954e507�body�ي行星状星云是中小质量恒星在红巨星阶段末抛出的外层气壳，被中心白矮星紫外辐射照亮，与行星无关。��A planetary nebula is the outer shell ejected by a low-to-medium mass star at the end of its red-giant phase, lit by the central white dwarf's UV light—despite the name, it has nothing to do with planets.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�04aa3fbcd90a�body�� 木卫二表面覆盖冰壳，其下被潮汐加热维持着全球性的液态咸水海洋，体积可能超过地球海水总和。冰下海洋与岩石海床接触可提供能量与矿物质，而欧罗巴快船等任务正调查其冰壳厚度与喷流，评估生命存在的可能。�NEuropa is sheathed in an ice shell beneath which tidal heating sustains a global salty liquid ocean that may hold more water than all Earth's oceans. The ocean's contact with a rocky seafloor can supply energy and minerals, and missions such as Europa Clipper are investigating ice thickness and plumes to assess the prospect of life.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�05a6e9aa4a8f�body�٘太阳黑子是太阳光球上温度较低、显得较暗的区域，由强磁场抑制对流造成，数量会随约11年的太阳活动周期增减。٤Sunspots are cooler, darker patches on the Sun's surface caused by strong magnetic fields suppressing convection; their number rises and falls on an ~11-year cycle.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�05ba259cb057�body��,按可见物质计算，星系外缘的恒星绕转速度应随距离下降，但薇拉·鲁宾等测得的自转曲线却在外侧保持平坦。这意味着星系被大量看不见的“暗物质”晕所包裹；早在1930年代，兹威基在星系团中也发现了类似的缺失质量迹象。�Based on visible matter alone, outer stars' orbital speeds should drop with distance, yet Vera Rubin's measured rotation curves stay flat far out. This implies galaxies are embedded in unseen “dark matter” halos; Zwicky saw similar missing mass in galaxy clusters back in the 1930s.�ans��src���薇拉·鲁宾、肯特·福特,《Rotation of the Andromeda Nebula from a Spectroscopic Survey of Emission Regions》,The Astrophysical Journal,1970 (DOI: 10.1086/150317)；弗里茨·兹威基（1933，星系团质量缺失）٭Rubin and Ford, 'Rotation of the Andromeda Nebula from a Spectroscopic Survey of Emission Regions', The Astrophysical Journal, 1970, DOI: 10.1086/150317; Fritz Zwicky (1933)��id�0636f649fc64�body��V1908 年 6 月，一颗直径约几十米的小天体在西伯利亚通古斯河上空约 8 公里处空中爆炸，释放能量相当于约千万吨 TNT，摧毁了 2000 多平方公里的森林，但几乎没有留下陨石坑。它说明即使不大的小行星也可能造成区域级破坏，是现代行星防御研究的重要案例。��In June 1908, a small body tens of meters across exploded about 8 km above the Tunguska River in Siberia, releasing energy equivalent to roughly ten megatons of TNT and flattening more than 2,000 square kilometers of forest, with almost no crater left behind. It shows that even modest asteroids can cause regional devastation, and it is a key case for modern planetary defense research.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�08cdaaf0ac16�body�ٜ太阳风是太阳大气持续向外喷射的带电粒子流（质子和电子），速度可达每秒数百公里，会影响地球磁场并产生极光。ٱThe solar wind is a stream of charged particles (protons and electrons) flowing outward from the Sun at hundreds of km/s, influencing Earth's magnetic field and causing auroras.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�0a1725ca1194�body��\伽利略探测器在飞掠木卫二时，测到它产生了一个感应磁场，只有表面下存在导电的咸水层才能解释这种信号。它的冰面上布满纵横交错的裂缝，撞击坑很少，说明表面年轻、有东西在不断重塑。那里的海洋水量可能是地球海洋的两倍，靠木星潮汐加热保持液态。�mThe Galileo spacecraft measured an induced magnetic field around Europa that can only be explained by a conductive salty layer under the surface. Its ice is criss-crossed with fractures and shows few craters, signs of a young, actively resurfaced shell. The ocean below may hold twice as much water as all of Earth's seas, kept liquid by tidal heating from Jupiter.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�0bc3aaff775d�body�ي中子星是已知密度仅次于黑洞的天体，一茶匙中子星物质重达数十亿吨。其表面引力约为地球的千亿倍。ٴNeutron stars are the densest objects known after black holes; a teaspoon of their material weighs billions of tons. Their surface gravity is about a hundred billion times Earth's.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�0e0f8324b2a1�body��x口径（物镜直径）最重要，它决定集光能力和能看清多暗多细的目标，比放大倍数更关键。�sAperture (objective diameter) matters most—it sets light-gathering and detail, more important than magnification.�ans��src��<Terence Dickinson,《NightWatch》第4版,Firefly Books,2006�nT. Dickinson, NightWatch: A Practical Guide to Viewing the Universe, 4th ed., Firefly Books, 2006; Chinese ed.��id�0ed998d3ceee�body��两大主流方法是凌星法与径向速度法。凌星法通过探测行星从恒星前方经过时造成的微弱亮度下降（开普勒望远镜以此发现数千颗）；径向速度法则测量行星引力使恒星产生的周期性微小摆动（多普勒效应）。�-The two leading methods are the transit and radial-velocity methods. The transit method catches the tiny dimming when a planet crosses its star's face (used by Kepler to find thousands); the radial-velocity method measures the small periodic wobble a planet induces in its star via the Doppler effect.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�0ee98dcd1dee�body��M辐射纹是撞击时抛射出的浅色物质，它们在月表呈放射状延伸，可以长达上千公里。较年轻的撞击坑（如第谷坑）辐射纹清晰，而古老的撞击坑辐射纹会因微陨石轰击和太阳风侵蚀而逐渐变暗消失，因此辐射纹的清晰度可以用来判断撞击坑的相对年龄。�NRays are light-colored material excavated and thrown outward during an impact, extending radially for up to thousands of kilometers. Young craters such as Tycho show crisp rays, while rays on old craters fade and disappear under micrometeorite bombardment and solar wind erosion, so ray prominence helps judge a crater's relative age.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�118e37979ceb�body�ٳ根据普朗克卫星的观测，宇宙约68%是暗能量、27%是暗物质，仅约5%是我们熟悉的普通物质。肉眼可见的恒星和星系其实只占极小一部分。��According to the Planck satellite, the universe is about 68 percent dark energy, 27 percent dark matter, and only about 5 percent ordinary matter. The stars and galaxies we see are just a tiny fraction.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�13e9d38c0f22�body��G因为空间本身在膨胀。远处天体发出的光虽然只传播了138亿年，但光经过的空间一直在被拉伸，等光到达我们时，发出光的天体早已被推到更远的地方。把这些最远天体现今的坐标加起来，可观测宇宙的半径约有465亿光年，直径自然超过900亿光年。��Because space itself expands. Light from distant objects has travelled for only 13.8 billion years, but the space it crossed has kept stretching, so by the time it reaches us the source has been carried much farther away. Adding up the present-day coordinates of the farthest visible objects gives an observable radius of about 46.5 billion light-years, hence a diameter well over 90 billion.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�140b01d1e19d�body��0近地小行星的轨道与地球轨道接近，历史上曾有直径数十米的小天体进入大气爆炸，造成地面破坏。国际标准将轨道距离地球小于约 750 万公里且直径大于约 140 米的小行星定为“潜在威胁天体”，需要持续跟踪并精确计算其轨道。�\Near-Earth asteroids travel on orbits close to Earth's, and small bodies tens of meters across have exploded in the atmosphere with ground damage in the past. Asteroids that come within about 7.5 million km of Earth and are larger than about 140 m are classified as Potentially Hazardous Objects and are tracked continuously to refine their orbits.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�148116290752�body��I银河系由银盘、银心（中央核球）、银晕和银冕组成。银盘是薄薄的恒星和气体盘，太阳就位于盘面内离银心约 2.6 万光年的一条旋臂上；中央核球呈棒状结构；银晕是包围银盘、分布着球状星团的稀疏恒星区，其外还有更大范围看不见的暗物质晕。�eThe Milky Way consists of a disk, a central bulge, a halo and a corona. The disk is a thin disk of stars and gas in which the Sun sits on a spiral arm about 26,000 light-years from the center; the bulge is bar-shaped; the halo is a sparse region of stars and globular clusters enveloping the disk, and beyond it lies a far larger invisible dark matter halo.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�14a334bb6efd�body��	视星等描述地球上看到的亮度，绝对星等是天体置于 10 秒差距标准距离时的亮度，反映本征光度。两者通过距离模数（视星等减去绝对星等等于 5 倍对数距离比）联系，距离越远视星等越大（越暗）。��Apparent magnitude is the observed brightness from Earth; absolute magnitude is the brightness at a standard 10 pc distance, reflecting intrinsic luminosity. They connect via the distance modulus m−M=5 log10(d/10 pc); farther objects appear fainter.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�1625e4b6ff78�body�٫宜居带是恒星周围温度适中、允许液态水存在于行星表面的区域，常被称为“金发姑娘区”；液态水被视为生命存在的重要条件。ٶThe habitable zone is the region around a star where temperatures allow liquid water on a planet's surface—the 'Goldilocks zone'—since liquid water is key for life as we know it.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�18aede04ab2e�body��)红巨星是老年恒星，核心虽热，但外层膨胀到极大，表面温度反而降到只有几千摄氏度。恒星表面越冷，黑体辐射的峰值波长越长，偏向光谱的红端，所以它呈现橙红色。按维恩位移定律，颜色其实就是表面温度的直观反映。�kA red giant is an old star whose core is hot but whose envelope has expanded enormously, so its surface temperature actually drops to a few thousand degrees. The cooler a star's surface, the longer the peak wavelength of its blackbody radiation, shifting toward the red end of the spectrum. By Wien's law, colour is really a direct readout of surface temperature.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�19fe1fe406e3�body��1大质量天体（含不可见暗物质晕）的引力会轻微扭曲背景星系的像。通过统计大量星系形状的系统畸变（剪切场），可重建全天暗物质的质量图，而不依赖任何发光物质。暗能量巡天（DES）与 Euclid 卫星均以此绘制宇宙大尺度结构。�XMassive objects, including invisible dark-matter halos, gravitationally distort the images of background galaxies. By statistically measuring systematic shape distortions (shear) across many galaxies, one reconstructs all-sky dark-matter mass maps independent of luminous matter. DES and the Euclid satellite map large-scale structure this way.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�1adb0670b73a�body��h土卫六拥有浓密的大气与低温表面，甲烷在那里像水一样蒸发、凝结并形成降雨，汇入湖泊与河流。卡西尼号探测到液态甲烷湖和季节性云系，显示出一个以甲烷为工作流体的完整水文循环。它与地球水循环机制相同，只是工作物质从水换成了甲烷，温度低了近200开尔文。��Titan has a thick atmosphere and a frigid surface where methane evaporates, condenses into clouds, and falls as rain that feeds lakes and rivers. The Cassini-Huygens mission detected liquid methane lakes and seasonal clouds, revealing a complete hydrological cycle using methane as the working fluid. The mechanism mirrors Earth's water cycle exactly, only with methane instead of water and temperatures nearly 200 kelvin lower.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�1de827f8152e�body��*EHT 用甚长基线干涉技术把分布在全球的八台射电望远镜连成一台相当于地球大小的虚拟望远镜，并在 1.3 毫米波长观测。它记录黑洞周边吸积盘环路的无线电波并合成图像，2019 年首次拍到 M87* 的阴影，2022 年又拍到人马座 A*。�WThe EHT linked eight radio telescopes around the globe with very-long-baseline interferometry into a virtual telescope the size of Earth, observing at a wavelength of 1.3 mm. By recording and combining the radio waves from the ring of accreting material, it produced the first image of the shadow of M87* in 2019 and of Sagittarius A* in 2022.�ans��src��NEvent Horizon Telescope Collaboration 2019, ApJL 875, L1；2022, ApJL 930, L12�OEvent Horizon Telescope Collaboration 2019, ApJL, 875, L1; 2022, ApJL, 930, L12��id�2086af78987a�body���宇宙射线是接近光速的带电粒子，能量最高的“超高能宇宙射线”来源仍不明，可能与活动星系核喷流或星暴星系有关；因带电会被磁场偏转，难以直接回溯其源地。�Cosmic rays are charged particles near light speed; the origin of the most energetic 'ultra-high-energy' ones is unknown, possibly active galactic nucleus jets or starburst galaxies. Because they are charged, magnetic fields deflect them, hiding their source.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�20c69f420f07�body��M卡西尼探测器发现土卫二南极的几条大裂缝会持续喷出水汽和冰粒，形成高达数百公里的喷流。这些喷泉的源头是冰壳下几十公里深处的液态海洋，海洋里的水通过裂缝上涌，在真空环境中沸腾喷发。卡西尼还直接飞过喷流，在里面检测到了有机分子。�yThe Cassini spacecraft found long fissures at Enceladus's south pole continuously venting water vapour and ice grains into tall plumes hundreds of kilometres high. Their source is a liquid ocean tens of kilometres beneath the icy crust; water rises through the fractures and boils out into the vacuum. Cassini even flew through the plumes and detected organic molecules inside.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�21d0d743dc70�body�َ红矮星频繁爆发强烈耀斑和X射线，可能剥离行星大气、破坏表面生命，使处于宜居带的行星实际并不宜居。ٷRed dwarfs frequently erupt with strong flares and X-rays that can strip a planet's atmosphere and damage surface life, making habitable-zone planets there practically less habitable.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�2289a6129306�body��日冕物质抛射是太阳日冕中大量等离子体连同磁场被抛入行星际空间的现象，单次可释放数十亿吨物质并以每秒数百至上千公里速度运动。当抛射方向朝向地球时，可能引发地磁暴，干扰卫星、导航与电网。�mA coronal mass ejection is the expulsion of large amounts of solar coronal plasma together with its magnetic field into interplanetary space, releasing billions of tons of material at speeds from hundreds to over a thousand kilometers per second. When directed toward Earth, a CME can trigger geomagnetic storms that disrupt satellites, navigation, and power grids.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�23113b896d13�body��?火星土壤富含氧化铁（铁锈），使表面呈红色。�0Iron-oxide dust gives the surface its red color.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�2359c5599e2d�body��地球和火星绕太阳公转速度不同，二者相对位置不断变化。只有当地球追上并大致与火星成特定角度时，用最省燃料的转移轨道才能高效抵达，这种最佳几何配置约每26个月出现一次。错过就要再等两年多。�Earth and Mars orbit at different speeds, so their relative positions keep changing. Only when Earth catches up and aligns at a specific angle can a fuel-efficient transfer orbit reach Mars, and this favorable geometry recurs about every 26 months. Miss it and you wait over two years.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�2499f7785e21�body��&类星体是极其明亮的活跃星系核，中心是正在大量吸积物质的超大质量黑洞，吸积盘因摩擦升温到数百万开尔文而发出横跨电磁波段的光。它们在很远的距离仍能被观测到，因此是研究早期宇宙星系与黑洞共同演化的灯塔。�nA quasar is an extremely luminous active galactic nucleus powered by a supermassive black hole rapidly accreting matter; the accretion disk heats by friction to millions of kelvin and shines across the electromagnetic spectrum. Visible even at great distances, quasars serve as beacons for studying the co-evolution of galaxies and black holes in the early Universe.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�25c03186ec21�body��FGW170817 是 2017 年首次被探测到的双中子星并合事件，LIGO/Virgo 先捕捉到引力波，随后全球望远镜在电磁波段找到了对应的短伽马射线暴和千新星。它首次实现了引力波与电磁辐射的联合观测，并证实了重元素（如金、铂）可由 r-过程在并合中合成。��GW170817 was the first detected merger of two neutron stars, recorded in 2017 when LIGO/Virgo captured the gravitational waves and telescopes worldwide then found the matching short gamma-ray burst and kilonova in light. It achieved the first joint gravitational-wave and electromagnetic observation and confirmed that heavy elements such as gold and platinum are forged by the r-process during such mergers.�ans��src��Abbott et al.《Multi-messenger Observations of a Binary Neutron Star Merger》(ApJL 848, L12, 2017);LIGO-Virgo 科学合作组نAbbott et al., Multi-messenger Observations of a Binary Neutron Star Merger (ApJL 848, L12, 2017); LIGO-Virgo Scientific Collaboration��id�26e8697c110d�body�ٟ元代通过西域学者传入阿拉伯的历法、星表（如《万年历》）和仪器，郭守敬的授时历也吸收了其中的数学与测算方法。ٴIn the Yuan dynasty, Persian and Arabic calendars, star catalogs and instruments arrived via scholars from the West, and Guo Shoujing's work absorbed their mathematics and methods.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�2964989f72bf�body��M卡西尼号飞越土卫二南极的羽流时，探测到含盐的冰粒和简单有机物，说明物质来自与岩石接触的液态水体。羽流由卫星内部潮汐加热维持，喷口下的冰壳之下被认为存在一个全球性咸水海洋。这一组合使土卫二成为搜寻地外生命最有潜力的目标之一。��When Cassini flew through Enceladus's south-polar plumes, it found salty ice grains and simple organic molecules, indicating material from a liquid reservoir in contact with rock. Tidal heating within the moon sustains the plumes, and a global salty ocean is thought to lie beneath the icy shell. That combination makes Enceladus one of the most promising places to search for extraterrestrial life.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�2a6ce187f74b�body��{在强引力下时间显著变慢，从远处看落入者会越走越慢、红光渐暗，这被称为引力时间膨胀。ِUnder strong gravity time slows markedly; to a distant viewer a falling object appears to slow and redden—this is gravitational time dilation.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�2ab314e28b84�body�ٰNIRSpec在近红外做高分辨率光谱，分解星系与系外大气谱线；MIRI覆盖中红外，能穿透尘埃看恒星形成与暖尘，二者是韦布科学的核心。��NIRSpec takes high-resolution near-infrared spectra, resolving galaxy and exoplanet atmospheric lines; MIRI covers mid-infrared, seeing through dust to star formation and warm dust—both are central to Webb's science.�ans��src��vGardner J. P. et al., The James Webb Space Telescope, Space Science Reviews 123 (2006), DOI: 10.1007/s11214-006-8315-7�vGardner J. P. et al., The James Webb Space Telescope, Space Science Reviews 123 (2006), DOI: 10.1007/s11214-006-8315-7��id�2b5d21730991�body�٦棕矮星质量介于行星和恒星之间（约13到80倍木星质量），核心温度不够高，无法持续进行氢核聚变，因此被称为失败的恒星。٩A brown dwarf has a mass between a planet and a star (about 13–80 Jupiter masses) and its core is too cool to sustain hydrogen fusion, earning it the name failed star.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�2ca21ad2a9ae�body�ه旋涡星系拥有扁平的盘状结构和旋臂，恒星与气体沿旋臂集中，银河系和仙女座星系都属于旋涡星系。�sA spiral galaxy has a flat disk with arms where stars and gas concentrate; the Milky Way and Andromeda are spirals.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�2e0891e753d7�body��当恒星过于靠近中心黑洞、被潮汐力撕碎时，约一半物质被抛射、另一半吸积并发出明亮的 X 射线与紫外耀发。TDE 的光变与谱线特征可用来估计黑洞质量与自旋，是探测宁静星系中心黑洞的探针。�When a star passes too close to a central black hole, tidal forces tear it apart; about half is ejected and half accretes, flaring brightly in X-ray and UV. TDE light curves and spectra estimate black-hole mass and spin, probing dormant central black holes.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�2e6639461734�body��9耶泽罗是约 38 亿年前的一个湖泊遗址，具备河流入湖的三角洲沉积。毅力号确认了这里的古三角洲和湖底碳酸盐岩，并在岩石中采集了多份样品管，计划由后续任务送回地球分析。这些样品可能保存着火星早期环境甚至生命活动的痕迹。�KJezero is the site of a lake that existed some 3.8 billion years ago, with a river delta feeding into it. Perseverance has confirmed the ancient delta and lakebed carbonates there, and has sealed rock samples in tubes for a future mission to return to Earth. Those samples may preserve traces of early Martian environments or life.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�2eca99d13bd2�body�ٵTRAPPIST-1是一颗约40光年外的超冷红矮星，周围有7颗地球大小的岩质行星，其中几颗位于宜居带。它是研究系外岩石行星大气的重点目标。ٿTRAPPIST-1 is an ultracool red dwarf about 40 light-years away with seven Earth-sized rocky planets, several in the habitable zone. It is a prime target for studying exoplanetary atmospheres.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�2f68845be74d�body�ٍ是的。观测显示星系彼此远离，且距离越远的星系退行越快，说明宇宙至今仍在膨胀，并且膨胀还在加速。ٔYes. Galaxies recede from each other, faster the farther away they are, showing the universe is still expanding—and the expansion is accelerating.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�30cc6bf261e2�body�ٴ金星表面被浓厚的二氧化碳大气和硫酸云包裹，强烈的温室效应把热量牢牢锁住，使其表面温度高达约465℃，比离太阳更近的水星还热。��Venus is wrapped in a thick CO₂ atmosphere and sulfuric clouds; a runaway greenhouse effect traps heat, pushing its surface to about 465°C—hotter than Mercury, which is closer to the Sun.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�324cdc26e433�body�ٟ奥尔特云是理论上包裹太阳系外围的球状云团，距太阳大约从几千到十万个天文单位。它被认为是长周期彗星的来源地。��The Oort Cloud is a hypothetical spherical shell of icy bodies thought to surround the solar system at distances from a few thousand to about 100,000 astronomical units. It is believed to be the source of long-period comets.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�32a4b940c594�body�٤羲和号从特殊轨道观测太阳大气的磁场与速度，夸父号巡测太阳爆发和日地空间天气，二者共同守护地球的'空间环境'安全。ٵXihe observes solar atmospheric magnetic fields and flows from a special orbit, while Kuafu monitors solar eruptions and space weather—together guarding Earth's space environment.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�335d909d21f3�body��9银河系中心的黑洞叫人马座A*，质量约为太阳的400万倍。虽然这么重，它的直径却只有大约2400万公里，比水星到太阳的距离还小，在宇宙尺度上算是一颗小而密的天体。2022年，事件视界望远镜拍到了它周围发光气体形成的甜甜圈状影像。�DThe Milky Way's central black hole is Sagittarius A*, with a mass of about four million Suns. Heavy as that is, its diameter is only about 24 million kilometres, smaller than Mercury's orbit, making it small and dense on cosmic scales. In 2022 the Event Horizon Telescope imaged the doughnut-like glow of gas surrounding it.�ans��src��9EHT 合作组（M87 与银心成像论文，ApJ 专刊）�XEvent Horizon Telescope Collaboration (M87 and Sgr A* imaging papers, ApJ special issue)��id�34ce0841ffdf�body�ف太阳系位于银河系的一条旋臂（本地臂）上，距银心约2.7万光年。它绕银心公转一周约需2.3亿年。ٱThe solar system lies in a spiral arm of the Milky Way called the Local Arm, about 27,000 light-years from the galactic center. It takes roughly 230 million years to orbit once.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�3563a268bb50�body��!高能伽马光子进入大气后产生相对论性级联簇射，速度超过空气中光速，发射出短暂蓝色的切伦科夫光。地面大口径望远镜通过成像这些微弱蓝光闪烁，重建原伽马光子的能量与入射方向，覆盖从数十 GeV 到 TeV 的能段。�High-energy gamma photons create relativistic air showers that move faster than light in air, emitting brief blue Cherenkov light. Ground-based large telescopes image these faint flashes to reconstruct the primary gamma's energy and direction, covering tens of GeV to TeV.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�374df7d9f415�body��钱德拉是高分辨率X射线空间望远镜，专门观测宇宙中极高温、高能的过程，如黑洞吸积、星系团热气体和超新星遗迹。X射线被大气吸收，只能在太空中观测。它揭示了暗物质分布与黑洞周围极端环境的细节。�OChandra is a high-resolution X-ray space telescope observing extremely hot, high-energy processes such as black hole accretion, hot cluster gas, and supernova remnants. X-rays are absorbed by the atmosphere, so they must be observed from space. It revealed details of dark matter distribution and extreme environments near black holes.�ans��src��oChandrasekhar《An Introduction to the Study of Stellar Structure》（1939）；NASA 钱德拉X射线天文台�gChandrasekhar, An Introduction to the Study of Stellar Structure (1939); NASA Chandra X-ray Observatory��id�3792ea158586�body���单级火箭要带着全部燃料和空壳飞完全程，质量太大难以达到轨道速度。多级火箭在每层燃料烧完后抛掉空壳，减轻后续质量，让剩余发动机更高效加速，这种丢包袱的策略是实现入轨的关键。�>A single-stage rocket must carry all its fuel and empty tanks the whole way, making it too massive to reach orbital speed. A multi-stage rocket drops the empty shells after each stage burns out, lightening what remains so the surviving engines accelerate more efficiently — this staging is the key to reaching orbit.�ans��src��FSutton & Biblarz《火箭推进基础》（第 8 版，2010，Wiley）�CSutton & Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements (8th ed., Wiley, 2010)��id�38b2ab909d62�body��落向致密天体（黑洞、中子星）的物质在吸积盘内因粘滞摩擦逐级释放引力势能，被加热到数百万开尔文，主要发出 X 射线与紫外辐射。因此吸积盘通常呈高温蓝色或紫外色，而非以可见光为主。�Matter spiraling into a compact object releases gravitational potential energy through viscous friction in the disk and is heated to millions of kelvin, emitting mainly X-rays and ultraviolet light. Accretion disks are therefore typically hot and blue/UV rather than visibly dominated.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�3a9f049a52be�body��#生物标志物指可能由生命活动产生并可在大气光谱中检测的化学物种，例如氧气、臭氧与甲烷的非平衡共存。二氧化碳、水蒸气和氮气等也构成宜居背景。单一气体并不充分，需多种气体的化学不平衡组合来提高可信度。�KBiosignatures are chemical species that life might produce and that can be detected in atmospheric spectra, such as a non-equilibrium coexistence of oxygen, ozone, and methane. Carbon dioxide, water vapor, and nitrogen form the habitable background. No single gas suffices; a chemically imbalanced combination strengthens the case.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�3be33c2175c1�body���鲍里索夫是典型的星际彗星，有明显的彗发和气体活动，成分类似太阳系彗星；它证明星际空间中存在活跃天体，而奥陌陌更像无气体的岩石碎块。��Borisov was a typical interstellar comet with a clear coma and gas activity, much like Solar System comets; it proved active objects roam interstellar space, whereas Oumuamua looked like a gas-free rock.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�3db15586de9f�body�٥地球对月球的引力在月球上产生潮汐隆起，长期的潮汐摩擦使其自转周期与公转周期同步，于是月球始终以同一面朝向我们。٥Earth's gravity raises tidal bulges on the Moon, and long-term tidal friction synchronized its spin with its orbit, so the Moon always keeps the same face toward us.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�3ebb05adc912�body�ٜ陨石主要分为石陨石、铁陨石和石铁陨石。石陨石最常见，铁陨石来自小行星的金属核心，石铁陨石则介于两者之间。ٽMeteorites are mainly divided into stony, iron, and stony-iron types. Stony meteorites are the most common, iron ones come from the metal cores of asteroids, and stony-irons lie in between.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�3f1baea58745�body���LIGO 于2015年9月首次直接探测到引力波（事件 GW150914），信号来自约13亿光年外两个约30倍太阳质量的黑洞并合。这一发现证实了爱因斯坦的预言，并开启了“引力波天文学”这一全新观测窗口。�In September 2015 LIGO made the first direct detection of gravitational waves (event GW150914), from the merger of two ~30-solar-mass black holes about 1.3 billion light-years away. It confirmed Einstein's prediction and opened the new window of gravitational-wave astronomy.�ans��src��6LIGO 科学合作组（2015，GW150914 首次探测）�.LIGO Scientific Collaboration (2015, GW150914)��id�3f2e4ca66fae�body���木卫一受到木星强大的引力牵引，并与木卫二、木卫三形成轨道共振（拉普拉斯共振），持续的潮汐挤压使其内部反复摩擦生热。这种潮汐加热融化了内部岩石，造就了遍布全球的活火山。��Io is squeezed by Jupiter's strong gravity and locked in an orbital resonance with Europa and Ganymede (the Laplace resonance). The constant tidal flexing heats its interior through friction, melting rock and driving widespread active volcanism.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�4392220b3aca�body��0水星绕太阳公转一圈约88个地球日，而它自转很慢，一个太阳日（从日出到下一次日出）约176个地球日。这是因为水星自转周期约59天，加上公转造成的视角变化叠加，使太阳日拉长到一年的两倍。所以它上面一天确实比一年还长。�/Mercury orbits the Sun in about 88 Earth days, but it spins slowly, so one solar day (sunrise to sunrise) lasts about 176 Earth days. Its rotation period is about 59 days, and the motion around the Sun stretches the apparent solar day to twice the year. So on Mercury a day really is longer than a year.�ans��src��gPettengill 与 Dyce 1965 年《自然》雷达测得水星3:2自转-公转共振；NASA 水星数据表�qPettengill & Dyce (1965, Nature) radar detection of Mercury's 3:2 spin–orbit resonance; NASA Mercury Fact Sheet��id�45191498d403�body��Ia型超新星来自白矮星达到钱德拉塞卡极限后的热核爆发，其峰值光度由相同物理过程决定，因此本征亮度非常一致。菲利普斯关系进一步用光变曲线的衰减速率修正峰值亮度，使测距精度达到约百分之几。这让天文学家能够把它们的观测亮度转化为可靠的距离，并由此发现宇宙加速膨胀。��Type Ia supernovae arise from the thermonuclear disruption of a white dwarf near the Chandrasekhar limit, so their peak luminosity is set by a uniform physical process and is intrinsically consistent. The Phillips relation refines the peak brightness using the decline rate of the light curve, improving distance precision to a few percent. Astronomers convert their observed brightness into reliable distances, which is how the accelerating expansion was discovered.�ans��src��lPhillips《The absolute magnitudes of Type Ia supernovae》（1993，ApJ）；NASA/ESA 哈勃空间望远镜�dPhillips, The absolute magnitudes of Type Ia supernovae (1993, ApJ); NASA/ESA Hubble Space Telescope��id�46053252c2a9�body�ٍ星暴星系在极短时间内以远高于正常的速度制造恒星，常由星系并合触发，这种爆发通常只能维持几亿年。ٮA starburst galaxy forms stars at a far higher rate than usual over a short span, often triggered by mergers, and such bursts typically last only a few hundred million years.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�48702623eb9c�body�ٯ微重力导致骨钙流失、肌肉萎缩、体液上移和视力变化；长期月球（0.17g）或火星（0.38g）任务需要锻炼设备和人工重力等对抗措施。��Microgravity causes bone-calcium loss, muscle atrophy, fluid shifts upward and vision changes; long lunar (0.17g) or Mars (0.38g) missions need exercise gear and maybe artificial gravity to counter this.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�48a57415124c�body�ٹ塞德娜拥有异常遥远、近日点极高的轨道（约76天文单位起），无法由海王星解释，可能受经过的恒星或行星九扰动，是内奥尔特云的证据。��Sedna has an extremely distant orbit with a very high perihelion (~76 AU), unexplained by Neptune; it may have been perturbed by a passing star or Planet Nine, evidence for an inner Oort Cloud.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�4910e9970906�body��YIceCube 建在南极冰盖之下，利用一立方千米的纯净冰体作为探测介质，当高能中微子与冰中原子核作用产生缪子时，会在冰中留下蓝色切伦科夫光，被光纤传感器阵列记录。它已探测到来自深空弥漫的天体中微子流，并把一颗高能中微子追溯到耀变体 TXS 0506+056。��IceCube is buried beneath the Antarctic ice sheet and uses a cubic kilometer of pure ice as detector medium; when a high-energy neutrino interacts with a nucleus to produce a muon, the muon emits blue Cherenkov light recorded by an array of optical sensors. It has detected a diffuse flux of astrophysical neutrinos and traced one high-energy neutrino back to the blazar TXS 0506+056.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�49ea25da843e�body�ٰ韦布在JADES等巡天中发现红移z大于10、甚至z大于14的明亮星系，其数量与质量比现有宇宙学模型预期更多，挑战了早期星系形成理论。��In surveys like JADES, Webb found bright galaxies at redshifts z>10 and even z>14, more numerous and massive than current cosmological models predict, challenging theories of early galaxy formation.�ans��src�٦Matthee,《JWST provides a new view of cosmic dawn: latest developments in studies of early galaxies》,Contemporary Physics,2025 (DOI: 10.1080/00107514.2025.2586370)٤Matthee, 'JWST provides a new view of cosmic dawn: latest developments in studies of early galaxies', Contemporary Physics, 2025, DOI: 10.1080/00107514.2025.2586370��id�4adb791788a9�body�١韦布在JADES巡天中认证了红移达z约14的星系（如JADES-GS-z14-0），对应宇宙仅约3亿岁时，是目前已知最古老的星系候选之一。ٴIn JADES, Webb certified galaxies at redshift z≈14 (e.g. JADES-GS-z14-0), when the Universe was only about 300 million years old—among the most ancient galaxy candidates known.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�4b406edc1146�body��x去远离城镇、海拔较高、天气干燥的地方，避开月亮和灯光，银河的尘埃带才会清晰可见。�qGo far from towns, to higher, dry places, away from moon and lights, and the Milky Way's dust lane becomes clear.�ans��src��<Terence Dickinson,《NightWatch》第4版,Firefly Books,2006�nT. Dickinson, NightWatch: A Practical Guide to Viewing the Universe, 4th ed., Firefly Books, 2006; Chinese ed.��id�4c034e0eb068�body��5要在近地轨道不掉下来，卫星必须让地球引力刚好充当向心力。令万有引力等于质量乘向心加速度，解出的速度约为每秒7.9公里，也就是贴着地面做圆形轨道的最低速度。低于这个速度，卫星会落回地面；高于它，轨道就会变成椭圆。�qTo stay in a low orbit without falling, a satellite must have Earth's gravity act exactly as the centripetal force. Equating gravity with mass times centripetal acceleration gives about 7.9 kilometres per second, the minimum speed for a circular orbit skimming the surface. Slower than that, the satellite falls back to the ground; faster, its orbit becomes an ellipse.�ans��src��0《天文学概论》（航天与轨道力学）�@An Introduction to Astronomy (spaceflight and orbital mechanics)��id�4d1526405546�body��P超级地球指质量约为地球1到10倍的系外岩石行星，太阳系里没有这一档，介于地球和天王星、海王星之间。它们有的可能是岩石世界，有的表面覆盖着深达几十公里的海洋，有的干脆是裹着厚厚氢氦的小型海王星。观测显示这类行星在银河系里相当常见。�tA super-Earth is a rocky exoplanet with roughly one to ten times Earth's mass, a class missing from our Solar System and sitting between Earth and Uranus or Neptune. Some may be rocky worlds, some may wear oceans tens of kilometres deep, and some turn out to be mini-Neptunes with thick hydrogen and helium envelopes. Observations show they are quite common in the galaxy.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�4db5be10a9d2�body�ٶ各地历法依据不同：公历以1月1日、农历以立春附近的正月初一、伊斯兰历随月相游移、伊朗以春分——新年日期反映了各自的历法逻辑。٥Calendars differ: Gregorian Jan 1, Chinese New Year near spring's start, Islamic by the moon, Iranian at the equinox—each New Year reflects its own calendar logic.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�4e5b4676ee8a�body�ٟ星系在引力下相撞并合，能触发猛烈恒星形成、重塑结构，并让中心黑洞共同增长，银河系未来就将与仙女座星系并合。ٵGalaxies collide and merge under gravity, triggering bursts of star formation, reshaping structure, and growing central black holes; the Milky Way will one day merge with Andromeda.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�50f66aa52a8e�body�٫偏振测量分析光波振动方向的偏好，可揭示尘埃排列、磁场方向与散射机制，用于研究恒星形成区、活动星系核喷流与系外大气。��Polarimetry analyzes the preferred direction of light's vibration, revealing dust alignment, magnetic-field direction and scattering; it is used for star-forming regions, AGN jets and exoplanet atmospheres.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�517c58f74678�body�ٍ木星、土星大气按温度和凝结高度分带，氨云在最上、硫化和铵云在下，强纬向急流形成可见条纹与风暴。��Jupiter and Saturn atmospheres are banded by temperature and condensation height, with ammonia clouds on top and ammonium-hydrogen-sulfide clouds below; strong zonal jets form visible stripes and storms.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�51ee3f9644dd�body�� 磁暴期间高能粒子会穿透卫星，造成单粒子翻转等故障，浓密大气加热上升还会增加卫星轨道阻力，使卫星轨道加速衰减。同时地磁感应电流会流入长距离输电线路，可能使变压器过热损坏，历史上曾造成大规模停电。�]During magnetic storms, energetic particles can strike satellites, causing faults such as single-event upsets, while the heated, denser upper atmosphere increases drag and speeds orbital decay. Meanwhile, geomagnetically induced currents flow through long transmission lines and can overheat transformers, historically causing large-scale blackouts.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�52a8a3efd50e�body��*比邻星b是距我们最近的岩质系外行星，位于红矮星宜居带内，但恒星频繁的耀斑可能剥离其大气。若保有大气，成分可能受强烈紫外辐射改造，并以二氧化碳或氮为主。其真实大气状况仍是未解之谜，需未来望远镜直接探测。�=Proxima Centauri b is the nearest rocky exoplanet, in the habitable zone of a red dwarf, but frequent stellar flares may strip its atmosphere. If retained, it could be dominated by carbon dioxide or nitrogen, altered by intense UV radiation. Its actual atmosphere remains unknown, awaiting future direct observations.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�534009849ead�body��LHB 假说认为约 41–38 亿年前，巨行星轨道不稳（尼斯模型）导致大量小行星与彗星被抛向内太阳系，在月球与类地行星表面留下密集撞击坑。月球高地撞击坑密度是其主要证据，但具体是否集中爆发仍有争议。�*The LHB hypothesis holds that ~4.1–3.8 Gyr ago, giant-planet orbital instability (Nice model) scattered asteroids and comets inward, battering the Moon and terrestrial planets with impact craters. Lunar highland crater density is key evidence, though whether it was a sharp spike remains debated.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�53988854431d�body��D由中子简并压支撑的中子星存在最大质量，约在太阳质量的2.2至2.3倍（托尔曼-奥本海默-沃尔科夫极限）。超过这一极限，简并压无法抵抗引力，天体便会坍缩成黑洞。因此致密天体在约2.5至5太阳质量区间形成了一个观测上稀少的“质量鸿沟”。�<Neutron stars, supported by neutron degeneracy pressure, have a maximum mass near 2.2 to 2.3 solar masses, the Tolman-Oppenheimer-Volkoff limit. Beyond it, degeneracy pressure fails and the object collapses into a black hole. This leaves an observed paucity of compact objects in the roughly 2.5 to 5 solar-mass gap.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�53f85091f8b3�body��q旅行者号1977年发射，利用行星引力弹弓一次次加速：旅行者2号依次掠过木星、土星、天王星和海王星，完成了著名的行星大巡游。靠这种借力，探测器不需要携带大量燃料就获得了足够的逃逸速度。旅行者1号2012年、旅行者2号2018年先后穿过日球层顶，如今都运行在星际空间里。�vLaunched in 1977, the Voyagers repeatedly gained speed through planetary gravity assists: Voyager 2 swung past Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, and Neptune in the famous grand tour. With this borrowed momentum the probes reached escape speed without hauling huge fuel tanks. Voyager 1 crossed the heliopause in 2012 and Voyager 2 in 2018, and both now operate in interstellar space.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�541ec5cf478a�body��)矮星系是数量最多、质量最小的星系，常作为大星系的“积木”通过并合促成星系成长。它们还保留着早期宇宙的化学与恒星形成记录，是研究星系形成的重要样本。许多矮星系被暗物质晕主导，是研究暗物质的天然实验室。�VDwarf galaxies are the most numerous and least massive systems, often acting as building blocks whose mergers grow larger galaxies. They also preserve records of early-universe chemistry and star formation, making them key samples for studying galaxy formation. Many are dark-matter-dominated, serving as natural laboratories for dark matter.�ans��src��v论文 Star-Formation Histories, Abundances, and Kinematics of Dwarf Galaxies in the Local Group,Tolstoy等,ARA&A,2009ٮTolstoy E., Hill V. & Simon J.D., Star-Formation Histories, Abundances, and Kinematics of Dwarf Galaxies in the Local Group, Annual Review of Astronomy and Astrophysics, 2009��id�54445e29858c�body�ٱ节气按太阳在黄道的位置（阳历性质）而定，所以公历日期稳定；春节按朔望月（阴历）定，农历置闰使它在1月21日至2月20日间游移。ٽSolar terms follow the Sun's position (solar-based), so they're stable on the Gregorian calendar; the New Year follows lunar months, drifting between Jan 21 and Feb 20 due to intercalation.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�57728118b36a�body��31929年哈勃测得星系退行速度与距离成正比，说明宇宙并非静态而是在膨胀。这一关系首次给出了星系距离的系统化标尺，把宇宙从恒定的背景变成演化的整体。它为日后大爆炸理论的确立铺平了道路，也暗示宇宙有一个有限的起点。�UIn 1929 Hubble found that galaxies recede proportionally to their distance, showing the universe is not static but expanding. The relation gave astronomers a systematic yardstick for galactic distances and turned the cosmos from a fixed backdrop into an evolving whole. It paved the way for the Big Bang model and implied a finite beginning.�ans��src��iHubble《A relation between distance and radial velocity》（1929，PNAS）；NASA 哈勃空间望远镜�aHubble, A relation between distance and radial velocity (1929, PNAS); NASA Hubble Space Telescope��id�577f8df3961b�body�٥同一半径的行星质量可差很多：岩石行星密度高、蓬松的含大量气体；这条关系帮我们区分超级地球与水世界、迷你海王星。ٳPlanets of the same radius can differ greatly in mass: rocky ones are dense, puffy ones hold lots of gas; this relation separates super-Earths from water worlds and mini-Neptunes.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�57bfb01796c4�body���高山空气稀薄、水汽少、大气稳定，能减少光线的吸收和湍流抖动，获得更清晰的观测条件。例如夏威夷的莫纳克亚和智利的阿塔卡马都是世界级台址。��High mountains offer thin, dry, stable air that reduces absorption and turbulent blur, giving clearer views. Sites like Mauna Kea in Hawaii and Atacama in Chile are world-class observatory locations.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�58ea2f7a5cf8�body�ٷ日全食时月球恰好遮住明亮的太阳光球层，相比之下暗弱的日冕才得以显现。日冕是太阳最外层的高温稀薄大气，温度可达上百万开尔文。��During a total eclipse the Moon blocks the bright solar photosphere, allowing the faint corona to become visible. The corona is the Sun's outermost, hot and tenuous atmosphere, reaching temperatures of over a million kelvin.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�5afa8a9f1efb�body��太阳持续发出带电粒子流——太阳风，速度可达每秒数百公里。地球磁场在空间中形成磁层，像屏障一样把大部分太阳风偏转开，太阳风在磁层外侧形成弓形激波，磁场还把一部分带电粒子捕获进范艾伦辐射带。�?The Sun continuously releases a stream of charged particles, the solar wind, moving at hundreds of kilometers per second. Earth's magnetic field creates a magnetosphere that deflects most of the wind like a barrier; the wind forms a bow shock upstream, and the field traps some charged particles in the Van Allen belts.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�5ce92e68ea9d�body��D红矮星表面磁场活动强烈，会频繁爆发 X 射线和紫外耀斑，能量比太阳耀斑强得多。耀斑会冲刷行星大气，甚至可能剥离行星的大气层；但另一方面，有些研究认为耀斑的紫外辐射反而可能促进某些前生物化学反应的进行，影响是复杂且双重的。�_Red dwarfs have vigorous magnetic activity and erupt in X-ray and ultraviolet flares far more energetic than solar flares. These flares bombard planetary atmospheres and can even strip them away; on the other hand, some studies suggest flare ultraviolet radiation could drive certain prebiotic reactions, so the net effect is complex and double-edged.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�5d218a13f691�body���会。星系在引力作用下可能相互靠近并合并，恒星本身很少直接相撞，但气体云会被压缩从而触发大量新恒星诞生；银河系未来也将与仙女座星系合并。٪Yes. Galaxies can merge under gravity; individual stars rarely collide, but gas clouds compress and spark star formation. The Milky Way will one day merge with Andromeda.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�5da1e2ec1710�body��2小行星采矿通常瞄准近地小行星中的 M 型（金属型）天体，富含铁、镍与铂族金属，以及 C 型（碳质）天体，可能携带水冰与有机化合物。前者可用于空间制造与稀有金属，后者既能提供推进剂用的水，也可能含生命相关前体物质。�IAsteroid mining typically targets M-type (metallic) near-Earth asteroids rich in iron, nickel, and platinum-group metals, and C-type (carbonaceous) bodies that may carry water ice and organics. The former serve space manufacturing and rare metals, while the latter can supply water for propellant and possibly prebiotic material.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�5e934a681450�body���因为火星是离地球较近、环境相对温和的星球，可能曾存在液态水与生命线索，被视为未来人类多行星生存的候选地，也能推动科技与科学探索。٬Mars is nearby with relatively mild conditions, may have once had liquid water and life, and is a candidate for future multi-planet living—driving science and technology.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�5ed4ae9bbafa�body��哈勃在1926年提出的分类图将星系按形态分为椭圆星系、透镜状星系和旋涡（及棒旋）星系，形似音叉。它反映了星系外观的系统差异，但后来发现形态更多由演化与环境影响，而非简单的线性序列。�?Hubble's 1926 classification diagram sorts galaxies by shape into ellipticals, lenticulars, and spiral (including barred-spiral) galaxies, arranged like a tuning fork. It captured systematic appearance differences, though we now know morphology is shaped more by evolution and environment than a simple linear sequence.�ans��src��K埃德温·哈勃（1926，《星云的星系外天文学》分类论文）�*Edwin Hubble (1926, galaxy classification)��id�5f3e47a4792c�body���多普勒效应使靠近我们的光源谱线蓝移、远离者红移。天文学家借此测量天体的视向速度——例如通过恒星光谱的周期性微小位移发现绕其运行的行星（径向速度法），或测定星系的退行速度。�4The Doppler effect shifts a source's spectral lines blue when approaching and red when receding. Astronomers use it to measure line-of-sight velocities—for example, the tiny periodic shifts in a star's spectrum that reveal orbiting planets (the radial-velocity method), or the recession speeds of galaxies.�ans��src�ٿ多普勒（C. Doppler，1842，多普勒效应原始论文）；迈耶与奎洛兹（Mayor & Queloz）,《A Jupiter-mass companion to a solar-type star》,Nature,1995 (DOI: 10.1038/378355a0)وC. Doppler (1842, original effect); Mayor & Queloz, 'A Jupiter-mass companion to a solar-type star', Nature, 1995, DOI: 10.1038/378355a0��id�63bd708dce49�body�ٮ光谱分辨率是望远镜区分相邻波长的能力，分辨率越高越能分离密集谱线、精确测速度和化学丰度，是研究恒星与系外的关键指标。��Spectral resolution is a telescope's ability to separate nearby wavelengths; higher resolution resolves crowded lines and measures velocities and abundances precisely—key for stars and exoplanets.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�648171cd6bbe�body��1EHT 把分布在全球的射电望远镜通过甚长基线干涉技术连成一台口径相当于地球直径的虚拟望远镜，从而具备足以分辨黑洞阴影的角分辨率。2019 年它发布了 M87 星系中心黑洞的环形图像，2022 年又发布了银河系中心人马座 A* 的图像。�tThe EHT links radio telescopes around the globe through very long baseline interferometry into a virtual telescope with an effective aperture the size of Earth, giving it the angular resolution to resolve a black hole shadow. In 2019 it released the ring-shaped image of the black hole in galaxy M87, and in 2022 the image of Sagittarius A* at the center of the Milky Way.�ans��src��J论文 First M87 Event Horizon Telescope Results. I,EHT合作组,ApJL,2019لEvent Horizon Telescope Collaboration et al., First M87 Event Horizon Telescope Results. I., The Astrophysical Journal Letters, 2019��id�649ed7919c15�body���恒星级黑洞由大质量恒星死后核心坍缩形成，质量只有几个到几十个太阳质量，在银河系里数量很多。超大质量黑洞质量可达数百万到上百亿个太阳，盘踞在星系中心，它的形成途径至今仍在研究中，可能靠合并增长，也可能由早期巨气体云直接坍缩。两者的基本物理相同，但尺度天差地别。��Stellar-mass black holes form from the collapsed cores of dead massive stars, weigh only a few to tens of solar masses, and are plentiful in the Milky Way. Supermassive black holes, up to hundreds of millions or tens of billions of solar masses, sit at galaxy centres; how they grow is still under study, possibly through mergers or direct collapse of giant gas clouds early on. The physics is the same, but the scales are vastly different.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�67e50d23eab7�body�ٮ早期火星有较厚大气和磁场保护，表面温暖足以存在液态水；随着内核冷却、磁场消失、大气被太阳风剥离，水便蒸发或冻结流失。��Early Mars had a thicker atmosphere and magnetic field shielding, keeping the surface warm enough for liquid water; as its core cooled and the magnetic field died, the solar wind stripped the atmosphere and water escaped or froze.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�6895cb1549e3�body��好奇号在盖尔撞击坑的泥岩中检测到了多种有机分子，包括含碳的复杂化合物，并发现甲烷浓度会随季节变化。有机分子本身不等于生命，但它们是生命的前体物质，证明火星在过去能够保存有机碳。�3Curiosity has detected a variety of organic molecules, carbon-bearing compounds, in the mudstones of Gale crater, and has observed that methane levels vary with the seasons. Organic molecules are not life itself, but they are building blocks of life and show that ancient Mars could preserve organic carbon.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�69090417071f�body�٠西方把七颗星看作大熊座的一部分（尾巴），中国则独立称为'北斗'，并据其形状定出'斗柄指东，天下皆春'等季节规律。ٷThe West sees them as part of the Great Bear's tail; China calls them the Northern Dipper and used its handle's pointing to mark seasons ('when the handle points east, spring comes').�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�6e1220361134�body��2015 年 LIGO 探测到两个约 30 倍太阳质量黑洞并合产生的时空涟漪，其波形与广义相对论双黑洞旋进—并合—铃宕的数值模拟精确吻合。这是人类首次直接探测到黑洞并合，也验证了黑洞作为动态天体真实存在。�:In 2015 LIGO detected spacetime ripples from the merger of two black holes of about 30 solar masses each, with a waveform matching general-relativistic simulations of binary inspiral, merger and ringdown. It was the first direct detection of a black-hole merger and confirmed black holes as real dynamical objects.�ans��src��=Abbott 等（LIGO/Virgo）2016, PRL 116, 061102（GW150914）�<Abbott et al. (LIGO/Virgo) 2016, PRL, 116, 061102 (GW150914)��id�70b46e9931ec�body�ي本星系群是包括银河系、仙女座星系和三角座星系在内的约50个星系组成的松散集合，直径约1000万光年。ٗThe Local Group is a loose gathering of about 50 galaxies, including the Milky Way, Andromeda, and Triangulum, spanning roughly 10 million light-years.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�7557ca3cb66f�body�ٗY型是褐矮星中最冷的一类，表面温度可低至约300开尔文，接近室温，颜色偏红，是最接近行星质量的亚恒星天体。ٯY-type is the coldest class of brown dwarf, with surface temperatures down to about 300 K—near room temperature—and reddish color, the most planet-like substellar objects.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�77688021b72e�body�ٜ受主星与邻近天体引力拉扯，卫星内部摩擦生热；木卫二和土卫二因此拥有冰下海洋，成为太阳系内潜在宜居的热点。ٻTugged by its planet and neighbors, a moon's interior heats from friction; Europa and Enceladus thus host subsurface oceans, making them prime habitability candidates in the Solar System.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�78572bebdc0e�body�ٯ超新星遗迹是爆炸抛出的气体在星际空间膨胀形成的云团；蟹状星云是1054年一颗超新星的遗骸，中心还藏着一颗快速自转的中子星。٬A supernova remnant is the expanding cloud of gas from the blast; the Crab Nebula is the debris of a 1054 supernova and hides a rapidly spinning neutron star at its center.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�7a9c04652bf8�body��-太阳宇宙线来自太阳耀斑与日冕物质抛射，能量较低（通常 MeV–GeV）、受太阳活动调制明显；银河系宇宙线来自超新星遗迹等河内加速源，能量可延伸至极高能并成分更重。二者在到达地球时受太阳风与地磁场的屏蔽程度不同。�.Solar cosmic rays come from solar flares and CMEs, are lower energy (typically MeV–GeV), and strongly modulated by solar activity; Galactic cosmic rays originate in supernova remnants and reach far higher energies with heavier composition. They differ in how solar wind and Earth's field shield them.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�7ab71cc66fd1�body�ٖ金星云层主要由浓硫酸液滴构成，而非地球那样的水云，这层云把大部分阳光反射掉，使金星在夜空中格外明亮。��Venus's clouds are made mainly of droplets of concentrated sulfuric acid rather than water like Earth's clouds; this layer reflects most sunlight, making Venus exceptionally bright in the sky.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�7bbd518f5a06�body�ف阿波罗11、12、14、15、16、17号共6次成功把航天员送上月球表面，13号因故障未能登月但安全返回。�rApollo 11,12,14,15,16,17 successfully landed astronauts—six times; Apollo 13 failed to land but returned safely.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�7c806758fec0�body�٨二者是小行星带中最大的天体，谷神星是矮行星（含地下盐水储层），灶神星是分异过的岩质天体，其陨石曾被带回地球研究。ٽThey are the largest bodies in the asteroid belt: Ceres is a dwarf planet with a subsurface brine reservoir, while Vesta is a differentiated rocky world whose meteorites have reached Earth.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�7d06a124d340�body��近地小行星是轨道与地球轨道相近、可能接近地球的小天体。绝大多数体积很小且不会撞击地球，但较大的近地天体若撞击会造成区域甚至全球灾难。天文学家正持续监测并研究偏转技术以应对潜在威胁。�Near-Earth asteroids are small bodies whose orbits come close to Earth's. Most are tiny and pose no threat, but a larger one could cause regional or global disaster if it hit. Astronomers monitor them continuously and study deflection methods against potential threats.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�7d5d1dba1b1f�body��/赫罗图以恒星的光谱类型（或温度）为横轴、光度（或绝对星等）为纵轴绘制恒星。赫茨普龙与罗素独立发现，大多数恒星落在一条“主序”带上，由此揭示了恒星的质量、温度与光度之间的系统关系，是现代恒星天文学的基石。�7The H–R diagram plots stars by spectral type (or temperature) against luminosity (or absolute magnitude). Hertzsprung and Russell independently found that most stars lie on a “main sequence,” revealing systematic links among a star's mass, temperature, and luminosity—a cornerstone of stellar astronomy.�ans��src��Z艾纳尔·赫茨普龙（1905–1911）与亨利·诺里斯·罗素（1913）原始论文�=Hertzsprung (1905–1911) and Russell (1913), original papers��id�7ed263650f3b�body��8CCD（电荷耦合器件）由大量光电二极管像素组成，光子打在半导体上产生电子并被储存在像素势阱中，再由移位寄存器逐行读出为电信号。它因量子效率高、噪声低而成为天文成像主流，不过在红外波段逐渐被汞镉碲等专用探测器取代。��A CCD, charge-coupled device, consists of many photodiode pixels; photons hitting the semiconductor generate electrons stored in pixel wells and then shifted out row by row through a register as electrical signals. Its high quantum efficiency and low noise made it the mainstream in astronomical imaging, though in the infrared it is increasingly replaced by specialized detectors such as mercury cadmium telluride.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�803b2b51e769�body��SKA是正在建设、总收集面积达一平方公里的巨型射电望远镜阵列，分布在南非和澳大利亚。它将以空前灵敏度绘制中性氢分布、探测早期宇宙并搜索可能的地外信号。建成后将极大推动射电天文学的发展。�XThe SKA is a giant radio telescope array under construction with a total collecting area of one square kilometer, spanning South Africa and Australia. It will map neutral hydrogen, probe the early universe, and search for possible extraterrestrial signals with unprecedented sensitivity. Upon completion it will greatly advance radio astronomy.�ans��src��tSchilizzi,《The SKA》,Proceedings of From Antikythera to the Square Kilometre Arra,2013 (DOI: 10.22323/1.170.0044)�rSchilizzi, 'The SKA', Proceedings of From Antikythera to the Square Kilometre Arra, 2013, DOI: 10.22323/1.170.0044��id�81c017e27104�body�٨宜居带是恒星周围温度允许液态水存在的区域，既不太热也不太冷。位于宜居带的岩质行星被认为是寻找地外生命的优先目标。��The habitable zone is the region around a star where temperatures could allow liquid water, neither too hot nor too cold. Rocky planets there are top targets in the search for life beyond Earth.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�81d02f589d7f�body�ٜ地球、月球和火星位置不断变化，只有在特定几天出发，才能用最省燃料的轨道相遇；错过就要再等几个月甚至两年。ٙAs Earth, Moon and Mars move, only on certain days can you take the most fuel-efficient path to meet them; miss it and you wait months or even two years.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�82a52c878c2f�body�ي它将多次飞掠木卫二，用雷达穿透冰壳探测地下海洋、评估其宜居性，是搜寻太阳系内生命的重要任务。٦It will repeatedly fly past Europa, using radar to probe the ice shell and subsurface ocean and assess habitability—a major search for life within the Solar System.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�8301a0afe9f6�body�ف初一、十五时太阳、月球、地球近似成一线，两者引力叠加，使高潮更高、低潮更低，称为大潮。�At new and full moon the Sun, Moon and Earth align, their gravities combine, making higher highs and lower lows—spring tides.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�83e7aee57549�body��云和霾中的微粒会散射或吸收穿过大气边缘的光，压平分子吸收线的对比度并抬升光谱基线。厚云可掩盖大部分分子特征，使大气显得“平淡”。通过建模粒子大小和分布，研究者仍能从中提取温度和部分成分信息。�YParticles in clouds and hazes scatter or absorb light passing through the atmospheric limb, flattening molecular absorption features and raising the spectral baseline. Thick clouds can mask most molecular signatures, making the atmosphere look featureless. Modeling particle size and distribution still extracts temperature and some composition.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�8490f1c5e81f�body�٩ALMA等毫米波阵列能解析原行星盘内的环与缝隙，这些结构被认为是行星正在形成的证据，直接展示恒星与行星系统的“摇篮”。��Millimeter arrays like ALMA resolve rings and gaps inside protoplanetary disks; these structures are taken as evidence of planets forming, directly showing the 'cradle' of star and planet systems.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�86bf50e3e94e�body�ٷ太阳风是太阳持续向外喷射的带电粒子流，速度大约每秒400公里。它在约100个天文单位处形成日球层顶，阻挡了部分星际物质进入太阳系。��The solar wind is a steady stream of charged particles from the Sun, moving at about 400 kilometers per second. It forms the heliopause at roughly 100 astronomical units, shielding the solar system from some interstellar material.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�86e356ad1a61�body�ِ双胞胎中一人乘近光速飞船远行返回，会比留在地球的兄弟更年轻，这是狭义相对论中时间膨胀的真实结果。ٚOf twins, one riding a near-light-speed ship returns younger than the one who stayed on Earth—a real consequence of time dilation in special relativity.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�878bf39f6515�body��%水星表面布满撞击坑，最大的撞击盆地是直径约 1550 公里的卡洛里斯盆地，内部由多环结构环绕。在水星两极的永久阴影坑内，雷达观测发现了疑似水冰的反射信号，那里的温度常年低于零下 170 摄氏度，冰可以长期保存。�kMercury's surface is heavily cratered; its largest impact basin, Caloris, is about 1,550 km wide and surrounded by concentric rings. Radar observations have detected bright reflections consistent with water ice inside polar craters in permanent shadow, where temperatures stay below about minus 170 degrees Celsius year-round, so ice can survive for long periods.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�8891626a12d5�body��J宜居带是恒星周围温度适中、使行星表面能维持液态水的轨道范围，又称「金发姑娘区」。它的内外边界取决于恒星光度与行星大气的温室效应，对暗弱的红矮星较近、对明亮的恒星较远。宜居带只是液态水存在的必要条件，并不保证行星真正宜居。��The habitable zone is the orbital region around a star where temperatures allow liquid water on a planet's surface, often called the Goldilocks zone. Its inner and outer edges depend on the star's luminosity and the planet's atmospheric greenhouse effect, lying closer in for faint red dwarfs and farther out for bright stars. The zone is only a necessary condition for liquid water and does not guarantee actual habitability.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�894cb08b6606�body��银河系中心被称为人马座 A*（Sgr A*）的射电源，质量约400万个太阳质量。天文学家通过长期追踪周围恒星的紧密高速轨道（如 UCLA 银河系中心组和事件视界望远镜的观测）推断出这一致密质量的存在。�(The radio source Sagittarius A* (Sgr A*) at the Milky Way's center has a mass of about four million Suns. Astronomers inferred this compact mass by tracking the tight, fast orbits of nearby stars over many years (work by the UCLA Galactic Center Group and imaging by the Event Horizon Telescope).�ans��src��d事件视界望远镜合作组（EHT，2022）；加州大学洛杉矶分校银河系中心研究组�HEvent Horizon Telescope Collaboration (2022); UCLA Galactic Center Group��id�89585fdcca67�body�ٯ阿尔忒弥斯是美国牵头的新一轮探月计划，目标在2020年代让首位女性和下一位男性登陆南极，并建立月球门户以支撑未来火星任务。٭Artemis is a US-led new lunar program aiming to land the first woman and next man near the south pole in the 2020s and build a lunar Gateway to support future Mars missions.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�89eabee12c2e�body��e伽利略号探测到木卫二表面有冰壳的裂缝与稀少的撞击坑，并测得其磁场随木星磁场周期性变化，这是内部导电液体层的强信号。潮汐加热使冰壳之下保持液态，而表面的锰、镁等盐类暗示海水与岩石海底发生过反应。欧罗巴快船任务正进一步探测这一海洋的化学性质。��The Galileo mission saw a fractured, sparsely cratered ice shell on Europa and measured a magnetic field that varied with Jupiter's, a strong sign of an internal conducting fluid layer. Tidal heating keeps liquid water beneath the ice, and surface salts such as magnesium and manganese imply the ocean has reacted with a rocky seafloor. The Europa Clipper mission is now probing that ocean's chemistry in detail.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�8a2a645a27c0�body�ٮ不是。多普勒红移来自天体相对运动，宇宙学红移来自空间自身膨胀拉长光波；遥远星系的红移主要是后者，需用广义相对论描述。��No. Doppler redshift comes from relative motion, while cosmological redshift comes from space itself expanding and stretching the light. Distant galaxies are dominated by the latter, described by general relativity.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�8a8d83ae9741�body��=天王星的自转轴倾角约98°，几乎是横躺在轨道平面上转动，主流解释是形成早期遭受了一次巨大的侧向撞击。它拥有一组暗淡、狭窄且与其赤道共面的环；由于自转轴近乎横躺，整个环系相对于其轨道平面近乎垂直，由旅行者2号详细探测。�VUranus has an axial tilt of about 98°, essentially rolling on its side, most likely from a giant off-center impact early in its history. It also has a set of dark, narrow rings lying in its equatorial plane; because of the near-sideways spin, the whole ring system is nearly perpendicular to the orbital plane, mapped in detail by Voyager 2.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�8aee02219c0a�body�ٴ可观测宇宙是以我们为中心、光自大爆炸以来所能到达的球形区域，半径约465亿光年；超出此范围的区域其光还没来得及到达我们这里。��The observable universe is the spherical region around us from which light has had time to reach us since the Big Bang, about 46.5 billion light-years in radius; beyond it, light hasn't arrived yet.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�8af8720fae49�body���盖亚卫星自2013年运行，以前所未有的精度测量了超过十亿颗恒星的位置、自行和视差，绘制出最详尽的银河系三维星图。这些数据大幅刷新了我们对银河系结构、恒星距离和动态历史的认识。�Since 2013 Gaia has measured the positions, proper motions, and parallaxes of over a billion stars with unprecedented precision, building the most detailed 3D map of the Milky Way. The data have reshaped our picture of the Galaxy's structure, stellar distances, and dynamic history.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�8b9291fe7fb0�body�ٗ需在火星起飞、轨道交会对接并将样本送回地球，技术链条极长且要严防地球生物污染，目前由NASA与ESA合作推进。ٽIt must launch from Mars, dock in orbit and return samples to Earth—an extremely long chain requiring strict protection against Earth contamination; NASA and ESA are pursuing it together.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�8ea5b6efa275�body��恒星的定义是核心持续进行氢聚变，而点燃并维持氢聚变至少需要约0.08倍太阳质量。质量不足的褐矮星达不到这个门槛，只能在形成初期短暂烧掉一点氘，随后靠收缩慢慢散热，越变越冷。它常常被称为失败的恒星。�NA star is defined by sustaining hydrogen fusion in its core, which needs at least about 0.08 times the Sun's mass. A brown dwarf below that threshold never ignites proper hydrogen fusion; it briefly burns a little deuterium when young and then simply contracts and cools, fading steadily. That is why it is often called a failed star.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�8eae5c97e7c7�body�ف地轴倾斜使夏季时某半球更多面向太阳、日照弧线更长，冬季则相反，于是昼夜长短随季节变化。ًAxial tilt makes a hemisphere face the Sun more in summer, lengthening the daylight arc, and less in winter, changing day length by season.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�8ee1a09a4f76�body��地球植被中的叶绿素在约700纳米处对近红外光反射率骤增，形成独特的“红边”光谱特征。若在系外行星反射光谱中检测到类似陡变，可能暗示光合作用式生物圈。但它并非生命独有，需排除矿物等其他成因。�Chlorophyll in Earth's vegetation sharply raises reflectance near 700 nm, creating the distinctive “red edge.” Detecting a similar spectral jump in an exoplanet's reflected light could hint at a photosynthetic biosphere. It is not unique to life, so mineral causes must be excluded.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�8fd6e2d9c753�body��R金星比地球更靠近太阳，早期液态水蒸发后，水汽这种强温室气体使大气进一步升温。水汽上升至高层被太阳紫外光分解，氢逃逸到太空，二氧化碳则留在大气中积累到约90倍地球大气压。缺乏板块运动与液态海洋使碳无法被重新封存，温室效应彻底失控。��Venus sits closer to the Sun, and once its early liquid water evaporated, water vapor — a potent greenhouse gas — heated the atmosphere further. The vapor rose, was photodissociated by ultraviolet light, and its hydrogen escaped to space while carbon dioxide accumulated to about 90 times Earth's surface pressure. Without plate tectonics or oceans to reabsorb carbon, the greenhouse effect ran away completely.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�9206484e23ee�body���不能直接看到黑洞本身，因为它不发光；但可观测它周围发光物质组成的吸积盘、喷流，以及事件视界在背景光前投下的“阴影”（如2019年首张黑洞照片）。��We can't see the black hole itself since it emits no light, but we observe its glowing accretion disk, jets, and the 'shadow' it casts on background light—as in the first black hole image of 2019.�ans��src��9EHT 合作组（M87 与银心成像论文，ApJ 专刊）�XEvent Horizon Telescope Collaboration (M87 and Sgr A* imaging papers, ApJ special issue)��id�92471988d68c�body�ٷ土卫六拥有浓厚氮气大气和液态甲烷雨湖，是太阳系唯一有稳定表面液体的卫星，其化学被认为类似地球早期，是搜寻前生命化学的热点。ٿTitan has a thick nitrogen atmosphere and lakes of liquid methane rain—the only moon with stable surface liquids—and its chemistry resembles early Earth, a hotspot for pre-life chemistry.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�927a7b492623�body��-按可见物质（恒星与气体）的引力，外围恒星转速应随半径增大而下降；但 21 厘米氢线观测显示许多旋涡星系的自转曲线在远处保持平坦。这需要额外的、不可见的质量（暗物质晕）在外围提供引力，是最早的暗物质证据之一。�"Visible matter alone predicts outer stellar speeds should decline with radius, yet 21 cm HI observations show many spirals have flat rotation curves far out. This requires extra invisible mass—a dark-matter halo—providing gravity at large radii, among the earliest dark-matter evidence.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�930643f20d4a�body��P当系外行星从恒星前方经过时，星光会穿过行星大气，大气中的分子会留下特征性的指纹，韦布望远镜利用这一点识别水、二氧化碳、甲烷等分子。同时出现氧气和甲烷这种理论上难以长期共存的组合，被认为是可能的生命迹象，但仍需排除非生物成因。��When an exoplanet passes in front of its star, starlight travels through the planet's atmosphere and molecules imprint characteristic fingerprints, which JWST uses to identify water, carbon dioxide and methane. Combinations such as oxygen with methane, which should not persist for long, are treated as possible signs of life, though non-biological origins still have to be ruled out.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�933b90f598ed�body���本星系群是以银河系与仙女座星系（M31）为首、约 80 个星系组成的松散集团，直径约 1000 万光年（约 3 Mpc）。它的第三大成员是三角座星系（M33），其余多为矮椭圆与矮不规则星系。�␀The Local Group is a loose association of about 80 galaxies led by the Milky Way and Andromeda (M31), spanning roughly 10 million light-years (about 3 Mpc). Its third-largest member is Triangulum (M33); the rest are mostly dwarf ellipticals and irregulars.�ans��src��Dvan den Bergh 1999, Astron. Astrophys. Rev. 9, 273《本星系群》�Svan den Bergh (1999), Astron. Astrophys. Rev. 9, 273, 'The local group of galaxies'��id�93d33e8c969b�body���行星状星云与行星毫无关系，只是早期望远镜中其圆润形态类似行星而得名。它们是中低质量恒星（如太阳）在生命末期抛出的发光气体壳层，中心残留的白矮星发出的紫外辐射使其发光。�$Planetary nebulae have nothing to do with planets; they were named for their round, planet-like appearance in early telescopes. They are glowing shells of gas ejected by low- to intermediate-mass stars like the Sun at the end of life, lit up by ultraviolet light from the central white dwarf.�ans��src��[郭新（S. Kwok，2000，《行星状星云的起源与演化》，Springer/A&A Library）�GS. Kwok (2000, The Origin and Evolution of Planetary Nebulae, Springer)��id�94406cca159a�body��引力波红移指波的频率在传播中因宇宙膨胀而降低，与光波的红移类似。它把观测到的频率与源处固有频率联系起来，是推断波源距离和宇宙学参数的桥梁之一。结合电磁对应体测得的红移，可约束膨胀历史。�OGravitational wave redshift is the lowering of wave frequency during propagation due to cosmic expansion, analogous to light's redshift. It links observed and intrinsic frequencies and helps infer source distance and cosmological parameters. Combined with an electromagnetic counterpart's redshift, it constrains the expansion history.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�96df2f3b99d2�body�ٽ巡天望远镜视场比哈勃大300多倍，擅长对大范围天区快速拍照普查，并可与天宫空间站共轨、方便维护升级，而哈勃视场较窄、专注深场精测。��Xuntian has a field of view over 300 times wider than Hubble's, suited to fast wide-area surveys, and shares orbit with the Tiangong station for easy servicing; Hubble has a narrow field for deep precise imaging.�ans��src��G国务院新闻办公室《2021中国的航天》航天白皮书，2022�^State Council Information Office: China's Space Program: A 2021 Perspective, white paper, 2022��id�975d83a7aa18�body�ّ两体系统中存在L1到L5五个引力平衡点；L1、L2适合放望远镜（如SOHO、韦布），L4、L5可存放“特洛伊”小行星。١In a two-body system there are five gravitational balance points, L1–L5; L1 and L2 suit telescopes (SOHO, Webb), while L4 and L5 can harbor 'Trojan' asteroids.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�9ae8ae0ec3a5�body��脉冲星是高速自转的中子星，拥有极强的倾斜偶极磁场。其磁极沿磁轴喷出相对论性粒子束，随自转扫过地球时就像灯塔，产生毫秒到秒量级的严格周期射电脉冲。周期缓慢变长反映自转能因磁偶极辐射而损失。�_Pulsars are rapidly rotating neutron stars with extremely strong, tilted dipole magnetic fields. Particle beams shot from the magnetic poles sweep past Earth like a lighthouse as the star spins, producing strictly periodic radio pulses from milliseconds to seconds. The slowly lengthening period reflects spin energy lost to magnetic dipole radiation.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�9c8903dcdccd�body�ٷ比冲衡量火箭发动机效率，等于单位推进剂产生的冲量（常换算成秒），越高代表同样燃料获得越多速度增量，是推进系统设计核心指标。پSpecific impulse measures engine efficiency—impulse per unit propellant, often in seconds; higher means more velocity gain from the same fuel, a core figure of merit for propulsion design.�ans��src��FSutton & Biblarz《火箭推进基础》（第 8 版，2010，Wiley）�CSutton & Biblarz, Rocket Propulsion Elements (8th ed., Wiley, 2010)��id�9e2f75008810�body��<强耀斑引发的射电爆发会干扰高频通信与 GPS 信号，而朝向地球的日冕物质抛射可诱发地磁暴，在长距离输电线上感应出破坏性电流、损坏变压器，并迫使卫星进入安全模式。1989 年魁北克大停电就是地磁感应电流导致电网失效的典型案例。��Intense flares cause radio bursts that disrupt high-frequency communication and GPS signals, while Earth-directed coronal mass ejections can induce geomagnetic storms that drive destructive currents in long power lines, damage transformers, and force satellites into safe mode. The 1989 Quebec blackout is a classic case where geomagnetically induced currents knocked out the power grid.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�9e448c87d65f�body��Q哈勃定律说，星系离我们越远，退行速度越快，两者成正比，即速度等于哈勃常数乘以距离。这意味着几乎所有星系都在相互远离，是宇宙在整体膨胀的强有力证据，而不是地球处在宇宙中心。普朗克卫星测得的哈勃常数约为每百万秒差距每秒67到68公里。��Hubble's law states that the farther a galaxy is from us, the faster it recedes, the two being proportional: recession speed equals the Hubble constant times distance. Since nearly every galaxy is moving away from every other, this is powerful evidence that the whole universe is expanding, not that Earth sits at its centre. The Planck satellite measured the Hubble constant at about 67 to 68 kilometres per second per megaparsec.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�9f182734f96a�body��(FAST 是世界最大单口径球面射电望远镜，口径达五百米，接收面积远超此前的阿雷西博望远镜。其巨大的集光面积与主动反射面调形能力使其对暗弱射电源与窄带信号的灵敏度居世界前列，特别适合脉冲星搜索与中性氢巡天。�aFAST is the world's largest single-dish spherical radio telescope, with a 500-meter aperture far exceeding the former Arecibo telescope in collecting area. Its huge area and actively shaped reflector give it among the highest sensitivities to faint radio sources and narrowband signals, especially suited to pulsar searches and neutral hydrogen surveys.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�a0bc56f5ed22�body�ٮ贵州的喀斯特洼地天然像个巨碗，能托住500米口径的反射面，且当地人烟稀少、电磁干扰低，适合接收极其微弱的宇宙无线电信号。٨Guizhou's karst depression naturally cradles the 500-meter dish, and its sparse population gives low radio interference—ideal for catching faint cosmic radio signals.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�a0c8500a6b1b�body��事件视界是黑洞的边界，它不是固体表面，而是一个有去无回的临界位置。在那里，逃离黑洞所需的逃逸速度正好等于光速，所以连光也无法逃出。任何物质一旦越过视界，就再也无法把任何信息传回外面。�The event horizon is the boundary of a black hole. It is not a solid surface but a point of no return: there the escape velocity needed to get away equals the speed of light, so not even light can leave. Anything that crosses the horizon can never send information back out.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�a17d0b8d8e1d�body��,发射星云内部的炽热恒星电离周围的气体，气体在复合时发出特征颜色的光，比如猎户座大星云呈现红色（氢的发射线）。反射星云则本身不发光，只是尘埃把附近恒星的光散射出来，通常呈蓝色，因为蓝光更容易被尘埃散射。�mAn emission nebula's hot interior stars ionize surrounding gas, which glows in characteristic colors as it recombines; for example the Orion Nebula appears red from hydrogen's emission lines. A reflection nebula does not shine on its own but simply scatters light from a nearby star, usually appearing blue because blue light scatters more efficiently off the dust.�ans��src��'《天文学概论》（星云分类）�ESO (nebula types)��id�a1af8912dcb5�body�� 水星的核心占据其半径约85%，质量占比远高于其他类地行星。信使号（MESSENGER）探测表明，这可能是由于太阳系形成早期水星经历了一次巨大撞击、剥离了大部分外层硅酸盐幔，或是在高温原行星盘中铁优先吸积所致。�4Mercury's core takes up about 85% of its radius, a far larger metal fraction than other terrestrial planets. MESSENGER data suggest this may result from a giant impact early in solar-system history that stripped much of its silicate mantle, or from preferential iron accretion in the hot protoplanetary disk.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�a1c3cf695846�body��w德雷克方程估算银河系中能够与我们通信的文明数量，它把恒星形成率、有行星的恒星比例、每颗恒星宜居行星数、生命出现概率、智慧生命概率、文明寿命等多个未知因子相乘。方程的数值高度不确定，但它把“银河系里有多少地外文明”这一问题拆解成可以逐项研究的科学问题。��The Drake equation estimates the number of communicating civilizations in the Milky Way, multiplying factors such as the star formation rate, the fraction of stars with planets, the number of habitable planets per star, the probability that life and intelligence arise, and the lifetime of civilizations. Although its numerical result is highly uncertain, it breaks the question of extraterrestrial civilizations into terms that can be studied one by one.�ans��src��*《天文学概论》（德雷克方程）�!IAU (SETI and the Drake equation)��id�a208e0e32700�body��L主要阻力来自木星。木星强大的引力不断扰动小行星带的天体，让它们的相对速度太大，撞到一起往往崩碎而不是黏合；木星的轨道共振区还把许多小天体清了出去。小行星带全部物质加起来还不到月球质量的4%，只能说是一颗没能长成的行星的原料。�vJupiter is the main culprit. Its powerful gravity keeps stirring up the belt, giving the bodies there too much relative speed so collisions smash them apart rather than gluing them together, and its orbital resonances sweep many objects out entirely. All the belt's material together is under four percent of the Moon's mass — the raw stuff of a planet that never grew up.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�a2face622a83�body��*观测发现星系中心超大质量黑洞质量与宿主星系核球（bulge）质量、恒星速度弥散存在紧密的 M–σ 关系。这通常被解释为黑洞与宿主在并合与共演化过程中通过反馈（如活动星系核风）相互调节，避免气体无节制地落入中心。�Observations show a tight M–σ relation between supermassive black-hole mass and host bulge mass (or stellar velocity dispersion). It is usually interpreted as co-evolution: feedback such as AGN winds regulates growth of both, preventing runaway central gas inflow.�ans��src��YKormendy & Ho 2013, ARAA 51, 511《超大质量黑洞与宿主星系（不）共演化》فKormendy & Ho (2013), Annu. Rev. Astron. Astrophys. 51, 511, 'Coevolution (Or Not) of Supermassive Black Holes and Host Galaxies'��id�a321030f893a�body���太空垃圾是失效卫星、火箭残骸和碰撞产生的碎片，主要聚集在近地轨道。它们以极高速度飞行，哪怕小碎片撞击卫星也会造成破坏。数量增多还可能引发链式碰撞，使轨道越来越危险。�Space debris is defunct satellites, spent rocket stages and fragments from collisions, concentrated in low Earth orbit. Moving at extreme speeds, even tiny pieces can wreck a satellite on impact. Growing numbers risk a chain reaction of collisions that makes orbits ever more hazardous.�ans��src��y凯斯勒与库尔-帕莱 1978 年《地球物理研究杂志》(JGR) 关于轨道碎片链式碰撞 (凯斯勒综合症)�NKessler & Cour-Palais (1978, JGR) on orbital-debris cascade (Kessler syndrome)��id�a33042e913a0�body�ٿ某些热木星大气高层吸收恒星紫外（如TiO、VO分子）而变热，形成温度随高度升高的逆温层，使某些吸收线从吸收变发射，是系外大气研究焦点。��In some hot Jupiters, high-altitude molecules (TiO, VO) absorb stellar UV and heat the upper layer, creating a temperature inversion where temperature rises with height—flipping some lines from absorption to emission, a focus of exoplanet study.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�a56e7ae016c1�body�ٙ星座只是从地球看过去方向接近的投影，成员星可能相距光年之遥、彼此毫无关联，只是恰好出现在同一视线方向。١A constellation is just a projection of stars that happen to share a viewing direction from Earth; its members may be light-years apart and physically unrelated.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�a5d2184ddbe9�body�ٱ白矮星是中小质量恒星演化到末期的残骸，靠电子简并压支撑，不再进行核聚变。它体积小、密度极高，一茶匙白矮星物质重达数吨。��A white dwarf is the remnant of a low- to medium-mass star, supported by electron degeneracy pressure and no longer fusing atoms. It is tiny and extremely dense; a teaspoon of its material weighs several tons.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�a9560713f51b�body��|它在2020年从月球采集约1.7公斤月壤并成功带回地球，是人类时隔四十多年再次取回月球样品。�uIn 2020 it collected ~1.7 kg of lunar soil and returned it—the first Moon sample brought back in over four decades.�ans��src��G国务院新闻办公室《2021中国的航天》航天白皮书，2022�^State Council Information Office: China's Space Program: A 2021 Perspective, white paper, 2022��id�adb7ce9c600d�body�ٜ超新星是大质量恒星生命末期发生的剧烈爆炸，瞬间释放的能量可超过其一生辐射总和，并把重元素抛撒到宇宙空间。ٵA supernova is a violent explosion at the end of a massive star's life, releasing in moments more energy than it radiated in its whole life and scattering heavy elements into space.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�afd3d68d01f2�body���该定律指出，遥远星系的退行速度与其距离成正比（v = H₀·d），比例常数 H₀ 即哈勃常数。它直接表明宇宙正在膨胀，是现代观测宇宙学的基石，由勒梅特与哈勃分别在1927和1929年提出。�The law states that a galaxy's recession speed is proportional to its distance (v = H₀·d), with H₀ the Hubble constant. It shows directly that the universe is expanding and is a foundation of observational cosmology, formulated by Lemaître (1927) and Hubble (1929).�ans��src��N乔治·勒梅特（1927）；埃德温·哈勃（1929，星系退行观测）�-Georges Lemaître (1927); Edwin Hubble (1929)��id�aff4806f86e8�body�٤南朝的祖冲之编订《大明历》，首次把'岁差'引入中国历法计算，并提出更接近真实的交点月长度，提高了日月食预报精度。ٷThe scholar Zu Chongzhi compiled the Daming Calendar, the first Chinese calendar to account for precession, and gave a more accurate nodal-month length, improving eclipse predictions.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�astro_19_001�body���凌星光穿过行星高层大气的环状路径,谱线中心的吸收截面远大于连续谱,使对应波长的等效行星半径增大,凌星深度随之加深。钠的双共振线位于589纳米光学波段,标高放大效应显著,成为最早被证认的地外行星大气特征之一。2002年哈勃STIS仪器在HD 209458b上测得的钠吸收正是这一机制的经典实证。��Transit light samples an annular path through the planet's upper atmosphere, where line-center absorption cross sections dwarf the continuum value, raising the apparent radius at those wavelengths and deepening the transit. The sodium doublet sits at 589 nm in the optical, so the scale-height amplification is strong enough to observe from orbit. Hubble STIS measurements of sodium absorption on HD 209458b in 2002 remain the classic demonstration of this mechanism.�ans��src�ٌCharbonneau, Brown, Noyes, Gilliland,《Detection of an Extrasolar Planet Atmosphere》,The Astrophysical Journal,2002 (DOI: 10.1086/338770)يCharbonneau, Brown, Noyes, Gilliland, 'Detection of an Extrasolar Planet Atmosphere', The Astrophysical Journal, 2002, DOI: 10.1086/338770��id�astro_19_004�body���瞬时辐射来自中心引擎(新生黑洞或磁星)驱动的超高洛伦兹因子外流内部的激波耗散或磁场重联,典型持续时间短于百秒。余辉则是这股外流扫过周边介质形成的外部激波,经由同步辐射从伽马段一路冷却到射电,其衰减行为遵循 Blandford-McKee 自相似解。Swift 卫星对 X 射线余辉的系统跟踪把两个阶段衔接起来,并揭示出暗示中心引擎持续活动的平台期成分。�)Prompt emission comes from internal dissipation - shocks or magnetic reconnection within an ultra-relativistic outflow launched by a central engine such as a newborn black hole or magnetar. The afterglow instead forms when that ejecta sweeps up the surrounding medium in an external shock, cooling through synchrotron radiation from gamma rays down to radio while following the Blandford-McKee self-similar decay. Systematic Swift monitoring of X-ray afterglows bridged the two phases and revealed plateau features pointing to prolonged engine activity.�ans��src��lKumar 与 Zhang,2015年,Physics Reports,561卷第1期:伽马射线暴及相对论喷流物理的长篇评述�cKumar & Zhang 2015, Physics Reports, 561, 1 - The physics of gamma-ray bursts and relativistic jets��id�astro_19_007�body���黑子先在南北纬约三十度浮现并向赤道漂移,说明每个周期内环向磁场自高纬向低纬传播,这是较差自转把极向场缠绕成环向场的直接体现。Babcock-Leighton 类发电机模型据此构建:经向环流搬运磁通量并向赤道汇聚,同时决定了大约11年的周期长度。极区磁场反转的时刻与黑子带的迁移轨迹一起,把模型参数约束得很紧。�Sunspots first appear near thirty degrees latitude in each hemisphere and drift equatorward, showing that the toroidal field propagates pole-to-equator within every cycle as differential rotation winds up the poloidal field. Babcock-Leighton type dynamos build on this picture: meridional circulation transports flux and converges it toward the equator while setting the roughly eleven-year period. The timing of polar-field reversals together with the migrating sunspot belts constrains model parameters very tightly.�ans��src��QHathaway,2010年,Living Reviews in Solar Physics,第7号综述:太阳活动周期�FHathaway 2010, Living Reviews in Solar Physics, 7, 1 - The Solar Cycle��id�astro_19_010�body���PSR B1913+16 由两颗中子星构成,轨道周期约7.75小时,广义相对论预言引力波辐射带走轨道能量,使双星缓慢靠近。泰勒与魏斯伯格团队近三十年的脉冲到达时间监测显示,轨道周期每年缩短约76微秒,与四极辐射公式的预测吻合到千分之二以内。这项工作让赫尔斯与泰勒获得1993年诺贝尔物理学奖,并为后来的直接探测奠定了实验基础。�PSR B1913+16 pairs two neutron stars in a 7.75-hour orbit, and general relativity predicts that gravitational radiation drains orbital energy, slowly tightening the binary. Nearly three decades of pulse arrival-time monitoring by Taylor and Weisberg showed the orbital period shrinking by about 76 microseconds per year, matching the quadrupole-formula prediction to within roughly 0.2 percent. The work earned Hulse and Taylor the 1993 Nobel Prize in Physics and laid the experimental groundwork for later direct detection.�ans��src��vTaylor 与 Weisberg,1982年,The Astrophysical Journal,253卷908页:PSR 1913+16 计时给出的引力波阻尼新检验كTaylor & Weisberg 1982, ApJ, 253, 908 - A new test of general relativity: gravitational radiation and the binary pulsar PSR 1913+16��id�astro_19_011�body���如果旋臂是刚性物质臂，较差自转会在几亿年内把缠绕过紧的臂抹平，而观测到的旋涡图样长期存在。密度波理论把旋臂理解为恒星与气体轨道拥挤形成的图案：恒星短暂进入臂区时速度受到扰动、气体被压缩触发成星，随后各自穿出旋臂继续运行。这样图案以近似恒定的图样速度传播，个别天体只是路过，臂形因此不会随较差自转越缠越紧。�If arms were material structures, differential rotation would wind them up within a few hundred million years, yet observed spiral patterns persist far longer. In the density-wave picture the arm is a traffic-jam-like crowding of stellar and gaseous orbits: stars perturb each other's velocities as they enter, gas is compressed enough to form stars, and both stream out the other side. The pattern then propagates at a roughly fixed pattern speed while individual objects merely pass through, so the arms do not wind tighter over time.�ans��src�ٔ林家翘 & 徐遐生《螺旋结构的密度波理论》论文系列（ApJ, 1964–1966）；Binney & Tremaine《Galactic Dynamics》第2版第6章�nLin & Shu, density-wave theory papers (ApJ, 1964–1966); Binney & Tremaine, Galactic Dynamics, 2nd ed., Ch. 6��id�astro_19_014�body���地球自转让所有天体以恒星日速率匀速掠过望远镜视场，漂移扫描让CCD以同一速率连续转移电荷读出，相当于让探测器与天空同速移动。这样不需要昂贵的跟踪转台和大视场拼接停顿，一条长条带可以整夜不间断地记录下来，占空比接近百分之百。斯隆数字巡天等大规模测光巡天正是靠这一模式高效积累了上亿个源的多波段测光。��Earth's rotation carries every source across the field at the sidereal rate, and drift scanning shifts CCD charge along at that same speed so the detector effectively tracks the sky electronically. This avoids costly precision tracking and stop-and-go mosaic pointing: one long strip can be recorded continuously all night at nearly full duty cycle. Large photometric surveys such as the Sloan Digital Sky Survey used exactly this mode to accumulate multi-band photometry for hundreds of millions of sources.�ans��src��dSDSS 概念设计文档与 York et al. 2000年SDSS总述论文；Gunn et al. 1998年SDSS相机论文�WYork et al. 2000 SDSS overview paper; Gunn et al. 1998 paper on the SDSS imaging camera��id�astro_19_017�body���行星本体遮挡的是几何圆盘对应的恒星光，但高层大气在特定波长上有附加不透明度，恒星光穿过这些半透明层时会按吸收截面被削弱。波长越接近强吸收带，能穿透的大气层越高，等效遮蔽面积越大，表现为凌星深度在该波段系统性加深。比较不同波段的视半径就能反演出钠钾原子线、水汽或云霾等成分与悬浮物的信息。��The planet's opaque disk blocks starlight geometrically, but its upper atmosphere adds wavelength-specific opacity along the limb where starlight grazes semi-transparent layers. Near strong absorption bands the light penetrates higher, more tenuous layers, enlarging the effective occulting area and deepening the transit depth systematically at those wavelengths. Measuring the apparent radius versus wavelength therefore reveals species such as sodium, potassium, water vapor, or the presence of aerosols.�ans��src�ٽSeager & Sasselov,《Theoretical Transmission Spectra during Extrasolar Giant Planet Transits》,The Astrophysical Journal,2000 (DOI: 10.1086/309088)；Brown 2001年凌星大气温室模型ٹSeager & Sasselov, 'Theoretical Transmission Spectra during Extrasolar Giant Planet Transits', The Astrophysical Journal, 2000, DOI: 10.1086/309088; Brown 2001 transit atmospheric model��id�astro_20_001�body���月球正面以暗色的月海玄武岩平原为主,而背面几乎全是明亮崎岖的高地,地壳也比正面厚约20公里。主流解释认为这种二分性源于早期岩浆洋结晶后月球被潮汐锁定,背面持续暴露在撞击与富含铝物质堆积之下,形成更厚的地壳,抑制了玄武岩溢流。2019年嫦娥四号在冯·卡门撞击坑的探测进一步表明,背面月幔中可能富集橄榄石等深部物质。�The lunar near side is dominated by dark basaltic maria, while the far side is almost entirely bright, rugged highlands with a crust roughly 20 km thicker. The leading explanation ties this dichotomy to lunar magma-ocean crystallization followed by tidal locking: the far side accumulated more aluminum-rich material and a thicker crust that suppressed later basalt flooding. Data from Chang'e 4 at Von Kármán crater in 2019 further suggests the far-side mantle may be enriched in deep-seated minerals like olivine.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�astro_20_004�body��v这源于原行星盘中的温度梯度:距离年轻太阳较近的区域温度高,只有金属和硅酸盐等耐熔物质能凝结成核,故形成了体积较小、密度较高的水星、金星、地球与火星。在雪线以外温度足够低,水冰、甲烷、氨等挥发物得以大量凝结,固体表面密度显著提高,使核心迅速增长到足以捕获氢氦包层的质量,最终演化为木星、土星、天王星与海王星这类气态或冰质巨行星。开普勒望远镜对系外行星系统的统计也表明,这一分布规律在其他恒星周围并非普遍成立,提示行星迁移过程同样重要。�YIt follows from the temperature gradient in the protoplanetary disk: close to the young Sun only refractory metals and silicates could condense into solid seeds, producing small dense worlds like Mercury, Venus, Earth, and Mars. Beyond the snow line, water, methane, and ammonia froze out in abundance, raising the surface density enough for cores to rapidly reach masses capable of capturing hydrogen-helium envelopes, yielding Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, and Neptune. Exoplanet statistics from Kepler show this pattern is not universal around other stars, hinting that planetary migration also matters.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�astro_20_007�body���中国史书连续两千余年系统记录了新见亮星的位置、颜色和可见时长,为公元185年、1006年、1054年等历史超新星提供了精确到月的时标。这些记录帮助现代天文学家把蟹状星云等遗迹与其母超新星直接对应起来,并据此测定遗迹的膨胀年龄。其他文明的记录大多缺乏这种连续性和定位精度,因此中国档案成为标定超新星频率的不可替代基准。�BChinese dynastic histories systematically logged the positions, colors, and visibility durations of newly appearing stars over more than two thousand years, providing month-level dates for historical supernovae such as those of AD 185, 1006, and 1054. These records allowed modern astronomers to link remnants like the Crab Nebula directly to their parent explosions and to derive remnant expansion ages. Few other civilizations kept records of comparable continuity and positional accuracy, making the Chinese archives an irreplaceable baseline for calibrating supernova rates.�ans��src��ZStephenson & Green 2002, Historical Supernovae and their Remnants, Oxford University Press�[Stephenson & Green 2002, Historical Supernovae and their Remnants (Oxford University Press)��id�astro_20_010�body�� 主带小行星形成于雪线以内,以硅酸盐和金属为主,轨道倾角和偏心率适中,长期保持无活动状态;彗核则形成于外太阳系,保留了大量水冰和一氧化碳等挥发分,接近太阳时升华产生彗发和彗尾。然而小行星带并非完全干燥,部分位于主带内侧的冰质小行星在近日点附近也会出现尘埃彗发,被称为活动小行星或主带彗星。它们保留了原始挥发布,说明主带的冰可以在浅层存活数十亿年,是研究内太阳系水来源的重要对象。��Main-belt asteroids formed inside the snow line and are dominated by silicates and metal, with modest eccentricities and inclinations that keep them inactive; comet nuclei formed in the outer Solar System and retain abundant water ice and volatiles like CO, which sublimate near perihelion to produce a coma and tail. Yet the belt is not perfectly dry: some icy asteroids well inside the belt develop dust comas near perihelion and are classed as active asteroids or main-belt comets. Their preserved volatile inventory shows shallow ice can survive billions of years in the belt, making them key targets for studying the origin of water in the inner Solar System.�ans��src��=Hsieh & Jewitt 2006, Science 312, 561《主带中的彗星》�YHsieh & Jewitt 2006, Science 312, 561, "A Population of Comets in the Main Asteroid Belt"��id�astro_20_011�body���时域天文学研究天体亮度、位置或光谱随时间的变化,关注超新星、变星、伽马暴和引力波事件等暂现源。它长期受限于望远镜难以对同一片天区反复巡天,数据存储与快速预警能力也不足。近十年来大视场巡天(如 ZTF)和自动化编目流水线让每晚发现成千上万个瞬变事件成为可能,该领域随之爆发式增长。�Time-domain astronomy studies how celestial objects change in brightness, position, or spectrum over time, focusing on transients such as supernovae, variable stars, gamma-ray bursts, and gravitational-wave events. For decades it was limited by telescopes that rarely revisited the same sky region and by insufficient data pipelines for rapid alerts. In recent years wide-field surveys like ZTF and automated classification pipelines that flag thousands of transient candidates per night have made the field explode.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�astro_20_014�body���天文数据常带有非高斯误差、删失(如探测上限)和复杂的选择效应,最小二乘的假设在这些情况下失效。贝叶斯框架能把先验知识、测量不确定度和选择函数统一写进似然函数,并用 MCMC 或嵌套采样给出参数的后验分布而非单点估计。这使得结果自带误差棒和模型比较能力,已成为 LSST 等大型巡天的标准工具链。��Astronomical data often carry non-Gaussian errors, censoring (e.g. detection limits), and complicated selection effects that violate least-squares assumptions. The Bayesian framework folds prior knowledge, measurement uncertainty, and the selection function into a single likelihood, then uses MCMC or nested sampling to deliver full posterior distributions instead of point estimates. This yields built-in error bars and model comparison, and it is now standard in the analysis pipelines of surveys like LSST.�ans��src��bFeigelson & Babu《Modern Statistical Methods for Astronomy》;LSST 数据管理科学验证文档ـFeigelson & Babu, Modern Statistical Methods for Astronomy with R Applications (Cambridge); LSST DM technical notes on inference��id�astro_21_001�body��c绝大多数系外行星由凌星法和视向速度法发现:前者捕捉行星凌星时恒星亮度的周期性下降,NASA的开普勒与TESS任务借此累计找到数千颗行星;后者测量恒星光谱的多普勒摆动,能直接给出行星质量。两种方法联用可同时确定行星半径与质量,进而推算密度并判断其内部构成。��Most known exoplanets come from the transit and radial-velocity methods: the former catches the periodic dips in starlight when a planet crosses its star's disk, which is how NASA's Kepler and TESS missions have racked up thousands of planets, while the latter measures the Doppler wobble of stellar spectra and yields planet masses directly. Used together, the two methods pin down both radius and mass, so densities and interior compositions can be inferred.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�astro_21_004�body���GW170817首次同时探测到双中子星并合的引力波、伽马射线暴和千新星电磁对应体,LIGO/Virgo的引力波信号与费米卫星的伽马射线触发仅相隔约1.7秒。随后全球数十台望远镜锁定宿主星系NGC 4993,证实金、铂等重元素在并合中经快中子俘获过程产生,并给出了独立的哈勃常数测量。该事件表明引力波与电磁波联合观测能获取任何单一信使都无法提供的信息。�WGW170817 detected gravitational waves from a binary neutron star merger together with its gamma-ray burst and kilonova counterpart, the LIGO/Virgo signal and Fermi's gamma-ray trigger separated by only about 1.7 seconds. Dozens of telescopes then pinned the event to host galaxy NGC 4993, confirming that heavy elements like gold and platinum are forged in the merger through rapid neutron capture and delivering an independent measurement of the Hubble constant. The event proved that combining gravitational-wave and electromagnetic observations yields information no single messenger can provide.�ans��src��KAbbott et al. (2017, Physical Review Letters);LIGO/Virgo 科学合作组织�RAbbott et al. (2017, Physical Review Letters); LIGO/Virgo Scientific Collaboration��id�astro_21_007�body���恒星在相隔半年两次观测之间的角位移等于日地平均距离在该星处的张角,1 角秒视差定义为 1 秒差距,约合 3.26 光年。大气湍流与折射把单站地面测量的精度压在几十毫角秒,可靠的视差样本长期局限于几百光年之内。伊巴谷天测卫星把精度推进到约 1 毫角秒,盖亚巡天进一步进入亚毫角秒区间,使数以亿计的恒星拥有了纯几何距离。�hThe angular shift of a star between observations taken six months apart equals the angle subtended by the mean Earth-Sun distance at that star; one arcsecond of parallax defines one parsec, roughly 3.26 light-years. Atmospheric turbulence and refraction cap single-site ground-based precision at a few dozen milliarcseconds, confining reliable parallax samples to within a few hundred light-years for generations. The Hipparcos astrometry satellite pushed accuracy to about one milliarcsecond, and the Gaia survey now reaches sub-milliarcsecond level, giving hundreds of millions of stars purely geometric distances.�ans��src��pvan Leeuwen,Astrophysics and Space Science 333:29 (2007);Gaia 合作组,Astronomy and Astrophysics 649:A1 (2021)�yvan Leeuwen, Astrophysics and Space Science 333, 29 (2007); Gaia Collaboration, Astronomy and Astrophysics 649, A1 (2021)��id�astro_21_010�body��层级成团预言尺度越大的结构成形越晚,但近红外选样光谱却显示最亮的椭圆星系早在红移二前后便完成了绝大部分恒星形成,而矮星系至今仍在经历旺盛的恒星诞生,恒星形成高峰随质量下降而逐级推迟,这种反序被命名为下行化。这说明重子物质的恒星形成效率受反馈过程和气体供给历史的调制,并不由暗物质并合的时刻单独决定。数值模拟只有在引入活动星系核反馈之后,才能重现大质量星系的提前熄火。��Hierarchical assembly predicts that structures of larger scale form later, yet near-infrared selected spectroscopy shows the brightest elliptical galaxies completed most of their star formation by around redshift two while dwarf galaxies still experience vigorous star birth today, the peak of star formation shifting progressively later toward lower masses, an inversion named downsizing. This indicates that the star-formation efficiency of baryons is modulated by feedback processes and gas supply history rather than dictated solely by dark-matter merger epochs. Numerical simulations reproduce the premature quenching of massive galaxies only once active-galactic-nucleus feedback is introduced.�ans��src��NCowie 等,Astronomical Journal 112:839 (1996);Thomas 等,Nature 433:740 (2005)�YCowie et al., Astronomical Journal 112, 839 (1996); Thomas et al., Nature 433, 740 (2005)��id�astro_21_011�body��当前景星系或星系团的引力场弯曲时空时,来自更远光源的光线会沿多条测地线路径到达观测者,因此同一目标可以呈现为两到四个分离的像,几何条件合适时还会连成一个爱因斯坦环。像的分离角由爱因斯坦半径决定,它随透镜质量、以及源-透镜-观测者三者的距离组合而变化,所以测量这个角度可以直接估计透镜系统的质量。强透镜还能放大背景天体的亮度和尺度,让本来看不见的高红移星系变得可研究。��When the gravitational field of a foreground galaxy or cluster curves spacetime, light from a more distant source reaches the observer along several geodesic paths at once, so one target can appear as two to four separate images; under favorable geometry they merge into an Einstein ring. The image separation is set by the Einstein radius, which depends on the lens mass and the distances among source, lens, and observer, so measuring that angle yields a direct estimate of the lens system's mass. Strong lensing also magnifies the brightness and apparent size of background objects, bringing otherwise invisible high-redshift galaxies into reach.�ans��src��sSchneider, Ehlers & Falco《Gravitational Lenses》(Springer);NASA/ESA Hubble Space Telescope 强透镜巡天图像�xSchneider, Ehlers & Falco, Gravitational Lenses (Springer); NASA/ESA Hubble Space Telescope strong-lensing survey images��id�astro_22_001�body���宇宙早期是高温等离子体，光子被自由电子反复散射，无法自由传播。约在大爆炸后38万年，温度降至3000 K上下，质子与电子复合成中性原子，光子解耦后一路传播至今。宇宙膨胀把这些光子的波长拉伸了约1100倍，黑体谱温度随之降为如今的约2.725 K，成为宇宙起源于炽热致密状态的最直接证据。�In the early Universe a hot plasma filled space, and photons were scattered over and over by free electrons, unable to travel freely. About 380,000 years after the Big Bang the temperature fell to roughly 3000 K, protons and electrons recombined into neutral atoms, and the photons decoupled and have streamed freely ever since. Cosmic expansion stretched their wavelengths by a factor of about 1100, cooling their blackbody spectrum to about 2.725 K today - the most direct evidence that the Universe began in a hot, dense state.�ans��src��WFixsen, D. J.《宇宙微波背景的温度》The Astrophysical Journal 707, 916 (2009)ُD. J. Fixsen, 'The Temperature of the Cosmic Microwave Background', The Astrophysical Journal 707, 916 (2009), DOI: 10.1088/0004-637X/707/2/916��id�astro_22_004�body���强磁暴期间，携带着南向行星际磁场的抛射物与地球磁层发生磁重联，大量能量注入使环电流增强、地表磁场剧烈起伏。依照法拉第电磁感应定律，快速变化的磁场会在长距离输电线路、油气管道等良导体中激发地磁感应电流，使变压器直流偏磁饱和、异常发热乃至损坏。1989年3月的大磁暴就让加拿大魁北克电网在约一分半钟内全线崩溃。�.During a severe storm, ejecta carrying a southward interplanetary magnetic field reconnects with Earth's magnetosphere; the injected energy intensifies the ring current and makes the ground-level magnetic field fluctuate rapidly. By Faraday's law of induction, these swift variations drive geomagnetically induced currents along long conducting paths such as power lines and pipelines, biasing transformers into half-cycle saturation, overheating and damaging them. The great March 1989 storm collapsed the entire Quebec power grid in roughly ninety seconds.�ans��src��jBoteler, D. H. 等《地磁扰动对地表电气系统的影响》Advances in Space Research 22, 17 (1998)ٮD. H. Boteler, R. J. Pirjola & H. Nevanlinna, 'The effects of geomagnetic disturbances on electrical systems at the Earth's surface', Advances in Space Research 22, 17 (1998)��id�astro_22_007�body���在行星参考系里，双曲线飞掠只改变探测器速度的方向，进入与离开时的相对速率相同。但行星本身正以每秒数十公里的速度绕太阳运行，把两个参考系叠加起来看，探测器相对太阳的速度矢量被偏向了加速方向，日心系动能随之增加。这份能量取自行星绕日的轨道能量，由于行星质量极其巨大，其轨道改变小得永远无法测出。��In the planet's reference frame, a hyperbolic flyby merely rotates the spacecraft's velocity vector: the departure speed equals the arrival speed. The planet, however, orbits the Sun at tens of kilometers per second, so combining the two frames shows the heliocentric velocity bent toward a faster direction, raising its kinetic energy around the Sun. That energy comes from the planet's own orbital motion, whose change is far too tiny ever to measure.�ans��src�٤Flandro G. A., Fast Reconnaissance Missions to the Outer Solar System Using Energy Derived from the Gravitational Field of Jupiter, Acta Astronautica 12, 329 (1966)٤G. A. Flandro, Fast Reconnaissance Missions to the Outer Solar System Using Energy Derived from the Gravitational Field of Jupiter, Acta Astronautica 12, 329 (1966)��id�astro_22_010�body���关键在于两点。火星表面重力只有地球的百分之三十八左右，地壳可以承受更高的火山堆叠而不崩塌；同时火星没有地球式的板块运动，岩石圈长期固定在地幔热柱上方，熔岩在同一地点持续喷发、层层堆积数十亿年，最终垒成单一巨盾，而非像夏威夷那样随板块移动排成岛链。奥林帕斯山因此成为太阳系已知最高的火山之一。�␀Two conditions matter. Martian surface gravity is only about thirty-eight percent of Earth's, so the crust can support far taller volcanic stacks without collapsing. Mars also lacks Earth-style plate tectonics: its lithosphere stayed anchored above a long-lived mantle plume, letting lava erupt and pile up layer upon layer at one site for billions of years, building a single colossal shield instead of an island chain like Hawaii. Hence Olympus Mons ranks among the tallest known volcanoes in the solar system.�ans��src��ACarr M. H., The Surface of Mars, Cambridge University Press, 2006�FMichael H. Carr, The Surface of Mars, Cambridge University Press, 2006��id�astro_22_011�body���传统上宜居环境以地表液态水和温和温度为准。极端微生物能在强辐射、高温、高盐或深地下的环境中存活并高效修复DNA损伤，说明生命耐受边界远比想象更宽。天体生物学因此把地下卤水、冰壳之下的海洋等先前被排除的环境纳入搜寻范围，把宜居标准改写为液态水、可用能量与关键元素三者兼备。��Habitability was once judged by surface liquid water and mild temperatures. Extremophiles survive strong radiation, high heat, salinity, or deep subsurface conditions and repair DNA damage efficiently, showing life's physical limits are far broader than assumed. Astrobiology therefore includes subsurface brines and oceans beneath ice shells in its searches, redefining habitability as the simultaneous presence of liquid water, usable energy, and biologically key elements.�ans��src��kRothschild L. J. & Mancinelli R. L., Life in extreme environments, Nature 409 (2001), DOI: 10.1038/35059215�kRothschild L. J. & Mancinelli R. L., Life in extreme environments, Nature 409 (2001), DOI: 10.1038/35059215��id�astro_22_014�body���湍流让波前不停畸变，星像被抖散成一角秒左右的光斑。自适应光学用亮星或钠激光导星实时测量波前误差，驱动变形镜以每秒上千次频率施加反向补偿，把能量重新聚拢到接近衍射极限的核内。这使大型地基望远镜在近红外波段获得近乎太空的分辨本领，也是极大望远镜不可或缺的关键技术。��Turbulence keeps bending incoming wavefronts, smearing stars into blobs about one arcsecond wide. An adaptive optics system measures those errors in real time with a bright star or a sodium laser guide star, then drives a deformable mirror applying opposite corrections up to a thousand times per second, refocusing the light into a core approaching the diffraction limit. This gives large ground-based telescopes near-space resolution in the near-infrared and is indispensable for extremely large telescopes.�ans��src�ٕDavies R. & Kasper M., Adaptive Optics for Astronomy, Annual Review of Astronomy and Astrophysics 50 (2012), DOI: 10.1146/annurev-astro-081811-125447ٕDavies R. & Kasper M., Adaptive Optics for Astronomy, Annual Review of Astronomy and Astrophysics 50 (2012), DOI: 10.1146/annurev-astro-081811-125447��id�astro_23_007�body���统一模型认为宽线区半径仅光日量级、紧贴黑洞，被外圈几秒差距尺度的尘埃环遮挡；视线掠过环侧的天体（如赛弗特2型）看不到宽线，只露出范围大得多的窄线区。关键证据是偏振：NGC 1068的散射光经偏振测量显出隐藏的宽线，证明宽线区存在只是被遮住；此类天体强烈的X射线重吸收也与这一几何一致。��In the unified model, the broad-line region is compact (light-day scales) and hugs the black hole, hidden from side-on views by a dusty torus a few parsecs across; only the much larger narrow-line region stays visible, giving type 2 spectra. The decisive evidence is polarimetry: in NGC 1068, polarized light revealed broad lines scattered into our line of sight, proving the hidden region exists, and the strong X-ray absorption in such sources matches the same geometry.�ans��src��;Antonucci & Miller, ApJ 297, 621 (1985), doi:10.1086/163559�_Antonucci & Miller, ApJ 297, 621 (1985), doi:10.1086/163559 (polarized broad lines in NGC 1068)��id�astro_23_011�body��爆发中新合成的镍-56（半衰期约6天）经β+衰变变为钴-56，后者再衰变为稳定铁-56，半衰期约77天。当抛射物膨胀变得光学薄后，这两步衰变释放的伽马射线与正电子成为主要能源，晚期光度因此按钴-56的半衰期指数下降。SN 1987A的测光证实了该机制，也表明铁峰元素确产生于爆发性核燃烧。��Freshly synthesized nickel-56 (half-life about 6 days) beta-decays into cobalt-56, which decays to stable iron-56 with a half-life near 77 days. Once the expanding ejecta turn optically thin, gamma rays and positrons from this chain dominate the energy budget, so the late luminosity fades exponentially on the cobalt-56 half-life. Photometry of SN 1987A confirmed the mechanism and showed that iron-peak elements are truly forged in explosive nuclear burning.�ans��src��fW. D. Arnett，《天体物理杂志》（ApJ）第253卷第785页，1982年；SN 1987A测光检验。�SW. D. Arnett, Astrophysical Journal 253, 785 (1982); tested by SN 1987A photometry.��id�astro_23_014�body���长周期彗星源于奥尔特云：早期被巨行星散射到数千至数万天文单位远的冰体，长期受银河系潮汐力作用，轨道面已充分随机化，故来向任意。短周期彗星则来自扁薄的柯伊伯带与散射盘，那里保留着原行星盘的几何形态，成员经共振或相互摄动迁入内太阳系时，仍带着小倾角与顺行特征。��Long-period comets come from the Oort Cloud: icy bodies flung by the giant planets to thousands of astronomical units, where the Galactic tide has spent billions of years randomizing their orbital planes, so they return from arbitrary directions. Short-period comets instead originate in the flattened Kuiper Belt and scattered disk, which retain the primordial disk's geometry; members nudged inward through resonances carry small inclinations and prograde motion.�ans��src�ٞJ. H. Oort，《荷兰天文学会公报》（BAN）第11卷第91页，1950年；J. Fernández，《皇家天文学会月报》第192卷第481页，1980年。٧J. H. Oort, Bulletin of the Astronomical Institutes of the Netherlands 11, 91 (1950); J. Fernández, Monthly Notices of the Royal Astronomical Society 192, 481 (1980).��id�astro_24_001�body���靠「凌星透射光谱」。当行星从母恒星前方经过,恒星的光会有一小部分穿过行星大气边缘再到达我们;不同分子只在特定波长上吸收光,把凌星时与凌星外的光谱相除,吸收特征的「指纹」便浮现出来——钠钾的吸收线、水汽与甲烷的宽带、乃至金属蒸气。詹姆斯·韦布望远镜凭借6.5米口径与红外灵敏度,已能在一颗系外行星大气中清晰识别出二氧化碳。� Through transmission spectroscopy during transits. As a planet crosses its star's disk, a sliver of starlight skims through the planet's atmospheric limb before reaching us; molecules absorb only at characteristic wavelengths, so dividing the in-transit spectrum by the out-of-transit one reveals fingerprints — sodium and potassium lines, broad water and methane bands, even metal vapors. With its 6.5-meter mirror and infrared sensitivity, the James Webb Space Telescope has now cleanly identified carbon dioxide in an exoplanet atmosphere.�ans��src�ٗSeager 与 Sasselov,《Theoretical Transmission Spectra during Extrasolar Giant Planet Transits》,The Astrophysical Journal,2000 (DOI: 10.1086/309088)ٓSeager & Sasselov, 'Theoretical Transmission Spectra during Extrasolar Giant Planet Transits', The Astrophysical Journal, 2000, DOI: 10.1086/309088��id�astro_24_004�body��.宇宙始于近乎均匀但带有微小密度涨落的气体。引力是「嫌贫爱富」的不稳定放大器:密度略高的区域吸引更多物质,越富越吸;略稀疏的区域则被抽空。暗物质占总物质的八成以上且不发光不碰撞,先在自身引力下坍缩成巨大的暗物质晕并连成纤维状骨架,普通气体顺骨架流入晕中点亮为星系。数值模拟重现出的宇宙网与红移巡天绘制的三维地图高度一致——纤维、壁、节点与空洞,正是初始涟漪历经百亿年引力放大的模样。�WThe universe began nearly homogeneous but with tiny density ripples. Gravity is an unstable amplifier that favors the rich: slightly denser patches attract more matter while underdense ones get drained. Dark matter, over eighty percent of the cosmic mass and both invisible and collisionless, collapsed first into vast halos threaded by filamentary scaffolds; gas flowed along the filaments into halos and lit up as galaxies. Simulations reproduce this cosmic web, and redshift surveys map exactly the filaments, walls, nodes and voids that those primordial ripples grew into over ten billion years.�ans��src��nBond、Kofman 与 Pogosyan,《How filaments of galaxies are woven into the cosmic web》,Nature 第380卷,1996�pJ. R. Bond, L. Kofman and D. Pogosyan, How filaments of galaxies are woven into the cosmic web, Nature 380, 1996��id�astro_24_008�body��(广义相对论允许大质量天体弯折光线,当前景星系恰好横在类星体与地球之间且近乎对准,星光沿两侧对称路径同时到达——我们看到两个同源像,光谱一致,只是时间延迟数天到数百天。若对准完美,像被拉成环绕前景天体的光弧,即爱因斯坦环。1979年沃尔什等人发现的孪生类星体Q0957+561是首个确认案例,透镜从此成为称重工具:像间距与环半径直接量出前景天体总质量(含不发光的暗物质),时间延迟还能倒推宇宙膨胀速率。�kGeneral relativity lets massive bodies bend light. When a foreground galaxy sits almost precisely between quasar and Earth, rays travel two symmetric paths around it and arrive together — two images of one source, spectra identical but delayed by days to hundreds of days. Near-perfect alignment stretches the image into a luminous ring around the lens: an Einstein ring. The 1979 double quasar Q0957+561 was the first confirmed case; lensing since became a weighing tool, because image separation and ring radii measure total lens mass including dark matter, and time delays even probe the universe's expansion rate.�ans��src��xWalsh、Carswell 与 Weymann,《0957+561 A, B: Twin Quasistellar Objects or Gravitational Lens?》,Nature 第279卷,1979�}D. Walsh, R. F. Carswell and R. J. Weymann, 0957+561 A, B: Twin Quasistellar Objects or Gravitational Lens?, Nature 279, 1979��id�astro_24_020�body���1900年代哈佛天文台的计算员亨丽爱塔·勒维特研究麦哲伦云中的变星,在1777颗样本里确认了25颗造父变星,并发现关键规律:造父变星的光变周期越长,平均亮度越高——由于云内成员距离相近可视为同处一线,周期与光度的严格关系由此确立。这意味着造父变星是自带标尺的灯:测出周期得到真实亮度,再比观测亮度即可反推距离,几百万光年外也能丈量。哈勃正是用它确认仙女座在银河系之外,并进而发现宇宙膨胀。聋哑的她生前署名权寥寥,如今造父变星被称为宇宙距离阶梯的第一级横档。��Around 1908 the Harvard computer Henrietta Leavitt, working through a sample of 1,777 variable stars in the Magellanic Clouds and picking out 25 Cepheids among them, found the key law: longer-period Cepheids shine brighter on average, and since Cloud members share one distance the period-luminosity relation held strictly. Cepheids became lamps carrying their own rulers: read the period for true brightness, compare with apparent brightness, invert for distance millions of light-years away. Hubble used them to place Andromeda beyond our galaxy, then discovered cosmic expansion. Deaf and barely credited alive, Leavitt now names the first rung of the cosmic distance ladder.�ans��src�ىLeavitt 与 Pickering,《Periods of 25 Variable Stars in the Small Magellanic Cloud»,Harvard College Observatory Circular 第173卷,1912ٍH. S. Leavitt and E. C. Pickering, Periods of 25 Variable Stars in the Small Magellanic Cloud, Harvard College Observatory Circular 173, 1912��id�astro_26_009�body���因为氢分子只能在尘埃遮蔽紫外线、低温高密的环境里大量存活,这类云正是新恒星集中诞生之处,猎户座星云便是近旁实例。巨分子云的质量远超金斯质量,本应整体快速坍缩,实际上却由湍流运动、磁场与热压力共同支撑,维持数百万年的准稳态;湍流又把云碎裂成众多致密核,各核分别坍缩成星团,所以恒星往往成批出生。�CMolecular hydrogen survives in bulk only where dust screens out ultraviolet light inside cold, dense clouds, and such clouds are exactly where new stars gather to be born, the Orion nebula being a nearby case. Although far more massive than their Jeans mass and thus prone to rapid global collapse, giant molecular clouds are propped up by turbulent motions, magnetic fields and thermal pressure in a quasi-steady state lasting millions of years, while turbulence fragments them into dense cores that collapse separately into clusters, which is why stars tend to form in batches.�ans��src�ٳShu、Adams 与 Lizano,《Star Formation in Molecular Clouds: Observation and Theory》,Annual Review of Astronomy and Astrophysics,1987 (DOI: 10.1146/annurev.aa.25.090187.000323)ٮShu, Adams & Lizano, 'Star Formation in Molecular Clouds: Observation and Theory', Annual Review of Astronomy and Astrophysics, 1987, DOI: 10.1146/annurev.aa.25.090187.000323��id�astro_26_013�body��#因为哈勃定律让红移直接对应距离:宇宙膨胀把星光整体拉长,在低红移下距离近似等于光速乘以红移再除以哈勃常数,一条光谱便是一把量尺。巡天批量采集星系光谱后,天球上的二维投影沿视线方向展开,显露出星系墙、巨洞与纤维交织的宇宙网,CfA 巡天的窄片图首次绘出该结构,斯隆数字巡天更将其扩展至上百万个星系。只是在小红移处,星系自身数百公里每秒的本动速度会混入退行速度,需按速度场模型加以改正。��Because Hubble's law ties redshift directly to distance: cosmic expansion stretches starlight, and at low redshift the distance is approximately cz divided by the Hubble constant, so a single spectrum doubles as a rangefinder. Once surveys collect spectra in bulk, the sky's two-dimensional projection unfolds along the line of sight, exposing walls, voids and filaments of the cosmic web; the CfA survey's narrow slice charts drew them first, and the Sloan Digital Sky Survey extended the census past a million galaxies. At small distances, however, peculiar velocities of hundreds of km/s contaminate the recession speed and must be corrected with flow models.�ans��src���V. de Lapparent、M. Geller 与 J. Huchra,1986年,The Astrophysical Journal,302卷L1页:CfA 切片揭示星系巨墙;D. York 等人,2000年,The Astronomical Journal,120卷1579页:斯隆数字巡天技术概要��V. de Lapparent, M. Geller & J. Huchra 1986, ApJ, 302, L1 - A slice of the universe revealing the Great Wall; D. York et al. 2000, AJ, 120, 1579 - The Sloan Digital Sky Survey technical overview��id�astro_26_016�body��这就是所谓的“巧合难题”(coincidence problem)。物质密度随膨胀按体积三次方稀释,辐射稀释得更快,唯有暗能量近似恒定:早期物质遥遥领先,红移约零点七时宇宙率先转入加速膨胀,直到红移零点三附近暗能量密度才反超物质。若两者天然量级悬殊,“今天”恰逢交接时刻的概率极低。流行的出路包括人择选择——只有真空能足够小的宇宙才养得出星系和观察者——以及弦理论景观中真空能量的随机分布。�uThis is the coincidence problem. Matter density dilutes with the inverse cube of the scale factor and radiation even faster, whereas dark energy stays nearly constant: matter dominated overwhelmingly early on, accelerated expansion began around redshift seven tenths, and dark energy overtakes matter only near redshift three tenths. If the two were born wildly different in magnitude, the chance that today lands just when they cross is tiny. Popular escapes include anthropic selection - only universes with small enough vacuum energy grow galaxies and observers - and random vacuum energies across the string-theory landscape.�ans��src���S. M. Carroll,2001年,Living Reviews in Relativity,4卷1号:The Cosmological Constant;P. J. E. Peebles 与 B. Ratra,2003年,Reviews of Modern Physics,75卷559页:The Cosmological Constant and Dark Energy��S. M. Carroll 2001, Living Reviews in Relativity, 4, 1 - The Cosmological Constant; P. J. E. Peebles & B. Ratra 2003, Reviews of Modern Physics, 75, 559 - The Cosmological Constant and Dark Energy��id�astro_26_019�body���直接证据来自伽马射线:高能质子撞击星际气体中的原子核,先产生中性π介子,再衰变为一对伽马光子,Fermi 卫星在银盘和多个分子云方向都测到与气体分布吻合的此类辐射,说明质子确实在与介质碰撞。另一条线索是电离:宇宙线能钻进紫外光照不进的稠密云核,H3+ 离子的吸收线由此推出可观的中性电离率。此外宇宙线压强显著支撑着星际气体,参与抵抗自引力坍缩。��The direct evidence comes from gamma rays: a high-energy proton striking a nucleus in interstellar gas produces a neutral pion that decays into a pair of gamma-ray photons, and the Fermi satellite has detected exactly this radiation across the Galactic plane and toward several molecular clouds, tracking the gas distribution and proving that protons really collide with the medium. Another clue is ionization: cosmic rays reach dense cloud cores that ultraviolet light cannot penetrate, and absorption lines of H3+ ions translate into a measurable ionization rate there. Cosmic-ray pressure also materially supports interstellar gas against self-gravity.�ans��src���M. Ackermann 等人(Fermi-LAT),2013年,Science,339卷807页:在 IC443 与 W44 探测到π介子衰变特征;B. J. McCall 等人,2003年,Nature,422卷500页:H3+ 谱线推证英仙座ζ方向宇宙线通量增强��M. Ackermann et al. (Fermi-LAT) 2013, Science, 339, 807 - Detection of the characteristic pion-decay signature in supernova remnants; B. J. McCall et al. 2003, Nature, 422, 500 - Enhanced cosmic-ray flux toward zeta Persei inferred from H3+ spectrum��id�b05906958ece�body�٥这台位于智利的大视场巡天望远镜每三夜扫描整片天空，十年积累海量数据，用于捕捉瞬变天体、近地小行星和暗能量演化。��This large-survey telescope in Chile will scan the whole sky every three nights, accumulating a decade of massive data to catch transient objects, near-Earth asteroids and dark-energy evolution.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�b0975e35f4b3�body�ه它们用放射性同位素电源（核电池）把钚衰变的热转为电，不依赖阳光，能在沙尘暴和夜里持续工作。ٟThey use radioisotope power (nuclear batteries) converting plutonium decay heat to electricity, independent of sunlight, working through dust storms and night.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�b20eec162c2b�body��{恒星的颜色由表面温度决定：温度高的偏蓝白色，温度低的偏橙红色，这遵循黑体辐射规律。هA star's color reflects its surface temperature: hotter stars appear blue-white, cooler ones orange-red, following blackbody radiation.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�b2b2543b1ef7�body��宇宙年龄由哈勃常数 H0、物质密度与暗能量密度共同决定，可表述为这些参数积分得到的宇宙时。普朗克卫星结合 CMB 温度与偏振涨落拟合 ΛCDM 模型，得出宇宙年龄 13.80 ± 0.02 Ga。该结果与最老球状星团年龄相互印证。�The cosmic age follows from integrating cosmic time in terms of H0, matter density, and dark-energy density. Planck's CMB temperature and polarization fluctuation fit to ΛCDM yields 13.80 ± 0.02 Gyr, consistent with the ages of the oldest globular clusters.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�b3d73c2bf091�body�٢恒星级黑洞由大质量恒星核心坍缩而成；超大质量黑洞存在于星系中心，成因仍与早期宇宙气体直接坍缩或黑洞并合有关。ٲStellar black holes form from the core collapse of massive stars; supermassive ones sit at galaxy centers and likely grew from direct collapse of early gas or successive mergers.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�b3f477dfb335�body��火星轨道器拍摄到了干涸的河谷网络、扇形三角洲和湖底层状沉积物，它们只有长期流动的液态水才能形成。好奇号与毅力号还在古湖床发现了河流冲刷形成的鹅卵石和只能在水中生成的黏土矿物。�$Mars orbiters have imaged dried river valleys, fan-shaped deltas and layered lakebed sediments, which only long-lived flowing water could have created. Rovers Curiosity and Perseverance have additionally found water-worn pebbles and clay minerals that form only in water in ancient lake beds.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�b496c48b1fb1�body�ٟ主小行星带位于火星和木星轨道之间，包含数百万颗岩石与金属小天体。木星的强大引力阻止了它们聚集成为一颗行星。��The main asteroid belt lies between the orbits of Mars and Jupiter and holds millions of rocky and metallic bodies. Jupiter's strong gravity prevented them from assembling into a single planet.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�b66e3e3d8cb3�body��"恒星越大，核心的温度和压强越高，氢聚变燃烧得越猛烈。恒星的光度大约随质量的3.5次方增长，所以一颗质量为太阳10倍的恒星，燃料消耗要快上千倍，寿命只有几千万年。太阳这种中等恒星反而能稳定燃烧约100亿年。�fThe more massive a star, the hotter and denser its core and the faster hydrogen fuses there. A star's luminosity grows roughly as the 3.5th power of its mass, so a star ten times the Sun's mass burns fuel a thousand times faster and lives only tens of millions of years. A middleweight star like the Sun can instead burn steadily for about ten billion years.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�b6e2122c2f03�body�ٟ北斗由多颗卫星不停播发带精确时间戳的信号，接收机测出几颗卫星信号的到达时间差，用三角定位算出经纬度与高度。ٹBeidou satellites broadcast signals with precise timestamps; a receiver measures arrival-time differences from several satellites and triangulates your latitude, longitude and altitude.�ans��src��e国务院新闻办公室《2021中国的航天》白皮书：北斗卫星导航定位原理（2022）�`SCIO white paper 'China's Space Program: A 2021 Perspective': BeiDou positioning principle, 2022��id�b79824a2ad74�body��P太阳耀斑是磁重联瞬间释放的电磁辐射爆发，主要在 X 射线与紫外波段突然增亮，几乎不抛射大量物质。日冕物质抛射则伴随等离子体团的抛射，携带磁场与物质进入行星际空间，二者常同源出现但物理后果不同：前者影响电离层，后者更易引发地磁暴。��A solar flare is a sudden burst of electromagnetic radiation from magnetic reconnection, flashing mainly in X-ray and ultraviolet light with little bulk material ejected. A coronal mass ejection accompanies the expulsion of a plasma cloud carrying magnetic field into interplanetary space; the two often share a source but differ in effect, flares disturbing the ionosphere and CMEs more readily driving geomagnetic storms.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�b95055687dab�body��最常用的两类是凌星法（行星从恒星前方经过时使星光规律变暗）和视向速度法（行星引力让恒星轻微摆动，光谱线周期性红蓝偏移）。此外还有直接成像、微引力透镜和天体测量等方法作为补充。�-The two most used methods are the transit method (a planet dims its star regularly as it passes in front) and the radial-velocity method (a planet's gravity makes the star wobble slightly, shifting spectral lines periodically red and blue). Direct imaging, microlensing and astrometry supplement them.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�b9f30f10e240�body��
热木星是质量接近木星、却以极近轨道（仅几天周期）绕恒星运行的气态巨行星，表面温度极高。1995年飞马座51b 的发现颠覆了“巨行星应形成于远处”的传统认识，迫使理论家重新思考行星迁移机制。�␀Hot Jupiters are Jupiter-mass gas giants on extremely close orbits (periods of days) with very high temperatures. The 1995 discovery of 51 Pegasi b overturned the assumption that giant planets form far out, forcing theorists to rethink planetary migration.�ans��src��eMayor, Queloz,《A Jupiter-mass companion to a solar-type star》,Nature,1995 (DOI: 10.1038/378355a0)�cMayor, Queloz, 'A Jupiter-mass companion to a solar-type star', Nature, 1995, DOI: 10.1038/378355a0��id�bf7020784b76�body��钱德拉塞卡极限约为 1.4 倍太阳质量，是白矮星靠电子简并压能支撑自身引力的最大质量。超过此极限，电子简并压无法抗衡引力，白矮星将坍缩（通常引发 Ia 型超新星）。它标定了低质量恒星演化的终点。�The Chandrasekhar limit is about 1.4 solar masses, the maximum mass a white dwarf can support by electron degeneracy pressure. Beyond it, degeneracy pressure fails and the dwarf collapses (typically triggering a Type Ia supernova). It marks the endpoint of low-mass stellar evolution.�ans��src��BChandrasekhar 1931, ApJ 74, 81《理想白矮星的最大质量》�JChandrasekhar (1931), ApJ 74, 81, 'The Maximum Mass of Ideal White Dwarfs'��id�c0e595fdbea3�body��f暗能量是推动宇宙加速膨胀的神秘力量，约占宇宙总能量的68%。它在空间里表现为一种近乎均匀的排斥性压力，与暗物质正好相反。1998年科学家通过观测遥远超新星发现宇宙在加速膨胀后，暗能量才进入主流视野，它最像爱因斯坦提出的宇宙学常数，但本质仍然是个谜。��Dark energy is the mysterious force driving the universe's expansion to accelerate, making up about 68 percent of the total energy budget. It acts as a nearly uniform repulsive pressure filling space, the opposite of dark matter's clustering effect. It entered the mainstream after the 1998 discovery, from distant supernovae, that expansion is speeding up; it resembles Einstein's cosmological constant, though its true nature remains a mystery.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�c10987a80c2f�body���氢同位素比对显示，多数彗星的水氘/氢比远高于地球海洋，而一类碳质球粒陨石的水同位素与地球接近。因此主流观点认为地球水主要来自类型相近的小行星，彗星贡献较小。�Hydrogen isotope ratios show most comets have D/H far higher than Earth's oceans, whereas certain carbonaceous chondrites match Earth's water. The prevailing view is that Earth's water came mainly from similar asteroids, with only minor cometary contribution.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�c1ccd87c99d8�body��w3颗可算出经纬高三维位置，第4颗用来校正接收机时钟误差，才能得到准确的时间和位置。�dThree give 3D position; a fourth corrects the receiver's clock error for accurate time and location.�ans��src��G国务院新闻办公室《2021中国的航天》航天白皮书，2022�^State Council Information Office: China's Space Program: A 2021 Perspective, white paper, 2022��id�c44100ca27c7�body���包括绕火星飞行的轨道器（如火星勘测轨道器）、着陆与巡视的“好奇号”“毅力号”火星车，以及我国的“天问一号”等，它们寻找水的痕迹与生命线索。يThey include orbiters (like MRO), rovers such as Curiosity and Perseverance, and China's Tianwen-1, searching for water and signs of life.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�c5fbf72c3b23�body���盖亚以极高精度测量十亿余颗恒星的天球位置、自行与视差，视差直接给出距离，自行揭示横向运动，再结合测光得到温度与光度。其数据革命性地绘制了银河系的三维结构与运动学。�"Gaia measures positions, proper motions, and parallaxes for over a billion stars with extreme precision; parallax gives distance directly, proper motion reveals transverse motion, and photometry yields temperature and luminosity—revolutionizing the 3D map and kinematics of the Milky Way.�ans��src��pvan Leeuwen,Astrophysics and Space Science 333:29 (2007);Gaia 合作组,Astronomy and Astrophysics 649:A1 (2021)�yvan Leeuwen, Astrophysics and Space Science 333, 29 (2007); Gaia Collaboration, Astronomy and Astrophysics 649, A1 (2021)��id�c610782af037�body���耀变体是喷流几乎正对地球的活动星系核，相对论性集束效应把光度与变幅放大、把时标压缩。喷流内激波与磁重联在近黑洞尺度上快速变化，因而在数小时到数天内就能观测到显著光变。�	Blazars are active galactic nuclei whose jets point nearly at Earth; relativistic beaming amplifies luminosity and compresses timescales. Shocks and magnetic reconnection in the jet vary rapidly near the black hole, producing notable variability from hours to days.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�c6803ec1a854�body�٩2019年事件视界望远镜（EHT）公布了室女座M87星系中心超大质量黑洞的首张直接图像。2022年又发布了银河系中心人马座A*的图像。��In 2019 the Event Horizon Telescope released the first direct image of the supermassive black hole at the center of the galaxy M87 in Virgo. In 2022 it also imaged Sagittarius A* at our own galactic center.�ans��src��'事件视界望远镜合作组（EHT）�+Event Horizon Telescope (EHT) Collaboration��id�c8d357dc21d4�body�ّ伊斯兰历是纯阴历，一年12个朔望月约354天，比太阳年短约11天，所以节日相对季节不断前移，不与寒暑绑定。ٟThe Islamic calendar is purely lunar—12 months of about 354 days, ~11 short of a solar year—so its holidays drift earlier each year, untied to the seasons.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�c8efcc279403�body�ٴ超级地球是质量介于地球与海王星之间（约1到10倍地球质量）的系外行星，多为岩石或岩石与气体的混合体，太阳系内并没有这类行星。ٍA super-Earth has a mass between Earth's and Neptune's (about 1–10 Earth masses), often rocky or a rock-gas mix; the solar system has none.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�c9bcafbb2426�body��白矮星是太阳这类恒星死后的残骸，质量接近太阳却被压缩到地球大小，密度高达每立方厘米约100万克，一茶匙就有好几吨重。它靠电子的简并压力支撑，电子被挤到不能再靠近，才抵挡住引力继续坍缩。��A white dwarf is the leftover core of a star like the Sun, packing about a solar mass into an Earth-sized object, so its density reaches roughly one million grams per cubic centimetre and a teaspoonful weighs several tonnes. It is held up by electron degeneracy pressure: electrons squeezed so tightly they resist any closer packing, which stops gravity from crushing the star further.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�cabcaadafcef�body��V大红斑是木星南半球一个比地球还大的反气旋风暴，由木星内部热量驱动而不是靠表面日照维持。木星没有固态表面的摩擦耗散，且周围急流不断向其输送角动量，使这个涡旋能长期自我维持。朱诺号测得它深度可达数百公里，是木星大气动力学结构的产物。��The Great Red Spot is an anticyclonic storm in Jupiter's southern hemisphere larger than Earth, driven by the planet's internal heat rather than surface sunlight. Jupiter lacks a solid surface to dissipate it through friction, and surrounding jets continually feed it angular momentum, letting the vortex sustain itself. Juno measurements show it extends hundreds of kilometers deep, a product of the planet's atmospheric dynamics.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�cc41380f328a�body��脉冲星是高速自转的中子星，拥有极强且倾斜的磁场，沿磁极发出射电等辐射束。随着星体自转，辐射束像灯塔一样周期性扫过地球，于是被探测为极其规律的脉冲信号，由贝尔·伯内尔于1967年发现。�Pulsars are rapidly spinning neutron stars with very strong, tilted magnetic fields that beam radio emission from their poles. As the star rotates, the beam sweeps past Earth like a lighthouse, producing extremely regular pulses—discovered by Jocelyn Bell Burnell in 1967.�ans��src��O乔斯林·贝尔·伯内尔与安东尼·休伊什（1967，脉冲星发现）�+Jocelyn Bell Burnell & Antony Hewish (1967)��id�cd2773fa5d43�body��_火星北极有一层由水冰构成的永久极冠，厚度可达数公里；南极永久极冠则以二氧化碳干冰为主，其下覆盖着水冰。冬季大气中的二氧化碳凝结到极冠上，使极冠明显扩大，春季干冰升华又使其缩小。这种季节性的二氧化碳循环导致火星两极的大小年复一年地涨落。��The permanent northern polar cap of Mars is made of water ice several kilometers thick, while the permanent southern cap is dominated by carbon-dioxide ice, with water ice beneath it. In winter, carbon dioxide from the atmosphere condenses onto the caps, making them expand dramatically, and in spring the dry ice sublimates away, shrinking them. This seasonal carbon-dioxide cycle drives the annual waxing and waning of the Martian polar caps.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�ce9b726fbc57�body��q猎户座大星云距离我们约 1350 光年，是离地球最近的大质量恒星形成区，其中不仅有发光的电离氢区，还包裹着正在坍缩的分子云和数百颗年轻的恒星。望远镜能直接分辨出原恒星、环绕的尘埃盘和被电离气体包围的年轻恒星，让天文学家得以观察恒星从诞生到成熟的整个过程。�vAbout 1,350 light-years away, the Orion Nebula is the nearest large star-forming region. It contains a glowing ionized-hydrogen region plus the molecular cloud collapsing within it and hundreds of young stars. Telescopes can resolve protostars, surrounding dusty disks and young stars embedded in ionized gas, letting astronomers watch star formation from birth to maturity.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�d11c9e705584�body��约50亿年后，太阳核心的氢将耗尽，它会膨胀成一颗红巨星，可能吞没水星和金星。再过数十亿年，外层物质抛散形成行星状星云，核心留下一颗致密的白矮星，逐渐冷却变暗。这是类似太阳质量恒星的典型归宿。�@In about 5 billion years the Sun will exhaust the hydrogen in its core and swell into a red giant, possibly engulfing Mercury and Venus. After more billions of years it will shed its outer layers as a planetary nebula, leaving a dense white dwarf that slowly cools and fades. This is the typical fate of a Sun-like star.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d17bbfbc6e77�body�ف赫罗图以恒星的光谱类型（温度）为横轴、光度为纵轴作图，能直观展示恒星的演化阶段和分类。٣The Hertzsprung-Russell diagram plots stars by spectral type (temperature) against luminosity, revealing their evolutionary stages and classifications at a glance.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�d23ab551eaec�body���恒星颜色由其表面温度决定：蓝白色恒星温度高（上万开尔文），黄色如太阳约 5800 K，红色恒星较冷（约 3000 K）。这是黑体辐射规律——温度越高，辐射峰值越偏蓝。�A star's color is set by its surface temperature: blue-white stars are hot (tens of thousands of kelvin), yellow ones like the Sun are about 5800 K, and red stars are cooler (around 3000 K). This follows blackbody radiation — the hotter the star, the bluer the peak of its light.�ans��src��MCarroll & Ostlie《现代天体物理导论》（第 2 版，2007）第 3 章�OCarroll & Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics (2nd ed., 2007), ch. 3��id�d2e8bd4a793a�body�٨地球的天然卫星是月球，它与太阳的引力共同作用于地球海洋，形成潮汐。月球引力使正对和背对月球两侧的的海水微微隆起。ٿEarth's natural satellite is the Moon, whose gravity works with the Sun's to raise tides in the oceans. The Moon's pull makes the water bulge slightly on both the near and far sides of Earth.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d3065686443f�body�ٍ空间站和里面的人都在自由落向地球（绕地飞行），处于微重力状态，所以看起来像飘浮，并非没有重力。كThe station and its crew are freely falling around Earth in microgravity, so they appear to float—not because there's no gravity.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d38980b927a4�body���ΛCDM（冷暗物质加宇宙学常数）模型描述当前宇宙约由 5% 普通重子物质、27% 冷暗物质和 68% 暗能量组成。普朗克卫星对宇宙微波背景的观测给出了这一标准宇宙学模型的关键参数。�0The ΛCDM (cold dark matter plus cosmological constant) model describes the present universe as roughly 5% ordinary baryonic matter, 27% cold dark matter, and 68% dark energy. Planck satellite observations of the cosmic microwave background provide the key parameters of this standard cosmological model.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�d58784922e1a�body��M泛种说认为生命或其前体物质可由陨石、彗星或星际尘埃在行星之间传播，即地球生命可能源自外太空带来的有机分子甚至微生物。它解释了生命物质的「搬运」而非「从无到有」的合成，因此把起源问题推回到更早的环境，目前仍属未被证实的假说。�~Panspermia holds that life or its precursor molecules could be transported between planets by meteorites, comets, or interstellar dust, so Earth life might have originated from organics or microbes delivered from space. It explains the delivery of living matter rather than its abiogenesis from non-life, thus pushing the origin question earlier, and remains an unproven hypothesis.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�d63322e102e0�body�ٮ火箭要把自身和剩余燃料一起加速，单级难达轨道速度；多级在部分燃料用尽后抛掉空壳，逐段提高质量比，使最终有效载荷入轨。��A rocket must accelerate itself plus leftover fuel, so a single stage rarely reaches orbital speed; staging jettisons empty shells as fuel is spent, raising the mass ratio step by step so the payload reaches orbit.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d67a724a5374�body���史瓦西半径由公式 Rs = 2GM/c² 给出，是质量 M 的黑洞的临界半径：若把该质量压缩到这一尺度内，连光也无法逃逸。对于不旋转的黑洞，这个边界就是事件视界，由史瓦西在1916年求得。��The Schwarzschild radius, Rs = 2GM/c², is the critical radius for a mass M: compress that mass inside it and not even light can escape. For a non-rotating black hole this boundary is the event horizon, derived by Schwarzschild in 1916.�ans��src��*卡尔·史瓦西（1916，史瓦西解）�Karl Schwarzschild (1916)��id�d74406c4cc9a�body��E当行星从恒星前方经过时，会挡住一部分星光，使恒星看起来短暂变暗。行星越大，星光减弱得越多，所以凌日深度可以估算行星大小。开普勒和TESS望远镜长期监视数十万颗恒星，找到多次规律性变暗，就能确认一颗行星，并量出它的公转周期。�XWhen a planet passes in front of its star, it blocks a little starlight and the star briefly dims. The bigger the planet, the deeper the dimming, so the transit depth reveals the planet's size. Kepler and TESS monitor hundreds of thousands of stars over long periods, and repeated, regular dimmings confirm a planet and give its orbital period.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�d960d7b22691�body�٫约6600万年前一颗约10公里小行星撞在现今墨西哥尤卡坦半岛的希克苏鲁伯，引发全球气候灾变，导致非鸟恐龙灭绝和白垩纪结束。��About 66 million years ago a ~10 km asteroid hit the Yucatán peninsula (Chicxulub) in modern Mexico, triggering global climate catastrophe that ended the non-avian dinosaurs and the Cretaceous.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d996f9cbdc5a�body���根据 2006 年 IAU 决议，矮行星是围绕太阳运行、自身引力足以呈近球形、但尚未清空轨道附近其他天体的天体。冥王星、谷神星、阋神星均属此类，因未清空轨道邻近区域而被排除出行星行列。�CPer the 2006 IAU resolution, a dwarf planet orbits the Sun, is massive enough for a near-spherical shape under its own gravity, but has not cleared its orbital neighborhood of other bodies. Pluto, Ceres, and Eris fall in this class and were excluded from full planet status because they failed to clear their neighborhoods.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�da5dccb0f085�body��SDSS是迄今规模最大的光学巡天之一，用专用望远镜对大片天区进行成像与光谱观测，测定了数百万星系和类星体的红移。它绘制了宇宙的三维大尺度结构，并为重子声学振荡等研究提供了核心数据。�/The SDSS is among the largest optical surveys, using a dedicated telescope for imaging and spectroscopy over large sky areas, measuring redshifts for millions of galaxies and quasars. It mapped the universe's 3D large-scale structure and supplied core data for studies like baryon acoustic oscillations.�ans��src��dSDSS 概念设计文档与 York et al. 2000年SDSS总述论文；Gunn et al. 1998年SDSS相机论文�WYork et al. 2000 SDSS overview paper; Gunn et al. 1998 paper on the SDSS imaging camera��id�db7da4dd03cf�body�ٮ天体测量学是精确测量天体位置、距离和运动的分支学科。它为基础天文学提供恒星的自行、视差和历表，是导航与参考系的基石。��Astrometry is the branch of astronomy that precisely measures the positions, distances, and motions of celestial objects. It provides stellar proper motions, parallaxes, and ephemerides, underpinning navigation and reference frames.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�dd2e3ea8bde9�body�ٗ灵神星几乎全由金属构成，可能是某原行星被撞击后的裸露金属核，NASA的Psyche任务将首次探访这类“天体铁芯”。ٲPsyche is made almost entirely of metal and may be the exposed iron-nickel core of a shattered protoplanet; NASA's Psyche mission will be the first to visit such an 'iron world.'�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�dd4a07d126dc�body�� 宇宙微波背景辐射全天空平均温度约为 2.725 开尔文，其温度起伏幅度仅约十万分之五（约 ±0.00014 开尔文）。这些微小密度涨落被认为是日后星系与大尺度结构形成的种子，也是宇宙学标准模型最直接的观测支柱之一。�rThe cosmic microwave background has a mean temperature of about 2.725 kelvin, with temperature fluctuations of only about five parts in 100,000 (roughly ±0.00014 K). These tiny density ripples are regarded as the seeds from which galaxies and large-scale cosmic structure later grew, and are among the strongest observational pillars of the standard cosmological model.�ans��src��PPlanck Collaboration 2018, A&A 641, A6（普朗克卫星最终宇宙学参数）�NPlanck Collaboration 2018, A&A, 641, A6 (Planck final cosmological parameters)��id�ddf7080c86af�body�ٜ木星内部有巨大的金属氢层，加上快速自转，像发电机一样产生太阳系最强的行星磁场，磁层范围可容纳上千个地球。��Jupiter's vast layer of metallic hydrogen, combined with rapid rotation, acts like a dynamo producing the strongest planetary magnetic field in the solar system, with a magnetosphere that could contain thousands of Earths.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�dfcac391b2c5�body��G土星环几乎全部由水冰颗粒组成，大小从微米尘到数米巨块不等，环绕行星赤道面分布。土卫与环内粒子的密集轨道共振切割出卡西尼缝等清晰分界，并激发螺旋密度波。卡西尼号发现环物质持续受到微小陨石轰击而逐渐变暗，暗示它们相对年轻。��Saturn's rings are composed almost entirely of water-ice particles ranging from micrometer dust to meter-sized chunks, spread across the planet's equatorial plane. Dense orbital resonances with Saturn's moons carve sharp divisions like the Cassini Division and excite spiral density waves. Cassini found the ring material is steadily darkened by micrometeorite impacts, suggesting the rings are relatively young.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�e0f1da0f477f�body���奥林帕斯山是太阳系最高的火山，高出火星基准面约 21 公里，宽达 600 公里；水手谷则是太阳系最大的峡谷系统，绵延约 4000 公里。由于火星没有板块运动，火山可以在固定热点上持续堆积，形成巨大的盾状火山。水手谷则主要由地壳拉伸（裂谷作用）形成，并与塔尔西斯隆起造成的应力密切相关。��Olympus Mons is the tallest volcano in the solar system, rising about 21 km above the Martian datum and spanning 600 km, while Valles Marineris is the largest canyon system, stretching roughly 4,000 km. With no plate tectonics on Mars, volcanoes pile up over fixed hot spots, building giant shield volcanoes. Valles Marineris formed mainly through crustal extension (rifting), closely linked to the stresses produced by the Tharsis uplift.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�e22603c871f0�body���像太阳这样的主序星靠核心的质子—质子链（pp 链）把氢聚变成氦并释放能量。质量更大的恒星则主要通过碳氮氧（CNO）循环聚变氢；当核心氢耗尽，恒星会膨胀成红巨星，进入后续演化阶段。�ASun-like main-sequence stars are powered by the proton–proton (pp) chain in their cores, fusing hydrogen into helium and releasing energy. More massive stars mainly use the carbon–nitrogen–oxygen (CNO) cycle, and when core hydrogen is exhausted the star swells into a red giant and enters later evolutionary stages.�ans��src��}Bethe & Critchfield,《The Formation of Deuterons by Proton Combination》,Physical Review,1938 (DOI: 10.1103/physrev.54.248)�{Bethe & Critchfield, 'The Formation of Deuterons by Proton Combination', Physical Review, 1938, DOI: 10.1103/physrev.54.248��id�e3ccce8bc2af�body��!暗物质晕是包裹星系团的巨大引力势阱，其质量可达可见物质的五倍以上，是维持星系团整体结构的关键。星系和炽热气体都嵌在晕中，靠其引力束缚在一起。通过对引力透镜和X射线气体的测量，可推断晕的质量分布。�FThe dark matter halo is a vast gravitational well enveloping a galaxy cluster, with several times more mass than the visible matter and crucial for holding the cluster together. Galaxies and hot gas are embedded in it, bound by its gravity. Gravitational lensing and X-ray gas measurements reveal the halo's mass distribution.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�e5989f895ff1�body��,赫罗图以恒星的光谱型或温度为横轴、光度为纵轴画出每个恒星的位置，揭示出明显的演化序列。主序、巨星支和白矮区等结构反映出恒星质量与年龄的对应关系。借助它，天文学家能推断星团的年代、恒星的质量和演化阶段。�UThe Hertzsprung-Russell diagram plots stars by spectral type or temperature against luminosity, revealing distinct evolutionary sequences. Features like the main sequence, giant branch, and white-dwarf region reflect the links between stellar mass and age. With it, astronomers infer a cluster's age and a star's mass and evolutionary stage.�ans��src��zHertzsprung（1911）与 Russell（1913）的原始工作；Carroll 与 Ostlie《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》�nHertzsprung (1911) and Russell (1913) original works; Carroll & Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics��id�e5dc29890028�body�٠七天一周源自古代近东，把肉眼可见的7个天体（日、月、金、木、水、火、土）各对应一天，后来随历法传播到全世界。٫The 7-day week came from the ancient Near East, naming each day for one of the seven visible 'planets' (Sun, Moon, and five wanderers), spreading worldwide with calendars.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�e7d6e19a2cf0�body��C比邻星b是距离太阳系最近的系外行星，约4.2光年外，质量略大于地球且位于其红矮星宜居带内。它接收的恒星辐射虽以红外为主，但理论上表面可有液态水。欧洲南方天文台的观测在2016年确认其存在，使其成为近未来直接成像任务的首选目标。�uProxima Centauri b is the closest known exoplanet, about 4.2 light-years away, with a mass slightly above Earth's and an orbit within its red dwarf's habitable zone. Although most of its star's radiation is infrared, liquid water could in principle exist on its surface. ESO observations confirmed it in 2016, making it a top target for near-future direct-imaging missions.�ans��src��uAnglada-Escudé 等《A terrestrial planet at Proxima Centauri》（2016，Nature）；欧洲南方天文台（ESO）�tAnglada-Escudé et al., A terrestrial planet at Proxima Centauri (2016, Nature); European Southern Observatory (ESO)��id�e8c179746ae1�body��恒星级黑洞由大质量恒星坍缩形成，质量通常约3到几十个太阳质量；超大质量黑洞位于星系中心，质量达数百万至数十亿太阳质量。两者之间的“中等质量黑洞”较为罕见，其形成途径仍是活跃的研究方向。�/Stellar-mass black holes form from collapsing massive stars and weigh roughly 3 to a few tens of solar masses, while supermassive black holes sit at galaxy centers with millions to billions of solar masses. Intermediate-mass black holes in between are rare, and how they form is an active research area.�ans��src��B《黑洞天文物理》（恒星级与超大质量黑洞综述）�6Black hole astrophysics (stellar-mass vs supermassive)��id�e9948d9088f0�body�پ旅行者1号和2号于1977年发射，飞掠木星、土星等行星后继续向外飞行；旅行者1号已进入星际空间，并携带着记录地球声音与图像的“金唱片”。٪Launched in 1977, Voyagers 1 and 2 flew past Jupiter, Saturn, and more, then headed outward; Voyager 1 has entered interstellar space carrying the Golden Record of Earth.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�ead653b3ce77�body�ٱ土卫二南极喷发出含盐分的水冰羽流，表明其冰壳之下存在液态海洋。羽流中检测到了有机物和氢气，具备生命所需的一些化学条件。��Enceladus shoots salty water-ice plumes from its south pole, evidence of a liquid ocean beneath its icy crust. The plumes contain organics and hydrogen, suggesting some of the chemistry life needs may be present.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�ed587f86ffd4�body���火星与木星轨道之间小行星带的星子持续受到木星强引力摄动，轨道被搅动到高速碰撞而非温和吸积，难以长大成行星核。木星的迁移（大迁徙模型）还可能清空并重塑了这一区域。�Planetesimals in the Mars–Jupiter gap were continuously stirred by Jupiter's strong perturbations into high-velocity collisions instead of gentle accretion, preventing growth into a planetary core. Jupiter's migration (Grand Tack) may also have cleared and reshaped the region.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�f24ced666678�body�ٮ大气湍流使星光抖动、星像模糊，视宁度差会限制地面望远镜的分辨率，因此大望远镜常建于高处干燥之地或借助自适应光学补偿。ٹAtmospheric turbulence makes starlight shimmer and images blur; poor seeing limits ground-based resolution, so big telescopes sit on high dry sites or use adaptive optics to compensate.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�f38e75ce8505�body�٥是的。EHT对M87的研究结合了阴影与长达数千光年的相对论喷流，帮助理解超大质量黑洞如何将物质加速到近光速并反馈星系。��Yes. EHT work on M87 combined the shadow with its thousand-light-year relativistic jet, helping explain how supermassive black holes accelerate matter near light speed and feed back on their galaxies.�ans��src��NEvent Horizon Telescope Collaboration 2019, ApJL 875, L1；2022, ApJL 930, L12�OEvent Horizon Telescope Collaboration 2019, ApJL, 875, L1; 2022, ApJL, 930, L12��id�f3c96c5e11f0�body�١ESI综合半径、密度、表面温度等参数给出与地球的相似度（0到1），用于筛选最可能宜居的候选，但只是粗略的排序工具。��The ESI combines radius, density and surface temperature into a similarity-to-Earth score (0 to 1), used to rank the most promising habitable candidates, though it is only a rough sorting tool.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�f400123539e8�body��l高山站海拔超过大气层的大部分水汽，空气又干又稀薄，星光被扰动和吸收得少，成像更清晰；智利的阿塔卡马沙漠一年有三百多个晴天，是地球上观星条件最好的地方之一。夏威夷莫纳克亚山海拔约4200米，同样干燥稳定。世界上几台最大的光学和射电望远镜都建在这两处。��High-altitude sites rise above most of the atmosphere's water vapour, and with the air so dry and thin, starlight is less distorted and absorbed, giving sharper images. Chile's Atacama Desert enjoys over 300 clear nights a year and is among the best stargazing spots on Earth, while Hawaii's Mauna Kea, at about 4,200 metres, is likewise dry and stable. Several of the world's largest optical and radio telescopes stand on these two sites.�ans��src��<Terence Dickinson,《NightWatch》第4版,Firefly Books,2006�nT. Dickinson, NightWatch: A Practical Guide to Viewing the Universe, 4th ed., Firefly Books, 2006; Chinese ed.��id�f4e0777d19eb�body��n胚种论认为生命或其前体分子可能由陨石、彗星或星际尘埃在行星之间传播，从而把生命带到地球。虽然星际有机分子和抗辐射微生物的存在提供了一定支持，但该假说并不能解释生命的起源，只是转移了问题发生地。此外，宇宙射线与再入高温对生命体的杀伤仍是重大障碍。��Panspermia holds that life, or its precursor molecules, may have been carried between planets by meteorites, comets, or interstellar dust, seeding life on Earth. The discovery of interstellar organics and radiation-resistant microbes lends some support, yet the hypothesis does not explain life's origin, only relocates it. Cosmic rays and the heat of atmospheric reentry remain serious obstacles for viable organisms.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�f81fb940b8f5�body���红移指天体光谱线向长波（红端）移动，通常由宇宙膨胀造成的星系退行引起。红移越大意味着天体越远、时代越早，它是宇宙学距离测量的基础。�Redshift is the shift of a celestial object's spectral lines toward longer (redder) wavelengths, usually from the recession of galaxies due to cosmic expansion. Larger redshift means greater distance and earlier epoch, forming the basis of cosmological distance measurement.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�f8c32f49c3c3�body�ٷ按哈勃分类，星系主要分为椭圆星系、旋涡星系（含棒旋星系）和不规则星系。旋涡星系有明显的旋臂，椭圆星系呈椭球状且恒星较年老。��In Hubble's classification, galaxies are mainly elliptical, spiral (including barred spirals), and irregular. Spirals show clear arms, while ellipticals are ellipsoidal and made of older stars.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�f9508f107d82�body�ّ太阳耀斑是太阳表面局部突然释放的巨大能量爆发，伴随高能粒子和X射线，可能干扰地球无线电通信与卫星。ٗA solar flare is a sudden burst of energy on the Sun's surface, sending high-energy particles and X-rays that can disrupt Earth's radio and satellites.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�fa2da8674d3b�body��;液态水是几乎所有已知生命化学反应的溶剂，细胞内的生化反应都需要在水环境中进行，因此“跟着水找生命”成为行星探测的基本策略。地球之外只要有长期存在的液态水，无论是地下海洋还是表面湖泊，都被视为可能存在生命的地方。�BLiquid water is the solvent for nearly all known biochemistry; cellular reactions take place in aqueous environments, so following the water has become the core strategy of planetary exploration. Any world with long-lived liquid water, whether a subsurface ocean or a surface lake, is treated as a potential site for life.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�fac7ce88db62�body��J根据广义相对论，大质量天体或星系团会弯曲它周围的时空，使经过的光线偏折，就像一面透镜。背景星系的光因此被扭曲、放大，甚至形成环状或弧状影像，透镜的强度和变形程度取决于前景天体的质量，因此可以测量出包括暗物质在内的总质量。�GAccording to general relativity, a massive object or galaxy cluster warps surrounding spacetime and deflects passing light like a lens. Background galaxies appear distorted, magnified, or arranged into rings and arcs; the strength of this lensing depends on the foreground mass, so it measures total mass including dark matter.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�fc14622edf8b�body��:双中子星并合会抛出大量富含中子的物质，在极短时间内通过快中子俘获（r-过程）合成比铁重的元素，包括金、铂、铀等。GW170817 的千新星观测在光谱与亮度演化上与 r-过程产物高度吻合，有力支持这类并合是宇宙中重元素的重要产地。��Binary neutron star mergers eject large amounts of neutron-rich matter that, in a fraction of a second, synthesizes elements heavier than iron through rapid neutron capture, the r-process, including gold, platinum, and uranium. The kilonova of GW170817 matched r-process products in both spectrum and brightness evolution, strongly supporting such mergers as a major site of the Universe's heavy elements.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�fc37e9056c15�body��q折射望远镜用凸透镜把光弯折聚焦，伽利略时代的天文望远镜就是这种；它的缺点是不同颜色的光聚焦点略有不同，会产生色差，而且大透镜又厚又重，容易下垂变形。反射望远镜改用凹面镜反射聚焦，没有色差，镜面可以做得很大，现代大型望远镜包括韦布几乎都是反射式的。��A refractor uses a convex lens to bend and focus light, the kind of telescope Galileo used; its drawbacks are that different colours focus at slightly different points, causing chromatic aberration, and that large lenses are thick, heavy, and prone to sagging. A reflector instead focuses light with a concave mirror, which shows no chromatic aberration and can be built very large, which is why nearly all modern observatories, including Webb, are reflectors.�ans��src��*《天文学概论》（望远镜原理）�/An Introduction to Astronomy (telescope optics)��id�fc5ae427f37f�body�٬巡天是用望远镜系统性地扫描大片天区、积累海量天体目录的工作，例如斯隆数字巡天（SDSS）绘制了数百万星系和类星体的图谱。٬A survey systematically scans large sky areas to build vast catalogs of objects; the Sloan Digital Sky Survey (SDSS), for instance, mapped millions of galaxies and quasars.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�fcb36a4e7ae9�body�٭在太阳核心约1500万摄氏度和极高密度下，氢原子核通过质子-质子链反应聚变成氦，质量亏损转化为巨大能量，这就是阳光的来源。٪In the core at ~15 million °C and extreme density, hydrogen nuclei fuse into helium via the proton–proton chain; the lost mass becomes energy—the source of sunlight.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�fde54cca2856�body��2哥白尼把地球从宇宙中心移到绕太阳公转的行星之一，用日心体系取代托勒密的地心模型。这一转变不只是几何重排，更强调用观测和数学检验取代权威与哲学思辨。库恩指出，它奠定了现代科学以证据为本、不断自我修正的范式。�{Copernicus moved Earth from the center of the universe to just one planet orbiting the Sun, replacing Ptolemy's geocentric model with a heliocentric one. The shift was more than geometric: it elevated observation and mathematical testing over authority and philosophical argument. Kuhn noted that it established the modern, evidence-based and self-correcting scientific paradigm.�ans��src��_Kuhn《The Copernican Revolution》（1957，Harvard University Press）；NASA 历史办公室�UKuhn, The Copernican Revolution (1957, Harvard University Press); NASA History Office��id�010f10202306�body��TRAPPIST-1 是一颗距地球约 40 光年的超冷红矮星，拥有七颗地球大小的岩质行星，其中三到四颗位于宜居带。由于恒星暗弱，这些行星的凌星信号很强、易于用詹姆斯·韦伯望远镜研究大气，是探测生命迹象的优先目标。�KTRAPPIST-1 is an ultracool red dwarf about 40 light-years away with seven Earth-sized rocky planets, three or four of them in the habitable zone. Because the star is faint, the planets' transit signals are strong and easy to study with the James Webb Space Telescope, making the system a top target in the search for signs of life.�ans��src�ٍGillon 等,《Seven temperate terrestrial planets around the nearby ultracool dwarf star TRAPPIST-1》,Nature,2017 (DOI: 10.1038/nature21360)َGillon et al., 'Seven temperate terrestrial planets around the nearby ultracool dwarf star TRAPPIST-1', Nature, 2017, DOI: 10.1038/nature21360��id�03fc6d0e2bf6�body�ٯ它们是木卫一 Io、木卫二 Europa、木卫三 Ganymede、木卫四 Callisto；木卫二冰壳之下被认为存在液态海洋，是搜寻地外生命的重点目标。ٝThey are Io, Europa, Ganymede, and Callisto; Europa is thought to hide a liquid ocean beneath its ice shell, making it a prime target in the search for life.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�106d58fa6a0f�body��COBE 卫星在 1990 年测得的 CMB 谱与 2.725 K 黑体辐射吻合到万分之几的精度，这种普适热平衡谱只能由早期高温致密宇宙冷却形成。稳恒态模型用星系际尘埃散射星光来解释 CMB，却无法自然产生如此精确的黑体形状。�eThe COBE satellite measured the CMB spectrum in 1990 to match a 2.725 K blackbody to better than a few parts in 10,000, a universal thermal-equilibrium shape that only arises from the cooling of an early hot, dense universe. Steady-state models invoked interstellar dust scattering starlight, but they cannot naturally produce such a precise blackbody form.�ans��src��=Mather 等 1990, ApJ 354, L37（COBE/FIRAS 黑体谱测量）�AMather et al. 1990, ApJ, 354, L37 (COBE/FIRAS blackbody spectrum)��id�109093c0262a�body�ٛ他们靠日晷看日影定当地真太阳时，城市间用统一'标准钟'或天文台授时；中国历代设司天监、钦天监专门测时颁历。٤They used sundials for local solar time and a unified civic clock or observatory for standards; China's astronomical bureaus measured and issued time and calendars.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�1937ee23e242�body�ه变星的亮度会随时间发生规律性变化，原因包括脉动、旋转或伴星掩食，是测量宇宙距离的重要工具。ٟA variable star changes brightness over time, due to pulsation, rotation, or eclipsing by a companion, and serves as a key tool for measuring cosmic distances.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�1c704331dc37�body���1995 年哈勃在看似空白的一小块天区长时间曝光，拍到约三千个极遥远的星系，把可观测宇宙的可视历史大幅推前。它首次直观展示星系随红移的演化，并成为后来各类深场巡天的范本。�5In 1995 Hubble stared at a seemingly empty patch of sky for a long exposure and captured about three thousand extremely distant galaxies, pushing the visible history of the universe far back. It gave the first direct view of galaxy evolution with redshift and became the template for later deep-field surveys.�ans��src�٨Williams, Blacker, Dickinson, Dixon,《The Hubble Deep Field: Observations, Data Reduction, and Galaxy Photometry》,The Astronomical Journal,1996 (DOI: 10.1086/118105)ْWilliams et al., 'The Hubble Deep Field: Observations, Data Reduction, and Galaxy Photometry', The Astronomical Journal, 1996, DOI: 10.1086/118105��id�23350db9ad9b�body�ټ质量在约13倍木星质量（氘燃烧下限）以上算褐矮星、以下算行星；但实际难以直接测质量，常靠形成方式（独立形成还是绕恒星）辅助判断。��Above about 13 Jupiter masses (the deuterium-burning limit) it is a brown dwarf, below it a planet; but mass is hard to measure directly, so formation history (isolated vs. orbiting a star) helps decide.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�2ec811d11898�body��~地球磁场像漏斗把太阳粒子导向南北磁极，所以极光带集中在高纬度地区，如北极圈和南极圈。٘Earth's magnetic field channels solar particles toward the magnetic poles, so auroral belts sit at high latitudes like the Arctic and Antarctic circles.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�2f9b51867a0c�body�٪干支纪日连续60天循环，是对时间本身的均匀切分；生肖依附于年，而年的长度由太阳回归决定，二者都源于对天体周期的测量。ٴThe ganzhi day count is a uniform 60-day cycle of time itself; the zodiac depends on the year, whose length is set by the solar return—both stem from measuring celestial periods.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�320452ba2606�body��水是普通分子，在巨行星、褐矮星甚至恒星大气中都能由化学平衡自然产生，并不要求生物活动。确认生命需要综合氧气、甲烷等不平衡气体的共存、季节变化与行星表面条件等多重证据，远超出单一分子检测。�eWater is a common molecule that forms naturally by chemical equilibrium in giant planets, brown dwarfs and even stellar atmospheres, with no need for biology. Confirming life requires multiple lines of evidence — co-existing out-of-equilibrium gases like oxygen and methane, seasonal changes, surface conditions — far beyond a single molecule detection.�ans��src�٘Catling, Krissansen-Totton, Kiang & Crisp,《Exoplanet Biosignatures: A Framework for Their Assessment》,Astrobiology,2018 (DOI: 10.1089/ast.2017.1737)ٖCatling, Krissansen-Totton, Kiang & Crisp, 'Exoplanet Biosignatures: A Framework for Their Assessment', Astrobiology, 2018, DOI: 10.1089/ast.2017.1737��id�33a394a9f3f2�body�٨2005年发现的阋神星质量比冥王星还大，迫使天文学家正视“什么是行星”问题，直接推动了IAU 2006年矮行星定义与冥王星除名。ٹThe 2005 discovery of Eris, more massive than Pluto, forced astronomers to face 'what is a planet,' directly driving the IAU's 2006 dwarf-planet definition and Pluto's reclassification.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�3856675759d0�body���中子星是大质量恒星的核心坍缩遗迹：电子被压进质子合成中子，靠中子简并压与核力撑住，整个太阳质量塞进直径约 20 公里的天体，每立方厘米以亿吨计。核心本就在自转，半径骤减几个数量级，角动量守恒使它转得极快，毫秒脉冲星每秒能转数百圈。但它并不均匀，外壳远稀疏于核心；脉冲星也不会自行加速，毫秒级那批靠吸积伴星物质被重新加速。��A neutron star is the collapsed core of a massive star: electrons are pressed into protons to make neutrons, and neutron degeneracy plus the nuclear force holds it up, so an entire solar mass is squeezed into a body about 20 km across, hundreds of millions of tonnes per cubic centimeter. The core was already spinning, and shedding several orders of magnitude of radius spins it up by conservation of angular momentum, so millisecond pulsars can turn hundreds of times a second. It is not uniform, though - the crust is far less dense than the core. Nor does a pulsar accelerate on its own: the millisecond ones were re-spun by accreting matter from a companion.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�3b55ac0d22aa�body�٦2006年国际天文学联合会规定行星需“清空轨道附近天体”，而冥王星轨道附近仍有大量类似天体，因此被重新归类为矮行星。٪In 2006 the IAU required planets to have 'cleared their orbital neighborhood'; Pluto shares its region with many similar bodies, so it was reclassified as a dwarf planet.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�40f3e53fbb7f�body�ق吸积盘是物质螺旋落向黑洞或致密天体时形成的旋转盘，因摩擦升温而发出强烈的X射线和可见光。ٞAn accretion disk is the swirling disk of matter spiraling into a black hole or compact object; friction heats it so it emits strong X-rays and visible light.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�44b7cda0d898�body�٠干支用10天干配12地支组成60年一轮的纪年法，其中12地支源自木星约12年绕天一周（岁星纪年），是早期天文观测的产物。��The ganzhi system pairs 10 heavenly stems with 12 earthly branches in a 60-year cycle; the 12 branches originated from Jupiter's roughly 12-year orbit (the 'year-star' reckoning), a product of early sky observation.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�45435f909378�body��4主流的“大碰撞假说”认为，约45亿年前一颗火星大小的原行星（常称“忒伊亚”）撞击了早期地球，溅出的物质在地球周围吸积形成了月球。阿波罗任务带回的月球岩石与该假说相符，例如月岩与地幔具有几乎一致的氧同位素组成。�BThe leading “giant-impact hypothesis” holds that about 4.5 billion years ago a Mars-sized protoplanet (often called Theia) struck the early Earth, and debris from the impact accreted into the Moon. Apollo lunar samples support this, notably showing Moon rocks and Earth's mantle share nearly identical oxygen isotopes.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�46bedd2e69f8�body�َ闰年规则：能被4整除，但整百年必须能被400整除才是闰年。1900不能被400整除，2000可以，所以2000年是闰年。�pRule: divisible by 4, but a century year must be divisible by 400. 1900 isn't, 2000 is, so 2000 was a leap year.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�51b01fa4e7b8�body�ٍ天狼星在日出前首次重现（偕日升）恰逢尼罗河泛滥前夕，埃及人据此定出一年约365天的周期来安排农耕。ىSirius's first dawn reappearance (heliacal rising) coincided with the Nile's flood, so Egyptians used its ~365-day cycle to time farming.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�5e9bfd8754d4�body���彗核是冰掺尘埃，本身几乎不发光。靠近太阳时冰直接升华，气体带着尘埃溢出成彗发，再分两路：中性尘埃被太阳辐射压向外推、反射阳光，成宽而弯的尘埃尾；电离气体被太阳风及其磁场拖拽，成笔直背离太阳的离子尾，长可超过日地距离。但要注意尾的朝向由太阳定而非飞行方向，彗星离去时尾巴在它前头；那看着实心的光带也稀薄得挡不住背后的星。�nA comet nucleus is ice mixed with dust and barely shines by itself. Nearing the sun the ice sublimates straight into gas, dust spilling out with it into a coma, then two forces sort the debris: radiation pressure pushes neutral dust outward and reflected sunlight makes the broad curved dust tail, while the solar wind and its magnetic field drag ionized gas into a straight ion tail pointing away from the sun, long enough to exceed the earth-sun distance. The sun, not the motion, sets that direction—an outbound comet has its tail ahead of it—and the seemingly solid band is too tenuous to hide the stars behind it.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�60346c5e8c1c�body�ٙ大红斑是木星上持续了至少三百年的巨型风暴，是一个比地球还大的反气旋漩涡，颜色来自大气中的复杂化学物质。ٰThe Great Red Spot is a giant storm on Jupiter that has raged for at least 300 years—an anticyclonic vortex larger than Earth, colored by complex chemicals in the atmosphere.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�635d87702ba6�body��柯伊伯带是海王星轨道外、贴近黄道面的冰质小天体盘，是短周期彗星的来源。奥尔特云是包裹太阳系的、半径约 1–2 光年的球壳状彗星库，提供长周期彗星，两者共同构成太阳系外缘的冰封边疆。�9The Kuiper Belt is a disk of icy bodies just beyond Neptune, near the ecliptic plane, and it supplies short-period comets. The Oort Cloud is a roughly spherical shell of comets about 1–2 light-years in radius enclosing the Solar System and feeding long-period comets, together forming the frozen outer frontier.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�859a29af503d�body�٨七夕源自中国牛郎织女传说，对应天鹰座的牵牛星（河鼓二）与天琴座的织女星，被银河分隔，只在七月七（旧历）隔河相会。ٮTanabata comes from the Chinese Cowherd-and-Weaver myth: Altair (in Aquila) and Vega (in Lyra) split by the Milky Way meet only on the 7th night—a star-crossed lovers tale.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�87b4c493aa73�body�ٓ为便于全国协调，中国跨多个地理时区却统一采用东八区（北京时间），因此西部实际日出比时钟显示晚很多。ًFor national coordination China spans several geographic zones but uses one time (UTC+8), so the west sees sunrise much later by the clock.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�8f798450b218�body�ْ仙女座星系（M31）比银河系略大，直径约22万光年，恒星数量也更多。二者正以约110公里每秒的速度相互靠近。ټThe Andromeda Galaxy (M31) is slightly larger than the Milky Way, about 220,000 light-years across with more stars. The two are approaching each other at roughly 110 kilometers per second.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�9037835815bc�body��伽利略探测与后续观测表明，木卫二冰壳之下存在全球性的液态咸水海洋，体积可能两倍于地球海洋，并有潮汐加热维持液态。冰下海洋加能量来源的组合，使它成为太阳系内最可能找到生命的地方之一。�3Galileo and later observations show that beneath Europa's icy shell lies a global salty liquid-water ocean perhaps twice Earth's ocean volume, kept liquid by tidal heating. The combination of a subsurface ocean and an energy source makes it one of the most promising places in the Solar System to seek life.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�94778e8c5a1b�body�ي节气依据太阳在黄道上的位置（地球绕日轨道）划分，反映气温、降水和物候变化，是农耕的重要参考。ٍSolar terms are based on the Sun's position along the ecliptic, marking temperature, rainfall and phenology changes—key guides for farming.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�95b44ef8deda�body�٨古代朝鲜长期使用中国的二十八宿与浑天体系，并建有瞻星台（如庆州瞻星台），其历法多承自中原，星图也以中国星官为主。ٱAncient Korea used China's 28-mansion and celestial-sphere system, built observatories like Cheomseongdae, and inherited calendars and star charts centered on Chinese asterisms.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�9aa015ed5be7�body�ٮ质量越大的恒星虽然燃料更多，但燃烧极其剧烈、消耗更快，寿命反而更短；太阳约能活100亿年，而大质量恒星可能只活几百万年。٣More massive stars have more fuel but burn far more furiously and die sooner; the Sun will live about 10 billion years, while massive stars may last only millions.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�9b308c23945b�body���1995年发现的主星飞马座51（51 Pegasi）的行星51 Peg b，是第一颗被确认的绕类太阳恒星的系外行星。它是一颗热木星，这项发现获得了2019年诺贝尔物理学奖。��The planet 51 Pegasi b, found in 1995 around the Sun-like star 51 Pegasi, was the first confirmed exoplanet orbiting a Sun-like star. A hot Jupiter, its discovery won the 2019 Nobel Prize in Physics.�ans��src�قMayor 与 Queloz《A Jupiter-mass companion to 51 Pegasi》（1995，Nature）；Lin 等《Orbital migration》（1996，Nature）�rMayor & Queloz, A Jupiter-mass companion to 51 Pegasi (1995, Nature); Lin et al., Orbital migration (1996, Nature)��id�a777d5c618dc�body�ل选月亮不亮、天空晴朗、远离城市灯光的地方，躺下让视野尽量开阔，耐心等待即可，无需望远镜。�zChoose a moonless, clear, dark site away from city lights, lie back for a wide view, and be patient—no telescope needed.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�af9e6974debb�body��土卫六是太阳系中唯一拥有浓厚大气层和表面液体的卫星。卡西尼-惠更斯任务发现其两极分布着由液态甲烷和乙烷构成的湖泊与河流，并存在类似地球的降雨-侵蚀-沉积循环，只是“水”被碳氢化合物取代。�␀Titan is the only moon with a thick atmosphere and surface liquids. The Cassini–Huygens mission found polar lakes and rivers of liquid methane and ethane, plus an Earth-like cycle of rain, erosion, and deposition—except that hydrocarbons replace water.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�astro_25_014�body��[恰恰相反!北半球冬天时地球其实离太阳最近。季节的真正导演是地轴倾斜23.5度:夏天你的半球朝太阳倾斜,阳光近乎直射,同样一束光集中在小片地面上,还照得更久;冬天斜倾远离,阳光斜着扫过,能量摊薄在更大面积上,日照时间又短——倾斜决定冷暖,距离只是配角。�oQuite opposite! Northern winter happens when Earth is nearest the Sun. Seasons are directed by the 23.5-degree tilt: in summer your hemisphere leans sunward so beams strike nearly straight, concentrating energy over small areas with long days; winter leans away, sunlight sweeps slantwise across wider ground with short days. Tilt rules climate; distance only cameos.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版天文分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�ZTen Thousand Whys: Astronomy volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�astro_25_015�body��E主因是海洋:水对红橙黄光吸收较强,蓝光最容易被散射回来,深海水区把其他颜色吞掉,只把蓝色反射向太空;白云的漩涡是第二贡献者。宇航员因此称地球为蓝色弹珠。每颗行星的颜色都是它的自拍照:火星是铁锈的红,金星是被浓硫酸云染成的黄白。�KOceans lead the way: water absorbs longer wavelengths while blue scatters most readily back to space, and deep seas swallow other hues; white cloud swirls chip in second — astronauts call Earth the blue marble. Every planet photographs its own selfie: Mars rust-red from iron oxide, Venus yellow-white under sulfuric acid clouds.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版天文分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�ZTen Thousand Whys: Astronomy volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�b453a0277d1d�body�ٛ太阳系大约形成于46亿年前，由一团巨大的分子云引力坍缩而成。太阳系中最古老的陨石为这一年龄提供了直接证据。ٿThe solar system formed about 4.6 billion years ago from the gravitational collapse of a giant molecular cloud. The oldest meteorites in the solar system provide direct evidence for this age.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�b4d90ddcb931�body���黑洞按质量主要分为恒星级黑洞（数倍至数十倍太阳质量）、超大质量黑洞（百万至数十亿倍太阳质量，位于星系中心）和中等质量黑洞。原初黑洞目前仍是假说。��By mass, black holes are mainly stellar-mass (a few to tens of solar masses), supermassive (millions to billions of solar masses, found in galactic centers), and intermediate-mass. Primordial black holes remain hypothetical.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�b8b436ede822�body�٣因为月球轨道相对地球公转轨道倾斜约5度，多数月份月球从太阳上方或下方掠过，只有交点附近才会三者恰成一线形成食。ٖThe Moon's orbit is tilted about 5 degrees, so most months it passes above or below the Sun; eclipses occur only near the nodes where the three align.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�be16cb0ff192�body�ٙ火星有时爆发席卷全球的沙尘暴，可遮住整个星球表面数周甚至数月，使阳光难以到达地面，曾影响探测器的供电。ٴMars occasionally develops global dust storms that can blanket the entire planet for weeks or months, blocking sunlight from the surface and once crippling a lander's power supply.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�c8e338958ab0�body��C传统宜居带按恒星光度与有效温度给出液态水可存在的轨道距离范围（如 Kasting 1993 的边界），并随恒星演化而移动。它的局限在于只考虑了液态水和入射辐射，忽略了大气成分、板块活动、潮汐锁定与恒星耀斑等决定真实可居住性的关键因素。��The conventional habitable zone gives the orbital range where liquid water could exist based on a star's luminosity and effective temperature (e.g. the Kasting 1993 boundaries), and it moves as the star evolves. Its limitation is that it considers only liquid water and incoming radiation, ignoring atmosphere composition, plate tectonics, tidal locking and stellar flares that truly determine habitability.�ans��src�كKasting、Whitmire 与 Reynolds,《Habitable Zones around Main Sequence Stars》,Icarus 101, 108,1993 (DOI: 10.1006/icar.1993.1010)�~Kasting, Whitmire & Reynolds, 'Habitable Zones around Main Sequence Stars', Icarus 101, 108, 1993, DOI: 10.1006/icar.1993.1010��id�cb12f040e0f2�body�ٓ大质量天体弯曲周围时空，使背后星光路径偏折、影像被放大或扭曲，如同宇宙中的透镜，可用来称量暗物质。َA massive object bends spacetime so background light is deflected and distorted like through a lens—a cosmic lens used to weigh dark matter.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�ced5f0a20516�body�ٓ公历以地球绕日周期（太阳年）为准；农历兼顾月相和太阳年，用闰月来对齐季节，所以节日公历日期会变动。ٱThe Gregorian calendar follows the solar year; the lunar calendar tracks both moon phases and the solar year with leap months, so festival dates shift on the Gregorian calendar.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d8a874312097�body�ٜ星舰是SpaceX完全可重复使用、运载能力极大的飞船，目标是大幅降低入轨成本，支撑星座部署、月球基地与火星殖民。ٯStarship is SpaceX's fully reusable, very high-capacity vehicle aimed at drastically cutting launch cost, enabling satellite constellations, lunar bases and Mars colonization.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�ddfb3bf33881�body�ٸ位于波多黎各的阿雷西博望远镜曾是世界最大的单口径射电望远镜之一，用于射电天文、行星雷达和搜寻地外文明。它于2020年坍塌后退役。��The Arecibo Telescope in Puerto Rico was once among the world's largest single-dish radio telescopes, used for radio astronomy, planetary radar, and the search for extraterrestrial intelligence. It collapsed and was decommissioned in 2020.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�e04fda5497cb�body�٫金星作为晨星、昏星周期性出现，玛雅人测得它约584天的会合周期并用于决定战争与祭祀的吉日，其历书对金星记录精确到半天。٠As morning/evening star, Venus's ~584-day cycle was used by the Maya to pick auspicious days for war and ritual; their Venus tables were accurate to half a day.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�e6f6ae9d8f8c�body�٪超新星是恒星生命末期发生的剧烈爆炸，瞬间的亮度可超过整个星系。它分为Ia型和核心坍缩型等，是宇宙中重元素的重要来源。��A supernova is a violent explosion at the end of a star's life, briefly outshining an entire galaxy. Types include Ia and core-collapse, and supernovae are a major source of the universe's heavy elements.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�ead3c10fdc06�body�ِ它们大气中的甲烷吸收红光、反射蓝绿光，使两颗冰巨星呈现青蓝色，其中海王星因更活跃的大气显得更蓝。ٮMethane in their atmospheres absorbs red light and reflects blue-green light, giving both ice giants a cyan hue; Neptune looks bluer due to more active atmospheric processes.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�f2a925358f41�body�٢土星拥有太阳系中最壮观、最明亮的行星环，主要由冰粒和岩石碎块组成。木星、天王星和海王星也拥有暗淡得多的环系。ٵSaturn has the most spectacular and brightest ring system in the solar system, made mainly of ice particles and rock fragments. Jupiter, Uranus, and Neptune have much fainter rings.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�f4c4c68d9486�body�ٞ12生肖对应12地支，而12地支源于木星约12年绕天一周的观测；西方黄道也有12宫，是不同文明对'12'这一周期的有趣巧合。ٚThe 12 animals match the 12 earthly branches, derived from Jupiter's ~12-year orbit; the West's 12 zodiac signs are a curious parallel to the same number.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�fc3b00eb7170�body�ه因为月球被地球潮汐锁定，它绕地球一周的时间和自转一周的时间相同，所以始终以同一面朝向地球。�pThe Moon is tidally locked by Earth, so its orbital and rotation periods match, always showing us the same face.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�08f9619c5a12�body�ٔ太阳的能量来自核心处的氢核聚变，四个氢核聚变成一个氦核并释放能量。这个过程每秒将约6亿吨氢转化为氦。��The Sun's energy comes from hydrogen fusion in its core, where four hydrogen nuclei combine into one helium nucleus and release energy. About 600 million tons of hydrogen are converted into helium every second.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�1d392299bfe5�body���红巨星是恒星核心氢耗尽后外层膨胀、表面变冷变红的阶段，体积可膨胀到原来的上百倍。大约 50 亿年后，太阳核心氢烧完也会膨胀成红巨星，可能吞没水星和金星。�A red giant is the phase after a star exhausts core hydrogen, when its outer layers expand and the surface cools and reddens, swelling to over a hundred times its former size. In roughly 5 billion years the Sun will do the same and may engulf Mercury and Venus.�ans��src��MCarroll & Ostlie《现代天体物理导论》（第 2 版，2007）第 9 章�OCarroll & Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics (2nd ed., 2007), ch. 9��id�1f0995a150ce�body���国际空间站在约 400 公里高度以约每秒 7.7 公里的速度绕地球做圆周运动，它的下落正好被地球弯曲的曲面接住，于是持续绕圈而不坠地。稀薄大气仍有阻力，所以需要货运飞船偶尔抬升轨道。�The ISS orbits about 400 km up at roughly 7.7 km/s, fast enough that its fall is continually matched by the curve of Earth's surface, so it keeps circling instead of dropping. Thin atmospheric drag still slows it, so cargo ships periodically reboost its orbit.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�44b870358cca�body���望远镜主要分为光学望远镜（收集可见光）、射电望远镜（接收无线电波）和空间望远镜（在大气层外工作）等。不同波段让我们看到宇宙的不同面貌。��Telescopes mainly include optical ones (collecting visible light), radio ones (receiving radio waves), and space telescopes (working above the atmosphere). Different wavelengths reveal different faces of the universe.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�astro_25_007�body���是真的!太阳的直径约139万公里,相当于109个地球排成一排;它的肚子里能塞进约130万个地球。而且太阳并不黄,它发出的光混合所有颜色,合在一起才是白光——太空里看太阳其实是刺眼的白色。��True! The Sun spans about 1.39 million kilometers — 109 Earths shoulder to shoulder — with room inside for roughly 1.3 million Earths. And the Sun is not yellow: it mixes every color into white light; from space it blazes pure white.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版天文分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�ZTen Thousand Whys: Astronomy volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�b04daed61dcc�body���恒星级黑洞通常由大质量恒星坍缩形成，质量约为太阳的 5 到几十倍。而星系中心的超大质量黑洞质量可达百万到数百亿倍太阳质量，两者不仅在质量上悬殊，形成机制也大不相同。�Stellar-mass black holes form from the collapse of massive stars and weigh roughly 5 to a few tens of solar masses. Supermassive black holes at galaxy centers instead reach millions to tens of billions of solar masses, differing not only in scale but also in how they formed.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�057a513a7e7c�body�� 地球有足够的质量维持内部热量、又有充足的地表水润滑岩石圈，使刚性板块得以破裂并缓慢移动。金星可能曾有过但已停滞，火星则因体积小冷却太快而早早停止。水的存在和适宜大小被认为是地球板块运动的关键。�+Earth is massive enough to keep internal heat and has abundant surface water to lubricate the lithosphere, letting rigid plates break and drift. Venus may have had tectonics that stalled, while small Mars cooled too fast and stopped early. Water and the right size are thought key to Earth's plates.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�08cb3a75000a�body��冥王星有一层极稀薄的大气，主要成分是氮，来自表面氮冰的升华。由于冥王星轨道偏心率大、有季节变化，当它靠近太阳时大气膨胀，远离时部分气体又会冻结回表面。这种大气会随公转周期显著『呼吸』。�9Pluto has an extremely thin nitrogen atmosphere from the sublimation of surface nitrogen ice. Because its orbit is highly eccentric with strong seasons, the atmosphere expands when Pluto nears the Sun and partly freezes back onto the surface when it recedes. The atmosphere thus 'breathes' over its orbital cycle.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�0c391aa62584�body�ل像芬迪湾这样的喇叭形浅湾会产生潮汐共振，把涌进来的潮水不断放大，形成世界罕见的超大潮差。ـFunnel-shaped shallow bays like the Bay of Fundy resonate with the tide, amplifying the incoming water into record-large ranges.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�121670f66944�body�ف因为回归年（约365.24天）不是整数，加上闰年和平年的安排，使得二分二至的时刻落在不同日期。قThe tropical year (~365.24 days) isn't an integer, and leap-year rules shift the exact moment of solstices/equinoxes across dates.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�16504cfbddc7�body�ٙ它在约400公里高度以每秒约7.7公里速度绕地做圆周运动，重力刚好提供向心力，靠“持续下落却不落地”维持轨道。كAt ~400 km it orbits at ~7.7 km/s; gravity supplies the centripetal force, so it keeps 'falling around' Earth without extra thrust.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�167644c170f2�body�ٳ相对论限制的是物质在空间里运动的速度，而宇宙膨胀是空间本身在拉伸，远处星系是被变大的空间'带走'，并非在空间中超光速飞行。ٮRelativity limits how fast things move through space, but cosmic expansion is space itself stretching; distant galaxies are carried by growing space, not speeding through it.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�167bbdd98ade�body�ٷ它是木星大气中的巨型反气旋风暴，因行星没有固态表面摩擦耗散、且内部热量持续供给，得以在流体中长久维持，只是尺寸在缓慢缩小。٪It's a giant anticyclonic storm; with no solid surface to create friction and steady internal heat feeding it, it persists in the fluid atmosphere, only slowly shrinking.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�1a769e4d80bb�body��u在太空就地取材制造燃料和材料，能大幅降低从地球运货的成本，支撑更远的载人探索。�_In-space resource use cuts the cost of hauling from Earth, enabling farther crewed exploration.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�1be7f6b21862�body�ٖ月球引起的潮汐摩擦正让地球自转极其缓慢地变慢，每世纪一天大约变长约1.7毫秒，远古时一天只有二十多小时。٘Tidal friction from the Moon very slowly brakes Earth's spin—about 1.7 milliseconds longer per century; in the distant past a day was only ~20+ hours.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�208caced54ec�body��~月球背面永远背对地球，无法直接通信，鹊桥中继星停在地月拉格朗日点，把信号转发回地球。ـThe far side never faces Earth, so the Queqiao relay satellite at a Lagrange point bounces signals between the lander and Earth.�ans��src��_国务院新闻办公室《2021中国的航天》白皮书：嫦娥工程探月任务（2022）�YSCIO white paper 'China's Space Program: A 2021 Perspective': Change lunar missions, 2022��id�230213ac722e�body�ٙ折射镜成像锐利好维护但大口径贵；反射镜口径大性价比高但需偶尔调光轴；折反镜紧凑便携适合摄影但价格较高。ٱRefractors give sharp, low-maintenance views but cost more per inch; reflectors are affordable and large but need collimation; catadioptrics are compact for imaging but pricier.�ans��src��<Terence Dickinson,《NightWatch》第4版,Firefly Books,2006�nT. Dickinson, NightWatch: A Practical Guide to Viewing the Universe, 4th ed., Firefly Books, 2006; Chinese ed.��id�27dbd6571e03�body���光年是距离单位，指光在真空中一年走过的距离，约为9.46万亿公里。因为宇宙极其广阔，用公里表示天体距离会数字太大，所以天文学家改用光年。注意：光年说的是距离，不是时间。�A light-year is a unit of distance, the length light travels in vacuum in one year, about 9.46 trillion kilometers. Because the universe is so vast, kilometers would give unwieldy numbers, so astronomers use light-years. Note: a light-year measures distance, not time.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�30e3ac765b2c�body��1993年航天员乘航天飞机上天，为它安装了一套矫正光学组件（像配眼镜），使其恢复清晰视力。�tIn 1993 astronauts flew up on a shuttle and installed corrective optics—like glasses—restoring its sharp vision.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�395119e8a99c�body��i用向下照射、截光型的暖色LED灯，减少向上散射的光，既能省电又能保护暗夜。�jUse downward, shielded warm-LED lamps that cut upward scatter—saving energy while protecting dark skies.�ans��src��<Terence Dickinson,《NightWatch》第4版,Firefly Books,2006�nT. Dickinson, NightWatch: A Practical Guide to Viewing the Universe, 4th ed., Firefly Books, 2006; Chinese ed.��id�3b01f4cc3056�body�٨因为空间在各个点都均匀膨胀，从任何星系看别人都在远离；就像膨胀气球上的斑点，彼此距离都增大，没有哪个斑点是中心。ٕSpace expands uniformly everywhere, so from any galaxy others recede; like dots on an inflating balloon, all distances grow and no dot is the center.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�402f78e96359�body�ٜ强烈的太阳风暴（地磁暴）会压缩并扰动地球磁层，使极光带向低纬度扩张，这时南方地区也可能看到红绿色的极光。٬Strong solar storms (geomagnetic storms) disturb Earth's magnetosphere and push the auroral oval toward lower latitudes, letting mid-latitude regions see red-green auroras.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�4201a2eb44e2�body�ٳ黑暗森林把'听不到外星人'解释为文明因怕被消灭而保持沉默，是对费米悖论的一种文学化解答，但属于猜想而非已被证实的科学结论。٣'Dark Forest' explains the silence as civilizations hiding to avoid destruction—a literary answer to Fermi's paradox, but speculation rather than proven science.�ans��src��'《天文学概论》（费米悖论）�(Encyclopaedia Britannica (Fermi paradox)��id�459c68c87e20�body�ٌ岩石同位素显示月球可能源于约45亿年前一颗火星大小天体撞击地球溅出的物质凝聚而成（大碰撞假说）。ًRock isotopes suggest the Moon formed about 4.5 billion years ago from debris of a Mars-sized body hitting Earth (giant-impact hypothesis).�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�47414ba66f5a�body��8太阳形成后，年轻太阳的辐射和太阳风把内侧的挥发性物质（水、气体）吹向外侧，使内区只留下耐热的岩石金属，形成小而密的类地行星。外区较冷，能积累大量氢氦成为气态巨行星。这种由温度梯度决定的物质分异塑造了行星布局。�RAfter the Sun formed, its radiation and wind blew volatile materials like water and gas outward, leaving only heat-resistant rock and metal in the inner region to make small dense terrestrial planets. The cooler outer region accumulated hydrogen and helium into gas giants. This temperature-driven segregation shaped the planetary layout.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�477cc6154e4c�body�ټ戴森球会遮挡恒星可见光却以红外余热向外辐射，于是目标星在可见光变暗的同时呈现异常强的红外信号，这正是天文学家搜寻的'异常候选'。��A Dyson sphere would dim a star's visible light but glow strongly in infrared waste heat, so the target looks dim in visible but anomalously bright in infrared—a signature astronomers hunt for.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�4bfb464fe3dd�body��#土卫二南极喷出的冰喷泉含有水汽、盐分和简单有机分子，表明其冰壳之下存在液态海洋。潮汐加热为这片地下海提供了能量，而有机物和液态水是生命的基本要素。卡西尼号曾在喷流中检测到构成生命相关的化学成分。�8Enceladus shoots ice plumes from its south pole containing water vapor, salts and simple organics, evidence of a liquid ocean beneath the ice. Tidal heating supplies energy to that subsurface sea, and organics plus liquid water are the ingredients of life. Cassini detected life-relevant chemistry in the plumes.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�4e421df281d3�body��.碳质球粒陨石含有水、有机分子和保存了太阳系形成早期的原始物质，几乎未被加热改造。它们被认为是构建地球等岩质行星的原料之一，还可能是地球水和生命前体物质的来源。分析它们等于直接读取46亿年前的『时间胶囊』。�ECarbonaceous chondrites contain water, organic molecules and pristine material from the solar system's birth, barely altered by heating. They are thought to be building blocks of rocky planets like Earth and may have delivered its water and prebiotic matter. Studying them is like reading a 4.6-billion-year-old time capsule.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�52fd983e8f6c�body���潮汐摩擦把地球自转的一部分角动量转移给月球轨道，使月球每年远离约3.8厘米。同时地球自转因此略微变慢，一天的长度在缓慢增加。这是角动量守恒在地月系统中的直接体现。�Tidal friction transfers some of Earth's rotational angular momentum into the Moon's orbit, pushing the Moon outward by about 3.8 centimeters per year. Earth's spin slows slightly as a result, lengthening the day. This is angular-momentum conservation acting in the Earth-Moon system.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�54e587a9bd5b�body�ي他公开支持日心说，与当时教会的宇宙观相悖，结果被审判并被迫放弃观点，成为科学自由的著名事件。كHe publicly supported heliocentrism against Church doctrine, was tried and forced to recant—a famous case for scientific freedom.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�5b7cff617308�body�٬光传播需要时间，太阳的光要8分钟才到地球，遥远星系的光走了上亿年；所以我们望得越远，看到的就越是宇宙更早时期的样子。ٙLight takes time to travel—Sunlight needs 8 minutes, distant galaxies millions of years—so the farther we look, the earlier in cosmic history we see.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�62348540cd1f�body�ه历元是星表坐标对应的标准参考时刻；由于岁差和恒星自行，坐标会随时间偏移，必须注明基准年代。ٍAn epoch is the reference time for catalog coordinates; due to precession and proper motion, positions drift, so the base era must be stated.�ans��src��<Terence Dickinson,《NightWatch》第4版,Firefly Books,2006�nT. Dickinson, NightWatch: A Practical Guide to Viewing the Universe, 4th ed., Firefly Books, 2006; Chinese ed.��id�64a814b3af65�body��g由教皇格里高利十三世在1582年改革儒略历而定，使日历与季节长期保持一致。�lPope Gregory XIII reformed the Julian calendar in 1582, keeping the calendar aligned with seasons long-term.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�668c6383b5c4�body���天文学家按反射光谱把小行星大致分为C、S、M等类型：C型富含碳质、颜色偏暗，最常见；S型以硅酸盐岩石为主；M型富含金属，可能是破碎行星核的残片。分类有助于推断它们的成分和起源。�	By reflection spectra, asteroids are grouped into classes like C, S and M: C-type are dark, carbon-rich and most common; S-type are silicate rocks; M-type are metallic, possibly fragments of broken planetary cores. Classification helps infer composition and origin.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�66f9c6632a4a�body�ه同一星团的恒星几乎同龄但质量不同，质量大的演化更快；看哪些质量的星已离开主序就能反推年龄。ٌCluster stars share an age but differ in mass; since massive ones evolve faster, seeing which masses left the main sequence reveals the age.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�6f1dea80a65b�body��;探测器从行星旁掠过时，借助行星的引力改变自身速度和方向，就像被甩了一下的弹弓。相对太阳来看，探测器可以『窃取』行星的一小部分轨道动量来加速或减速，而行星自身几乎不受影响。旅行者号正是靠多次引力助推才飞出太阳系。�JWhen a probe swings past a planet, the planet's gravity bends and changes its speed and direction, like a slingshot. In the Sun's frame the craft 'steals' a tiny bit of the planet's orbital momentum to speed up or slow down, while the planet is essentially unaffected. The Voyagers used repeated assists to leave the solar system.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�6f51896fd5cd�body�ٹ闰秒会让金融、通信、导航系统每次都要特殊应对，易出故障；2022年国际计量大会决定最晚2035年起不再插入闰秒，改用更平滑的协调方式。��Leap seconds force finance, communications and navigation systems to make special adjustments and risk glitches; in 2022 the metrology assembly decided to stop inserting them by 2035, using smoother coordination.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�6fec5a563413�body��即使在数百公里高空，仍有极稀薄的大气分子产生微弱阻力，使卫星逐渐损失轨道能量、轨道高度缓慢下降。高度越低阻力越大，形成正反馈，最终再入烧毁。因此空间站需要定期抬升轨道来『续命』。�Even hundreds of kilometers up, a trace of atmosphere creates tiny drag that slowly bleeds orbital energy and lowers altitude. Lower altitude means more drag, a positive feedback that ends in reentry and burn-up. That is why stations periodically raise their orbit to stay alive.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�700e89df47dd�body��x多台小望远镜协同可形成等效大口径、还能同时覆盖多波段与广视场，成本与可靠性更优。�xMultiple small telescopes together mimic a large aperture and cover more bands and field at better cost and reliability.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�75cca6f56106�body��1火箭推进剂分液体和固体两大类：液体如液氧-煤油、液氢-液氧，比冲高、可节流关断；固体燃料结构简单、响应快但难控制。还有剧毒但可常温存贮的肼类，以及正在发展的甲烷燃料。不同任务会权衡性能、成本和安全性来选型。�:Rocket propellants split into liquid and solid types: liquids like LOX-kerosene or LH2-LOX give high efficiency and throttle control, while solids are simple and quick but hard to control. There are also storable hydrazines and the emerging methane fuels. Missions weigh performance, cost and safety when choosing.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�76abf3d13184�body�ف掉落地面的叫陨石。它保留了太阳系早期的物质成分，是研究行星形成和太阳系的“时间胶囊”。مOne that reaches the ground is a meteorite. It preserves early solar-system material, a 'time capsule' for studying planet formation.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�7a9bc06c2540�body��5冥卫一卡戎质量约为冥王星的五分之一，两者相互潮汐锁定，永远以同一面朝向彼此，形成少见的『双矮行星』系统。它们的共同质心落在两者之外，因此更像一对互相绕转的伙伴。这一系统为研究矮行星演化和碰撞起源提供了线索。�[Charon is about one-fifth of Pluto's mass, and the pair are mutually tidally locked, always showing the same face to each other, forming a rare 'binary dwarf planet' system. Their center of mass lies between them, so they behave more like partners orbiting a point in space. The system offers clues to dwarf-planet evolution and collision origins.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�8b4c89f0ff7d�body��x信号穿过电离层时速度会变化，导致定位偏差；系统用双频信号来修正这种延迟提高精度。�zSignals slow in the ionosphere, biasing position; systems use dual frequencies to correct this delay and improve accuracy.�ans��src��G国务院新闻办公室《2021中国的航天》航天白皮书，2022�^State Council Information Office: China's Space Program: A 2021 Perspective, white paper, 2022��id�8b82c73812af�body�ي夏令时把时钟拨快一小时，让傍晚多利用日光、减少照明用电；并非所有国家都采用，且起止日期不同。ْDaylight saving shifts clocks forward an hour to use evening daylight and cut lighting energy; not all countries use it, and start/end dates vary.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�976313541580�body�٨根据广义相对论，引力越强、时空弯曲越厉害，时钟走得越慢；GPS卫星离地心较远、引力较弱，其钟比地面快，必须事先校正。ٳPer general relativity, stronger gravity bends spacetime more and slows clocks; GPS satellites higher up feel weaker gravity and tick faster, so they must be corrected in advance.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�9d4f37af049d�body��1908年西伯利亚通古斯地区发生猛烈空中爆炸，摧毁约2000平方公里森林却没留下陨石坑。主流解释是一颗直径数十米的小天体在大气层中空爆，可能是小行星或彗星碎片。它警示了近地小天体撞击的现实威胁。�/In 1908 a violent aerial explosion flattened about 2,000 square kilometers of Siberian forest with no impact crater. The leading explanation is a small body tens of meters across that airburst in the atmosphere, perhaps an asteroid or comet fragment. It warns of the real threat from near-Earth objects.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�a00147cd2397�body���它认为复杂生命需要恰好合适的恒星类型、行星位置、大卫星、板块运动等一长串巧合，地球这样的条件在银河系中极其稀少，所以智慧生命罕见。��It argues complex life needs a long chain of coincidences—right star type, location, big moon, plate tectonics—making Earth-like conditions so rare in the galaxy that intelligent life is uncommon.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�a1fa5a12624b�body�ٱ他们发现日食约每18年11天重复一次（'沙罗周期'），记录历史食象后就能推算未来哪些朔日可能发生日食，是人类最早的日月食预报。ٴThey found eclipses repeat every ~18 years 11 days (the Saros cycle); logging past eclipses let them forecast which new moons might bring one—humanity's first eclipse prediction.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�b08fb19df0ad�body�ٹ在相对论中，两个事件是否'同时'取决于观察者的运动状态；不同惯性系对先后顺序会有不同判断，所以不存在对所有人都一致的绝对时刻。١In relativity whether two events are simultaneous depends on the observer's motion; different frames disagree on order, so there is no absolute now for everyone.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�b16f94de859b�body���天体间的引力使彼此产生'潮汐鼓包'，若自转快于公转，鼓包被拉伸并借摩擦力减慢自转，最终自转与公转同步；对月球而言这一过程发生在数十亿年前。��Mutual gravity creates tidal bulges; if a body spins faster than it orbits, the bulge is dragged and friction slows the spin until rotation matches orbit—for the Moon this locked billions of years ago.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�b32d6c65d3d2�body��G在恒星周围的原始星盘中，微米级尘埃通过碰撞黏结成更大的颗粒，再经引力吸积长成星子，最终形成行星胚胎和行星，这一过程叫吸积。内侧岩质行星靠固体物质堆积，外侧巨行星先形成核再俘获气体。吸积理论能解释行星大小分布和轨道特征。�RIn a protoplanetary disk, micron-sized dust sticks into bigger grains through collisions, then grows by gravitational accretion into planetesimals and finally planets, a process called accretion. Inner rocky planets build from solids, while outer giants form cores that then capture gas. Accretion theory explains planet sizes and orbits.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�b40f5a749d1a�body���不会。太阳目前正处于稳定的中年阶段，依靠核心的氢聚变为氦发光，这一阶段还能持续约50亿年。之后它会膨胀成红巨星，最终收缩为白矮星并逐渐冷却。所以太阳的寿命是有限的。��No. The Sun is in a stable middle age, shining by fusing hydrogen into helium in its core, a phase lasting about 5 billion more years. It will then swell into a red giant and finally shrink into a cooling white dwarf. So the Sun's life is finite.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�b79976cc4ca6�body�ٟ月球引起的潮汐摩擦把地球自转的角动量转移给月球轨道，使日长每世纪增加约1.7毫秒；远古一年有400多天，就是证据。٭Tidal friction from the Moon transfers Earth's spin angular momentum to the lunar orbit, lengthening the day by ~1.7 ms per century; ancient years had over 400 days—proof.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�b79c908d3c8f�body���星系是由引力束缚在一起的大批恒星、星际气体、尘埃和暗物质的巨大集合体。小的星系只有几百万颗恒星，大的星系可达数万亿颗。银河系只是宇宙中数千亿个星系之一。�A galaxy is a vast collection of stars, interstellar gas, dust, and dark matter all bound together by gravity. Small galaxies hold only a few million stars, while large ones contain trillions. The Milky Way is just one of hundreds of billions of galaxies in the universe.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�b79e5ba0b727�body�ٱ当卫星靠近到行星的潮汐引力超过自身引力时，就会被拉扯解体，这个临界距离叫洛希极限；土星环可能就来自越过极限的卫星碎屑。ٹWhen a moon comes so close that the planet's tidal pull beats its own gravity, it breaks up; that distance is the Roche limit—Saturn's rings may be debris from a moon that crossed it.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�b82c8d58c5b4�body�ه月球绕地球轨道是椭圆的，近地点附近满月时离地球更近，视直径和亮度都会比远地点满月增大一些。وThe Moon's orbit is elliptical; a full moon near perigee is closer, so its apparent size and brightness are a bit larger than at apogee.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�c436d9f47b4f�body�ِ恒星各自以不同速度和方向运动（自行），几万年累积下来亮星的相对位置会变化，星座形状也就慢慢变形。ٟStars move at different speeds and directions (proper motion); over tens of thousands of years their relative positions shift, slowly reshaping constellations.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�cb012516a46f�body�ٖ他仍认为行星沿正圆轨道匀速运动，且太阳在宇宙中心；后来开普勒发现椭圆轨道、牛顿给出引力解释才更完善。مHe still used circular uniform orbits with the Sun at the universe's center; Kepler's ellipses and Newton's gravity later refined it.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�cb4ce425f06f�body���恒星、行星、气体等我们熟悉的普通（重子）物质只占宇宙总能量密度的约5%。剩下的约27%是暗物质，约68%是暗能量。也就是说，宇宙中绝大部分成分人类至今还不了解。�Ordinary (baryonic) matter that we know as stars, planets, and gas makes up only about 5% of the universe's total energy density. The remaining roughly 27% is dark matter and about 68% is dark energy. In other words, most of the universe's makeup remains unknown to us.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�d22c5dcd3a22�body�ٓ平时太阳强光掩盖了暗淡的日冕，日全食时月球恰好遮住光球层，亮度骤降上百万倍，稀薄的日冕才显露出来。ٞNormally the bright photosphere hides the faint corona; during totality the Moon blocks the photosphere, dimming light a millionfold so the thin corona shows.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d468c43fc8d2�body��月球的引力像一根『锚』，减弱了其他行星对地球自转轴的扰动，使地轴倾角长期保持在约23.5度附近。若没有这样的大卫星，地轴可能剧烈摆动，导致气候极端不稳。这种稳定被认为有利于地球生命的长期演化。�'The Moon's gravity acts like an anchor that damps perturbations from other planets, keeping Earth's axial tilt near a steady 23.5 degrees. Without such a large moon the tilt could wobble wildly, causing extreme climate instability. This stability is thought to have helped life persist on Earth.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d4cef1b3a7b9�body�ه它把可能含生命信息的岩芯封存，等待未来的取样返回任务带回地球，在更强大的实验室里仔细分析。�|It caches cores that may hold biosignatures for a future sample-return mission to bring to Earth labs for detailed analysis.�ans��src��{Witze,《NASA Mars rover to cache first rock samples for delivery to Earth》,Nature,2022 (DOI: 10.1038/d41586-022-04433-6)�yWitze, 'NASA Mars rover to cache first rock samples for delivery to Earth', Nature, 2022, DOI: 10.1038/d41586-022-04433-6��id�d538b163166c�body��u按相对论，越接近光速所需能量越大，且有时间膨胀效应，使跨越光年级距离极其困难。�xRelativity says energy balloons as you approach light speed, with time dilation, making light-year trips extremely hard.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d59844661d74�body��o最近距离单程约7个月；由于地球和火星轨道位置，发射窗口每约26个月才出现一次。�yA one-way trip is ~7 months at closest approach; launch windows open only about every 26 months due to orbital positions.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�e1702a3f83d0�body�٨若宇宙无限古老且静止，各个方向都该有星光、夜空应全亮；实际宇宙有限年龄且膨胀红移削弱远处星光，所以天空仍是黑的。��In an infinite, eternal static universe every direction would show starlight and the sky would glow; but the universe has finite age and expansion redshifts distant light, leaving the sky dark.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�e80740280a6e�body�٢土星环由无数冰与岩石碎块组成，位于它的洛希极限内、无法聚成卫星；木星、天王星也有环，只是暗淡得多，不易看见。ٙSaturn's rings are countless ice and rock bits within its Roche limit, unable to clump into a moon; Jupiter and Uranus have fainter rings, harder to see.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�ee757da6863a�body��r它把行星轨道周期的平方与轨道半长轴的立方联系起来，可据此推算天体距离或质量。�sIt links the square of the orbital period to the cube of the semi-major axis, letting us infer distances or masses.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�f1382d8e6b78�body�ٳ它是宇宙约38万岁时、物质与辐射脱耦后释放的光，如今红移成微波充满全天空，记录了最早期宇宙的温度起伏，是宇宙学的关键证据。��It's light released when the universe was ~380,000 years old, after matter and radiation decoupled; now redshifted to microwaves, it maps the infant universe's temperature ripples—key cosmological evidence.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�f309e07744e7�body���它设想从普通物质到星际文明之间有一道极难跨越的关卡（如生命起源、核毁灭），我们没看到外星文明，可能说明大多数文明都卡在了这道过滤器上。��It imagines a very hard barrier between matter and interstellar civilization (e.g., origin of life, nuclear ruin); our silence from aliens may mean most civilizations get stopped at that filter.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�f3930caa33aa�body��|两者都按太阳黄经划分，但节气是每15度均匀分24段，而西方星座边界是历史上不规则划定的。مBoth use solar longitude, but terms divide it evenly into 24 steps of 15°, while Western constellation borders were set irregularly.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�f3c3560d0571�body�ٴ高处空气稀薄而稳定、水汽少，沙漠晴天多、湿度低，都能减少图像模糊与遮挡；远离城市还能避开灯光造成的光污染，看到更暗的星。��High, dry mountain sites have thin, steady air and little water vapor; deserts are clear and arid, reducing blur and blockage, while distance from cities avoids light pollution so fainter stars are visible.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�f588bc178eb9�body��大黑斑是1989年旅行者2号发现于海王星南半球的一个巨型风暴系统，面积接近地球大小。它类似木星大红斑，但由甲烷吸收使暗区呈现深蓝黑色。有趣的是，后来观测发现它已消失，说明海王星大气变化很快。� The Great Dark Spot was a giant storm in Neptune's southern hemisphere spotted by Voyager 2 in 1989, about the size of Earth. Like Jupiter's red spot but appearing dark blue-black from methane absorption, it later vanished in later observations, showing Neptune's atmosphere changes fast.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�f668440eea1d�body�� 主要方法有两种：凌星法观测行星遮住恒星时亮度的细微下降，径向速度法测量行星引力使恒星产生的微小摆动。此外还有直接成像、微引力透镜等。这些方法让我们已发现数千颗系外行星，并评估其是否位于宜居带。�CThe main methods are the transit method, watching tiny brightness dips as a planet crosses its star, and the radial-velocity method, measuring the star's tiny wobble from the planet's gravity. Direct imaging and microlensing also help. They have revealed thousands of exoplanets and let us assess habitable-zone candidates.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�001c2b684135�body�٢当双星相互遮挡时，亮度出现规律凹缺，结合轨道周期可推算两星的大小、质量与温度，是精确测定恒星参数的重要手段。ٻWhen the two stars eclipse each other, the light dips regularly; with the orbital period this yields their sizes, masses, and temperatures—a precise way to determine stellar parameters.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�009b04bb35e3�body��在原行星盘内区温度高，挥发性冰无法凝结，只剩难熔的岩石和金属形成类地行星。外区低于雪线，水冰等挥发物可以富集，于是形成以冰和气体为主的巨行星，这一温度梯度是成分分带的根本原因。�XIn the inner protoplanetary disk temperatures were too high for volatile ices to condense, leaving only refractory rock and metal to build terrestrial planets. Beyond the snow line, water ice and other volatiles could accumulate, enabling ice- and gas-rich giant planets; this temperature gradient is the root cause of the compositional zoning.�ans��src���Hayashi,《Structure of the Solar Nebula, Growth and Decay of Magnetic Fields and Effects of Magnetic and Turbulent Viscosities on the Nebula》,Progress of Theoretical Physics Supplement,1981 (DOI: 10.1143/ptps.70.35)��Hayashi, 'Structure of the Solar Nebula, Growth and Decay of Magnetic Fields and Effects of Magnetic and Turbulent Viscosities on the Nebula', Progress of Theoretical Physics Supplement, 1981, DOI: 10.1143/ptps.70.35��id�00fe151aa590�body���毫秒脉冲星以极高稳定性发出射电脉冲，相当于宇宙中的天然时钟；当波长以光年计的纳赫兹引力波穿过地球与脉冲星之间的时空时，会周期性地改变脉冲到达地球的时间。NANOGrav 等阵列通过长期监测数十颗脉冲星的到达时间残差的相关性，在 2023 年报告了来自超大质量黑洞双星背景的纳赫兹引力波迹象。��Millisecond pulsars emit radio pulses with extraordinary clock-like stability, acting as natural cosmic clocks; when nanohertz gravitational waves with light-year wavelengths pass through the spacetime between Earth and a pulsar, they periodically alter the pulse arrival times at Earth. Arrays such as NANOGrav monitor the correlated timing residuals of dozens of pulsars over years and in 2023 reported evidence of a nanohertz gravitational-wave background from supermassive black hole binaries.�ans��src��*NANOGrav 合作（脉冲星计时阵列）�,NANOGrav Collaboration (Pulsar Timing Array)��id�010ed2a84977�body�ٴ赫罗图以恒星的光谱类型（对应温度）为横轴、光度为纵轴绘制，多数恒星落在主序带上。它能直观地反映恒星的演化阶段和物理性质。��The Hertzsprung-Russell diagram plots stars by spectral type (temperature) against luminosity, with most lying along the main sequence. It reveals a star's evolutionary stage and physical nature at a glance.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�028ba1e85a5d�body�ٗ长暴（持续数秒到几分钟）通常关联大质量恒星的坍缩，短暴（不到两秒）多来自双中子星或中子星-黑洞的并合。��Long bursts (seconds to minutes) are usually linked to collapsing massive stars, while short bursts (under two seconds) mostly come from mergers of two neutron stars or a neutron star and black hole.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�03605b5759a5�body���伽利略号探测器发现，木卫二在木星磁场中穿行时会产生感应磁场，这是其内部存在导电层的最有力证据，而最合理的导电层就是咸水海洋。与此同时，木卫二表面的裂缝、碎冰块和“混沌地形”表明冰壳一直在缓慢活动，表面年龄极轻。潮汐加热则为海洋保持液态提供了持续能量。据此估算，木卫二的海洋深度可能达数十到上百公里。��The Galileo spacecraft found that Europa generates an induced magnetic field as it moves through Jupiter's magnetosphere, the strongest evidence for an electrically conductive layer beneath the surface, most plausibly a salty ocean. At the same time, the moon's surface cracks, ice rafts and chaotic terrain reveal ongoing crustal activity and a very young surface age. Tidal heating supplies the energy that keeps the ocean liquid. Estimates put the ocean's depth at tens to more than a hundred kilometers.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�036a90049f17�body�ٺ潮汐锁定是天体因引力相互作用，自转周期与公转周期逐渐同步的现象，结果是它总以同一面朝向引力更强的伴侣；月球与许多卫星都如此。٦Tidal locking is when an object's spin synchronizes with its orbit due to gravity, always showing one face to its partner; the Moon and many moons are tidally locked.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�0401f8fd0093�body��P事件视界望远镜将分布全球的多台射电望远镜通过甚长基线干涉连成口径相当于地球大小的虚拟望远镜，在1.3毫米波长观测黑洞周围发光的吸积环。结合原子钟同步与海量相关处理，重建出M87*和人马座A*的阴影图像。这是干涉技术和计算成像的巅峰之作。��The Event Horizon Telescope linked radio dishes worldwide via Very Long Baseline Interferometry into a virtual telescope the size of Earth, observing the glowing accretion ring around black holes at 1.3 mm. Using atomic-clock synchronization and massive correlation processing, it reconstructed shadow images of M87* and Sagittarius A*. It is a pinnacle of interferometry and computational imaging.�ans��src��NEvent Horizon Telescope Collaboration 2019, ApJL 875, L1；2022, ApJL 930, L12�OEvent Horizon Telescope Collaboration 2019, ApJL, 875, L1; 2022, ApJL, 930, L12��id�04284940d0ff�body�٢椭圆星系外形接近椭球、缺乏明显旋臂和大量气体尘埃，恒星大多年老，新恒星形成很少，是宇宙中常见的星系形态之一。٠Elliptical galaxies are oval-shaped with little gas or dust and few spiral arms; their stars are mostly old, and they form few new stars—a common galaxy type.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�04e16ae05487�body��t流浪行星是不围绕任何恒星运行、在星系中自由漂浮的行星质量天体，可能源于行星系统形成时的抛射或恒星疏散。它们自身不发光，仅靠极微弱的余热辐射，因此常规凌星和视向速度法都失效。微引力透镜是目前最有效的方法，当它们偶然掠过背景恒星前方时会使星光短暂增亮。��Rogue planets are planet-mass bodies drifting freely through the galaxy with no host star, likely ejected during the chaos of planet formation or stellar dispersal. They emit no starlight, only faint residual heat, so transit and radial-velocity methods fail. Microlensing is currently the most effective technique, briefly brightening a background star when a rogue planet passes in front of it.�ans��src��}Sumi 等《Unbound or distant planetary-mass population》（2011，Nature）；NASA 南希·格雷斯·罗曼空间望远镜�pSumi et al., Unbound or distant planetary-mass population (2011, Nature); NASA Nancy Grace Roman Space Telescope��id�05051b5f5f0b�body�٫极暗光源到达探测器的光子数本身随机起伏（散粒噪声），遵循泊松统计，是限制测光精度的基本极限，常需长时间曝光来压制。ٷFor very faint sources, the random arrival of photons (shot noise) follows Poisson statistics and sets the basic limit on photometric precision, usually beaten down by long exposures.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�064d72dfb9f2�body��量子场论估算的真空能密度比观测到的暗能量密度大了约10的120次方倍，这一巨大差异称为宇宙学常数问题。它被视为理论物理最严重的失配之一。调和二者可能需要新的对称性或量子引力理论。�BQuantum field theory estimates a vacuum energy density about 10^120 times larger than the observed dark energy density, a discrepancy known as the cosmological constant problem. It is considered one of the worst mismatches in theoretical physics. Reconciling them may require new symmetries or a quantum theory of gravity.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�065706a962e5�body���引力弹弓是利用行星引力为探测器加速或改变方向的技术：探测器借行星公转的动量“借力”，从而节省燃料抵达更远目标，如旅行者号借助木星、土星加速。پA gravity assist uses a planet's gravity to speed up or redirect a probe, borrowing the planet's orbital momentum to save fuel for farther targets—Voyager used Jupiter and Saturn this way.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�06cdfc111f11�body���韦布在早期宇宙（z约7-10）看到比模型预测更多、更亮、更成熟的星系，若属实意味着星系形成比想像更快，可能需要修正暗物质晕吸积或恒星初始质量函数。��Webb sees more, brighter, more mature galaxies in the early Universe (z≈7–10) than models predict; if real, galaxy formation was faster than thought, perhaps needing revised dark-matter halo accretion or stellar initial mass function.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�07402261fbc5�body��G黑洞热力学第一定律将质量变化、角动量、电荷与视界面积（熵）和表面引力（温度）联系起来，形式类似普通热力学第一定律。它表明增加黑洞质量或角动量会相应改变其视界面积和表面引力。这一对应揭示了引力量与热力学量之间的深刻关系。��The first law of black hole thermodynamics relates changes in mass, angular momentum, and charge to the horizon area (entropy) and surface gravity (temperature), mirroring the ordinary first law of thermodynamics. It shows that adding mass or spin changes the horizon area and surface gravity accordingly. This correspondence reveals a deep link between gravitational and thermodynamic quantities.�ans��src��LWald, R.M.《广义相对论》1984 年芝加哥大学出版社，第 12 章�EWald, R.M., General Relativity (Univ. of Chicago Press, 1984), ch. 12��id�091f7edd31c6�body��w单独一颗恒星的质量无法直接测量，但双星系统提供了途径。观测两颗星的轨道周期和半长轴，代入牛顿引力与开普勒第三定律，可以求出系统的总质量。如果还能测出每颗星相对质心的轨道半径，就能分别求出各自的质量。双星轨道测量因此是唯一能直接测定恒星质量的可靠途径。��The mass of an isolated star cannot be measured directly, but binary systems provide a way. Observing the orbital period and semimajor axis of two stars and applying Newtonian gravity with Kepler's third law yields the system's total mass. If each star's orbit around the barycenter is also measured, the individual masses can be separated. Binary orbit analysis is thus essentially the only reliable direct route to stellar masses.�ans��src��3《天文学概论》（双星轨道质量测量）�"IAU (binary star mass measurement)��id�095e0863bd6d�body�ّ距离我们最近的系外行星是围绕比邻星运行的“比邻星b”，位于约4.2光年外半人马座三星系统中的红矮星旁。لThe nearest exoplanet is Proxima b, orbiting the red dwarf Proxima Centauri about 4.2 light-years away in the Alpha Centauri system.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�0adffa5aa2ce�body�٨地下实验室（如XENONnT、LZ、PandaX）用极纯液体闪烁体等待暗物质粒子撞上原子核产生微弱闪光，靠深埋地下屏蔽宇宙射线本底。��Underground labs (XENONnT, LZ, PandaX) use ultrapure scintillators to wait for a dark-matter particle to nudge a nucleus into a faint flash, shielded deep underground from cosmic-ray background.�ans��src��AXENON / LZ 暗物质直接探测实验（液氙时间投影室）�3XENON / LZ dark matter direct-detection experiments��id�0b5258124002�body��J围绕黑洞高速公转的吸积盘内侧物质在朝向地球一侧产生强蓝移、背向一侧强红移，形成不对称的宽铁 Kα 线。叠加黑洞引力造成的系统红移后，整体谱线畸变（相对论性展宽）可反推最内稳定圆轨道（ISCO）与黑洞自旋，二者贡献在模型拟合中分离。�nDisk material orbiting near the hole shows strong blueshift on the approaching side and redshift on the receding side, broadening the iron Kα line asymmetrically. Combined with the black hole's gravitational redshift, the relativistic line profile lets one infer the innermost stable circular orbit (ISCO) and spin, with the two contributions separated in modeling.�ans��src��LFabian, Rees, Stella & White 1989, MNRAS 238, 729（内盘 X 射线荧光）�kFabian, Rees, Stella & White (1989), MNRAS 238, 729, 'X-ray fluorescence from the inner disc in Cygnus X-1'��id�0cc2221337a4�body���当低质量恒星（约0.8至2.0倍太阳质量）耗尽核心氢后，简并电子气体支撑的氦核逐渐升温，直到氦聚变的点火温度被突破。由于简并物质不靠热压支撑，能量释放不会膨胀降温，导致失控式的热核爆发，即氦闪。它只在电子简并显著的核心出现，因此大质量恒星因核心温和膨胀而避免这一现象。��When a low-mass star, roughly one to two solar masses, exhausts core hydrogen, its helium core supported by degenerate electrons heats until it reaches the ignition temperature for helium fusion. Because degenerate matter does not expand and cool in response to heating, the energy release runs away in a violent thermonuclear event called the helium flash. This only happens where electron degeneracy is significant, so more massive stars avoid it by gently expanding their cores instead.�ans��src�نSchwarzschild 与 Härm《Evolution of a Massive Star》（1965，ApJ）；Kippenhahn 与 Weigert《Stellar Structure and Evolution》�uSchwarzschild & Härm, Evolution of a Massive Star (1965, ApJ); Kippenhahn & Weigert, Stellar Structure and Evolution��id�0e41c309e7cc�body��e双中子星并合抛出的富中子物质发生快中子俘获（r 过程）合成重元素。蓝色成分来自低不透明度、高纬度的较薄抛射物；红色成分来自赤道方向含镧系元素、不透明度高的较厚抛射物，对应并合喷流与潮汐尾的不同几何。引力波事件 GW170817 的电磁对应体证实了该模型。�gEjected neutron-rich matter in a binary neutron-star merger undergoes r-process synthesis of heavy elements. The blue component comes from low-opacity, high-latitude thin ejecta; the red from equatorial, lanthanide-rich, high-opacity thick ejecta—different geometries of the jet and tidal tails. The GW170817 electromagnetic counterpart confirmed the model.�ans��src��;Abbott 等 2017, ApJ 848, L12（GW170817 引力波发现）�wAbbott et al. (2017), ApJL 848, L12, 'GW170817: Observation of Gravitational Waves from a Binary Neutron Star Inspiral'��id�0ec51652f680�body��Y自适应光学用可变形镜实时修正被大气扰动的波前，其形状由波前传感器每秒上千次测量决定。系统以明亮参考星或人造激光导星为基准，把模糊的星像恢复成接近衍射极限的锐利图像。欧洲南方天文台的甚大望远镜凭借这一技术显著提升了地基观测的分辨率。��Adaptive optics uses a deformable mirror to correct the wavefront distorted by the atmosphere in real time, its shape set by a wavefront sensor sampling thousands of times per second. The system locks onto a bright reference star or an artificial laser guide star to recover near diffraction-limited sharp images from blurred ones. ESO's Very Large Telescope uses this technique to dramatically raise ground-based resolution.�ans��src�ِBeckers《Adaptive Optics for Astronomy》（1993，Annual Review of Astronomy & Astrophysics）；欧洲南方天文台（ESO）甚大望远镜�rBeckers, Adaptive Optics for Astronomy (1993, Annual Review of Astronomy & Astrophysics); ESO Very Large Telescope��id�0f535ce6cd5b�body�ِ直接成像是给行星本身拍照，但行星比恒星暗上亿倍且离得很近，必须遮挡星光并借助自适应光学才能分辨。ٴDirect imaging photographs the planet itself, but planets are billions of times fainter than their star and very close, requiring starlight blocking and adaptive optics to resolve.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�13b3916b86a4�body���千新星是并合放射性抛射物自身的辐射（光学/红外），余辉是喷流撞入周围介质产生的多波段辐射；两者时空与机制都不同，共同描绘并合全貌。��A kilonova is the optical/infrared glow of the merger's radioactive ejecta, while the afterglow is multi-wavelength radiation from the jet slamming into surrounding matter; different in time, place and mechanism, together they paint the merger.�ans��src��Abbott et al.《Multi-messenger Observations of a Binary Neutron Star Merger》(ApJL 848, L12, 2017);LIGO-Virgo 科学合作组نAbbott et al., Multi-messenger Observations of a Binary Neutron Star Merger (ApJL 848, L12, 2017); LIGO-Virgo Scientific Collaboration��id�15020a31ece2�body��;在遗迹激波前后，带电粒子被上游与下游磁场不规则性反复跨越激波面散射，每轮穿越获得与当地流速成比例的增益，能量按幂律累积——即一阶费米加速。当粒子能量高到能逃逸时形成观测到的硬幂律宇宙线谱，并伴随强同步辐射遗迹。�dAcross the remnant shock, charged particles are repeatedly scattered by upstream/downstream magnetic irregularities, crossing the shock front each cycle and gaining energy proportional to the flow speed—first-order Fermi acceleration. High-energy particles eventually escape, yielding the observed hard power-law spectrum and strong synchrotron remnants.�ans��src��@Bell 1978, MNRAS 182, 147《激波锋面上宇宙线的加速》�QBell (1978), MNRAS 182, 147, 'The acceleration of cosmic rays in shock fronts. I'��id�16721f17ebd2�body��0中子星靠中子简并压力与核力抵抗自身引力。理论上的最大质量由托尔曼-奥本海默-沃尔科夫极限给出，约在2至3倍太阳质量之间；超过它，中子星将坍缩成黑洞。近年对双中子星并合的观测把这一上限约束到约2.3倍太阳质量附近。�PA neutron star resists its own gravity through neutron degeneracy pressure and nuclear forces. Theory sets a maximum mass, the Tolman–Oppenheimer–Volkoff limit, at roughly 2–3 solar masses; above it the star collapses into a black hole. Recent neutron-star-merger observations constrain this upper bound to about 2.3 solar masses.�ans��src��dTolman、Oppenheimer 与 Volkoff（1939，中子星最大质量）；LIGO/Virgo（GW170817 约束）�;Tolman, Oppenheimer & Volkoff (1939); LIGO/Virgo (GW170817)��id�17378bd5351b�body��贝肯斯坦证明黑洞的熵正比于其事件视界面积而非体积，即面积定律，这暗示引力系统的信息容量由边界面积决定。贝肯斯坦上限则给出一个有限区域中可容纳的最大信息量。这些结果深刻影响了全息原理的提出。�lBekenstein showed that a black hole's entropy is proportional to the area of its event horizon rather than its volume, the area law, implying that a gravitational system's information capacity is set by its boundary area. The Bekenstein bound gives the maximum information that can fit in a finite region. These ideas strongly influenced the holographic principle.�ans��src��LWald, R.M.《广义相对论》1984 年芝加哥大学出版社，第 12 章�EWald, R.M., General Relativity (Univ. of Chicago Press, 1984), ch. 12��id�174bab1080a2�body���柯伊伯带是位于海王星轨道外约 30–50 天文单位的盘状区域，由冰质天体构成、基本处于行星形成后原位保留的状态。奥尔特云则是延伸至数千至十万天文单位的球壳，被认为是早期太阳系外围天体被巨行星引力散射到遥远轨道后形成的彗星储库，二者一扁一盘、一远一球，起源机制迥异。��The Kuiper Belt is a disk-like region from about 30 to 50 astronomical units beyond Neptune, made of icy bodies largely retained in situ after planet formation. The Oort Cloud is a spherical shell reaching thousands to a hundred thousand astronomical units, thought to be a comet reservoir formed when outer Solar System bodies were gravitationally scattered to distant orbits by the giant planets, so one is a flat disk nearby and the other a far spherical shell of different origin.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�19158f4250ba�body��d太阳发电机理论认为，差旋层中的较差自转把极向磁场拉伸成环向磁场，而对流区的浮力和螺旋对流又把部分环向磁场扭转为反向的极向磁场，形成自我维持的振荡。这一 α-Ω 发电机解释了 11 年黑子周期与磁场极性翻转，但对流区细节与子午环流的作用仍是研究前沿。��Solar dynamo theory holds that differential rotation in the tachocline stretches poloidal field into toroidal field, while buoyancy and helical convection in the convection zone twist part of that toroidal field back into reversed poloidal field, producing a self-sustaining oscillation. This alpha-Omega dynamo explains the 11-year sunspot cycle and magnetic polarity reversal, though the details of the convection zone and meridional circulation remain active research frontiers.�ans��src�� 《天体物理学杂志》(ApJ)�The Astrophysical Journal (ApJ)��id�1c09a6108068�body��I太阳内部较差自转把子午环流产生的极向磁场拉伸成环向磁场，这一过程由对流层的湍流对流不断放大与重组。磁场在表面浮现形成黑子和活动区，极性每11年翻转一次，构成22年的磁周期。帕克在1955年提出的发电机理论为解释这一周期奠定了基础。��Differential rotation inside the Sun stretches the poloidal field generated by meridional circulation into a toroidal field, while turbulent convection in the envelope continually amplifies and reorganizes it. Magnetic flux emerges at the surface as sunspots and active regions, with polarity flipping every 11 years, giving a 22-year magnetic cycle. Parker's 1955 dynamo theory laid the foundation for explaining this periodicity.�ans��src��UParker《The solar dynamo》（1955，ApJ）；NASA 太阳动力学天文台（SDO）�KParker, The solar dynamo (1955, ApJ); NASA Solar Dynamics Observatory (SDO)��id�1e869874d6e6�body��t超新星爆发与活动星系核会把能量和金属物质以风与喷流形式注入星际介质，既能加热并驱散冷气体、抑制过度恒星形成，也能在局部压缩气体诱发新恒星。二者在质量—恒星质量关系等观测中留下的统计痕迹表明，反馈是解释为何大质量星系恒星形成早早熄火的关键负反馈回路。��Supernova explosions and active galactic nuclei inject energy and metals into the interstellar medium through winds and jets, heating and dispersing cold gas to suppress excessive star formation while occasionally compressing gas to trigger new stars. The statistical imprint of both, seen in relations such as the black hole mass–stellar mass correlation, shows that feedback is the key negative loop explaining why massive galaxies quenched star formation early.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�1effb45d06bb�body��次级凌星指行星转到恒星背后、其自身热辐射被遮挡的时刻。比较行星在掩食前后与恒星叠加及单独恒星的亮度差，可得到行星的发射通量，进而推算其昼夜面平衡温度。结合光谱还能绘制温度随波长的变化。�HA secondary eclipse occurs when the planet passes behind the star and its own thermal emission is blocked. Comparing the brightness with and without the planet's contribution yields the planet's emitted flux, from which day-side equilibrium temperature is derived. Spectrally resolved eclipses map temperature versus wavelength.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�1fd13b58014d�body��z蓝离散星出现在球状星团等年老星团中，却比同族恒星更蓝更亮，看似违反了“星团内所有恒星同龄”的预期。主流解释是，在星团拥挤的内部，它们通过与伴星并合或吸积物质而重新获得质量。质量增加使氢燃料供应和表面温度随之升高。因此它们在赫罗图上显得比同龄恒星更年轻。��Blue stragglers appear in old clusters such as globulars yet are bluer and brighter than their siblings, seemingly violating the expectation that all cluster stars formed together. The leading explanation is that in the crowded cluster interior they gain mass by merging with or accreting from companions. The added mass boosts their hydrogen supply and surface temperature. As a result they appear younger than their true age on the H-R diagram.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�23284f8321fd�body��h核—幔分异指行星早期熔融时致密铁镍下沉形成金属核心、轻物质上浮成地幔的过程，释放的引力能使内部长期保持高温液态外核。液态金属外核的对流与行星自转耦合，通过发电机效应产生全球磁场，因此是否有活跃磁场往往取决于是否发生过充分分异并保有液态外核。��Core-mantle differentiation is the early molten-stage sinking of dense iron-nickel to form a metallic core and rising of lighter material into a mantle, and the released gravitational energy keeps the interior hot enough for a long-lived liquid outer core. Convection in that liquid metallic outer core, coupled with planetary rotation, generates a global magnetic field through the dynamo effect, so an active field usually depends on thorough differentiation and a retained liquid outer core.�ans��src��《天体物理学报》�Acta Astrophysica Sinica��id�235875a201a5�body��G多个独立证据指向暗物质：星系外缘恒星旋转速度过快，按可见物质算引力不够；星系团中星系运动也需要额外质量；引力透镜弯曲程度超出可见物质；宇宙微波背景涨落也要求有额外物质成分。这些观测共同表明，可见物质只是宇宙的一小部分。��Several independent lines of evidence point to dark matter: stars at galaxy edges rotate too fast for the visible mass's gravity; galaxy motions in clusters need extra mass; gravitational lensing bends more than visible matter allows; and cosmic microwave background fluctuations require an extra matter component. Together they show visible matter is only a small fraction of the universe.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�240d6ffe91a3�body���与产生清晰弧像的强引力透镜不同，弱引力透镜使背景星系的形状产生微小而系统的拉伸。单个星系的变形几乎察觉不到，但统计数十亿个星系的平均形状，就能恢复出追踪前景暗物质分布的剪切场。欧几里得望远镜正是通过高精度测量星系形状的系统性变形，来绘制暗物质的大尺度分布图。由此可以检验宇宙学模型，并约束暗物质与暗能量的性质。��Unlike strong lensing, which produces dramatic arcs, weak lensing causes small, systematic distortions in the shapes of background galaxies. The effect is imperceptible for any single galaxy, but averaging billions of galaxies recovers the shear field that traces foreground dark matter. Euclid precisely measures these systematic shape distortions to map dark matter's large-scale distribution. The results test cosmological models and constrain the nature of dark matter and dark energy.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�248eca295174�body��旋臂并非由固定恒星组成，而是“密度波”——林家翘与徐遐生提出的理论中，引力波般的密度波绕星系缓慢旋转，压缩经过的气体触发恒星形成，使旋臂表现为明亮的新生恒星带，从而长期维持形态。�
Spiral arms are not made of fixed stars but are “density waves.” In the Lin–Shu theory, wave-like compressions rotate slowly through the galaxy, squeezing passing gas to trigger star formation, so arms appear as bright bands of new stars and persist over time.�ans��src��H林家翘与徐遐生（Lin-Shu，1964–1969，星系密度波理论）�+Lin & Shu density-wave theory (1964–1969)��id�24d045d12caa�body��兹威基 1933 年从后发座星系团成员星系的速度弥散推断，所需引力质量远大于可见恒星质量。现代弱引力透镜通过背景星系的形状畸变直接测绘星系团总质量分布，证实大部分质量来自不发光暗物质。�IIn 1933 Zwicky inferred from the velocity dispersion of galaxies in the Coma Cluster that the gravity needed far exceeds the visible stellar mass. Modern weak gravitational lensing maps a cluster's total mass directly from the distorted shapes of background galaxies, confirming that most of the mass is non-luminous dark matter.�ans��src��KZwicky 1933, Helvetica Physica Acta 6, 110；Clowe 等 2006, ApJL 648, L109�OZwicky 1933, Helvetica Physica Acta, 6, 110; Clowe et al. 2006, ApJL, 648, L109��id�2586855ba5d0�body��J当两个星系并合时，引力潮汐与动力学摩擦会把气体从盘面向中心输运并压缩，触发剧烈的云团坍缩与星暴。这种集中供料同时也会喂养中心黑洞，使活动星系核反馈在后期又把气体吹散、熄灭恒星形成，形成「并合—星暴—反馈熄灭」的演化序列。��During a galaxy merger, tidal forces and dynamical friction funnel and compress gas from the disk toward the center, triggering intense cloud collapse and a starburst. This concentrated fuel also feeds the central black hole, whose active galactic nucleus feedback later expels the gas and quenches star formation, forming an evolution sequence of merger, starburst, and feedback quenching.�ans��src�� 《天体物理学杂志》(ApJ)�The Astrophysical Journal (ApJ)��id�26d5309c2826�body��	持续时间长于约 2 秒的长暴通常由大质量恒星核坍缩产生，伴以超新星；短暴（小于 2 秒）则对应双中子星或中子星–黑洞并合，伴以千新星，已被 GW170817 证实。两者喷流结构与余辉环境也明显不同。�Long bursts (>~2 s) typically arise from massive-star core collapse with a supernova; short bursts (<2 s) correspond to binary neutron-star (or NS–BH) mergers with a kilonova, confirmed by GW170817. Their jet structures and afterglow environments also differ markedly.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�2a6b12a66d54�body���恒星磁场会使大气中的原子能级发生分裂，谱线由此出现多条精细分量，且各分量的偏振状态不同，这一效应称为泽曼效应。通过测量谱线的分裂间距和偏振，可以推算出磁场强度。除太阳外，天文学家已在许多恒星上测到比太阳强得多的磁场。磁星表面磁场甚至可达 10 的 15 次方高斯量级。��A stellar magnetic field splits the atomic energy levels in the star's atmosphere, producing multiple fine line components with distinct polarization, an effect called the Zeeman effect. Measuring the splitting and polarization of spectral lines reveals the field strength. Besides the Sun, astronomers have measured far stronger fields on many stars. Magnetar surfaces can reach up to 10^15 gauss.�ans��src��-《天文学概论》（恒星磁场测量）�IAU (stellar magnetic fields)��id�2dc3f8c4097e�body��}高红移星系是指退行速度极快、红移值很大（如 z>6，对应宇宙年龄不足10亿年）的星系，其光线在膨胀宇宙中经过上百亿年才到达我们。研究它们能直接观测早期宇宙的结构形成、恒星和黑洞的诞生，并检验星系演化与宇宙再电离模型。它们还是探测早期物质分布与暗物质晕的重要探针。��A high-redshift galaxy is one whose light has been stretched by cosmic expansion to very large redshifts (e.g. z>6, when the universe was under a billion years old), so we see it as it was over ten billion years ago. Studying them lets us observe directly how the first galaxies, stars, and black holes formed, and test models of galaxy evolution and cosmic reionization. They also serve as probes of the early matter distribution and dark-matter halos.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�2f22ded38897�body���中性氢基态的超精细跃迁发出波长 21 厘米（频率 1420 MHz）的辐射，其信号强度会随再电离进程中中性氢比例下降而衰减，并记录下中性气体温度与密度涨落。通过红移这一信号到低频射电波段，SKA、HERA 等望远镜能绘制再电离的时空演化图，这是目前唯一可在三维上直接追踪电离泡扩张的手段。��The hyperfine transition of neutral hydrogen ground state emits at 21 centimeters (1420 MHz); its signal weakens as the neutral fraction drops during reionization and encodes the temperature and density fluctuations of neutral gas. Redshifting this line into low-frequency radio bands, telescopes such as SKA and HERA can map the spatiotemporal evolution of reionization, the only method that directly tracks the growth of ionized bubbles in three dimensions.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�3047fadeb3bb�body��EPeVatron 是能把宇宙线加速到拍电子伏（10 的 15 次方电子伏）量级的天体源。困难在于：宇宙线带电粒子在银河系磁场中反复散射，到达地球时已失去方向信息；只能通过其撞击气体产生的伽马射线（强子成分）间接定位，且需排除轻子辐射混淆。�KA PeVatron accelerates cosmic rays to peta-electronvolt (10^15 eV) energies. The difficulty: charged cosmic rays are scattered by Galactic magnetic fields and arrive isotropized, so direction is lost; one must infer sources indirectly from gamma rays from hadronic collisions with gas, while excluding leptonic-radiation confusion.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�322b19bd92d4�body��当行星凌星时，恒星光会穿过行星大气的边缘薄层，其中的原子和分子在特定波长吸收光，使该波长处的凌星深度略增。通过比对不同波长的凌星深度（即透射光谱），可辨认出钠、水、二氧化碳等成分。�6During a transit, starlight passes through the thin limb of the planet's atmosphere, where atoms and molecules absorb at specific wavelengths and deepen the transit slightly there. Comparing transit depths across wavelengths (the transmission spectrum) reveals species such as sodium, water and carbon dioxide.�ans��src�ٌCharbonneau, Brown, Noyes, Gilliland,《Detection of an Extrasolar Planet Atmosphere》,The Astrophysical Journal,2002 (DOI: 10.1086/338770)يCharbonneau, Brown, Noyes, Gilliland, 'Detection of an Extrasolar Planet Atmosphere', The Astrophysical Journal, 2002, DOI: 10.1086/338770��id�33ada3eeb9d6�body�ِ海卫一沿与海王星自转相反的逆行轨道运行，且表面有冰火山活动，很可能是被海王星俘获的柯伊伯带天体。٢Triton orbits Neptune retrograde (backward) and shows cryovolcanic activity, strongly suggesting it is a captured Kuiper Belt object rather than an original moon.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�34774a1483ff�body�٨日冕是太阳大气最外层的稀薄高温等离子体，温度高达上百万摄氏度，远高于表面，只有在日全食时或借助日冕仪才能观测到。ٙThe corona is the Sun's outermost, tenuous, million-degree plasma layer—hotter than its surface—visible during a total eclipse or with a coronagraph.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�34853fb4d587�body���类星体是活动星系核中极端明亮的一类。中心超大质量黑洞把周围气体吸引过来，物质下落时释放的引力能转化为辐射，效率远超核聚变。因此，一个星系的核心就能发出相当于数百个星系的光。观测到的最远类星体红移超过 7，对应宇宙不足 10 亿岁的年代，说明超大质量黑洞在大爆炸后很快就已形成。��Quasars are the most luminous class of active galactic nucleus. The central supermassive black hole drags in surrounding gas, and the gravitational energy released as matter falls inward is converted into radiation far more efficiently than nuclear fusion. A single galactic core can therefore outshine hundreds of galaxies. The most distant quasars have redshifts beyond 7, from when the universe was less than a billion years old, showing that supermassive black holes formed very quickly after the Big Bang.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�34fdde6b4fc1�body���早期探测到的太阳中微子数量只有理论预测的三分之一左右，被称为太阳中微子难题。后来发现中微子具有质量并会发生味振荡，标准太阳模型因此得到证实。�Early detectors captured only about a third of the solar neutrinos predicted by theory, a discrepancy known as the solar neutrino problem. It was resolved when experiments showed that neutrinos have mass and oscillate between flavors, confirming the standard solar model.�ans��src��'萨德伯里中微子观测站（SNO）�"Sudbury Neutrino Observatory (SNO)��id�350c38141ec3�body��*恒星沿视线运动会使吸收或发射谱线整体移动：靠近则蓝移（波长变短）、远离则红移。由波长偏移量除以静止波长等于视向速度除以光速，可解出视向速度。高精度（米/秒级）视向速度法是探测系外行星与双星的关键手段。�␀Line-of-sight motion shifts spectral lines: approaching yields blueshift (shorter wavelength), receding redshift. From Δλ/λ0 = v_r/c one solves the radial velocity v_r. High-precision (m/s) radial velocities are key to detecting exoplanets and binaries.�ans��src��<Terence Dickinson,《NightWatch》第4版,Firefly Books,2006�nT. Dickinson, NightWatch: A Practical Guide to Viewing the Universe, 4th ed., Firefly Books, 2006; Chinese ed.��id�3752a6cee35d�body���奥林帕斯山是火星上的一座盾状火山，高约22公里，是太阳系已知最高的山。火星重力较弱且地壳板块不漂移，使火山能够长期在同一处堆积增长。��Olympus Mons is a shield volcano on Mars about 22 kilometers high, the tallest known mountain in the solar system. Mars's weaker gravity and lack of moving tectonic plates let the volcano grow in one spot for a very long time.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�382f80380e46�body��_造父变星是一类亮度会周期性变化的恒星，其脉动周期越长，本身真实亮度就越高，这就是周光关系。天文学家通过测量周期算出它的真实亮度，再与看起来多亮比较，就能推出距离。哈勃当年正是用造父变星证明仙女座星系在银河系之外，从而确立了星系的存在。��Cepheid variables are stars whose brightness pulses periodically, and the longer the pulsation period, the greater their true luminosity, a relation called the period-luminosity law. Astronomers use the period to find the true brightness, then compare it with apparent brightness to derive distance. Hubble used Cepheids to prove the Andromeda Galaxy lies beyond the Milky Way, establishing that other galaxies exist.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�38d940693fb2�body���一对双胞胎，一个乘近光速飞船远行返回，会比留在地球的另一个更年轻——因为高速运动者时间变慢，且旅途中加速与参照系切换打破了对称。ٮOf twin siblings, the one who flies near light speed and returns is younger than the one who stayed—time runs slower for the traveler, and acceleration breaks the symmetry.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�3c60ff0c7972�body��&霍金辐射是黑洞因量子效应而缓慢向外辐射粒子的过程：在视界附近，真空涨落产生的粒子对中，一个落入黑洞、另一个逃逸，表现为黑洞在“蒸发”。质量越小的黑洞温度越高、蒸发越快，但恒星级黑洞的蒸发极其缓慢。�EHawking radiation is a slow quantum process by which a black hole emits particles: near the horizon, vacuum fluctuations produce particle pairs, one falls in and the other escapes, making the hole appear to “evaporate.” Smaller black holes are hotter and evaporate faster, but stellar-mass holes do so exceedingly slowly.�ans��src��0斯蒂芬·霍金（1974，黑洞辐射论文）�Stephen Hawking (1974)��id�3ca31461c42a�body�و千新星是两颗中子星并合时释放的短暂明亮爆发，其极端中子流通过r过程合成了金、铂等大量重元素。ٛA kilonova is a brief brilliant burst from merging neutron stars; its extreme neutron flux forges gold, platinum and many heavy elements via the r-process.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�3d3964afe3a5�body��CAI 是太阳系中最早结晶的高温难熔矿物集合，其铅–铅等同位素定年给出约 45.67 亿年的形成时刻，被约定为太阳系的时间零点。以 CAI 为基准的相对定年（如锰–铬、铝–镁法）可重建各天体的形成次序。�␀CAIs are the earliest-crystallized, high-temperature refractory minerals in the Solar System; lead–lead dating places them at ~4.567 Gyr, adopted as time zero. CAI-anchored relative dating (Mn–Cr, Al–Mg) reconstructs the formation sequence of bodies.�ans��src��MConnelly 等 2012, Science 338, 651（太阳原行星盘固体绝对年代）مConnelly et al. (2012), Science 338, 651, 'The Absolute Chronology and Thermal Processing of Solids in the Solar Protoplanetary Disk'��id�3f153bd6188d�body��k这是观测偏倚。凌日要求行星轨道几乎正对我们侧着，能发生凌日的几何概率约等于恒星半径除以轨道半径，轨道越远越难碰到；确认行星还要至少三次凌日，所以公转周期短的近轨道行星更容易被确认。同时行星越大，星光变暗越明显，信号越强，小行星自然更常被漏掉。��It is an observational bias. A transit requires the orbit to lie almost edge-on to us, and the geometric probability is roughly the stellar radius divided by the orbital radius, so wide orbits rarely line up; confirming a planet also needs at least three transits, which favours short-period planets. Meanwhile bigger planets dim the star more deeply, giving a stronger signal, so small planets are more often missed.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�40790aca0ab9�body���在行星的参考系里，探测器飞入和飞出时速度大小不变，只是方向改变，属于弹性散射；但换到太阳参考系看，行星本身以每秒十几公里的速度在轨道上运动，探测器就会被行星的轨道速度拖着改变速度，既可能加速也可能减速。木星绕太阳的速度约每秒13公里，旅行者号正是在它身后借力，把速度抬升到了逃逸太阳所需的水平。��In the planet's frame, the probe enters and leaves with equal speed, only its direction changes — an elastic scattering; but in the Sun's frame the planet itself moves at some ten-plus kilometres per second along its orbit, so the probe's velocity is dragged and altered by the planet's orbital speed, gaining or losing energy depending on the geometry. Jupiter travels around the Sun at about 13 kilometres per second, and Voyager slingshotted behind it to reach the speed needed to escape the Sun.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�41744964a973�body��12005年发现的阋神星质量甚至比冥王星还大，且同样位于外太阳系，这迫使天文界正视『行星』该如何界定的问题。如果冥王星算行星，阋神星及更多类似天体也该算，行星数目将失控。这一矛盾直接促成了2006年矮行星分类的诞生。�.Eris, found in 2005, is actually more massive than Pluto and also lies in the outer solar system, forcing astronomers to face how 'planet' should be defined. If Pluto counted, Eris and many more would too, and the planet count would explode. This tension directly led to the 2006 dwarf-planet category.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�41f89ed37ce7�body��w答案在轨道共振和潮汐加热。木卫一、木卫二和木卫三处于拉普拉斯共振中，公转周期成简单整数比，迫使木卫一的轨道保持偏心。轨道每圈被木星引力拉伸变形，内部因周期性弯折而摩擦生热，热量足以维持约400座活火山。它的表面不断被硫化合物重新覆盖，形成五彩斑斓的地貌。��The answer lies in orbital resonance and tidal heating. Io, Europa, and Ganymede are locked in the Laplace resonance, their orbital periods in simple integer ratios, which keeps Io's orbit eccentric. Each circuit, Jupiter's gravity flexes the moon, and the internal friction from repeated distortion generates heat enough to sustain about 400 active volcanoes. Its surface is endlessly resurfaced by sulphur compounds, producing a vivid, colourful terrain.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�425ead25cafd�body�ٰ'天宫'取天上宫殿之意，是长期有人驻留的科研平台；它可验证长期驻留、再生生保等关键技术，为未来载人登月与深空探测打基础。ٟ'Tiangong' means heavenly palace—a long-term crewed lab; it tests life-support and long-stay tech that future crewed lunar and deep-space missions will need.�ans��src��G国务院新闻办公室《2021中国的航天》航天白皮书，2022�^State Council Information Office: China's Space Program: A 2021 Perspective, white paper, 2022��id�4321f15e37c7�body��奥尔特云是假想中包裹太阳系的巨大球壳，距太阳约2000到10万天文单位，储存了上万亿颗冰质天体。长周期彗星就源于此处，受附近恒星引力扰动后飞向太阳。它被认为是太阳系形成时遗留的『原始冰库』。�.The Oort Cloud is a hypothetical vast spherical shell around the solar system, from about 2,000 to 100,000 astronomical units out, holding trillions of icy bodies. Long-period comets come from there, nudged Sunward by passing stars. It is thought to be a primordial 'ice reservoir' left from formation.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�4544b0a5362a�body��K双中子星并合发出的引力波振幅直接给出其光度距离，而伴随的电磁对应体（如千新星）能提供红移，二者结合可在不依赖宇宙距离阶梯的情况下独立测定哈勃常数。这种方法绕开了传统测距的级联误差，被视为化解当前 H0 测量分歧的独立仲裁手段。��The amplitude of gravitational waves from a binary neutron star merger directly yields its luminosity distance, while the associated electromagnetic counterpart such as a kilonova supplies the redshift; together they determine the Hubble constant independently of the cosmic distance ladder. This approach avoids the cascading errors of traditional distance measurements and is seen as an independent arbiter of the current H0 tension.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�46a892cefe0d�body��WELT 主镜由近八百片六角形镜段拼成 39 米口径，主动光学须实时调节每片镜段的纳米级位置以保持整体面形；叠加的多共轭自适应光学还要校正三维大气湍流，需激光导星与极快计算。这些系统使 ELT 的角分辨率比哈勃提高约十六倍，但控制复杂度与造价极高。��The ELT's primary mirror is assembled from nearly 800 hexagonal segments to 39 meters, and its active optics must adjust each segment's position at the nanometer level in real time to preserve the overall figure; layered multi-conjugate adaptive optics must also correct three-dimensional turbulence using laser guide stars and very fast computing. These systems give the ELT about sixteen times Hubble's angular resolution, but at extreme control complexity and cost.�ans��src�ٕDavies R. & Kasper M., Adaptive Optics for Astronomy, Annual Review of Astronomy and Astrophysics 50 (2012), DOI: 10.1146/annurev-astro-081811-125447ٕDavies R. & Kasper M., Adaptive Optics for Astronomy, Annual Review of Astronomy and Astrophysics 50 (2012), DOI: 10.1146/annurev-astro-081811-125447��id�478ad93db102�body���观测表明宇宙空间在大尺度上近乎几何平坦，但其密度需要在极早期被精确调校到极高精度才能保持平坦。暴胀理论通过极速膨胀将任何初始弯曲「拉平」，从而解释了这一巧合。��Observations show the universe is nearly geometrically flat on large scales, yet its density would have needed impossibly fine tuning early on to stay flat. Inflation solves this by stretching any initial curvature flat through rapid expansion.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�478b6fdafd7c�body��Z薇拉·鲁宾天文台以8.4米望远镜配合32亿像素相机，计划用十年时间反复扫描整个南天，生成史上最大的时域天文数据库。它能在单次巡天中同时追踪超新星、近地小行星、暗物质分布与银河系结构。这种宽视场、高频重访的模式让暂现天体与罕见事件无处遁形。��The Vera C. Rubin Observatory pairs an eight-meter-class telescope with a 3.2-gigapixel camera to repeatedly scan the entire southern sky over a decade, building the largest time-domain astronomy database yet. A single survey can simultaneously track supernovae, near-Earth asteroids, dark-matter distribution, and Galactic structure. Its wide field and frequent revisits leave transient and rare events nowhere to hide.�ans��src��S薇拉·C·鲁宾天文台（LSST）；Ivezić 等《LSST Science Book》（2009）�JVera C. Rubin Observatory (LSST); Ivezić et al., LSST Science Book (2009)��id�48d1814ad679�body���生物标志是大气中可由生命产生、且非生物过程难以长期维持的气体组合，例如氧气与甲烷共存、或臭氧与甲烷并存，是搜寻地外生命的关键线索。��A biosignature is a gas combination in an atmosphere that life can produce and non-biological processes cannot easily sustain—such as oxygen with methane, or ozone with methane—a key clue in the search for alien life.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�48d8693fae0f�body��H重子声学振荡是早期宇宙中声波在光子-重子流体中留下的密度涟漪，在大爆炸后约三十八万年冻结下来。它在今天星系的关联函数中表现为约五亿光年的特征尺度，被用作宇宙学标准尺。通过测量这一尺度随红移的变化，可约束暗能量和膨胀历史。��Baryon acoustic oscillations are density ripples left by sound waves in the early-universe photon-baryon fluid, frozen in about 380,000 years after the Big Bang. They appear today as a characteristic scale of about 500 million light-years in galaxy correlations, used as a cosmological standard ruler. Tracking this scale with redshift constrains dark energy and the expansion history.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�494ebbb07a4d�body�ٱ轴子是一种极轻、弱相互作用的假想粒子，原为解决强CP问题提出，其质量与耦合恰好可能解释暗物质，正被腔体实验（如ADMX）搜寻。��The axion is a hypothetical, extremely light, weakly interacting particle, originally proposed to solve the strong CP problem; its properties could explain dark matter and are hunted in cavity experiments like ADMX.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�499e5d83aaca�body��7鲁宾天文台（原 LSST）将在十年内反复拍摄南天，获取数十亿星系的形状与位置。星系背景光的微弱畸变（弱引力透镜）由前景大尺度物质分布造成，统计这种畸变随红移的演化可约束暗能量的状态方程，为宇宙加速膨胀提供独立检验。��The Rubin Observatory, formerly LSST, will repeatedly image the southern sky over ten years, cataloging the shapes and positions of billions of galaxies. The subtle distortion of background galaxy light by weak gravitational lensing traces foreground large-scale matter, and statistically tracking how that distortion evolves with redshift constrains the dark energy equation of state, independently testing cosmic acceleration.�ans��src��S薇拉·C·鲁宾天文台（LSST）；Ivezić 等《LSST Science Book》（2009）�JVera C. Rubin Observatory (LSST); Ivezić et al., LSST Science Book (2009)��id�4a5bb82989d5�body�ٸ中国留下了世界上最长、最连续的新星、超新星和日食记录（如1054年超新星对应今天的蟹状星云），为研究恒星演化提供千年尺度的证据。ٹChina has the world's longest continuous records of novae, supernovae and eclipses (e.g., the 1054 supernova now the Crab Nebula), giving millennia-scale evidence for stellar evolution.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�4ab877183071�body��)无毛定理表明，广义相对论中的稳态黑洞完全由三个可观测量——质量、电荷和角动量——描述，所有其他形成细节（毛发）都会随引力辐射消失。这让黑洞成为可精确建模的简洁物理系统，但也引出了信息悖论等深层难题。��The no-hair theorem states that a stationary black hole in general relativity is completely described by just three observable quantities — mass, charge and angular momentum — with all other formation details (the hair) radiated away. This makes black holes tractable, precisely modeled physical systems, yet it also raises deep puzzles such as the black-hole information paradox.�ans��src��LWald, R.M.《广义相对论》1984 年芝加哥大学出版社，第 12 章�EWald, R.M., General Relativity (Univ. of Chicago Press, 1984), ch. 12��id�4d10223848f8�body���按照开普勒定律，旋涡星系外侧恒星绕银心旋转的速度应随距离增大而下降，就像太阳系行星那样。但 20 世纪 70 年代，鲁宾和福特观测发现，旋涡星系外围的旋转速度基本保持不变。这说明外围存在大量既不发光也不吸光、却参与引力作用的物质，其质量远超可见恒星。这就是暗物质最早的强证据之一。��Keplerian dynamics predict that rotation speeds in the outer parts of spiral galaxies should fall with distance, as planets do in the solar system. But in the 1970s Vera Rubin and Kent Ford observed that rotation curves in the outer regions stay essentially flat. The only explanation is a large amount of invisible matter that neither emits nor absorbs light yet participates gravitationally, outweighing the visible stars. This became one of the earliest strong pieces of evidence for dark matter.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�4d564de7743d�body���WIMP是暗物质的候选粒子之一，假设它通过弱核力和引力相互作用、质量较大且运动缓慢。大量地下探测器正试图捕捉它与普通物质之间极罕见的碰撞。��A WIMP is a leading dark-matter candidate, hypothesized to interact via the weak nuclear force and gravity, with sizable mass and slow motion. Many underground detectors are trying to catch its exceedingly rare collisions with ordinary matter.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�4f87edbb42de�body�ٲEDGES声称在21厘米吸收谱中看到比预期更深、更冷的信号，若属实意味着早期宇宙气体异常冷或存在额外背景辐射，结果仍存激烈争论。��EDGES reported a 21-cm absorption signal deeper and colder than expected; if real it implies the early gas was unusually cold or there was extra background radiation—a result still fiercely debated.�ans��src���Yang, Pan, Vagnozzi, Valentino,《Dawn of the dark: unified dark sectors and the EDGES Cosmic Dawn 21-cm signal》,Journal of Cosmology and Astroparticle Physics,2019 (DOI: 10.1088/1475-7516/2019/11/044)��Yang, Pan, Vagnozzi, Valentino, 'Dawn of the dark: unified dark sectors and the EDGES Cosmic Dawn 21-cm signal', Journal of Cosmology and Astroparticle Physics, 2019, DOI: 10.1088/1475-7516/2019/11/044��id�4fdb42c84fcf�body���球状星团几乎是同一时间形成的恒星集合，此后没有新一代恒星补充。因此，成员星在赫罗图上构成的“主序拐点”直接对应星团从形成至今的演化年龄。由恒星演化模型反推，最老的球状星团年龄约在 110 亿到 130 亿年之间。这为银河系乃至宇宙的年龄设定了下限，并与宇宙学给出的宇宙年龄相协调。��Globular clusters formed nearly all at once, with no subsequent generations of stars. As a result, the turn-off point of their member stars on the H-R diagram directly yields the cluster's evolutionary age. Stellar evolution models date the oldest clusters to roughly 11 to 13 billion years. This sets a lower limit on the age of the Milky Way and of the universe, consistent with cosmological age estimates.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�50178ddc8fb4�body��(蟹状星云由公元 1054 年超新星遗迹中心的脉冲星驱动，其风星云在 GeV–TeV 波段有稳定且精确的能谱，被广泛用作地面切伦科夫望远镜与空间伽马望远镜的绝对流量校准基准。一旦蟹状星云自身出现耀发，便会挑战标准模型。�The Crab Nebula, powered by the pulsar from the AD 1054 supernova remnant, has a stable, precise GeV–TeV spectrum and is widely used as an absolute flux calibrator for ground and space gamma-ray telescopes. When the Crab itself flared, it challenged standard models.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�5245de6a0cac�body��k在太阳这类恒星核心，主要发生质子-质子链反应：四个氢核（质子）在高温高压下逐步聚变成一个氦核，过程中质量略有亏损并转为能量（质能方程 E=mc²）。核心温度约1500万度、密度极高，使量子隧穿得以克服质子间的电斥力。这个过程稳定地维持了恒星数十亿年的发光。��In Sun-like cores the main process is the proton-proton chain: four hydrogen nuclei (protons) slowly fuse into one helium nucleus under extreme heat and pressure, with a small mass deficit converted to energy via E=mc². At about 15 million degrees and enormous density, quantum tunneling overcomes the protons' electric repulsion. This process steadily powers stars for billions of years.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�52916ec26afa�body���超级地球是质量介于地球和海王星之间（约1至10倍地球质量）的行星，太阳系内没有此类天体。它们在外星系中非常常见，但确切的组成与形成仍存在争议。��A super-Earth is a planet with a mass between Earth's and Neptune's, roughly 1 to 10 times Earth's. The solar system has none, yet they are very common elsewhere, though their makeup and formation are still debated.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�530043edf936�body���造父变星的光变周期与其真实光度之间存在严格的正比关系，称为周光关系。天文学家只要测出它的光变周期，就能推知其绝对光度。再把绝对光度与观测到的视亮度比较，利用平方反比定律即可算出距离。哈勃太空望远镜对造父变星的精确测量是建立星系距离尺度、测定哈勃常数的关键步骤，精度可达百分之几。��Cepheid variables obey a strict period-luminosity relation. By measuring a Cepheid's pulsation period, astronomers can infer its true luminosity. Comparing that absolute luminosity with the observed apparent brightness and applying the inverse-square law then yields the distance. Hubble Space Telescope measurements of Cepheids are a cornerstone of the extragalactic distance scale and the Hubble constant, with a precision of a few percent.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�5302b9f2be10�body��WIMPs 是暗物质的主流候选粒子之一，只通过弱核力与引力相互作用。地下实验如 XENON 和 LZ 将超纯净的液氙置于深处以屏蔽宇宙射线，静静等待极罕见的 WIMP 撞击原子核事件，至今尚未确证其存在。�/WIMPs are a leading dark-matter candidate that interact only via the weak nuclear force and gravity. Underground experiments such as XENON and LZ place ultrapure liquid xenon deep below ground to shield cosmic rays and wait for the rare recoil of a nucleus struck by a WIMP; none has been confirmed yet.�ans��src��AXENON / LZ 暗物质直接探测实验（液氙时间投影室）�3XENON / LZ dark matter direct-detection experiments��id�530cf393e9fc�body���K2-18b是一颗位于宜居带的亚海王星，韦布在其大气中发现可能的DMS信号——在地球上DMS主要由海洋浮游生物产生，但该结果仍有争议、需复测确认。ٶK2-18b is a habitable-zone sub-Neptune where Webb found a possible DMS signal—on Earth DMS is mainly made by ocean phytoplankton—but the result is debated and needs confirmation.�ans��src�٘Catling, Krissansen-Totton, Kiang & Crisp,《Exoplanet Biosignatures: A Framework for Their Assessment》,Astrobiology,2018 (DOI: 10.1089/ast.2017.1737)ٖCatling, Krissansen-Totton, Kiang & Crisp, 'Exoplanet Biosignatures: A Framework for Their Assessment', Astrobiology, 2018, DOI: 10.1089/ast.2017.1737��id�550353e95b3c�body�ٴ这些是下一代地下引力波探测器，臂长更长、采用低温硅镜，灵敏度比LIGO提高约10倍，可探测到宇宙学距离的双星并合与早期宇宙信号。��These next-generation underground detectors use longer arms and cryogenic silicon mirrors, gaining about 10× LIGO's sensitivity to reach cosmological-distance mergers and early-Universe signals.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�557db93dbcdc�body��9TES 利用超导材料在临界温度附近电阻随温度剧烈变化的特性，把单个光子能量转化为可测电信号，实现近光子噪声极限的超高灵敏度计数。它们被用在远红外光谱仪中，能在冷宇宙尘埃辐射最亮的亚毫米波段以极高信噪比探测暗弱谱线。�yA TES exploits how a superconductor's resistance changes sharply near its critical temperature, converting individual photon energies into measurable signals for near-photon-noise-limited, ultra-sensitive counting. Used in far-infrared spectrometers, they detect faint lines at very high signal-to-noise in the submillimeter bands where cold cosmic dust radiates most brightly.�ans��src���Sonka, Rostem, Connors, Sharp,《Ultra-low-noise transition edge sensors (TES) with high pixel-filling fraction for far-infrared astronomy》,Millimeter, Submillimeter, and Far-Infrared Detectors and In,2026 (DOI: 10.1117/12.3105049)��Sonka, Rostem, Connors, Sharp, 'Ultra-low-noise transition edge sensors (TES) with high pixel-filling fraction for far-infrared astronomy', Millimeter, Submillimeter, and Far-Infrared Detectors and In, 2026, DOI: 10.1117/12.3105049��id�5601f9afb3a3�body��f事件视界望远镜把分布在全球的射电望远镜通过甚长基线干涉技术同步，等效出一台地球口径的虚拟望远镜。它在1.3毫米波长观测M87星系中心，收集跨越数千公里的相位信息，再用算法重建出环绕黑色阴影的光环。2019年公布的M87影像首次直接刻画了黑洞的事件视界轮廓。��The Event Horizon Telescope synchronized radio dishes across the globe using very-long-baseline interferometry, creating a virtual telescope the size of Earth. Observing the center of galaxy M87 at 1.3 mm, it gathered phase information spanning thousands of kilometers and reconstructed a bright ring around a dark shadow. The 2019 M87 image first directly outlined a black hole's event horizon.�ans��src�ٌ事件视界望远镜合作组《First M87 Event Horizon Telescope results》（2019，ApJL）；阿塔卡马大型毫米波阵列（ALMA）ْEvent Horizon Telescope Collaboration, First M87 Event Horizon Telescope results (2019, ApJL); Atacama Large Millimeter/submillimeter Array (ALMA)��id�566ab8bb79fb�body�ٚB模是CMB偏振的一种卷曲图案，原初引力波会在其上留下印记；探测它是验证暴胀的关键，目前只有上限、尚未确证。پB-modes are a curling pattern in CMB polarization where primordial gravitational waves would leave an imprint; detecting them is key to proving inflation, but so far only upper limits exist.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�56aed708c08e�body�ٰ把星系的光谱与实验室已知谱线对比，若特征线整体向长波（红）端偏移，偏移量除以原波长就是红移 z，可换算出退行速度和距离。��By comparing a galaxy's spectrum with known lab lines, the shift of features toward longer (red) wavelengths gives redshift z as the offset divided by the rest wavelength, from which recession speed and distance follow.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�581638fa674f�body��费米悖论指出：如果银河系中普遍存在地外文明，那么它们应该早已遍及整个星系，但人类至今没有观测到任何确凿的外星文明信号。可能的解释大致分为几类。其一，生命和文明在宇宙中极其罕见，地球甚至可能是孤例；其二，技术文明往往因战争、资源枯竭或自毁等原因在实现星际扩张前就消亡；其三，高等文明可能故意隐藏自己或放弃星际扩张。此外，也不排除人类当前搜索信号的方式本身存在局限。��The Fermi paradox notes that if extraterrestrial civilizations were common in the Milky Way, they should have spread across the whole galaxy, yet no confirmed alien signal has ever been detected. Proposed resolutions fall into several broad categories. Some argue that life and civilization are extraordinarily rare, possibly even unique to Earth; others that technological civilizations tend to self-destruct through war, resource depletion or self-inflicted catastrophe before interstellar expansion; still others that advanced civilizations deliberately conceal themselves or forgo expansion. A further possibility is that our current search strategies are simply too limited.�ans��src��'《天文学概论》（费米悖论）�(Encyclopaedia Britannica (Fermi paradox)��id�585515897aa5�body��>哈勃常数张力指早期宇宙方法（如普朗克卫星对宇宙微波背景的拟合，约 67 km/s/Mpc）与本地距离阶梯方法（如 SH0ES 团队用造父变星与 Ia 型超新星，约 73 km/s/Mpc）所得 H0 值存在超过 5σ 的偏差。这一差异可能暗示超出标准 ΛCDM 模型的新物理。� The Hubble tension refers to the discrepancy, exceeding 5σ, between early-universe methods (e.g., Planck CMB fitting, ~67 km/s/Mpc) and local distance-ladder methods (e.g., SH0ES using Cepheids and Type Ia supernovae, ~73 km/s/Mpc). The gap may hint at new physics beyond standard ΛCDM.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�58d60a7c4865�body�٭利用毫秒脉冲星极其规律的脉冲作为银河系时钟，当纳赫兹引力波经过时会微扰其到达时间，NANOGrav等已报告一致的低频频谱证据。��Millisecond pulsars act as ultra-regular galactic clocks; nanohertz gravitational waves slightly perturb their arrival times, and arrays like NANOGrav have reported a consistent low-frequency signature.�ans��src�هAgazie 等(NANOGrav 合作组),2023年,The Astrophysical Journal Letters,951卷L8号:15年数据集中的纳赫兹引力波背景证据�Agazie et al. (NANOGrav Collaboration) 2023, ApJL, 951, L8 - Evidence for a gravitational-wave background in the 15 yr data set��id�58f3d4e0bb6c�body��暗能量的状态方程参数 w 描述其压强与能量密度之比。若 w = -1（即“宇宙学常数”），压强与密度大小相等、符号相反；暗能量巡天与普朗克等观测都把 w 约束在 -1 附近，但略偏离也可能暗示暗能量随时间变化。�3The equation-of-state parameter w describes dark energy's pressure-to-density ratio. If w = −1 (a “cosmological constant”), pressure equals density in magnitude but opposite in sign. Surveys like DES and Planck constrain w near −1, though a slight deviation could mean dark energy evolves with time.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�58fa9fe31acc�body���早期地下探测器测到的太阳中微子数仅为标准太阳模型预测的三分之一，长期无法解释，即太阳中微子问题。后来的超级神冈与萨德伯里中微子观测站（SNO）证明，中微子在飞行中会从电子型转变为缪子型与陶子型（中微子振荡），说明它们具有质量，从而同时验证了太阳模型并打开了超出标准模型的新物理。��Early underground detectors measured only about one third of the solar neutrinos predicted by the standard solar model, the long-standing solar neutrino problem. Later Super-Kamiokande and the Sudbury Neutrino Observatory (SNO) showed that neutrinos oscillate among electron, muon, and tau flavors in flight, proving they have mass; this both validated the solar model and opened new physics beyond the Standard Model.�ans��src�� 《天体物理学杂志》(ApJ)�The Astrophysical Journal (ApJ)��id�598b6e56783b�body��A冰立方建在南极冰盖下，利用一立方公里的洁净冰作为探测介质，捕捉高能宇宙中微子与冰作用产生的切伦科夫光。它能在几乎全天空范围内识别来自遥远耀变体和超新星的中微子。中微子不带电且几乎不与物质作用，是穿透极强的高能信使。�{IceCube is built deep in the Antarctic ice sheet, using a cubic kilometer of clear ice as detector medium to catch Cherenkov light from high-energy cosmic neutrinos interacting with the ice. It identifies neutrinos from distant blazars and supernovae over nearly the full sky. Neutrinos are uncharged and barely interact, making them extremely penetrating high-energy messengers.�ans��src��fKrasberg,《The IceCube Neutrino Telescope》,AIP Conference Proceedings,2006 (DOI: 10.1063/1.2396956)�dKrasberg, 'The IceCube Neutrino Telescope', AIP Conference Proceedings, 2006, DOI: 10.1063/1.2396956��id�598cf99457de�body�ٝ南希·格雷斯·罗曼望远镜用大视场红外巡天做弱引力透镜和超新星统计，以更高精度测绘暗能量如何随宇宙时间演化。��The Nancy Grace Roman Telescope will use wide-field infrared surveys for weak gravitational lensing and supernova statistics, mapping with higher precision how dark energy evolves over cosmic time.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�59f1ca7ed495�body�ٳ银河系中心存在一个约400万倍太阳质量的超大质量黑洞，名为人马座A*。周围恒星以极高速度绕它运行，为黑洞的存在提供了直接证据。ټAt the Milky Way's center sits a supermassive black hole of about 4 million solar masses called Sagittarius A*. Nearby stars orbit it at extreme speeds, direct evidence for the black hole.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�5ae8a0384bbf�body��,GW170817是首次直接探测到的双中子星并合引力波事件，随后在全球望远镜中观测到对应的伽马射线暴与千新星光学信号。它首次实现引力波与电磁波的“多信使”联测，并独立测出哈勃常数、证实了重元素（如金）的r过程产地。��GW170817 was the first directly detected gravitational wave from a binary neutron star merger, followed by a corresponding gamma-ray burst and kilonova seen across the electromagnetic spectrum. It achieved the first multi-messenger observation linking gravitational and electromagnetic waves, independently measured the Hubble constant, and confirmed neutron-star mergers as sites of heavy-element r-process production like gold.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�5bff907e7969�body�ٖ中子星是质量约为太阳1.4到2倍、半径仅约10公里的极致密残骸，物质被压到原子核密度，一茶匙物质重达数亿吨。��A neutron star is an ultra-dense remnant about 1.4–2 times the Sun's mass squeezed into a ~10 km radius, with matter at nuclear density—a teaspoon would weigh hundreds of millions of tons.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�5c95e16d5566�body���在热力学上氧气是强氧化剂、甲烷是还原剂，二者会迅速反应而难以在平衡大气中同时高浓度共存。若观测到两者同时富集，在无强烈非生物来源（如光化学或地质释放）时，最自然的解释是存在持续的生物产氧与产甲烷过程。该判据依赖化学不平衡，因此必须排除恒星紫外驱动的产氧等非生物途径。��Thermodynamically, oxygen is a strong oxidant and methane a reductant, so they react rapidly and cannot coexist at high concentrations in chemical equilibrium. Observing both enriched simultaneously, absent strong abiotic sources such as photochemistry or geology, most naturally implies ongoing biological oxygen production and methanogenesis. Because the criterion rests on chemical disequilibrium, abiotic pathways such as stellar-UV-driven oxygen production must first be excluded.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�5d6e0570184f�body��#霍金在 1974 年指出，视界附近的量子涨落使一对虚粒子中一个落入黑洞、另一个逃逸，逃逸者表现为从视界外发出的热辐射。由于黑洞损失能量等效于损失质量，寿命极长的黑洞会极其缓慢地收缩、升温，直至最终爆发。�^In 1974 Hawking showed that quantum fluctuations just outside the horizon let one member of a virtual particle pair fall in while the other escapes, appearing as thermal radiation emitted from beyond the horizon. Because losing energy means losing mass, an extremely long-lived black hole shrinks and heats up very slowly until it finally evaporates.�ans��src��HHawking,《Black hole explosions?》,Nature,1974 (DOI: 10.1038/248030a0)�FHawking, 'Black hole explosions?', Nature, 1974, DOI: 10.1038/248030a0��id�5e568ce1f288�body��T磁星是一类特殊的中子星，表面磁场可达10的15次方高斯，远超普通脉冲星。主流理论认为，大质量恒星核心坍缩时剧烈的对流与快速自转把发电机机制放大，把磁场冻结并增强到极端强度。其磁能偶尔的重新连接会引发星震与伽马射线暴，即软伽马重复暴。��Magnetars are a special class of neutron stars with surface fields up to 10^15 gauss, far stronger than ordinary pulsars. The leading theory holds that during core collapse of a massive star, vigorous convection combined with rapid rotation drives a dynamo that amplifies and freezes in an enormous magnetic field. Occasional magnetic reconnection triggers starquakes and gamma-ray flares known as soft gamma repeaters.�ans��src�ٍDuncan 与 Thompson《Formation of Very Strongly Magnetized Neutron Stars》（1992，ApJ）；NASA 中子星内部组成探测器（NICER）ًDuncan & Thompson, Formation of Very Strongly Magnetized Neutron Stars (1992, ApJ); NASA Neutron Star Interior Composition Explorer (NICER)��id�61087b802b5a�body��0在广义相对论中，引力波只有“加号”（plus）和“叉号”（cross）两种张量偏振，对应互相垂直的两个拉伸-压缩方向。其他引力理论还可能预言标量或矢量偏振。通过多探测器网络分析偏振，可检验广义相对论在强场下的有效性。�TIn general relativity, gravitational waves have only two tensor polarizations, “plus” and “cross,” corresponding to two perpendicular stretch-squeeze directions. Alternative gravity theories may predict scalar or vector polarizations. Polarization analysis with detector networks tests general relativity in the strong-field regime.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�61561f4fbc98�body��3小行星主带中某些轨道周期与木星呈简单整数比，例如3:1共振，反复受木星摄动而获得能量。这种累积作用把小行星推离原轨道，清空出特定的半长径区间，形成空隙。威斯登在1982年用混沌动力学解释了这些空隙为何长期稳定存在。�|In the main asteroid belt, certain orbits have periods in simple integer ratios with Jupiter, such as the 3:1 resonance, and repeated Jupiter perturbations pump energy into them. The accumulated effect nudges asteroids out of their original orbits, clearing specific semimajor-axis ranges into gaps. Wisdom explained in 1982 why chaotic dynamics keeps these gaps stable over time.�ans��src�قKirkwood（1866）原始观测；Wisdom《Chaotic behavior in the asteroid belt》（1982，AJ）；NASA/JPL 太阳系动力学组�~Kirkwood (1866) original observation; Wisdom, Chaotic behavior in the asteroid belt (1982, AJ); NASA/JPL Solar System Dynamics��id�62b977322c77�body��L白矮星靠电子简并压、中子星靠中子简并压支撑，二者压强主要随密度而非温度上升。简并气体满足 p 正比于 ρ 的 5/3 次方（非相对论）或 4/3 次方（极端相对论，逼近质量上限），质量增大使引力压缩更强、半径反而缩小，直到达到各自的质量极限。�vWhite dwarfs (electron degeneracy) and neutron stars (neutron degeneracy) are supported by pressure that scales with density, not temperature. Degenerate gas obeys p∝ρ^(5/3) (non-relativistic) or p∝ρ^(4/3) (ultra-relativistic, near the mass limit); greater mass means stronger gravitational compression and a smaller radius, until the respective mass limit is reached.�ans��src��GShapiro & Teukolsky《黑洞、白矮星与中子星》（Wiley 1983）�NShapiro & Teukolsky, Black Holes, White Dwarfs and Neutron Stars (Wiley, 1983)��id�62f076d57e5f�body���引力波是时空曲率的涟漪，由大质量天体加速运动产生。2015年LIGO首次直接探测到两个黑洞合并产生的引力波，证实了爱因斯坦的预言，并开启了引力波天文学。��Gravitational waves are ripples in the curvature of spacetime made by violently accelerating masses. In 2015 LIGO directly detected waves from two merging black holes, confirming Einstein's prediction and opening gravitational-wave astronomy.�ans��src��9LIGO科学合作组织（LIGO Scientific Collaboration）�LIGO Scientific Collaboration��id�62f3efc75c11�body���木卫一处在木星与其他伽利略卫星的轨道共振中，木星强大的潮汐力不断拉伸和挤压它的内部，产生巨大摩擦热。这使它成为太阳系中火山活动最活跃的天体。��Io sits in an orbital resonance with Jupiter and the other Galilean moons, so Jupiter's powerful tides constantly flex its interior and generate enormous frictional heat. This makes Io the most volcanically active body in the solar system.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�63dbbdfc5792�body��'宇宙暴涨时期时空量子涨落被急剧拉伸，理论上会产生几乎尺度不变的随机引力波背景，即原初引力波。它们会在宇宙微波背景的偏振上留下特有的B模图案。探测这一信号将直接证实暴涨，但目前仍受前景辐射的强烈干扰。��During cosmic inflation, quantum spacetime fluctuations were stretched dramatically, theoretically producing a nearly scale-invariant stochastic background of gravitational waves—primordial gravitational waves. They would imprint a distinctive B-mode pattern on the cosmic microwave background's polarization. Detecting it would directly confirm inflation, but foreground emission strongly interferes.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�645036746b5b�body��9柯伊伯带位于海王星轨道之外约30至50个天文单位，是形成于原行星盘外缘的冰质小天体盘，轨道大致位于黄道面附近。奥尔特云则在远处呈球状分布，主要由早期被巨行星散射出去的天体组成，并受到银河系潮汐和恒星摄动的显著塑造。�\The Kuiper Belt lies just beyond Neptune at about 30 to 50 astronomical units and is a disk of icy bodies formed at the edge of the protoplanetary disk, with orbits near the ecliptic. The Oort Cloud is a distant spherical reservoir made largely of objects scattered outward by the giant planets and later shaped by galactic tides and passing stars.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�6474f5e6e58c�body��M天王星向外辐射的能量几乎等于吸收的阳光，内部热源异常微弱，与其姊妹星海王星形成鲜明对比，原因仍不明。其大气甲烷吸收导致极低的层顶温度，而甲烷与氢的混合物在深部高压下相态与对流模式也未被直接探测，使内部能量平衡成为未解问题。��Uranus radiates almost exactly as much energy as it absorbs from sunlight, with an anomalously weak internal heat source that contrasts sharply with Neptune, and the reason is unknown. Its methane absorption produces an extremely low tropopause temperature, while the phase behavior and convection of methane-hydrogen mixtures under deep high pressure remain unprobed, leaving its internal energy balance unsolved.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�661e25d76f45�body���CNO循环是氢通过碳、氮、氧作为催化剂逐步聚变成氦的核反应链，对温度极其敏感，温度每升高一点反应速率急剧上升。它在大质量恒星（约1.3倍太阳质量以上）的核心占能量产生的主要份额，而小质量恒星更多依赖质子-质子链。该机制由贝特在1939年系统阐明，是理解大质量恒星演化的基础。��The CNO cycle is a chain of nuclear reactions in which hydrogen is fused into helium using carbon, nitrogen, and oxygen as catalysts, and it is extremely temperature-sensitive so its rate rises steeply with core temperature. It dominates energy production in the cores of more massive stars, roughly above 1.3 solar masses, whereas lower-mass stars rely mainly on the proton-proton chain. Bethe laid out the mechanism in 1939, and it remains central to models of massive-star evolution.�ans��src��Bethe《Energy Production in Stars》（1939，Physical Review）；Kippenhahn 与 Weigert《Stellar Structure and Evolution》�pBethe, Energy Production in Stars (1939, Physical Review); Kippenhahn & Weigert, Stellar Structure and Evolution��id�670f591509e9�body��*K2-18b是一颗位于宜居带的亚海王星，JWST的观测在其大气中同时探测到甲烷和二氧化碳，并报告了可能存在的二甲基硫（DMS）的暗示。若DMS被确认，将是潜在生物标志，但尚需更高质量数据。该行星也可能拥有富氢的海洋大气。�%K2-18b is a habitable-zone sub-Neptune where JWST detected both methane and carbon dioxide, with a tentative hint of dimethyl sulfide (DMS). If confirmed, DMS would be a potential biosignature, though higher-quality data are needed. The planet may also harbor a hydrogen-rich ocean atmosphere.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�67f1016d9ca9�body���证据来自引力效应。星系旋转曲线显示，外缘恒星转得比可见物质引力能解释的快得多，说明星系四周裹着一层看不见的质量晕；引力透镜的弯曲程度也超过可见物质的预期。宇宙微波背景的温度起伏模式以及宇宙结构的演化，同样要求存在约占总能量27%的暗物质。它的粒子本质至今未知，正在被地下实验和加速器寻找。�The evidence is gravitational. Galaxy rotation curves show outer stars moving far faster than visible matter can explain, implying a halo of unseen mass; gravitational lensing is also stronger than expected from visible matter alone. The temperature-fluctuation pattern of the cosmic microwave background and the growth of cosmic structure likewise demand dark matter making up about 27 percent of the total energy. Its particle nature is still unknown and is being hunted in underground detectors and accelerators.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�682e618cc267�body���VLBI把分布在全球的多台射电望远镜联合起来，等效口径相当于地球直径，通过记录信号到达的时间差进行相干合成。事件视界望远镜正是用VLBI首次「拍摄」到黑洞阴影。��VLBI links radio telescopes across the globe, acting like one dish as wide as Earth, and combines their signals by their arrival-time differences. The Event Horizon Telescope used VLBI to capture the first image of a black hole's shadow.�ans��src��'事件视界望远镜合作组（EHT）�+Event Horizon Telescope (EHT) Collaboration��id�69aa338a3e56�body���地球绕太阳公转半年，观测者的位置移动了约3亿公里，近处的恒星相对背景恒星就会有一个微小的角度摆动，这个角度叫视差角。距离（以秒差距计）等于1除以视差角（以角秒计），比邻星的视差约0.77角秒，对应1.3秒差距。依巴谷卫星测了约12万颗恒星，盖亚卫星更是把精度推到微角秒量级。��As Earth orbits the Sun, the observer's position shifts by about 300 million kilometres over half a year, so a nearby star appears to swing by a tiny angle against background stars, called the parallax angle. Distance in parsecs equals one divided by the parallax angle in arcseconds: Proxima Centauri's 0.77-arcsecond parallax puts it at 1.3 parsecs. The Hipparcos satellite measured about 120,000 stars, and Gaia has pushed precision to microarcsecond levels.�ans��src��pvan Leeuwen,Astrophysics and Space Science 333:29 (2007);Gaia 合作组,Astronomy and Astrophysics 649:A1 (2021)�yvan Leeuwen, Astrophysics and Space Science 333, 29 (2007); Gaia Collaboration, Astronomy and Astrophysics 649, A1 (2021)��id�6bd8c3e96e1e�body��	主流候选粒子包括弱相互作用大质量粒子（WIMP）和轴子。WIMP 只通过弱力和引力与普通物质相互作用，轴子则是为解决强 CP 问题提出的极轻粒子，两者都可能构成冷暗物质。直接探测实验把探测器深埋地下以屏蔽宇宙射线，用高灵敏度探测器等待暗物质粒子偶尔与原子核碰撞产生的极微弱反冲信号。例如 LUX-ZEPLIN 使用数吨液态氙探测 WIMP，ADMX 等实验则用谐振腔寻找轴子，目前尚无确凿信号。��Leading candidate particles include weakly interacting massive particles (WIMPs) and axions. WIMPs interact with ordinary matter only through the weak force and gravity, while axions are extremely light particles originally proposed to solve the strong CP problem, and either could make up cold dark matter. Direct-detection experiments are placed deep underground to block cosmic rays, with ultra-sensitive detectors waiting for the faint recoil of a dark-matter particle striking a nucleus. LUX-ZEPLIN uses several tonnes of liquid xenon to hunt WIMPs and experiments such as ADMX use resonant cavities to look for axions, so far without a confirmed signal.�ans��src��/LUX-ZEPLIN 合作组（暗物质直接探测）�4LUX-ZEPLIN Collaboration (direct dark matter search)��id�6d594f99a771�body���宇宙射线是几乎以光速运动的高能带电粒子，主要是质子、原子核和少量电子。它们到达地球时还会与大气作用，产生次级粒子。能量较低的宇宙射线主要来自太阳和银河系内的超新星遗迹，后者通过激波加速机制把粒子推到极高能量。能量最高的极少数粒子可超过 10 的 20 次方电子伏特，被认为来自银河系外的活动星系核等极端天体。�Cosmic rays are high-energy charged particles, mostly protons, nuclei and a few electrons, moving at nearly the speed of light. On arrival they interact with Earth's atmosphere, producing secondary particles. Lower-energy cosmic rays come mainly from the Sun and from galactic supernova remnants, which accelerate particles through shock acceleration. The rarest ultra-high-energy particles exceed 10^20 electron volts and are thought to originate from extreme extragalactic sources such as active galactic nuclei.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�6dd3b85d4144�body��Y逃逸速度要求物体带着恰好为零的总机械能离开，也就是动能等于引力势能的绝对值。把方程对速度求解，得到根号下2GM除以r，而近地圆轨道速度是根号下GM除以r，两者正好相差根号2倍，地面处约为每秒11.2公里。这个比值只由能量关系决定，与星球密度无关。��Escape velocity requires the object to depart with exactly zero total mechanical energy, meaning its kinetic energy equals the magnitude of its gravitational potential energy. Solving for speed gives the square root of 2GM over r, while the low-orbit circular speed is the square root of GM over r, so the two differ by exactly the square root of two, about 11.2 kilometres per second at Earth's surface. The ratio follows purely from energy, independent of the planet's density.�ans��src��0《天文学概论》（航天与轨道力学）�@An Introduction to Astronomy (spaceflight and orbital mechanics)��id�6dd6f3e29fd5�body�٥脉冲星是高速自转的中子星，其强磁场把射电波等辐射束像灯塔一样扫过空间，使我们在地球上接收到极其规律的脉冲信号。٫A pulsar is a rapidly spinning neutron star whose strong magnetic field sweeps beams of radiation like a lighthouse, producing extremely regular pulses we detect on Earth.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�6f83b89e23d5�body�ٮ这取决于暗能量的性质。主流观点认为膨胀会持续加速，星系彼此远离，恒星燃尽、黑洞蒸发，宇宙最终走向寒冷空寂的“热寂”。��It depends on dark energy. The leading view is continued accelerating expansion: galaxies drift apart, stars burn out, black holes evaporate, and the universe ends in a cold, empty 'heat death.'�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�6f95ee7f858f�body�ټ观测显示中子星质量上限约2.3倍太阳质量、最小黑洞约5倍太阳质量，中间约3倍区间罕见，这一“质量鸿沟”暗示并合或超新星机制仍有未知。��Observations show neutron stars top out near 2.3 solar masses and the lightest black holes start near 5, leaving a rare 'gap' around 3 solar masses that hints at unknown merger or supernova physics.�ans��src��dTolman、Oppenheimer 与 Volkoff（1939，中子星最大质量）；LIGO/Virgo（GW170817 约束）�;Tolman, Oppenheimer & Volkoff (1939); LIGO/Virgo (GW170817)��id�70a6802c74db�body���观测显示，星系外缘恒星的旋转速度远高于仅由可见物质引力所能解释的值。这表明星系被大量不可见的暗物质晕所包围，是暗物质存在的关键证据之一。��Observations show that stars at a galaxy's edge orbit faster than the visible matter's gravity alone can explain. This implies galaxies are wrapped in massive invisible dark-matter halos, a key piece of evidence for dark matter.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�70fe157bcd87�body�ٖ玛雅人长期记录金星出没周期（约584天）、日月食和岁差，用观测台对齐天体升落，其长纪历精度可与现代比拟。ٴThe Maya tracked Venus's 584-day cycle, eclipses and precession with precise observatories aligned to risings and settings, achieving Long Count accuracy rivaling modern reckoning.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�739d7ca67b1f�body�ٺs 过程是慢中子俘获过程，发生在像红巨星这样的恒星内部，中子加入速度慢于 β 衰变，逐步生成比铁重但相对稳定的元素，如锶、钡、铅。��The s-process is slow neutron capture occurring inside stars like red giants, where neutrons are added more slowly than beta decay, building heavier stable elements such as strontium, barium, and lead.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�73b4807a0dea�body�٬回归年约365.2422天，四年一闰会略多，所以整百年不闰、但能被400整除的仍闰，使平均年长精确到365.2425天，误差数千年才差一天。ٿThe tropical year is ~365.2422 days; leaping every 4 overcounts, so century years skip unless divisible by 400, giving an average of 365.2425 days—off by a day only over thousands of years.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�73f8d6139bfe�body�ٲNASA的蜻蜓是一架核动力旋翼飞行器，将飞越土卫六表面采样，研究其有机化学与潜在前生命环境，是首个地外天体上的多旋翼探测器。��NASA's Dragonfly is a nuclear-powered rotorcraft that will fly across Titan sampling its surface, studying organic chemistry and possible pre-life environments—the first multirotor explorer on another world.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�7418dde7a358�body��e宇宙大尺度结构呈“宇宙网”：星系沿纤维和节点分布，纤维之间是近乎空旷的“宇宙空洞”。空洞内物质密度极低（约为宇宙平均的十分之一或更少），气体稀薄而温度低，却并非绝对真空——它们仍是暗物质和少量气体的稀疏分布区。空洞会随宇宙膨胀而不断变大。�{On the largest scales the universe forms a cosmic web: galaxies lie along filaments and clusters, and between those filaments sit nearly empty regions called cosmic voids. Voids have very low density (a tenth of the cosmic mean or less) with thin, cool gas, but they are not true vacuums—they still contain sparse dark matter and gas. Voids grow larger as the universe expands.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�743e6e3fe2f0�body��SDSS 大样本显示星系形态随局域密度变化：高密度环境（星系团中心）以早型（椭圆）星系与熄火星系为主，低密度场星系多为旋涡且恒星形成活跃。这种形态–密度关系是星系并合、潮汐剥离等环境熄火机制的证据。�]Large SDSS samples show galaxy morphology tracks local density: high-density environments (cluster cores) are dominated by early-type (elliptical) and quenched galaxies, while low-density field galaxies are mostly spirals with active star formation. This morphology–density relation evidences mergers, tidal stripping, and environmental quenching.�ans��src��?Dressler 1980, ApJ 236, 351《富星系团中的星系形态》�}Dressler (1980), ApJ 236, 351, 'Galaxy morphology in rich clusters: Implications for the formation and evolution of galaxies'��id�749808fc33c4�body���尼斯模型认为，早期巨行星的轨道曾经不稳定并发生过显著的迁移，把大量小天体抛向太阳系内外。这一过程被认为造成了后期的重轰炸事件，并塑造了外太阳系的结构。�The Nice model proposes that the giant planets' orbits were once unstable and underwent major migrations, flinging many small bodies inward and outward. This is thought to have caused the later heavy bombardment and shaped the structure of the outer solar system.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�74b2b3465805�body��宇宙再电离发生在红移约6到15之间，最早形成的恒星和星系释放的紫外光子逐渐电离了弥漫的中性氢。这一过程结束了宇宙黑暗时期，使宇宙对紫外光变得透明。莱曼α森林和21厘米线观测正在精细描绘其时空进程。�TCosmic reionization occurred between redshifts of about 6 and 15, as ultraviolet photons from the first stars and galaxies progressively ionized the diffuse neutral hydrogen. This ended the cosmic dark ages and made the universe transparent to UV light. The Lyman-alpha forest and 21-cm line observations are mapping its spacetime progress.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�75ca0d78db9f�body��7当行星从恒星前方经过时，部分星光穿过其大气边缘，大气中的分子会在特定波长吸收光，形成“透射光谱”。韦伯望远镜凭借红外灵敏度，在2022年于系外行星 WASP-39b 的大气中首次明确探测到二氧化碳，开启了细致大气刻画的新时代。�[As a planet transits, some starlight passes through its atmospheric limb, where molecules absorb at specific wavelengths, creating a transmission spectrum. With its infrared sensitivity, JWST made the first clear detection of carbon dioxide in an exoplanet atmosphere (WASP-39b) in 2022, opening a new era of detailed atmospheric characterization.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�763cc35725a0�body���Ia 型超新星是白矮星从伴星吸积物质、逼近钱德拉塞卡极限后引发的热核爆炸。由于爆炸发生在几乎相同的临界质量处，其峰值光度相当一致，因此被称为“标准烛光”。实际观测中还利用峰值光度与光变曲线衰减速度的关系进行校正。经过校正后距离测量精度大幅提高，可据此测出超新星所在遥远星系的距离。�#A Type Ia supernova is the thermonuclear explosion of a white dwarf after it accretes matter from a companion and approaches the Chandrasekhar limit. Because the explosion happens at nearly the same critical mass, peak luminosities are quite uniform, earning it the name standard candle. In practice, the relation between peak luminosity and the light curve's decline rate provides further calibration. With that calibration, distance measurements become far more precise, allowing astronomers to gauge the distance to the supernova's host galaxy.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�778d2124c41e�body�٥这类长伽马暴往往源于大质量恒星核心坍缩，坍缩本身触发超新星，而喷流击穿恒星外层产生伽马暴，所以二者常同源出现。ٹThese long GRBs often arise from the core collapse of a massive star; the collapse triggers a supernova while jets punch through the star to make the GRB, so both share a common origin.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�77a55f3df64f�body���冰巨星的内部主要由水、氨和甲烷等「冰」物质（在高压下呈流体状态）构成，而不是像木星那样以氢和氦为主。它们的大气含甲烷，使二者呈现蓝色。��Ice giants are built mostly from so-called ices such as water, ammonia, and methane in fluid form under high pressure, rather than from hydrogen and helium like Jupiter. Methane in their atmospheres gives both planets a blue color.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�78011b278456�body���根据霍金辐射理论，黑洞会因量子效应缓慢损失能量并辐射粒子，质量越小蒸发越快；但恒星级黑洞的蒸发时间远超宇宙当前年龄，实际上难以观测。ٽHawking radiation says black holes slowly lose energy via quantum effects; smaller ones evaporate faster, but stellar black holes would take vastly longer than the universe's age to vanish.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�78425d6ba16e�body���当物质落向黑洞时，在视界外形成高速旋转的吸积盘。剧烈的摩擦和引力势能释放把物质加热到数百万度，发出强烈的X射线等高能辐射，使黑洞变得「可见」。�As matter falls toward a black hole, it forms a fast-spinning accretion disk outside the horizon. Friction and released gravitational energy heat it to millions of degrees, emitting intense X-rays and other high-energy radiation that make the black hole "visible."�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�78a397050c38�body��两者都是把氢聚变成氦的核反应链。质子-质子链在像太阳这样的中低质量、较冷恒星中占主导；而 CNO 循环以碳、氮、氧为催化剂，对温度极其敏感，在更热、质量更大的恒星中成为主要产能方式。�,Both are nuclear chains fusing hydrogen into helium. The proton–proton chain dominates in cooler, lower-mass stars like the Sun, while the CNO cycle uses carbon, nitrogen, and oxygen as catalysts and is extremely temperature-sensitive, becoming the main energy source in hotter, more massive stars.�ans��src��R《现代天体物理学导论》（Carroll & Ostlie，恒星内部结构章节）�9An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics (Carroll & Ostlie)��id�78f8d20f3d84�body�ِ霍金辐射是黑洞因量子效应在事件视界附近缓慢漏出粒子的过程，意味着黑洞会极其缓慢地蒸发并最终消失。٣Hawking radiation is the slow leakage of particles near the event horizon due to quantum effects, meaning a black hole slowly evaporates and eventually disappears.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�793677612415�body���1998 年，两个团队用 Ia 型超新星作为标准烛光，测量极远超新星的红移和亮度。结果发现它们比预期的更暗，也就是距离比匀速膨胀模型预测的更远。结合红移数据推断，宇宙不仅在膨胀，而且膨胀正在加速。这说明存在一种具有负压、能量密度约占宇宙 70% 的成分，即暗能量；这一发现获得 2011 年诺贝尔物理学奖。�!In 1998 two teams used Type Ia supernovae as standard candles, measuring the redshifts and brightnesses of extremely distant supernovae. They found the supernovae dimmer than expected and therefore farther away than a steadily expanding universe predicts. Combined with the redshift data, this showed that the expansion of the universe is not merely happening but accelerating. The result implies a component with negative pressure, making up about 70 percent of the cosmic energy budget, dark energy, and earned the 2011 Nobel Prize in Physics.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�793d83ba13b3�body���ICRF以遥远的类星体为基准定义天球坐标系，是天体位置和导航的精确框架。它基于甚长基线干涉测量测定的射电源，取代了更早的动力学参考系。��The ICRF defines the celestial coordinate system using distant quasars as anchors, providing the precise framework for object positions and navigation. Based on VLBI-measured radio sources, it replaced earlier dynamical reference frames.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�79dc77bcdded�body��3相互绕转的双黑洞系统不断损失轨道能量，并以引力波形式辐射出去，导致轨道收缩并加快。当二者最终并合时，会释放出极强的引力波脉冲，并在毫秒间转变为单一的克尔黑洞。这一过程已被LIGO于2015年首次直接探测到（GW150914）。�<A binary black hole system loses orbital energy by radiating it as gravitational waves, causing the orbit to shrink and speed up. At final merger it releases an intense burst of waves and settles within milliseconds into a single Kerr black hole. This process was first directly detected by LIGO in 2015 as GW150914.�ans��src��=Abbott 等（LIGO/Virgo）2016, PRL 116, 061102（GW150914）�<Abbott et al. (LIGO/Virgo) 2016, PRL, 116, 061102 (GW150914)��id�7a6a394a10c3�body���蟹状星云对应 1054 年爆发的超新星，中国宋代天文记录准确记载了这次“客星”，是少数有明确历史记载的超新星之一。它由恒星爆发抛出的物质构成，目前仍以每秒约 1500 公里的速度膨胀。膨胀激波与周围星际介质相互作用，同时中心的中子星（脉冲星）持续向星云注入能量。这使得蟹状星云在几乎所有波段都持续辐射，成为超新星遗迹研究的样板。�The Crab Nebula is the remnant of the supernova seen in 1054, accurately recorded as a guest star in Song-dynasty Chinese annals, making it one of the few supernovae with definite historical records. It consists of material ejected in the blast, still expanding at about 1,500 km/s. The expanding shock interacts with the surrounding interstellar medium while the central neutron star (pulsar) keeps injecting energy into the nebula. Because it radiates across nearly every wavelength band, it is the benchmark supernova remnant.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�7b12a48ac011�body��太阳系黄道面与银河系银道面的夹角约 60 度，但因两平面交线恰靠近人马座，银心方向其实紧邻黄道。这一几何影响了星际尘埃消光在天空中的分布，也决定了巡天观测银道面附近天体时的策略与难度。��The ecliptic plane of the Solar System is inclined about 60 degrees to the galactic plane, yet because the line of intersection of the two planes lies near Sagittarius, the direction of the Galactic center actually sits close to the ecliptic. This geometry shapes the sky distribution of interstellar dust extinction and dictates survey strategies and difficulties when observing objects near the Galactic plane.�ans��src��HBinney & Merrifield《星系天文学》1998 普林斯顿大学出版社�EBinney & Merrifield, Galactic Astronomy (Princeton Univ. Press, 1998)��id�7be4587511ff�body�٥中子星内部物质在核密度之上的状态至今不明，测量其质量与半径能约束极端条件下的物态方程，这是现代核天体物理前沿。��The behavior of matter above nuclear density inside neutron stars is still unknown; measuring their mass and radius constrains the equation of state under extreme conditions, a frontier of nuclear astrophysics.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�7cb73117e5e4�body���星族III是宇宙中最早诞生的恒星，由大爆炸后纯氢氦气体在暗物质晕中直接坍缩形成，几乎不含比氦更重的元素（金属丰度趋近于零）。由于没有重元素帮忙散热，它们质量极大（数十到数百倍太阳质量）、温度高、寿命极短。它们以强烈的紫外辐射和最早的重元素（经超新星）启动了宇宙再电离与后续星系的化学演化。��Population III stars were the very first stars, formed from pristine hydrogen–helium gas in early dark-matter halos with essentially no elements heavier than helium (near-zero metallicity). Because heavy elements help gas radiate away heat, their absence let the gas collapse into very massive (tens to hundreds of solar masses), hot, short-lived stars. Their intense ultraviolet light and the first heavy elements from their supernovae drove cosmic reionization and seeded later chemical evolution.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�7d8c16ae6344�body�ٷ岁差使回归年（季节周期）略短于恒星年，长期累积会让节气相对恒星背景缓慢漂移；历法需以回归年为准，所以祖冲之等人要不断修正。��Precession makes the tropical year slightly shorter than the sidereal year, slowly shifting solar terms against the star background; calendars must use the tropical year, so scholars like Zu Chongzhi kept correcting them.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�7f12e6e7d938�body�ټ中子星是大质量恒星核心坍缩后，电子被压入质子形成中子的致密残骸，靠中子简并压支撑。典型中子星直径仅约20公里，质量却与太阳相当。�A neutron star is the dense remnant left when a massive star's core collapses and electrons are squeezed into protons to form neutrons, supported by neutron degeneracy pressure. A typical one is only about 20 kilometers across yet weighs as much as the Sun.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�7f1724d47be3�body��K在宇宙再复合之前，光子与重子耦合的等离子体里传播着声波，到复合时刻（红移约 1100）声波冻结，留下约 150 Mpc（共动）的特征尺度。通过测量星系成团中这一尺度随红移表现的视角大小与红移展宽，天文学家可约束宇宙的膨胀历史和暗能量性质。�eBefore recombination the photon–baryon fluid carried sound waves that froze at the recombination epoch (redshift ≈ 1100), leaving a characteristic scale of about 150 comoving Mpc. Measuring how that scale appears in angle and in redshift broadening within galaxy clustering lets astronomers constrain the expansion history and the nature of dark energy.�ans��src��OSDSS-III BOSS Collaboration 2013, MNRAS 433, 1202（重子声学振荡测量）�\SDSS-III BOSS Collaboration 2013, MNRAS, 433, 1202 (baryon acoustic oscillation measurement)��id�802af8b3ba76�body�ٱ磁星是磁场极强的中子星，表面磁场可达地球磁场的万亿倍以上，偶尔的星震会释放剧烈伽马射线爆，是宇宙中磁场最强的已知天体。٪A magnetar is a neutron star with a field over a trillion times Earth's; occasional starquakes unleash intense gamma-ray bursts, making it the most magnetic object known.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�8137ef835102�body���木卫一与木卫二、木卫三处于轨道共振之中，导致木星的巨大潮汐力周期性挤压和拉伸它。潮汐摩擦把机械能转化为热量，使木卫一内部保持部分熔融。这些热量驱动了数百座活火山，喷出硫和二氧化硫，形成黄橙色的硫沉积地表。木卫一由此成为太阳系中火山活动最活跃的天体，也是除地球外唯一确认正在喷发的天体。��Io is locked in orbital resonance with Europa and Ganymede, so Jupiter's enormous tides alternately squeeze and stretch it. Tidal friction converts this mechanical energy into heat, keeping the interior partially molten. That heat drives hundreds of active volcanoes erupting sulfur and sulfur dioxide, coating the surface in yellow-orange sulfur deposits. Io is thus the most volcanically active body in the solar system and the only one besides Earth confirmed to be erupting today.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�826b789305b5�body�ٯLISA由三颗相隔百万公里的航天器组成，用激光测距聆听毫赫兹引力波（如超大质量黑洞并合），填补地面探测器听不到的低频空白。��LISA uses three spacecraft a million kilometers apart, laser-ranging to listen for millihertz gravitational waves (e.g. supermassive black-hole mergers), filling the low-frequency gap ground detectors cannot hear.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�82d8b8ec7b61�body�ٴ奇点是黑洞中心理论上的一个点，所有质量被压缩到无限密度和无限时空曲率，已知物理定律在那里失效，需要量子引力理论才能描述。��The singularity is the theorized point at a black hole's center where mass is compressed to infinite density and curvature, where known physics breaks down and a quantum theory of gravity is needed.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�8476de3c9d5a�body�ٱ系外卫星绕系外行星运行，可能像木卫二一样拥有液态水海洋；寻找方法包括凌星时的次级掩食和凌星时长变化，目前尚无确证发现。ٻAn exomoon orbits an exoplanet and could host liquid-water oceans like Europa; hunters look for secondary eclipses during transit and transit-timing variations, but none is confirmed yet.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�8502bf4d8c9d�body��1814 年夫琅禾费在太阳光谱中辨认出数百条暗线（后称夫琅禾费线），基尔霍夫与本生随后证明这些线对应特定元素在气体中的吸收。这让天文学家能凭光谱读出恒星的化学成分，开启了天体物理学的化学分析时代。�IIn 1814 Fraunhofer identified hundreds of dark lines in the solar spectrum (later called Fraunhofer lines), and Kirchhoff and Bunsen then proved they correspond to absorption by specific elements in gas. This let astronomers read a star's chemical composition from its spectrum, opening the chemical-analysis era of astrophysics.�ans��src��}Kirchhoff, Bunsen,《Chemische Analyse durch Spectralbeobachtungen》,Annalen der Physik,1860 (DOI: 10.1002/andp.18601860602)�{Kirchhoff, Bunsen, 'Chemische Analyse durch Spectralbeobachtungen', Annalen der Physik, 1860, DOI: 10.1002/andp.18601860602��id�863c25c4998f�body��两个独立团队通过观测遥远 Ia 型超新星发现，宇宙不仅在膨胀，而且膨胀正在加速。这一发现意味着存在一种被称为“暗能量”的神秘成分约占宇宙总能量的68%，并因此获得2011年诺贝尔物理学奖。�Two independent teams found from distant Type Ia supernovae that the universe's expansion is accelerating, not slowing. This implied a mysterious “dark energy” makes up about 68% of the cosmic energy budget—work awarded the 2011 Nobel Prize in Physics.�ans��src��S超新星宇宙学计划与高红移团队（Perlmutter、Riess、Schmidt，1998）�LSupernova Cosmology Project & High-Z Team (Perlmutter, Riess, Schmidt, 1998)��id�86c6fc918e79�body���按国际天文学联合会2006年的定义，行星须绕太阳公转、自身引力使其近似球形、并已清空轨道附近的其他天体。冥王星因未满足第三条而被归为矮行星。ٷPer the IAU's 2006 definition, a planet orbits the Sun, is round from its own gravity, and has cleared its orbital neighborhood. Pluto fails the third criterion and is a dwarf planet.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�8782e92ecc8e�body��b宇宙学原理认为，在大尺度上宇宙在空间上是均匀且各向同性的，即无论从哪个位置、朝哪个方向看，宇宙的整体面貌都大致相同。它是现代宇宙学模型的基本假设，得到了宇宙微波背景高度各向同性等观测的支持。但在小尺度上，星系和星系团的分布当然并不均匀。��The cosmological principle holds that on large scales the universe is homogeneous and isotropic in space, meaning from any location and in any direction its overall appearance is roughly the same. It is a basic assumption of modern cosmological models and is supported by the high isotropy of the cosmic microwave background. On small scales, of course, galaxies and clusters are far from uniform.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�8793e7af0f2c�body��"重复 FRB 的多次爆发若来自固定源，其色散量的缓慢变化（排除本地贡献后）可反映源所在星系晕与弥散星系际介质的电子柱密度。结合红移可约束宇宙重子物质在温热弥漫介质中的占比，补充 X 射线对失踪重子的探测。�For a repeating FRB at a fixed source, slow DM changes (after removing local contributions) trace the electron column of the host halo and diffuse IGM. Combined with redshift, this constrains the fraction of cosmic baryons in the WHIM, complementing X-ray searches for missing baryons.�ans��src��WBochenek et al. & CHIME/FRB Collaboration, Nature 587 (2020);CHIME/FRB Catalog 1 (2021)�ZBochenek et al. and CHIME/FRB Collaboration, Nature 587 (2020); CHIME/FRB Catalog 1 (2021)��id�87e9f6353c5b�body���我们无法看到光子退耦之前“最初几分钟”本身，因为那时的宇宙对光不透明；可观测的“快照”是约38万年后形成的宇宙微波背景和原初核合成留下的轻元素丰度。通过分析微波背景的涨落以及氢、氦、锂的比例，天文学家能反推出大爆炸后几分钟内宇宙的温度、密度与膨胀速率。也就是说，我们看到的不是那一刻的光，而是它留下的物理指纹。�We cannot directly see the first few minutes themselves, because before photon decoupling (about 380,000 years after the Big Bang) the cosmos was opaque to light. The observable fingerprints of that era are the cosmic microwave background and the light-element abundances left by Big Bang nucleosynthesis. By analyzing CMB fluctuations and the ratios of hydrogen, helium, and lithium, astronomers reconstruct the temperature, density, and expansion rate of the universe minutes after its beginning—not its light, but its physical signature.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�8959609b4fc1�body��柯克伍德空隙是小行星带中几乎缺失小行星的特定半径区域，出现在与木星轨道周期成简单整数比（如3:1、2:1）的位置。在这些轨道共振点，木星引力周期性扰动使小行星轨道变得不稳定，最终将其散射出去。�Kirkwood gaps are regions in the asteroid belt nearly empty of asteroids, located where orbital periods are simple integer ratios (such as 3:1, 2:1) of Jupiter's. At these resonances, Jupiter's gravity periodically perturbs asteroids onto unstable orbits, scattering them away over time.�ans��src��R《太阳系动力学》（Murray & Dermott，轨道共振与混沌扩散研究）�<Solar System Dynamics (Murray & Dermott, orbital resonances)��id�8a6d555f6c05�body�٣连续引力波来自非轴对称、自转不规则的快速中子星，发出稳定几乎单频的信号，LIGO正用长期积分搜寻这类“宇宙哨声”。ٿContinuous waves come from rapidly spinning but slightly asymmetric neutron stars, emitting an almost single-frequency hum; LIGO searches for them with long integrations—a 'cosmic whistle.'�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�8ae95391fa39�body���宇宙中普通物质（重子）的总量可由大爆炸核合成和微波背景精确推知，但把恒星、星系内气体等发光物质加总，只找到约预期的 10%，其余“失踪的重子”被认为以稀薄、温热的气体（温介质 WHIM）形式弥漫在星系际和宇宙网纤维中。这些气体温度约 10^5–10^7 K、密度极低，难以探测；近年通过 X 射线和类星体吸收线观测已证认出其中相当部分。��The total amount of ordinary (baryonic) matter is precisely known from Big Bang nucleosynthesis and the CMB, yet summing stars and visible gas in galaxies accounts for only about 10% of it. The missing baryons are thought to reside as a thin, warm-hot gas (the WHIM) pervading intergalactic space and cosmic-web filaments—at 10^5–10^7 K and so low in density that it is hard to see. Recent X-ray and quasar-absorption-line observations have now accounted for a substantial fraction of them.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�8aeafbc2cdf1�body��>引力波波形的频率扫掠速率与振幅由双星的总质量与质量比决定，而波形在并合前后的相位与调制蕴含自旋信息。研究人员把观测信号与广义相对论数值相对论库中的模板逐毫秒匹配，通过贝叶斯参数估计得到质量、自旋及距离的后验分布。��The chirp rate and amplitude of a gravitational-wave waveform are set by the binary's total mass and mass ratio, while the phase and modulation around merger encode the spins. Researchers match the observed signal against templates from numerical relativity in general relativity millisecond by millisecond, using Bayesian parameter estimation to obtain posterior distributions for masses, spins, and distance.�ans��src�� 《天体物理学杂志》(ApJ)�The Astrophysical Journal (ApJ)��id�8b01796bea03�body���土卫六是太阳系中唯一拥有浓密大气层的卫星，表面有由液态甲烷形成的湖泊和河流。它被认为可能存在与地球不同的有机化学环境，是寻找地外生命的重要目标。��Titan is the only moon in the solar system with a dense atmosphere, and it has lakes and rivers of liquid methane on its surface. It may host an exotic organic chemistry unlike Earth's, making it a key target in the search for life beyond Earth.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�8bee970f49c5�body��vIa型超新星被当作标准烛光：它们的峰值光度几乎一致，所以视亮度能可靠地换算距离。1998年，两个独立团队比较遥远Ia型超新星的亮度与红移，发现它们比预期的要暗，也就是比按减速膨胀算出的距离更远，说明膨胀在加快。这一结果后来得到微波背景与重子声波振荡的独立印证。��Type Ia supernovae serve as standard candles: their peak luminosities are nearly uniform, so apparent brightness converts reliably into distance. In 1998 two independent teams compared the brightness and redshift of distant Type Ia supernovae and found them dimmer than expected, hence farther than a decelerating expansion predicts, meaning the expansion is speeding up. The result was later corroborated independently by the cosmic microwave background and baryon acoustic oscillations.�ans��src�لPerlmutter、Schmidt 与 Riess《超新星宇宙学计划》（1998/1999）；NASA 威尔金森微波各向异性探测器（WMAP）�vPerlmutter, Schmidt & Riess, Supernova Cosmology Project (1998/1999); NASA Wilkinson Microwave Anisotropy Probe (WMAP)��id�8e0a1e949366�body��*褐矮星质量介于行星与恒星之间（约13至80倍木星质量），核心温度与压力不足以持续稳定的氢聚变，因此无法像真正的恒星那样长期发光。天文学家常用“锂检验”来识别它们：质量足够低的褐矮星在其内部保留了原本的锂。�8Brown dwarfs have masses between planets and stars (about 13–80 times Jupiter's) and their cores are too cool and low-pressure to sustain stable hydrogen fusion, so they cannot shine like true stars. Astronomers often use the “lithium test”: brown dwarfs below a certain mass retain their original lithium.�ans��src��IRebolo、Zapatero Osorio 与 Martín（1992，褐矮星锂检验论文）�BRebolo, Zapatero Osorio & Martín (1992, brown dwarf lithium test)��id�8e81e4f48ebe�body�٪地球自转轴的指向像陀螺一样缓慢画圈（约26000年一周），使天极在星空中缓慢漂移，所以如今的北极星未来会被织女星等取代。٤Earth's spin axis slowly circles like a top (a ~26,000-year cycle), drifting the celestial pole across the sky, so today's Pole Star will later be replaced by Vega.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�8f62c9c7bd50�body���银盘主要由较年轻、金属丰度较高的恒星和气体构成，呈扁平盘状；银晕则包含年老、金属贫乏的恒星和球状星团，呈球状分布。这反映了银河系层次化的形成历史。��The disk is made of younger, metal-rich stars and gas in a flat plane, while the halo holds old, metal-poor stars and globular clusters in a spherical distribution. This mirrors the Milky Way's layered formation history.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�907e67b31190�body�ٲ中性氢原子超精细结构跃迁发出 21 厘米射电，能穿透尘埃、示踪星系中的氢气分布与运动，是研究星系结构和宇宙再电离的关键探针。ٿThe hyperfine transition of neutral hydrogen emits 21-cm radio that pierces dust and traces gas distribution and motion in galaxies, a key probe of galactic structure and cosmic reionization.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�914ced17ea58�body��&热木星因紧贴恒星而受热极强，白天侧温度可达数千开尔文，驱动强大的赤道急流将热量从昼面输运到夜面。其大气常出现平流层逆温，并在晨昏线附近形成金属云和矿物云。三维流体模拟显示其风带速度可达每秒数公里。�tHot Jupiters orbit so close to their stars that dayside temperatures reach thousands of kelvin, driving powerful equatorial jets that transport heat from day to night sides. Their atmospheres often show stratospheric inversions and form metal and mineral clouds near the terminator. Three-dimensional fluid simulations predict wind speeds of several kilometers per second.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�9292452af9af�body���天文学家按恒星的重元素含量将其分为星族I（较年轻、金属丰度较高）和星族II（较年老、金属丰度较低）。金属丰度反映了恒星形成时所在星系的化学演化阶段。��Astronomers split stars into Population I (younger, metal-rich) and Population II (older, metal-poor) by their heavy-element content. Metallicity records the chemical evolution stage of the galaxy in which a star formed.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�92edd24ca030�body��P主序星处于流体静力学平衡：核心氢聚变产生的向外压力与引力向内的拉拽恰好抵消。这种平衡还能自我调节——一旦引力占了上风，核心被压缩、温度升高，聚变加快，压力随即回升把恒星重新撑开。只要核心还有氢可烧，这种负反馈就让它保持稳定。��A main-sequence star sits in hydrostatic equilibrium: the outward pressure from hydrogen fusion in its core exactly balances the inward pull of gravity. The balance is self-regulating — if gravity gains the upper hand, the core compresses and heats up, fusion speeds up, and the pressure rebounds to puff the star back out. As long as hydrogen remains in the core, that negative feedback keeps the star steady.�ans��src��6《天文学概论》（恒星结构与主序阶段）�FAn Introduction to Astronomy (stellar structure and the main sequence)��id�9306f2739525�body��;水星的外核仍是部分熔融的液态铁镍，加上缓慢自转与足够的热对流，维持着一个微弱但真实的偶极磁场。信使号探测发现其磁场仅为地球的约百分之一，且磁轴相对自转轴明显偏移。这一磁场能部分偏转太阳风，在背阳侧形成小型磁层。��Mercury's outer core remains partly molten liquid iron-nickel, and with slow rotation and sufficient thermal convection it sustains a weak but genuine dipolar field. The MESSENGER mission found the field is only about one percent of Earth's and significantly offset from the spin axis. It still partly deflects the solar wind, producing a small magnetosphere on the planet's night side.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�945482780f54�body��O当行星从恒星前方经过时，部分星光会穿过行星大气，大气中的分子会吸收特定波长的光，留下指纹般的吸收谱线。通过对比凌星前后的光谱，天文学家能推断大气成分，如水汽、二氧化碳或甲烷。詹姆斯·韦伯望远镜正用这种方法分析遥远行星的大气。��When a planet transits its star, some starlight passes through the planet's atmosphere, where molecules absorb specific wavelengths and leave fingerprint-like lines. By comparing spectra before and during transit, astronomers infer the atmospheric composition, such as water vapor, carbon dioxide, or methane. The James Webb Telescope uses this method to analyze distant planet atmospheres.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�9499f064387a�body��&活动星系核是位于某些星系中心、异常明亮的致密区域，其能量来自超大质量黑洞吸积周围气体时释放的引力能，可将物质加热到极高温度并发出从射电到 X 射线的全波段辐射。类星体是其中极其遥远、明亮的活动星系核。� An active galactic nucleus (AGN) is an unusually bright, compact region at a galaxy's center powered by a supermassive black hole accreting gas, releasing gravitational energy that heats matter to extreme temperatures and emits across the spectrum. Quasars are very distant, luminous AGN.�ans��src��HPeterson（1997，《活动星系核导论》，剑桥大学出版社）�WB. M. Peterson (1997, An Introduction to Active Galactic Nuclei, Cambridge Univ. Press)��id�94c8fb57e18a�body��Q巨行星在距恒星较远处由冰与气体吸积形成，之后因与原行星盘的引力相互作用发生轨道迁移。盘内潮汐力矩或行星之间的引力散射可把行星推向极近的轨道，甚至形成潮汐锁定。1995年飞马座51b的发现首次证实这类天体的存在，彻底改变了行星形成理论。�hGiant planets form by accreting ice and gas far from their star, then migrate inward through gravitational interaction with the protoplanetary disk. Disk torques or mutual scattering can push a planet into a very close orbit, sometimes tidally locked. The 1995 discovery of 51 Pegasi b confirmed such objects and fundamentally reshaped planet-formation theory.�ans��src�قMayor 与 Queloz《A Jupiter-mass companion to 51 Pegasi》（1995，Nature）；Lin 等《Orbital migration》（1996，Nature）�rMayor & Queloz, A Jupiter-mass companion to 51 Pegasi (1995, Nature); Lin et al., Orbital migration (1996, Nature)��id�9502550ac952�body���韦布对TRAPPIST-1 e、f、g等高灵敏度观测未发现明显大气信号，提示这些岩石行星可能大气稀薄或已被恒星辐照剥离，使红矮星系的宜居前景更谨慎。��Webb's sensitive look at TRAPPIST-1 e, f and g found no clear atmospheric signal, suggesting these rocky planets may have thin atmospheres or have been stripped by stellar irradiation, making red-dwarf habitability more cautious.�ans��src��vGardner J. P. et al., The James Webb Space Telescope, Space Science Reviews 123 (2006), DOI: 10.1007/s11214-006-8315-7�vGardner J. P. et al., The James Webb Space Telescope, Space Science Reviews 123 (2006), DOI: 10.1007/s11214-006-8315-7��id�95ba4281efb7�body���2017年LIGO与Virgo探测到两颗中子星并合产生的引力波，同时望远镜在对应天区发现短暂的可见光与红外爆发，称为千新星。它证实了金、铂等重元素可在这种事件中锻造出来。��In 2017 LIGO and Virgo caught gravitational waves from two merging neutron stars, and telescopes saw a brief optical and infrared burst called a kilonova at the same spot. It confirmed that heavy elements like gold and platinum are forged in such events.�ans��src��Abbott et al.《Multi-messenger Observations of a Binary Neutron Star Merger》(ApJL 848, L12, 2017);LIGO-Virgo 科学合作组نAbbott et al., Multi-messenger Observations of a Binary Neutron Star Merger (ApJL 848, L12, 2017); LIGO-Virgo Scientific Collaboration��id�95bef8fd5ba5�body���「脏雪球」是天文学家对彗星的经典比喻，指彗星由冰（水、二氧化碳、甲烷）与尘埃岩石混合而成。这一模型由弗雷德·惠普尔提出，能解释彗星接近太阳时的喷发行为。��The "dirty snowball" is the classic analogy for a comet: a mixture of ices (water, carbon dioxide, methane) and dust or rock. Proposed by Fred Whipple, it explains why comets erupt as they approach the Sun.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�96541a2cebfa�body��E白矮星不再进行核反应，仅依靠简并电子气体的余热缓慢辐射冷却，其亮度随年龄单调下降。观测中只要找到最暗、因而最老的白矮星，就能定出星团冷却序列的截断年龄。温吉特等人1987年的研究把这一方法确立为测定球状星团年龄的可靠手段。�qWhite dwarfs no longer fuse nuclei and cool slowly by radiating the residual heat of a degenerate electron gas, their brightness falling monotonically with age. Observing the faintest, hence oldest, white dwarfs sets the truncation age of the cluster's cooling sequence. Winget and colleagues established this method in 1987 as a reliable way to date globular clusters.�ans��src��TWinget 等《Cooling of white dwarfs》（1987，ApJ）；NASA 哈勃空间望远镜�OWinget et al., Cooling of white dwarfs (1987, ApJ); NASA Hubble Space Telescope��id�965a6c1d8683�body��t每种元素都有自己独一无二的谱线位置，恒星光谱上的暗吸收线就像指纹一样，能指认恒星大气里有哪些元素。谱线的强度反映温度和元素丰度，谱线的移动还能暴露天体的视向速度。通过分析光谱，天文学家能得知恒星的温度、成分、密度甚至磁场，所以它被称为天体的身份证。��Every element has its own unique set of spectral-line positions, and the dark absorption lines in a star's spectrum act like fingerprints identifying which elements sit in its atmosphere. Line strengths reveal temperature and abundances, and line shifts expose radial velocity. By analysing spectra, astronomers learn a star's temperature, composition, density, and even its magnetic field, which is why the spectrum is called its identity card.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�96622f0d2233�body��_从远处看，黑洞的引力场和相同质量的普通天体完全一样，它并不会额外多拉周围的东西。远处绕行的恒星和气体在普通引力作用下就能稳定运动，只有闯进潮汐半径或视界以内的物质才会被吞掉。真正危险的只是它的视界内部，而不是黑洞本身有什么特别的吸力。��At a distance, a black hole's gravitational field is exactly the same as that of an ordinary object of equal mass; it exerts no extra pull. Stars and gas orbiting far away move stably under ordinary gravity, and only matter venturing inside the tidal region or the horizon is swallowed. What makes it dangerous is the interior beyond the horizon, not some special suction power of the hole itself.�ans��src��3《天文学概论》（黑洞与广义相对论）�AAn Introduction to Astronomy (black holes and general relativity)��id�9663f4ba1b0e�body�ٴ中性氢的超精细结构跃迁发出21厘米射电波，其红移后波长记录了再电离前后氢的分布，是绘制宇宙黎明的独特探针（如SKA、HERA实验）。��Neutral hydrogen's hyperfine transition emits 21-cm radio waves; their redshifted wavelengths record hydrogen distribution before and after reionization, a unique probe of cosmic dawn (e.g. SKA, HERA).�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�988d4c943d54�body��5火星质量小、引力弱，早期大气中的气体逐渐被太阳风剥离；同时它缺乏全球性磁场，无法像地球那样屏蔽太阳风。内部冷却也使火山和板块活动停止，不再补充气体。多重因素叠加让火星从较厚大气退化成今天稀薄的二氧化碳大气。�9Mars is small and weakly gravitational, so much of its early atmosphere was stripped by the solar wind; lacking a global magnetic field, it could not shield itself like Earth. Its interior also cooled, ending volcanism that might replenish gas. Together these left Mars with only a thin carbon-dioxide atmosphere.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�9932d54b9dac�body��s类星体是活动星系核的一种极端形式，其能量来自中央超大质量黑洞吸积周围气体时释放的引力能。物质在吸积盘中螺旋下落，摩擦升温到极高温度并发出从射电到X射线的宽谱辐射，部分以相对论性喷流形式喷出。施密特1963年测定3C 273的红移，确认它们是极遥远、极明亮的天体。��A quasar is an extreme form of active galactic nucleus powered by a central supermassive black hole releasing gravitational energy as it accretes surrounding gas. Material spirals inward through a disk, heated by friction to extreme temperatures and emitting broadband radiation from radio to X-rays, sometimes in relativistic jets. Schmidt's 1963 redshift of 3C 273 established them as extraordinarily distant, luminous objects.�ans��src�٥Schmidt《3C 273 redshift》（1963，Nature）；Rees《Astrophysical jets》（1984，Annual Review of Astronomy & Astrophysics）；NASA 钱德拉X射线天文台�oSchmidt, 3C 273 redshift (1963, Nature); Rees, Astrophysical jets (1984, ARA&A); NASA Chandra X-ray Observatory��id�9b6d6677d34b�body��r行星和恒星其实在绕共同的质心旋转，所以行星的引力会让恒星在视线方向上来回摆动。通过精密测量光谱线的周期性红移、蓝移，天文学家能算出恒星摆动的速度和周期，从而推断出看不见的行星及其最小质量。1995年，正是用这种方法发现了第一颗绕类似太阳恒星运行的行星。��A planet and its star actually orbit a common centre of mass, so the planet's gravity makes the star wobble back and forth along the line of sight. By precisely measuring the periodic red- and blueshift of spectral lines, astronomers derive the star's wobbling speed and period, revealing the invisible planet and its minimum mass. This very technique found the first planet around a Sun-like star in 1995.�ans��src�قMayor 与 Queloz《A Jupiter-mass companion to 51 Pegasi》（1995，Nature）；Lin 等《Orbital migration》（1996，Nature）�rMayor & Queloz, A Jupiter-mass companion to 51 Pegasi (1995, Nature); Lin et al., Orbital migration (1996, Nature)��id�9c7d795530e6�body�٢大部分重元素通过快中子俘获过程（r 过程）在中子星并合或某些超新星中形成，中子被快速俘获后再经 β 衰变变成重核。��Most heavy elements form via the rapid neutron-capture process (r-process) in neutron-star mergers or certain supernovae, where nuclei quickly grab neutrons and later beta-decay into heavy nuclei.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�9da2bf3c21df�body��w引力波引起的空间应变极其微小，典型只有10的负21次方量级，也就是在4公里的臂长上，长度变化只有约质子直径的千分之一。干涉臂越长，同样的应变造成的臂长差越大，越容易被检测到。为此，LIGO把测试质量用悬挂镜片隔振，在真空管道里运行，再用两臂的干涉相消来压制噪声。��Gravitational waves stretch space by only about one part in 10^21 — over a 4-kilometre arm, a change of roughly a thousandth of a proton's diameter. The longer the arms, the larger the length difference a given strain produces and the easier it is to measure. So LIGO suspends its mirrors as vibration-isolated test masses, runs the beams in vacuum tubes, and cancels noise by interfering the two arms.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�9e7bc04cdb7a�body��a太阳日冕温度高达百万开尔文，远高于其表面约5800开尔文的光球，能量如何从低温层向上传递成为长期难题。主流假说包括磁场重连引发的微耀斑，以及磁流体波把能量从对流区向上传输并在日冕耗散。SOHO和界面区成像摄谱仪等任务正在区分这两种机制的相对贡献。��The solar corona reaches millions of kelvin, far hotter than the roughly 5800 kelvin photosphere below, and how energy climbs from cool layers to heat it remains a long-standing puzzle. Leading hypotheses invoke magnetic reconnection in nanoflares and magnetohydrodynamic waves that carry energy upward from the convection zone and dissipate in the corona. Missions such as SOHO and IRIS are distinguishing the relative contributions of these mechanisms.�ans��src��nParker《Nanoflares and the solar X-ray corona》（1988，ApJ）；NASA 太阳与日球层天文台（SOHO）�iParker, Nanoflares and the solar X-ray corona (1988, ApJ); NASA Solar and Heliospheric Observatory (SOHO)��id�9ecdab5856e5�body���太阳耀斑是太阳大气中磁重联释放能量产生的电磁辐射爆发，能量以光速以 X 射线和紫外形式到达地球，主要影响电离层。日冕物质抛射则把数十亿吨等离子体连同其冻结的磁场整个抛向太空，需要一到三天才能到达地球。正是 CME 携带的磁场与地球磁场相互作用，才产生了最强的地磁暴。因此，相比耀斑，日冕物质抛射更容易引发强地磁暴。�7A solar flare is an explosive burst of electromagnetic radiation from magnetic reconnection in the solar atmosphere; its X-rays and ultraviolet arrive at light speed and mainly disturb the ionosphere. A coronal mass ejection (CME), by contrast, hurls billions of tons of plasma and its frozen-in magnetic field into space, taking one to three days to reach Earth. It is the CME's magnetic field interacting with Earth's magnetosphere that produces the strongest geomagnetic storms. A CME is therefore far more likely than a flare to trigger a major geomagnetic storm.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�a00342b9eb4d�body���大爆炸只造出氢、氦和微量锂，恒星聚变最多做到铁为止，因为比铁更重的元素聚变反而要吸收能量。铁以上的元素要靠中子俘获来造，其中快速俘获的r过程主要发生在超新星爆发，以及中子星并合这样极端的天文事件里。2017年LIGO和室女座探测器观测到的双中子星并合事件，就伴随产生了大量金、银等元素。��The Big Bang produced only hydrogen, helium, and a trace of lithium, and stellar fusion stops at iron, since fusing anything heavier costs energy instead of releasing it. Elements above iron form by neutron capture, and the rapid r-process takes place mainly in supernovae and extreme events such as neutron-star mergers. The 2017 binary neutron-star merger detected by LIGO and Virgo was observed to forge large amounts of gold and silver.�ans��src��7《自然》杂志（2017年双中子星并合观测）�5Nature (2017 binary neutron-star merger observations)��id�a12864c3bf72�body���哈勃张力是指测量当今宇宙膨胀速率（哈勃常数 H₀）的两种方法给出的数值不一致：基于微波背景和 ΛCDM 模型推得约 67 km/s/Mpc，而基于超新星等“距离阶梯”的局部测量约 73 km/s/Mpc，差距约 9%。这一分歧持续存在、难以用测量误差解释，可能意味着我们对暗能量、中微子或早期宇宙物理的理解需要修正。它是当代宇宙学最突出的未解之谜之一。��The Hubble tension is the mismatch between two ways of measuring today's expansion rate, the Hubble constant H₀. Early-universe inferences from the CMB within the ΛCDM model give about 67 km/s/Mpc, while local distance-ladder measurements using supernovae give about 73 km/s/Mpc—a ~9% discrepancy. Because it persists beyond measurement error, it may signal that our understanding of dark energy, neutrinos, or early-universe physics needs revision, making it one of cosmology's leading puzzles.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�a1ffdb64ceb2�body���大质量天体（包括暗物质晕）会弯曲背景光线，这种现象称为引力透镜。通过分析星系团造成的强、弱透镜畸变，可以绘制出不可见物质的分布，证明其远超可见物质。�Massive objects, including dark-matter halos, bend background light in an effect called gravitational lensing. By analyzing the strong and weak distortions around galaxy clusters, astronomers map the invisible matter and show it vastly outweighs the visible.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�a2891c287a05�body�٧Ia型超新星峰值光度几乎恒定，因为白矮星都在同一质量极限爆炸，所以比较观测亮度就能推算距离，帮助发现宇宙加速膨胀。��Type Ia supernovae have a nearly constant peak luminosity because white dwarfs explode at the same mass limit, so comparing observed brightness yields distance—key to discovering the accelerating Universe.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�a33f5cf9078b�body�ٺ活动星系核是某些星系中心异常明亮的区域，能量来自中心的超大质量黑洞吸积物质时释放的巨大引力能。类星体是其中极亮而遥远的一类。��An active galactic nucleus is an unusually bright center of a galaxy, powered by a supermassive black hole accreting matter and releasing huge gravitational energy. Quasars are among the brightest and most distant examples.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�a3c83bcf7460�body�ٷ潮汐锁定指卫星的自转周期与公转周期相同，使同一面始终朝向主星。地球对月球的引力潮汐作用逐渐减慢了月球自转，最终使它被锁定。��Tidal locking occurs when a moon's rotation period matches its orbital period, so the same side always faces its planet. Earth's tidal pull gradually slowed the Moon's spin until it became locked.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�a4643024a560�body��-ALMA是由数十台射电天线组成、位于海拔五千米沙漠的毫米波干涉阵，专门探测被尘埃遮蔽的冷气体与恒星形成区。其高分辨率和灵敏度能解析原行星盘的细节与早期星系的尘埃。它是研究宇宙“冷”成分最强大的地面设施之一。�\ALMA is a millimeter-wave interferometric array of dozens of radio antennas at 5000 meters altitude in the desert, probing cold gas and star-forming regions hidden by dust. Its resolution and sensitivity resolve protoplanetary disks and dusty early galaxies. It is among the most powerful ground facilities for the universe's “cold” components.�ans��src�ٌ事件视界望远镜合作组《First M87 Event Horizon Telescope results》（2019，ApJL）；阿塔卡马大型毫米波阵列（ALMA）ْEvent Horizon Telescope Collaboration, First M87 Event Horizon Telescope results (2019, ApJL); Atacama Large Millimeter/submillimeter Array (ALMA)��id�a58fd74a87c1�body��"水星椭圆轨道的近日点每世纪比牛顿理论预测多偏移约43角秒，这一异常长期困扰天文学家。爱因斯坦的广义相对论把太阳引力解释为时空弯曲，恰好算出了这多出的进动。这一成功成为广义相对论早期的重要验证之一。�5Mercury's perihelion advances about 43 arc-seconds per century more than Newton's theory predicts, a puzzle for a long time. Einstein's general relativity explains the Sun's gravity as curved spacetime and exactly accounts for the extra precession. This success became an early key test of general relativity.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�a7203899525f�body�٨望远镜、大气和探测器会引入偏差和噪声，校准用标准星和暗场、平场等校正响应，把原始计数转换成可靠的天体亮度与颜色。ټTelescopes, atmosphere, and detectors add bias and noise; calibration with standard stars and dark/flat frames corrects the response, turning raw counts into reliable brightness and color.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�a7cae878a8eb�body��B引力透镜直接测出星系团总质量，X 射线测出星系团内介质气体的重子质量，二者之比与宇宙重子分数对照即可检验重子是否缺失。结果显示 ICM 贡献了星系团内大部分重子，但某些星系团的总重子分数偏低，需用丢失重子或温热弥漫介质解释。�2Lensing directly measures total cluster mass, while X-rays measure the ICM gas baryon mass; their ratio versus the cosmic baryon fraction tests for missing baryons. ICM holds most cluster baryons, yet some clusters show low total baryon fractions, invoking missing baryons or warm-hot intergalactic medium.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�a9009481be50�body���在大爆炸后约38万年的微波背景形成、宇宙进入“黑暗时期”之后，第一批恒星和星系释放的紫外辐射逐渐把弥漫的中性氢重新电离成质子和自由电子。这一过程大约发生在红移 z≈6–20（宇宙年龄约4亿到10亿年），标志着宇宙从几乎全中性变为电离态。再电离也结束了宇宙黑暗时代，并深刻影响了此后星系的演化。�
After the cosmic microwave background formed (~380,000 years after the Big Bang) and the universe entered its dark ages, the ultraviolet light from the first stars and galaxies gradually reionized the pervasive neutral hydrogen, splitting it back into protons and free electrons. This reionization epoch spanned roughly z≈6–20 (about 400–1000 million years after the Big Bang) and marks the transition from a mostly neutral to an ionized universe. It ended the cosmic dark ages and shaped all later galaxy evolution.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�ab3ee139eeb5�body���视差是从两个不同位置观察同一近处物体时，它在远处背景上相对移动的现象。天文学家在地球公转轨道两端（相隔约半年）拍摄邻近恒星，测其相对遥远背景的微小位移角（半年视差），再用三角法算出距离，1秒差距约3.26光年。视差是确定恒星距离最可靠的直接方法，盖亚卫星已测上亿颗恒星的视差。��Parallax is the apparent shift of a nearby object against a distant background when viewed from two different positions. Astronomers photograph nearby stars six months apart at opposite ends of Earth's orbit, measure the tiny shift angle (the annual parallax), and use trigonometry to find distance; one parsec is about 3.26 light-years. Parallax is the most reliable direct distance method, and Gaia has measured it for over a billion stars.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�ada1a8a41ec2�body��q在核心坍缩超新星中，约 99% 的引力束缚能以中微子形式在数秒内释放，这是驱动爆发与合成重元素的能量来源，但光子要到数小时后才透出。1987A 超新星仅记录到 19 颗中微子，已能约束原中子星冷却时标；下一代探测器有望在银心事件中获得数万计数，从而区分不同爆炸机制。��In a core-collapse supernova, about 99% of the released gravitational binding energy emerges as neutrinos within seconds, powering the explosion and the synthesis of heavy elements, while photons escape only hours later. The 19 neutrinos from SN 1987A already constrained the protoneutron star cooling timescale, and next-generation detectors could record tens of thousands from a Galactic event, distinguishing rival explosion mechanisms.�ans��src�� 《天体物理学杂志》(ApJ)�The Astrophysical Journal (ApJ)��id�ae0350dc19d4�body�٢妊神星自转极快（约 4 小时一圈），离心力把它拉成椭球，还拥有光环和两颗卫星，是柯伊伯带中形态最奇特的天体之一。��Haumea spins extremely fast (about one rotation every 4 hours), and centrifugal force stretches it into an ellipsoid; it also has a ring and two moons, making it one of the oddest Kuiper Belt objects.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�aef51ebd2303�body�ٳGW170817的引力波波形给出了中子星“软化”程度的上限，配合千新星电磁观测估计抛射物质量，两者共同限制了核密度之上的物态方程。��The gravitational-wave signal of GW170817 bounds how 'soft' neutron-star matter can be, and kilonova light gives the ejected mass; together they constrain the equation of state above nuclear density.�ans��src��Abbott et al.《Multi-messenger Observations of a Binary Neutron Star Merger》(ApJL 848, L12, 2017);LIGO-Virgo 科学合作组نAbbott et al., Multi-messenger Observations of a Binary Neutron Star Merger (ApJL 848, L12, 2017); LIGO-Virgo Scientific Collaboration��id�af1ddc62d63f�body�ٜ星系自转曲线、星系团引力透镜和宇宙大尺度结构都显示可见物质远远不够，必须存在大量不可见物质提供额外引力。ٲGalaxy rotation curves, cluster gravitational lensing and large-scale structure all show visible matter is far too little, requiring large invisible mass to supply extra gravity.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�astro_19_003�body���X形亮脊是盒状/花生壳状核球侧视时的自然投影形态,由内盘恒星经共振俘获抬升离开银道面所致。Wegg 与 Gerhard 以红团簇巨星为标准烛光,从 VVV 巡天测光重建了核球的三维密度图,把沿视线拉长的棒与中央X形结构清晰地分离开。这样的几何表明银河系核球主要源自内盘的动力学失稳,而不是早期并合堆积的老年成分。��The X-shaped ridges arise naturally when a boxy/peanut bulge is seen edge-on, built as resonances lift inner-disk stars above the plane. Using red-clump giants as standard candles, Wegg and Gerhard reconstructed the bulge's three-dimensional density from VVV photometry, cleanly separating the elongated bar from the central X structure. This geometry indicates a bulge grown through disk dynamical instability rather than assembled from early merger debris.�ans��src�ټWegg, Gerhard,《Mapping the three-dimensional density of the Galactic bulge with VVV red clump stars》,Monthly Notices of the Royal Astronomical Society,2013 (DOI: 10.1093/mnras/stt1376)ٽWegg and Gerhard, 'Mapping the three-dimensional density of the Galactic bulge with VVV red clump stars', Monthly Notices of the Royal Astronomical Society, 2013, DOI: 10.1093/mnras/stt1376��id�astro_19_006�body���插板需要在白天人工钻孔并逐根插入光纤,一夜之内无法切换数千个观测目标。LAMOST 在五度直径的焦面上布设了4000个双轴微步进定位单元,由计算机按目标表并行驱动,几分钟内即可完成全焦面重构,单次曝光获得数千条低分辨率光谱。这一设计使其长期位居单次曝光获取光谱数最多的望远镜之列,支撑起千万量级的恒星光谱巡天。�Plug plates must be drilled and hand-plugged during daytime, so thousands of targets cannot be swapped within a single night. LAMOST instead deploys 4000 dual-axis micro-stepper units across its five-degree field of view, driven in parallel from a target catalog to reconfigure the whole focal surface within minutes and record several thousand low-resolution spectra per exposure. The design kept it among the telescopes capturing the most spectra per exposure, powering stellar surveys totaling tens of millions of spectra.�ans��src��rCui 等(LAMOST 团队),2012年,Research in Astronomy and Astrophysics,12卷1197页:LAMOST 先导试验观测报告�oCui et al. (LAMOST team) 2012, Research in Astronomy and Astrophysics, 12, 1197 - Preliminary LAMOST experiment��id�astro_19_009�body���模型假设入射 XUV 辐射的固定比例转化为气体克服行星引力所做的功,但真实效率取决于辐射沉积深度、氢分子解离、冷却谱线以及电离复合平衡,不同行星之间可差出一个数量级。观测端还叠加了恒星 XUV 光度本身的大误差,以及莱曼阿尔法、氦10830埃三重线等逃逸探针随温度结构的强烈变化。于是同一颗行星用不同代码拟合,得到的效率值可以从百分之几一直散布到几十个百分点。�jThe framework assumes a fixed fraction of incident XUV energy becomes work done by gas against planetary gravity, yet the genuine efficiency depends on where radiation deposits, on hydrogen dissociation, on cooling lines, and on ionization-recombination balance, varying by an order of magnitude between planets. Stellar XUV luminosities add large uncertainties, while escape probes such as Lyman-alpha and the helium 10830 angstrom triplet respond strongly to the assumed thermal profile. Fitting the same planet with different codes consequently spreads the inferred efficiency from a few percent to tens of percent.�ans��src���Lopez 与 Fortney,《THE ROLE OF CORE MASS IN CONTROLLING EVAPORATION: THE KEPLER RADIUS DISTRIBUTION AND THE KEPLER-36 DENSITY DICHOTOMY》,The Astrophysical Journal,2013 (DOI: 10.1088/0004-637x/776/1/2)��Lopez & Fortney, 'THE ROLE OF CORE MASS IN CONTROLLING EVAPORATION: THE KEPLER RADIUS DISTRIBUTION AND THE KEPLER-36 DENSITY DICHOTOMY', The Astrophysical Journal, 2013, DOI: 10.1088/0004-637x/776/1/2��id�astro_19_013�body���银河系富含尘埃，可见光会被吸收散射，几万光年外的中性氢云在光学波段基本不可见。中性氢原子基态超精细能级之间的自发跃迁产生1420 MHz谱线，虽然单个跃迁概率极低（约一千万年一次），但星际氢柱体巨大且该波段可穿透尘埃。此外氢是宇宙中最丰富的元素，大量原子的累积辐射使这条线成为绘制银河系内外中性氢分布的主力手段。�"Interstellar dust extinguishes visible light, so neutral hydrogen clouds across the Milky Way are essentially invisible optically. The ground-state hyperfine transition of atomic hydrogen emits at 1420 MHz; the spontaneous transition probability per atom is tiny (once per ~10 million years), but Galactic hydrogen columns are enormous and radio emission passes through dust unattenuated. Because hydrogen dominates the baryonic universe, the accumulated line emission maps neutral hydrogen throughout and beyond the Galaxy with high sensitivity.�ans��src���Ewen & Purcell,《Observation of a Line in the Galactic Radio Spectrum: Radiation from Galactic Hydrogen at 1,420 Mc./sec.》,Nature,1951 (DOI: 10.1038/168356a0)；van de Hulst 1945年理论预言论文��Ewen & Purcell, 'Observation of a Line in the Galactic Radio Spectrum: Radiation from Galactic Hydrogen at 1,420 Mc./sec.', Nature, 1951, DOI: 10.1038/168356a0; van de Hulst prediction paper (1945)��id�astro_19_016�body���气相两体反应在这种温度下势垒太高，效率极低，所以主要化学过程发生在冰冷的尘埃颗粒表面。CO等分子冻结在粒度表面后，宇宙线或紫外光子电离氢气产生的氢原子可以在表面量子隧穿并加合，逐级把CO氢化成HCO、H2CO直至CH3OH。实验室低温冰实验已复现这一反应链，说明表面化学而非热平衡气相反应主导了冷云中复杂分子的生成。��Two-body gas-phase reactions face prohibitive barriers at such temperatures, so the dominant chemistry happens on cold dust-grain surfaces. Once CO freezes out, H atoms produced by cosmic-ray or UV ionization can tunnel and add onto the ice, hydrogenating CO stepwise to HCO, H2CO, and finally CH3OH. Laboratory experiments on low-temperature ices have reproduced this chain, confirming that surface chemistry rather than thermal gas-phase reactions builds complex molecules in cold clouds.�ans��src��ZTielens & Hagen 1982年尘埃表面化学模型论文；Fuchs et al. 2009年CO加氢实验�lTielens & Hagen 1982 grain-surface chemistry model; Fuchs et al. 2009 CO-hydrogenation laboratory experiment��id�astro_19_019�body���Gaia第二次数据发布显示，不同金属丰度和年龄的恒星在垂直位置—垂直速度相空间中呈现出波浪状的密度起伏和速度螺旋结构，即所谓蜗牛壳图案。这被解释为数亿年前一个矮星系穿越银盘激发的弯曲振荡正在相位混合：初始紧密卷绕的相空间结构随时间松开，年轻与年老族群留下不同相位的印记。该证据表明银盘至今仍在回应吸积扰动，为盘的动力学加热历史提供了直接约束。�GGaia DR2 revealed snail-shell-like patterns in the vertical position–velocity distribution of stars spanning different metallicities and ages, indicating a bending wave still mixing through the disk. The leading interpretation is that a satellite galaxy crossing the plane several hundred million years ago excited coherent vertical oscillations whose tightly wound phase-space structure is now unwinding. Younger and older populations retain different phases of this response, showing the disk is still ringing from accretion events and constraining its dynamical heating history.�ans��src��qAntoja et al. 2018年Gaia DR2蜗牛结构Nature论文；Bland-Hawthorn & Tepper-García 2021年扰动起源分析�Antoja et al. 2018 Nature paper on the Gaia DR2 phase spiral; Bland-Hawthorn & Tepper-García 2021 perturbation-origin analysis��id�astro_20_006�body��v任何巡天都对亮度、颜色和天空位置设有探测阈值,亮星和近距恒星因此被系统性高估。若不做统计改正,样本会严重偏向大质量、高光度的恒星,而暗弱的低质量恒星大量缺失。通过蒙特卡洛模拟注入人工恒星再重新回收,可以量化完备度随星等的变化,从而反推出真实的初始质量函数。��Every survey imposes detection thresholds on brightness, color, and sky position, systematically overrepresenting luminous and nearby stars. Without statistical corrections, samples become strongly biased toward massive, high-luminosity stars while faint low-mass stars go missing. By injecting artificial stars into the images and measuring how many are recovered, astronomers quantify completeness as a function of magnitude and invert the bias to recover the true initial mass function.�ans��src�ٍChabrier 2003,《Publications of the Astronomical Society of the Pacific》115卷763页《银河系恒星与亚恒星初始质量函数》。ًChabrier G, Galactic stellar and substellar initial mass function, Publications of the Astronomical Society of the Pacific 115: 763 (2003).��id�astro_20_009�body���阿波罗地震仪和重力测量显示月球正面地壳厚约30公里,而背面可达60公里以上,这决定了撞击盆地能否被玄武岩充填成月海。主流模型认为岩浆洋结晶末期,最后残余的KREEP熔体因放射性生热元素富集而集中到正面中低纬区域,局部加热延长了那里的玄武岩喷发期。SPA巨型撞击对内部对流的扰动也可能参与其中,但热化学不对称目前是最受支持的解释。�1Apollo seismometers and gravity mapping show the nearside crust is about 30 km thick while the farside exceeds 60 km, controlling whether impact basins could be flooded by basalt to form maria. In leading models, late-stage residual melts of the magma ocean enriched in radiogenic elements (KREEP) concentrated beneath the nearside mid-latitudes, and the extra heat prolonged basaltic volcanism there. The giant South Pole–Aitken impact may also have perturbed interior convection, but the thermochemical asymmetry is currently the best-supported explanation.�ans��src��cWieczorek et al. 2012, Science 335, 1212《月球Procellarum KREEP岩区的高分辨率重力场》�aWieczoreck et al. 2012, Science 335, 1212, "High-resolution gravity field of the Moon from GRAIL"��id�astro_20_013�body���太阳自转叠加偶极磁场,使磁力线被太阳风拖曳成帕克螺旋,而磁场极性反转面延伸出去形成一个波浪状的电流片,地球穿越其不同侧面时就观测到磁扇形交替。流星体本身不受电磁力影响,但雷达流星监测依赖电离尾迹,太阳风与地磁活动会改变高层大气电离状态与背景噪声。因此扇形结构经过时,雷达流星计数会出现可统计到的涨落,这是日地耦合研究中的一个经典课题。�pSolar rotation acting on a dipolar field drags field lines into the Parker spiral, and the polarity-reversal surface extends outward as a wavy current sheet; as Earth crosses its different flanks, spacecraft observe alternating magnetic sectors. Meteoroids themselves are unaffected by electromagnetic forces, but radar meteor detection depends on ionized trails, and solar-wind conditions plus geomagnetic activity alter upper-atmosphere ionization and background noise. Statistically detectable fluctuations in radar meteor counts when a sector boundary passes are therefore a classic topic in Sun-Earth coupling research.�ans��src��>Parker,《Dynamics of the Interplanetary Gas and Magnetic Fields》,The Astrophysical Journal,1958 (DOI: 10.1086/146579)；Smith, E.J., Balogh, A. et al.,《Disappearance of the heliospheric sector structure at Ulysses》, Geophysical Research Letters, 1993 (DOI: 10.1029/93gl02632)；IMCOW 雷达流星数据集文献�:Parker, 'Dynamics of the Interplanetary Gas and Magnetic Fields', The Astrophysical Journal, 1958, DOI: 10.1086/146579; Smith, Balogh et al., 'Disappearance of the heliospheric sector structure at Ulysses', Geophysical Research Letters, 1993, DOI: 10.1029/93gl02632; IMCOW radar meteor dataset literature (Rendtel)��id�astro_20_016�body��i关键差异在于大气总量:金星的大气压约为地球的92倍,而火星只有地球的约0.6%,厚重的CO2大气让金星产生极强的温室效应。金星还覆盖着硫酸云层,进一步捕获红外辐射并反射阳光形成复杂的辐射平衡。因此金星表面约735 K,而火星因大气稀薄、热容量小,全球平均温度仅约210 K。��The key difference is total atmospheric mass: Venus's surface pressure is about 92 times Earth's, while Mars holds only about 0.6% of an atmosphere, and the thick CO2 envelope drives a runaway greenhouse effect on Venus. A global layer of sulfuric-acid clouds further traps outgoing infrared radiation while scattering sunlight into a complex radiative balance. As a result, Venus bakes at roughly 735 K, whereas Mars, with its thin air and low heat capacity, averages only about 210 K.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�astro_20_019�body���磁星拥有宇宙中最强的磁场(~10^14–10^15 G),其磁重联能以毫秒尺度释放巨大能量,正好匹配FRB的亮度和时标。2020年SGR 1935+2154爆发了与FRB高度相似的射电暴(SGR 1806-20在2004年的伽马耀发也伴随过类FRB信号),这是迄今最强的直接关联证据。此外CHIME对重复FRB的偏振、周期性活跃窗口等统计特征,也与年轻磁星的性质大体吻合,但单一磁星机制尚不能解释全部FRB。�1Magnetars carry the strongest known magnetic fields (~10^14–10^15 G), and magnetic reconnection on them can release enormous energy on millisecond timescales, matching FRB luminosities and durations. In April 2020 SGR 1935+2154 produced a radio burst strikingly similar to an extragalactic FRB — the strongest direct association to date. Statistical properties of repeating FRBs measured by CHIME, such as polarization behavior and periodic activity windows, also fit young magnetar models, though a single magnetar mechanism does not yet explain every FRB.�ans��src��WBochenek et al. & CHIME/FRB Collaboration, Nature 587 (2020);CHIME/FRB Catalog 1 (2021)�ZBochenek et al. and CHIME/FRB Collaboration, Nature 587 (2020); CHIME/FRB Catalog 1 (2021)��id�astro_21_003�body���强透镜产生多重像、爱因斯坦环和巨弧,可用来称量星系团质量并放大遥远的背景星系;弱透镜表现为背景星系形状的微小相干切变,是绘制暗物质大尺度结构和限制宇宙学参数的核心手段;微引力透镜则通过背景恒星的短暂增亮探测不可见致密天体,涵盖流浪行星与恒星级黑洞。三者共同把引力本身当作天然望远镜使用。�Strong lensing produces multiple images, Einstein rings, and giant arcs, letting astronomers weigh galaxy clusters and magnify faint background galaxies; weak lensing shows up as tiny coherent shears in the shapes of background galaxies and underpins maps of the cosmic web as well as tests of cosmological parameters; microlensing detects unseen compact objects, from free-floating planets to stellar-mass black holes, through the brief brightening of background stars. All three turn gravity itself into a natural telescope.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�astro_21_006�body���这类包体由黄长石、深绿辉石(fassaite)和尖晶石等难熔矿物组成,记录了约 1700 K 以上高温星云气体的冷凝序列,结晶时间比绝大多数球粒早一到三百万年。Pb-Pb 同位素体系给出的年龄集中在 4567.3 Ma 附近,不确定度仅数十万年,被采纳为太阳系演化的绝对时间零点。借助该锚点,球粒形成、行星核幔分异等相对时标才能换算为确定的纪年。�These inclusions consist of refractory minerals such as melilite, fassaite, and spinel, recording condensation sequences from nebular gas hotter than about 1700 K and crystallizing one to three million years before most chondrules. Their Pb-Pb isotope systematics cluster near 4567.3 Ma with uncertainties of only a few hundred thousand years, defining the absolute zero point of Solar System evolution. Anchored there, relative timescales for chondrule formation and planetary core-mantle differentiation convert into definite calendar ages.�ans��src��iConnelly 等,Science 338:651 (2012);MacPherson,Treatise on Geochemistry 第二版第一卷 1.4 节 (2014)�oConnelly et al., Science 338, 651 (2012); MacPherson, Treatise on Geochemistry 2nd ed., vol. 1, sec. 1.4 (2014)��id�astro_21_009�body���凌星光变曲线的深度给出行星半径与恒星半径之比,其形态和持续时间还编码轨道倾角与半长轴;视向速度的半振幅则给出质量乘以 sin 倾角的最小值。凌星的存在把倾角钉在接近九十度,sin 因子归一,于是真实质量与半径同时到手,平均密度随之可算,岩质、富水或厚气体包层的世界由此区分。开普勒望远镜产出数千个凌星候选体,ESPRESSO 等高稳定性阶梯光谱仪承担后续的质量复核。�iThe depth of a transit light curve gives the planet-to-star radius ratio, while its shape and duration encode orbital inclination and semi-major axis; the radial-velocity semi-amplitude yields mass multiplied by the sine of the inclination, a minimum value. Because a transit pins the inclination near ninety degrees, the sine factor normalizes, true mass and radius arrive together, and bulk density separates rocky, water-rich, or heavily gas-enveloped worlds. Kepler delivered thousands of transit candidates, with echelle spectrographs of extreme stability such as ESPRESSO performing follow-up mass verification.�ans��src��rSeager 与 Mallen-Ornelas,Astrophysical Journal 585:1038 (2003);Pepe 等,Astronomy and Astrophysics 645:A96 (2021)�xSeager & Mallen-Ornelas, Astrophysical Journal 585, 1038 (2003); Pepe et al., Astronomy and Astrophysics 645, A96 (2021)��id�astro_22_003�body���生物聚合物的有序结构依赖构象单一：若氨基酸旋光混杂，肽链难以折叠成稳定的活性形态，核酸螺旋也会失稳，因此旋光纯度被视为识别生命的化学判据。其起源尚无定论：主流假说包括恒星形成区圆偏振紫外光对两种对映体的选择性光解留下初始失衡、方解石等矿物表面对单一手性的选择性吸附富集，以及自催化反应把微小失衡指数式放大为宏观旋光纯度。��The orderly architecture of biopolymers demands uniform handedness: with mixed-chirality amino acids, peptide chains cannot fold into stable functional shapes and nucleic-acid helices lose integrity, so optical purity stands among the chemical criteria used to identify life. Its origin remains unresolved. Leading hypotheses include enantioselective photolysis by circularly polarized ultraviolet light from star-forming regions leaving an initial imbalance between mirror forms, preferential adsorption of one hand on mineral surfaces such as calcite, and autocatalytic networks amplifying a tiny initial excess exponentially into macroscopic homochirality.�ans��src��EU. Meierhenrich《氨基酸与生命的不对称性》Springer (2008)�RU. Meierhenrich, 'Amino Acids and the Asymmetry of Life', Springer, 1st ed. (2008)��id�astro_22_006�body���望远镜衍射极限约为1.22λ/D，口径增大本应不断锐化星像，但大气湍流使波前持续发生畸变。湍流相干长度r₀在地面台址上典型只有十几厘米，对应约一角秒的视宁度光斑；超过这一口径后星像尺寸趋于饱和，加大口径主要增加集光本领而非分辨本领。自适应光学借助变形镜实时补偿波前误差，才能使大望远镜逼近衍射极限。�HThe diffraction limit 1.22 lambda/D would keep sharpening images as aperture grows, but atmospheric turbulence continuously distorts the incoming wavefront. At visible wavelengths the turbulence coherence length r0 is typically only ten-odd centimeters even at good sites, corresponding to a seeing spot of roughly one arcsecond; beyond that aperture, image size saturates, so a larger mirror mainly gains light gathering rather than resolving power. Adaptive optics with deformable mirrors corrects the wavefront in real time, letting big telescopes approach their diffraction limit.�ans��src�٩Fried D. L., Optical Resolution through a Randomly Inhomogeneous Medium for Very Long and Very Short Exposures, Journal of the Optical Society of America 56, 1372 (1966)٩D. L. Fried, Optical Resolution through a Randomly Inhomogeneous Medium for Very Long and Very Short Exposures, Journal of the Optical Society of America 56, 1372 (1966)��id�astro_22_009�body���复合之前，宇宙是炽热的光子—重子等离子体，引力和光子压强的拉锯使密度扰动像声波一样振荡。光子退耦那一刻，不同尺度的模式停在各自相位上：被压缩到极值的尺度留下最热的第一个峰，其后依次出现冷暖相间的峰谷，特征角尺度约一度。第一峰位置直接约束空间曲率，各级峰高之比给出重子与物质密度，是精确宇宙学的支柱。�TBefore recombination the universe was a hot photon-baryon plasma, and the tug-of-war between gravity and radiation pressure made density perturbations oscillate like sound waves. At the moment photons decoupled, modes of different scales froze at different phases: the scale caught at maximum compression left the hottest first peak, followed by alternating peaks and troughs at a characteristic angular scale near one degree. The first peak's position directly measures spatial curvature, and the ratios of peak heights fix the baryon and total matter densities - pillars of precision cosmology.�ans��src�ٺHu W. & Dodelson S., Cosmic Microwave Background Anisotropies, Annual Review of Astronomy and Astrophysics 40, 171 (2002); Planck Collaboration, Planck 2018 结果 VI, A&A 641, A6 (2020)ٺW. Hu & S. Dodelson, Cosmic Microwave Background Anisotropies, Annual Review of Astronomy and Astrophysics 40, 171 (2002); Planck 2018 Results VI, Astronomy & Astrophysics 641, A6 (2020)��id�astro_22_013�body���室温下约300 K的望远镜本身就像黑体，峰值辐射恰在十微米附近，会以自身热发光淹没同波段的天体信号。将主镜降至几十开尔文、探测器再主动制冷到数开尔文，能把仪器背景压低几个数量级，微弱红外源才能测量。这正是斯皮策耗尽液氦后仅剩最短波段可用、韦布主镜被动冷至约45 K而MIRI仍需额外制冷机的原因。�,A telescope at room temperature near 300 K radiates like a blackbody peaking close to ten micrometers, and its own thermal glow would swamp celestial signals in exactly those bands. Dropping the primary mirror to a few dozen kelvin and actively chilling detectors to several kelvin suppresses instrumental background by orders of magnitude, making faint infrared sources measurable. That is why Spitzer retained only its shortest bands after the helium ran out, and why Webb's primary cools passively to about 45 K while MIRI needs dedicated refrigerators.�ans��src��vGardner J. P. et al., The James Webb Space Telescope, Space Science Reviews 123 (2006), DOI: 10.1007/s11214-006-8315-7�vGardner J. P. et al., The James Webb Space Telescope, Space Science Reviews 123 (2006), DOI: 10.1007/s11214-006-8315-7��id�astro_22_019�body���卡西尼号尘埃分析仪在飞越羽流时，检出质量超过200道尔顿、难溶于水的复杂有机大分子，性质酷似有机物受高温或水热作用后留下的难溶残渣。这表明冰壳下的海水正与多孔岩核发生高温水热反应，为深层海洋的复杂碳化学提供能量与原料。不过非生命途径同样能生成此类分子，它们只证明化学环境的潜力，并不构成存在生命的证据。�During its plume flybys, Cassini's dust analyzer registered insoluble organic macromolecules heavier than 200 daltons, resembling refractory residues left when organic matter is heated or processed hydrothermally. Their presence implies that seawater beneath the ice shell reacts with a porous rocky core at high temperature, supplying energy and raw material for complex carbon chemistry in the deep ocean. Because abiotic pathways produce such molecules too, they attest to chemical potential rather than proving life.�ans��src�لPostberg F. et al., Macromolecular Organic Compounds from the Depths of Enceladus, Nature 558 (2018), DOI: 10.1038/s41586-018-0246-4لPostberg F. et al., Macromolecular Organic Compounds from the Depths of Enceladus, Nature 558 (2018), DOI: 10.1038/s41586-018-0246-4��id�astro_23_006�body���今日柯伊伯带总质量仅约0.02倍地球质量，而要在原位碰撞吸积出100公里级天体，原盘质量至少需高出一个数量级，且太阳系年龄内的并合也太慢。这说明该区曾富含物质后被清空：海王星外迁时经共振俘获与引力散射，把大部分天体抛入奥尔特云或星际空间。质量亏损因此成为尼斯模型行星迁移理论的关键证据。��The Kuiper Belt now contains only about 0.02 Earth masses, yet growing 100-km bodies in situ requires a primordial disk at least an order of magnitude more massive, and collisions today cannot assemble such objects within the Sun's lifetime. The deficit implies the region once held far more material, most of it removed when Neptune's outward migration captured survivors into resonances and scattered the rest into the Oort cloud or interstellar space, a cornerstone prediction of the Nice model.�ans��src�مTsiganis et al., Nature 435, 459 (2005), doi:10.1038/nature03539；Morbidelli et al., Nature 435, 462 (2005), doi:10.1038/nature03540لTsiganis et al., Nature 435, 459 (2005), doi:10.1038/nature03539; Morbidelli et al., Nature 435, 462 (2005), doi:10.1038/nature03540��id�astro_23_009�body���太阳表面百万计的全局压力模式（p模）频率可测至十万分之一精度，对内部声速与密度剖面极其敏感。声速梯度在对流区底部（约0.713太阳半径）突变，在振荡频谱上留下可辨识特征，由此定出对流区深度；频率分裂分析还显示该处存在薄剪切层——差旋层（tachocline），较差自转在此过渡为近刚体转动，被视为太阳磁周发电机的所在。�Millions of global pressure (p) modes are measured with frequencies precise to about one part in a hundred thousand, tightly constraining the interior sound-speed and density profiles. A sharp change in the sound-speed gradient near 0.713 solar radii imprints a recognizable signature on the mode spectrum, fixing the convection-zone depth. Frequency splitting further reveals a thin shear layer there, the tachocline, where differential rotation yields to nearly solid rotation, widely identified as the seat of the solar magnetic dynamo.�ans��src��`Christensen-Dalsgaard, Reviews of Modern Physics 74, 1073 (2002), doi:10.1103/RevModPhys.74.1073نChristensen-Dalsgaard, Reviews of Modern Physics 74, 1073 (2002), doi:10.1103/RevModPhys.74.1073 (SOHO/MDI era helioseismology review)��id�astro_23_013�body��i该半径构成与土卫一的2:1平运动共振：粒子每绕土星两圈，便在同一相对方位受到一次土卫一的引力牵引，同相位的重复摄动不断泵大轨道偏心率。偏心率增大使粒子径向运动加剧、碰撞更频繁，耗散与角动量交换遂将物质清出共振带，留下宽约4800千米、边缘锐利的空隙。��This radius forms a 2:1 mean-motion resonance with Mimas: every two orbits a particle completes about Saturn, it receives one tug from the moon at the same relative position. Perturbations recurring in phase coherently pump up orbital eccentricity. The enlarged radial excursions intensify collisions among neighboring particles, and the resulting dissipation and angular-momentum exchange sweep material out of the resonance zone, leaving a gap about 4,800 kilometers wide with sharply defined boundaries.�ans��src��^C. D. Murray 与 S. F. Dermott，《太阳系动力学》，剑桥大学出版社，1999年。�VC. D. Murray & S. F. Dermott, Solar System Dynamics, Cambridge University Press, 1999.��id�astro_23_016�body���三条基线构成闭合三角形时，观测到的可见度相位之和只由源的亮度分布决定；每台天线上的大气或接收机误差属于“天线项”，在三角形中一正一负恰好抵消，因此闭合相位不受其污染。它是绝对相位丢失时仍稳健保留的结构信息，为自校准提供初始约束，使ALMA与全球VLBI能重建毫角秒级的可信图像。�Three baselines forming a closed triangle yield a sum of visibility phases that depends only on the source brightness distribution. Errors from the atmosphere above a dish or from receiver electronics enter through individual antennas, so within the triangle each appears once positively and once negatively and cancels exactly. This invariant survives even when absolute phases are corrupted, anchoring self-calibration and letting arrays like ALMA and global VLBI recover credible images at milliarcsecond resolution.�ans��src��qR. C. Jennison，《皇家天文学会月刊》(MNRAS) 第118卷第276页，1958年，DOI:10.1093/mnras/118.3.276�nR. C. Jennison, Monthly Notices of the Royal Astronomical Society 118, 276 (1958), doi:10.1093/mnras/118.3.276��id�astro_24_003�body���2020年4月28日,银河系磁星SGR 1935+2154被空间伽马射线监测器记录到硬X射线暴,同日又被CHIME与STARE2两台独立射电望远镜捕捉到毫秒射电暴——首次在家门口实现同一事件的双波段对应,能量虽远低于宇宙学FRB,机制却如出一辙。磁星拥有宇宙最强量级磁场,星壳应力突然释放可在磁层中激发相干的毫秒射电激波,天然满足FRB的全部苛刻条件;多个重复暴的宿主星系观测也支持年轻磁星起源。�7On 28 April 2020 the Galactic magnetar SGR 1935+2154 fired a hard X-ray burst recorded by space monitors, and the same day two independent radio telescopes, CHIME and STARE2, caught a millisecond radio burst — the first same-event, two-band catch in our own backyard. Far weaker than cosmological FRBs yet mechanically identical, it matched theory: magnetars carry the strongest known surface magnetic fields, sudden crustal stress fires coherent millisecond radio waves through the magnetosphere, and host-galaxy studies of repeating FRBs point to young magnetars.�ans��src��vCHIME/FRB 合作组等,《A bright millisecond-timescale radio burst from a Galactic magnetar》,Nature 第587卷,2020�uCHIME/FRB Collaboration et al., A bright millisecond-timescale radio burst from a Galactic magnetar, Nature 587, 2020��id�astro_24_007�body��A两个星系团以每秒四千多公里对撞后穿过彼此,照片叠加两种地图:X射线亮斑显示占普通物质大头的炽热气体——迎面风把它刹车甩在中间,像两团相撞的云;引力透镜重建的质量分布却显示主要质量已随星系径直穿行到两侧。即质量主体既不是气体也不是恒星,而是一种不与气体摩擦、碰撞中如幽灵般互不干扰的成分——恰是冷暗物质模型预言的性质。虽有个别研究者争论统计显著性,多数宇宙学家视其为排除纯修正引力的关键案例之一。��Two clusters crashed through each other at over four thousand kilometers per second, and the composite picture layers two maps. X-ray light marks the hot plasma holding most normal matter — ram pressure braked it mid-collision like two clouds colliding. Gravitational-lensing mass reconstruction, though, shows the dominant mass sailed straight through to both sides with the galaxies. The bulk of mass therefore neither glows nor frictionally interacts — it passed ghostlike through itself, exactly as cold dark matter models predict. Despite debates over statistical significance in individual merges, most cosmologists count it among the key cases ruling out purely modified-gravity accounts.�ans��src��yClowe 等,《A Direct Empirical Proof of the Existence of Dark Matter》,The Astrophysical Journal Letters 第648卷,2006�vD. Clowe et al., A Direct Empirical Proof of the Existence of Dark Matter, The Astrophysical Journal Letters 648, 2006��id�astro_24_009�body��:这是引力透镜的单星版:当一颗前景恒星恰好从背景恒星前掠过,其引力充当临时放大镜,背景星几天到几周内先亮后暗,光曲线形状由几何唯一决定。若前景星带着行星,行星的小透镜场会在主事件上叠加一个几小时到一天的尖峰——毛淑德与帕钦斯基1991年指出该信号能反推行星质量与轨道距离。方法的独特优势是对遥远暗淡的银河核球恒星敏感,专抓雪线以外的冷巨行星甚至自由漂浮行星;代价是不可重复:这样的对齐一生只有一次。��It is single-lens gravitational lensing: when a foreground star drifts across the line of sight to a background star, its gravity acts as a temporary magnifier and the source brightens then fades over days to weeks along a geometrically fixed curve. If the foreground star carries a planet, its own small lens adds a spike lasting hours to a day atop the main event — a signal Mao and Paczynski showed in 1991 encodes the planet's mass and orbital distance. The method uniquely senses dim distant stars toward the Galactic bulge, catching cold giant worlds beyond the snow line and even free-floating planets; the price is irrepeatability — the alignment happens once.�ans��src�فMao 与 Paczynski,《Gravitational Microlensing by Double Stars and Planetary Systems》,The Astrophysical Journal 第374卷,1991�~S. Mao and B. Paczynski, Gravitational Microlensing by Double Stars and Planetary Systems, The Astrophysical Journal 374, 1991��id�astro_24_012�body��&两头都被物理卡死。上限:恒星越亮,辐射压对表面气体的推斥越猛,超过爱丁顿极限(约150倍太阳质量量级)时光压直接把外层吹散,超大原恒星还会靠爆发性吸积自我调节;观测最大值在两百太阳质量上下。下限:0.08倍太阳质量的核不足以压缩出数千万开尔文的氢点火温度,引力收缩的热散尽后只能靠氘燃烧苟且降温,沦为棕矮星——它们数量其实不少,只是又暗又冷难被看见。0.08与150这两个数字划定了主序星的整个王国。�}Physics clamps both ends. The cap: brighter stars push radiation pressure harder against their own gas, and beyond the Eddington limit (around 150 solar masses) light blows away the envelope, while overmassive protostars self-regulate via eruptive accretion — observations top out near two hundred solar masses. The floor: below 0.08 solar masses cores never reach the tens of millions of kelvin needed for hydrogen ignition; after gravitational heat dissipates they limp along on deuterium, cooling as brown dwarfs — actually numerous, just too dim to census. Those two numbers, 0.08 and 150, bound the entire main-sequence kingdom.�ans��src��UEddington,《The Internal Constitution of the Stars»,Cambridge University Press,1926�YA. S. Eddington, The Internal Constitution of the Stars, Cambridge University Press, 1926��id�astro_24_015�body��w毫秒脉冲星的自转稳定堪比原子钟,脉冲到达地球的时间可以精确到纳秒。当一列波长数光年的超低频引力波(如星系中心超大质量黑洞双星绕转产生)扫过银河系,它会让不同方向的脉冲星时钟出现关联性的微微失谐——有的提前有的推后,构成特征图案。NANOGrav等四个团队追踪15年、监测数十颗脉冲星,2023年同时宣布探测到这种纳赫兹引力波背景的统计证据,强度与星系并合模型预言吻合。这相当于把整个银河系变成一台星系尺度的引力波天线,打开了观察超巨黑洞舞蹈的新窗口。�sMillisecond pulsars spin as steadily as atomic clocks, their pulses arriving to nanosecond precision. A train of ultralow-frequency gravitational waves — wavelengths of light-years, from orbiting supermassive black-hole binaries — would nudge different pulsar clocks in a correlated pattern, some early some late. Four teams including NANOGrav tracked dozens of pulsars across fifteen years and announced in 2023 statistical evidence for exactly such a nanohertz background, matching merger-model predictions. The galaxy itself became a galactic-scale antenna, opening a window onto the waltzes of supermassive black holes.�ans��src��pAgazie 等(NANOGrav 合作组),《The NANOGrav 15 yr Data Set»,The Astrophysical Journal Letters 第951卷,2023�ZG. Agazie et al., The NANOGrav 15 yr Data Set, The Astrophysical Journal Letters 951, 2023��id�astro_26_007�body��2极早期的声波在原初等离子体中传播,到复合时期冻结在约四亿九千万光年的共动尺度上,星系分布因此带有这一特征尺度,成为量天的标准尺。巡天在星系两点相关函数中定位声学峰,把它的视尺度与理论比较,即可定出各红移处的距离,重建膨胀历史并检验暗能量是否随时间演化;DESI合作组的上千万条星系光谱显示,允许演化时数据略偏好晚期w低于-1的模型,与微波背景联合后偏离常数暗能量约三个标准差(约3σ,尚存系统学争议)。��Sound waves racing through the primordial plasma froze at recombination onto a comoving scale of about 490 million light years, leaving that characteristic scale imprinted on galaxy clustering as a standard ruler. Surveys locate the acoustic peak in the galaxy two-point correlation function and compare its apparent scale with theory, yielding distances across many redshifts, rebuilding the expansion history and testing whether dark energy evolves; spectra of tens of millions of galaxies from the DESI collaboration mildly favor models with late-time w below -1 once evolution is allowed, deviating from constant dark energy by around three sigma when combined with the microwave background, though systematics remain debated.�ans��src��EDESI 合作组,2025年,暗能量光谱仪 DR2 重子声学振荡测量,Lawrence Berkeley National Laboratory 主导；Eisenstein, Zehavi, Hogg & Scoccimarro,《Detection of the Baryon Acoustic Peak in the Large‐Scale Correlation Function of SDSS Luminous Red Galaxies》,The Astrophysical Journal,2005 (DOI: 10.1086/466512)�GDESI Collaboration 2025, DESI DR2 baryon acoustic oscillation measurements, led by Lawrence Berkeley National Laboratory; Eisenstein, Zehavi, Hogg & Scoccimarro, 'Detection of the Baryon Acoustic Peak in the Large‐Scale Correlation Function of SDSS Luminous Red Galaxies', The Astrophysical Journal, 2005, DOI: 10.1086/466512��id�astro_26_017�body���要害在于检验状态方程是否随时间演化:宇宙学常数要求 w 永远等于负一,而精质的 w 取决于势能与动能之比,通常大于负一并随场的滚动缓缓漂移,个别模型甚至允许穿越负一。观测上把 Ia 型超新星、重子声学振荡与弱引力透镜的数据联合拟合,常用 w=w0+wa(1-a) 参数化;若 wa 显著偏离零,或结构增长历史与纯常数不符,便是标量场的蛛丝马迹。目前测量仍与常数兼容,裁决有待更大样本。�sThe acid test is whether the equation-of-state parameter evolves with time. A cosmological constant pins w permanently at minus one, whereas for quintessence w is set by the ratio of potential to kinetic energy, typically exceeding minus one and drifting as the field rolls, with some models even allowed to cross it. Observers combine type Ia supernovae, baryon acoustic oscillations and weak lensing, often fitting w=w0+wa(1-a); a significantly nonzero wa, or a growth history inconsistent with a pure constant, would betray the scalar field. Current data remain compatible with a constant; the verdict awaits larger samples.�ans��src��I. Zlatev、L. Wang 与 P. J. Steinhardt,1999年,Physical Review Letters,82卷896页:Quintessence, Cosmic Coincidence, and the Evolution of the Universe;C. Linder,2003年,Physical Review Letters,90卷091301号:Exploring the Expansion History of the Universe��I. Zlatev, L. Wang & P. J. Steinhardt 1999, Physical Review Letters, 82, 896 - Quintessence, cosmic coincidence, and the evolution of the universe; C. Linder 2003, Physical Review Letters, 90, 091301 - Exploring the Expansion History of the Universe��id�b00db5fbfaf1�body��>赫罗图把恒星按照光度（或绝对星等）和表面温度（或光谱型）画在一张图上，是恒星研究的基石。大多数恒星落在从左上到右下的主序带上，代表一生中稳定燃烧氢的阶段。通过赫罗图，天文学家可以推断出恒星的年龄、质量和演化阶段。�[The Hertzsprung-Russell diagram plots stars by luminosity and surface temperature, and it is a cornerstone of stellar astronomy. Most stars lie on the main sequence running from upper left to lower right, representing the stable hydrogen-burning phase of their lives. With this diagram astronomers infer a star's age, mass, and evolutionary stage.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�b1a26e83d7af�body�٪是的。并合抛出的物质形成千新星，而沿自转轴方向的相对论喷流产生短伽马暴；GW170817在引力波后1.7秒就探测到对应的伽马暴。��Yes. The merger ejects a kilonova, and a relativistic jet along the spin axis produces a short gamma-ray burst; for GW170817 the corresponding burst was seen just 1.7 seconds after the gravitational waves.�ans��src��;Abbott 等 2017, ApJ 848, L12（GW170817 引力波发现）�wAbbott et al. (2017), ApJL 848, L12, 'GW170817: Observation of Gravitational Waves from a Binary Neutron Star Inspiral'��id�b2e8be3c74e2�body��LWIMP（弱相互作用大质量粒子）是质量约 GeV–TeV 量级、仅通过弱力和引力作用的假想粒子，源自超对称等理论。轴子则是极轻的假想标量粒子，最初为解决强CP问题而提出，也可在极早期大量产生。二者代表了“重冷”和“轻冷”两类不同的探测思路。��WIMPs (weakly interacting massive particles) are hypothetical particles of GeV–TeV mass interacting only via the weak force and gravity, motivated by supersymmetry. Axions are extremely light hypothetical scalar particles first proposed to solve the strong CP problem and could be produced abundantly in the early universe. They represent “heavy cold” and “light cold” detection strategies, respectively.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�b337a916f4f9�body�ٲVLBI把全球射电望远镜当作一台地球大小虚拟望远镜的各部分，用原子钟记录信号并事后相关，基线越长分辨率越高，是EHT成像的基础。��VLBI treats radio dishes worldwide as parts of one Earth-sized virtual telescope, recording signals with atomic clocks and correlating them later; longer baselines give higher resolution—the basis of EHT imaging.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�b4445a438f67�body���钱德拉塞卡极限约为 1.4 倍太阳质量，是电子简并压能够支撑白矮星、使其不被自身引力坍缩的最大质量。超过这一极限，电子简并压失效，白矮星会继续坍缩成中子星或触发 Ia 型超新星。�The Chandrasekhar limit is about 1.4 solar masses, the maximum mass at which electron degeneracy pressure can support a white dwarf against its own gravity. Above it the degeneracy pressure fails and the white dwarf collapses into a neutron star or triggers a Type Ia supernova.�ans��src�ٯChandrasekhar,《The Highly Collapsed Configurations of a Stellar Mass. (Second Paper.)》,Monthly Notices of the Royal Astronomical Society,1935 (DOI: 10.1093/mnras/95.3.207)٭Chandrasekhar, 'The Highly Collapsed Configurations of a Stellar Mass. (Second Paper.)', Monthly Notices of the Royal Astronomical Society, 1935, DOI: 10.1093/mnras/95.3.207��id�b4b84cc0bd7b�body���子弹星系团是两个星系团高速碰撞的产物。碰撞中，星系团内的稀薄热气体因摩擦减速而滞留在中心，星系本身和暗物质则几乎不受阻碍地继续飞行。钱德拉 X 射线观测显示热气体集中在中心，而引力透镜显示质量集中于两侧的星系。这说明大部分质量不与气体一起减速，符合暗物质基本不碰撞的特性，也令修改引力理论难以解释。�'The Bullet Cluster is the product of two galaxy clusters colliding at high speed. During the collision, the diffuse hot gas decelerates through friction and lingers at the center, while the galaxies themselves and dark matter pass through nearly unimpeded. Chandra X-ray images show the hot gas concentrated centrally, whereas gravitational lensing places most of the mass with the galaxies on the sides. Because that mass does not slow down with the gas, the system matches weakly-interacting dark matter and is hard to explain with modified gravity.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�b4e5928231cb�body���ΛCDM（Lambda冷暗物质）模型是当前描述宇宙的主流框架，假设宇宙由暗能量（Λ）、冷暗物质和普通物质组成。它成功解释了大量宇宙学观测，但也面临一些局部张力。��The ΛCDM (Lambda cold dark matter) model is the leading framework for the universe, assuming it is made of dark energy (Λ), cold dark matter, and ordinary matter. It explains a wide range of cosmological observations, though some local tensions remain.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�b513222bda14�body��J观测显示日冕温度高达百万开尔文，反而远热于其下方约五千八百开的太阳表面，违背能量从热向冷自然传导的直觉，被称为日冕加热问题。主流候选机制是磁波耗散与纳米耀斑等磁重联将表面对流能量向上传输，但具体哪种主导仍缺乏决定性证据。��Observations show the corona reaches millions of kelvin, far hotter than the roughly 5,800 kelvin solar surface below, defying the intuitive flow of heat from hot to cold, the coronal heating problem. The leading candidates, dissipation of magnetic waves and nanoflare magnetic reconnection, transport energy from surface convection upward, but which mechanism dominates still lacks decisive evidence.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�b58bae4bd9d2�body�٭韦布在热木星WASP-39b的透射光谱中明确识别出CO2，是系外行星大气化学的突破，证明红外光谱能揭示行星形成时的盘内位置与成分。��Webb clearly identified CO2 in the transmission spectrum of the hot Jupiter WASP-39b—a breakthrough in exoplanet atmospheric chemistry, proving infrared spectra reveal where and how a planet formed.�ans��src�ٽSeager & Sasselov,《Theoretical Transmission Spectra during Extrasolar Giant Planet Transits》,The Astrophysical Journal,2000 (DOI: 10.1086/309088)；Brown 2001年凌星大气温室模型ٹSeager & Sasselov, 'Theoretical Transmission Spectra during Extrasolar Giant Planet Transits', The Astrophysical Journal, 2000, DOI: 10.1086/309088; Brown 2001 transit atmospheric model��id�b5d0a49cb4bb�body���高红移类星体是早期宇宙（z>6）中心超大质量黑洞（数亿太阳质量）剧烈吸积发光的活动星系核，其光亮到能在百亿光年外被今天的望远镜看到。它们令天文学家兴奋，是因为如此年轻（宇宙不到10亿年）的宇宙竟已存在质量惊人的黑洞，对黑洞形成与星系协同演化理论提出挑战。它们还为研究再电离时期的中性氢提供了强大的背景光源。�High-redshift quasars are active galactic nuclei at z>6 powered by supermassive black holes (hundreds of millions of solar masses) accreting matter so vigorously that they shine across more than ten billion light-years. Astronomers are excited because such massive black holes already existed when the universe was under a billion years old—a challenge for theories of black-hole formation and galaxy co-evolution. They also provide powerful background beacons for probing the neutral hydrogen of the reionization era.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�b6984fde6ce3�body���除氢和部分氦外，构成生命的碳、氧、铁等元素都是前代恒星在核聚变与超新星、中子星并合等事件中抛洒到星际空间，再聚集成新恒星和行星的。��Aside from hydrogen and some helium, the carbon, oxygen, and iron in life were forged in earlier stars and scattered by supernovae and neutron-star mergers, later gathering into new stars and planets.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�b81da219bc7c�body�٨若暗物质粒子相互湮灭或衰变，会在银河系中心等密集区产生特征伽马射线能谱，费米望远镜正寻找这种超出本底的超出信号。��If dark-matter particles annihilate or decay, they would produce a characteristic gamma-ray spectrum in dense regions like the Galactic Center; Fermi searches for such an excess above known backgrounds.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�b8f45ffafcb0�body��KΛCDM模型以冷暗物质和宇宙学常数Λ为核心，配合普通重子物质、中微子和辐射，描述从初期暴涨到今天的结构形成。冷暗物质率先成团提供引力骨架，宇宙学常数则驱动近期加速膨胀。普朗克卫星的精确参数测量使该模型成为当代宇宙学的基准框架。��The Lambda-CDM model centers on cold dark matter and a cosmological constant Lambda, joined by ordinary baryonic matter, neutrinos, and radiation, describing structure formation from early inflation to today. Cold dark matter clumps first to provide gravitational scaffolding, while the cosmological constant drives recent accelerated expansion. Precise parameter measurements from Planck have made it the benchmark framework of modern cosmology.�ans��src��Planck Collaboration《Planck 2018 宇宙学结果》；Peebles《Cosmology's Century》（2020，Princeton University Press）�wPlanck Collaboration, Planck 2018 cosmological results; Peebles, Cosmology's Century (2020, Princeton University Press)��id�b9726513bfe7�body���质子-质子链是太阳这类较小质量恒星的主要产能机制，氢核逐级直接融合。碳氮氧循环以碳、氮、氧为催化剂加速氢聚变，在质量更大的恒星中占主导，并且对温度更加敏感。��The proton-proton chain is the main energy source in Sun-like stars, fusing hydrogen nuclei directly step by step. The CNO cycle uses carbon, nitrogen, and oxygen as catalysts and dominates in more massive stars, being far more sensitive to temperature.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�ba1854e047c8�body���标准宇宙学表明，可观测宇宙在约138亿年前从一个极热、极密的状态膨胀而来，把时间往回推会得到一个密度和曲率发散的“奇点”。但奇点更可能是现有广义相对论在极端条件下失效的标志，而非真实物理状态；要描述那一刻需要尚未完成的量子引力理论。因此宇宙“从奇点开始”是一种基于外推的说法，而非已被证实的论断。�␀Standard cosmology shows the observable universe expanding from an extremely hot, dense state about 13.8 billion years ago, and extrapolating backward leads to a singularity of diverging density and curvature. But the singularity is more likely a sign that general relativity breaks down under extreme conditions than a real physical state; describing that moment requires a still-incomplete theory of quantum gravity. So saying the universe began from a singularity is an extrapolation, not an established fact.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�bb1431770744�body��-量子场论估算的真空能密度比宇宙学观测得到的暗能量密度大约高出 10^120 倍，是物理学中已知最极端的精细调节难题之一。观测到的 Λ 对应的特征能量尺度仅约 10^-3 电子伏（毫电子伏）量级，而理论预期却在普朗克尺度附近。�xQuantum field theory estimates a vacuum-energy density roughly 10^120 times larger than the dark-energy density inferred from cosmological observations, making this one of the worst fine-tuning problems in physics. The observed Λ corresponds to a characteristic energy scale of only about 10^-3 eV (milli-electron-volts), whereas theory expects a value near the Planck scale.�ans��src��nWeinberg,《The cosmological constant problem》,Reviews of Modern Physics,1989 (DOI: 10.1103/revmodphys.61.1)�lWeinberg, 'The cosmological constant problem', Reviews of Modern Physics, 1989, DOI: 10.1103/revmodphys.61.1��id�bc1e9c4f076f�body��,2017年，LIGO/Virgo 先探测到这次双中子星并合产生的引力波，全球望远镜随后在对应天区捕获到被称为“千新星”的可见光与伽马射线暴。这是首次同时用引力波和电磁波追踪同一事件，并证实这类并合是金、铂等重元素的产地。�SIn 2017 LIGO/Virgo first caught gravitational waves from a neutron-star merger, and telescopes worldwide then pinpointed a corresponding “kilonova” with optical and gamma-ray emission. It was the first event traced by both gravitational and electromagnetic waves, and confirmed such mergers forge heavy elements like gold and platinum.�ans��src��ALIGO/Virgo 合作组与全球望远镜联测（2017，GW170817）�=LIGO/Virgo Collaboration & global telescopes (2017, GW170817)��id�bc79274e4db2�body��k钱德拉塞卡极限约为1.4倍太阳质量，是电子简并压力能够支撑恒星残骸不被自身引力坍缩的最大质量。当白矮星通过吸积超过这一界限，简并压力失效，核心坍缩并触发Ia型超新星爆发。这一极限由钱德拉塞卡在1930年代用量子简并气体理论推导，是恒星残骸分类的关键边界。��The Chandrasekhar limit is about 1.4 solar masses, the maximum mass that electron degeneracy pressure can support against gravitational collapse in a stellar remnant. When a white dwarf accretes beyond this bound, degeneracy pressure fails, the core collapses, and a Type Ia supernova is triggered. Chandrasekhar derived it in the 1930s using quantum statistics of a degenerate gas, and it marks the dividing line among stellar remnants.�ans��src��oChandrasekhar《An Introduction to the Study of Stellar Structure》（1939）；NASA 钱德拉X射线天文台�gChandrasekhar, An Introduction to the Study of Stellar Structure (1939); NASA Chandra X-ray Observatory��id�bcded335b256�body��k生物印记指只能由生命活动维持、且非生物过程难以产生的化学不平衡，例如氧气与甲烷在大气中共存。通过透射光谱，望远镜在行星凌星时分析穿过大气的星光，识别这些气体的吸收特征。德马里等人提出的判据要求多个互补信号同时出现，以避免把地质过程误判为生命。��Biosignatures are chemical imbalances that life can maintain but non-biological processes struggle to produce, such as oxygen and methane coexisting in an atmosphere. Using transit transmission spectroscopy, telescopes analyze starlight passing through the atmosphere to spot these gases' absorption features. Des Marais and colleagues argued that multiple complementary signals must appear together to avoid mistaking geology for life.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�bcfbac498e9c�body��!尼斯模型假设早期四颗巨行星靠近且外缘有星子盘，行星与盘的引力相互作用引发轨道迁移并触发轨道共振穿越，使木星内移、土星等外移，并散射大量星子——既解释了 LHB，也说明了特洛伊小行星与共轨结构的来源。�@The Nice model posits the four giant planets started compact with an outer planetesimal disk; planet–disk interactions drove migration and a resonance-crossing instability, moving Jupiter inward and others outward while scattering planetesimals—explaining the LHB and the origin of Trojans and co-orbital structures.�ans��src��MTsiganis, Gomes, Morbidelli & Levison 2005, Nature 435, 459（尼斯模型）ٌTsiganis, Gomes, Morbidelli & Levison (2005), Nature 435, 459, 'Origin of the orbital architecture of the giant planets of the Solar System'��id�bd1a49a3f2cb�body��大质量天体弯曲身后光源的光线，形成放大、增亮甚至多重成像的引力透镜效应。弱透镜的统计扭曲可测绘暗物质分布，强透镜能让我们看到极暗远的星系。它既是天然望远镜，也是探测暗物质的关键工具。�RMassive objects bend light from background sources, producing gravitational lensing that magnifies, brightens, or even multiplies their images. Weak-lensing statistics map dark matter distribution, while strong lensing lets us see extremely faint, distant galaxies. It is both a natural telescope and a key tool for detecting dark matter.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�bd2ae211a8aa�body���哈勃深场通过长时间曝光一小片看似空旷的天空，揭示出其中数以千计的遥远星系。它表明宇宙中的星系数量以千亿计，并展示了星系随宇宙时间的演化。��By staring at a tiny, seemingly empty patch of sky for a long exposure, the Hubble Deep Field revealed thousands of distant galaxies. It showed that the universe holds hundreds of billions of galaxies and captured their evolution over cosmic time.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�be0634a78cb7�body���齐奥尔科夫斯基方程给出速度增量等于排气速度乘以质量比的自然对数。要入轨需要约每秒9.4公里的速度增量，而化学火箭排气速度只有每秒3公里上下，代入方程可算出初始质量约为空载质量的二十多倍，所以燃料占了火箭总重的绝大部分。更关键的是速度增量与质量比是对数关系，想多要一点速度，燃料就要按指数增长，分级正是为了绕开这个惩罚。�$The Tsiolkovsky rocket equation gives the speed increment as the exhaust velocity times the natural log of the mass ratio. Reaching orbit needs about 9.4 kilometres per second of delta-v, while chemical rockets exhaust at only about three kilometres per second, so the equation yields an initial mass over twenty times the empty mass, which is why fuel dominates a rocket's weight. Crucially, delta-v grows logarithmically with the mass ratio, so each extra bit of speed demands exponentially more fuel; staging is how engineers dodge that penalty.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�bec109137b88�body�ِ量子力学要求信息不灭，但落入黑洞的物质信息似乎随黑洞蒸发而消失，这与理论矛盾，至今仍是未解难题。٦Quantum mechanics says information cannot be destroyed, yet matter falling into a black hole seems to vanish as it evaporates—a contradiction that remains unsolved.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�bf6ad92c6b1e�body��(在氢逃逸的凌星光谱中，波长越短吸收越强的瑞利散射特征表现为蓝端加深的“尾”。它揭示上层大气正在经历流体动力的氢流失，并可用于约束行星的高层大气温度和逃逸率。结合莱曼α测量能区分风致逃逸与辐射压效应。�\In transit spectra of hydrogen escape, the Rayleigh scattering feature—stronger absorption at shorter wavelengths—appears as a deepened blue tail. It reveals hydrodynamic hydrogen loss in the upper atmosphere and constrains its temperature and escape rate. Combined with Lyman-alpha, it distinguishes wind-driven escape from radiation pressure.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�bf988e81e1a8�body��2观测显示高红移（早期宇宙）星系普遍更小、更不规则且恒星形成率更高，随宇宙年龄增长通过并合与吸积逐渐变成今天的大型盘状或椭圆星系。恒星质量函数也随红移向低质量端演化。研究这种演化需结合深场巡天与宇宙学模拟。�yObservations show that high-redshift (early-universe) galaxies are generally smaller, more irregular, and form stars at higher rates, gradually becoming today's large disks and ellipticals through mergers and accretion. The stellar mass function also shifts toward lower masses at high redshift. Studying this requires deep-field surveys combined with cosmological simulations.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�bff8f6c5c4e2�body�ٴ主序阶段是恒星一生中最长、最稳定的时期，核心通过氢聚变为氦来产能。恒星的质量决定了它在主序上停留的时间长短和最终的归宿。��The main sequence is the longest and most stable phase of a star's life, when its core fuses hydrogen into helium for energy. A star's mass determines how long it stays there and how it will end.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�c2330a2376b8�body��/旋转的克尔黑洞之外存在能层，其中时空被拖曳使任何粒子都无法保持静止。潘罗斯过程让粒子进入能层后分裂，一部分带着负能量落向黑洞、另一部分携走大于入射的总能量逃逸，从而从黑洞自转中偷走能量并轻微减慢其旋转。�SOutside a rotating Kerr black hole lies the ergosphere, where frame-dragging forbids any particle from remaining at rest. In the Penrose process, a particle entering the ergosphere splits; one fragment with negative energy falls in while the other escapes with more energy than the whole, extracting rotational energy and slowing the hole.�ans��src��TPenrose & Floyd 1971, Nature Physical Science 229, 177《从黑洞提取转动能》�mPenrose & Floyd (1971), Nature Physical Science 229, 177, 'Extraction of Rotational Energy from a Black Hole'��id�c26e29700c8a�body��,星系化学演化追踪恒星核合成产生的元素如何生成、混合并再进入星际介质，从而改变星系的金属丰度分布。通过比较恒星与气体中的元素比值，可反推恒星形成历史和吸积率。它把星系动力学、恒星演化与观测丰度联系起来。�kGalactic chemical evolution tracks how elements produced by stellar nucleosynthesis are generated, mixed, and returned to the interstellar medium, changing the galaxy's metallicity distribution. Comparing elemental ratios in stars and gas infers the star formation history and accretion rates. It links galaxy dynamics, stellar evolution, and observed abundances.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�c39ec5d40bbd�body���地球大气的湍流会使星光抖动、图像模糊。自适应光学系统用可变形镜面实时反向矫正，并以明亮的导星（或激光导星）为参照不断修正，从而让地面望远镜达到接近太空望远镜的分辨率。��Earth's turbulent atmosphere blurs starlight. Adaptive optics uses a deformable mirror to correct the distortion in real time, referencing a bright (or laser) guide star, letting ground-based telescopes approach space-telescope resolution.�ans��src�ِBeckers《Adaptive Optics for Astronomy》（1993，Annual Review of Astronomy & Astrophysics）；欧洲南方天文台（ESO）甚大望远镜�rBeckers, Adaptive Optics for Astronomy (1993, Annual Review of Astronomy & Astrophysics); ESO Very Large Telescope��id�c5a5eca433a8�body���质量越大的恒星核心温度和压力越高，核聚变进行得越快，反而寿命越短。例如几十倍太阳质量的恒星只能存在几百万年，而小质量红矮星可燃烧上万亿年。��More massive stars have hotter, denser cores and burn their fuel much faster, so they live shorter lives. A star dozens of times the Sun's mass may last only millions of years, while a low-mass red dwarf can shine for trillions.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�c78182386ab8�body��e中微子几乎不与物质相互作用，因此能直接穿出致密天体（如坍缩超新星核心或并合喷流）的内部，而光子会被外层物质吸收、引力波对对称坍缩不敏感。这一穿透性使中微子成为窥视极端高温高密度环境的唯一探针，但代价是探测需要巨型地下探测器且难以精确定位。��Neutrinos interact so weakly that they escape directly from the interiors of dense objects such as collapsing supernova cores or merger jets, whereas photons are absorbed by overlying material and gravitational waves are blind to spherically symmetric collapse. This transparency makes neutrinos the only probe of extreme temperature and density environments, at the cost of requiring huge underground detectors and offering poor localization.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�c8bb44930294�body��)木星磁场极强，捕获的大量带电粒子在周围形成强大的辐射带，剂量远超地球范艾伦带。探测器穿越时会遭受电子器件损伤和数据错误，因此任务需限制靠近时间并加厚屏蔽。朱诺号等探测器特意采用极轨道以降低辐射暴露。�"Jupiter's very strong magnetic field traps charged particles into radiation belts far harsher than Earth's Van Allen belts. Probes crossing them suffer electronic damage and data errors, so missions limit close passes and add shielding. Juno uses a polar orbit to reduce radiation exposure.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�c92442b7ced2�body���光在膨胀的空间里传播时，波长会随着空间本身的拉伸一起变长，向红端移动，这个现象叫宇宙学红移。它的大小满足1加红移等于现在与发射时刻的宇宙尺度之比，所以红移直接刻画了宇宙的膨胀倍数。更关键的证据是，遥远超新星的视亮度与其红移的关系符合加速膨胀的预期，说明红移确实来自空间扩张而不是简单的运动效应。�As light travels through expanding space, its wavelength is stretched along with space itself, shifting toward the red — the cosmological redshift. It satisfies the relation 1 + z equals the ratio of the current scale factor to the scale when the light was emitted, so redshift directly encodes how much the universe has grown. Crucially, the brightness-versus-redshift relation of distant supernovae matches an accelerating expansion, confirming that the shift comes from the stretching of space rather than a simple velocity effect.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�c9928df3ae9d�body��;星系碰撞时恒星之间几乎不会直接相撞，因为彼此距离极其遥远，但引力会扭曲星系形状并触发大量新恒星诞生。气体云碰撞压缩后会爆发式形成恒星，最终两个星系会并合成一个更大的椭圆星系。银河系与仙女座的合并就是未来的例子。�jWhen galaxies collide, their stars almost never hit each other because they are so far apart, but gravity distorts the galaxies and triggers bursts of new star formation. Colliding gas clouds compress and form stars explosively, and the two galaxies eventually merge into a larger elliptical. The future merger of the Milky Way and Andromeda is one such example.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�cb8efbc80e2b�body��>云与霾由悬浮微粒组成，会在宽波段上产生近乎平坦的消光，掩盖底层气体的精细吸收线，使分子特征变弱甚至消失。由于透射光谱对高层大气更敏感，建模时必须同时拟合微粒尺度分布与气体丰度，否则会系统性低估云下气体的真实含量。��Clouds and hazes made of suspended particles produce nearly flat extinction across broad bands, masking the fine absorption lines of underlying gases and weakening or erasing molecular features. Because transmission spectra are most sensitive to the upper atmosphere, models must jointly fit particle size distributions and gas abundances, or they will systematically underestimate the true abundances below the clouds.�ans��src�� 《天体物理学杂志》(ApJ)�The Astrophysical Journal (ApJ)��id�cdc85b0f7112�body��#霍曼转移是一条与起始轨道和目标轨道同时相切的半椭圆轨道，只需在两个切点做两次速度脉冲，就利用最少的速度增量在共面圆轨道间转移。它用尽引力场的自然几何，使燃料消耗最小，是多数探测器的基本轨道方案。�VA Hohmann transfer is a half-ellipse tangent to both the departure and arrival circular orbits, requiring only two velocity impulses at the tangent points to move between coplanar circular orbits with the least delta-v. By exploiting the natural geometry of the gravity field it minimizes fuel use and is the basic trajectory for most probes.�ans��src��@Bate, Mueller & White《天体动力学基础》1971，第 5 章�IBate, Mueller & White, Fundamentals of Astrodynamics (Dover, 1971), ch. 5��id�cf8726908543�body���天文学家长期追踪银心附近恒星的轨道，发现它们绕一个约400万倍太阳质量、体积极小的不可见天体运行。这项成果获得2020年诺贝尔物理学奖，该天体即人马座A*。��Astronomers tracked stars near the galactic center for years and found them orbiting an invisible object of about 4 million solar masses in a tiny volume. The work won the 2020 Nobel Prize in Physics; the object is Sagittarius A*.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d15a3975bbd3�body��S长期的天体测量显示银河系中心方向存在非轴对称的质量分布，恒星的运动模式偏离纯旋臂盘。通过近红外测光穿透尘埃，以及盖亚卫星对恒星自行的精确测量，天文学家确认了贯穿银心的长棒结构。这一棒结构引导气体向内流动，促进了中央核球的形成。�cDecades of astrometry revealed a non-axisymmetric mass distribution toward the Galactic center, with stellar motions deviating from a pure disk. Near-infrared photometry piercing the dust, together with Gaia's precise stellar proper motions, confirmed a long bar across the central region. This bar funnels gas inward and helps build up the central bulge.�ans��src��SWeinberg《The bar in the Milky Way》（1992，ApJ）；ESA 盖亚（Gaia）任务�@Weinberg, The bar in the Milky Way (1992, ApJ); ESA Gaia mission��id�d1762f7194c7�body���柯伊伯带是海王星轨道外30到50天文单位处的环状带，主体位于黄道面附近，包含冥王星、阋神星等冰质小天体，是短周期彗星的来源。奥尔特云则是包裹整个太阳系、范围从数千到约十万天文单位的球形云，内含上万亿颗冰体，靠附近恒星经过的引力扰动把长周期彗星抛向内太阳系。奥尔特云至今没有被直接观测到，只能从彗星轨道推断它的存在。��The Kuiper belt is a ring of icy bodies 30 to 50 astronomical units beyond Neptune, lying mostly near the ecliptic and home to Pluto, Eris, and others; it is the source of short-period comets. The Oort cloud is instead a spherical shell enveloping the whole Solar System, from a few thousand out to roughly 100,000 AU, holding trillions of icy objects that passing stars nudge inward as long-period comets. It has never been observed directly and is inferred solely from comet orbits.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d1c2d3a73270�body��?暴胀理论提出，在大爆炸后极短的一瞬间（约10的负32次方秒量级），宇宙经历了指数级的急剧膨胀，把原本极小区域放大到整个可见宇宙。它能解释宇宙为何如此均匀平坦，以及物质密度微小涨落的来源。这些涨落后来成长为星系和星系团。�WInflation theory proposes that around 10^-32 second after the Big Bang, the universe underwent exponential expansion, blowing up a minuscule region into the entire visible universe. It explains why the universe is so uniform and flat, and where the tiny density fluctuations came from. Those fluctuations later grew into galaxies and clusters.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�d240deecd75f�body���再电离时期指第一批恒星和星系的紫外辐射把中性氢重新电离成等离子体的过程，标志宇宙从黑暗走向被点亮。它大致发生在红移6到10之间，即大爆炸后约4亿到10亿年。普朗克卫星通过宇宙微波背景的偏振光学深度，以及詹姆斯·韦伯望远镜对早期星系的直接成像，共同约束了这一时期的起止时间。��The epoch of reionization is the era when the first stars and galaxies emitted ultraviolet radiation that reionized the neutral hydrogen, ending the cosmic dark ages. It took place roughly between redshift 6 and 10, or about 400 million to 1 billion years after the Big Bang. The Planck satellite constrains its timing through the optical depth of CMB polarization, while the James Webb Space Telescope maps the earliest galaxies directly.�ans��src�مPlanck Collaboration《Planck 2018 结果》X 章（再电离）；Barkana 与 Loeb《In the Beginning》（2001，Physics Reports）�tPlanck Collaboration, Planck 2018 results X (reionization); Barkana & Loeb, In the Beginning (2001, Physics Reports)��id�d48f934a4c04�body��再电离时期发生在宇宙诞生约数亿年后，第一批恒星和星系发出的紫外辐射逐渐把中性氢气体重新电离成等离子体。普朗克卫星与韦伯望远镜的观测帮助确定了这一过程大致在红移约6至10、即大爆炸后约10亿年内完成。�PThe reionization epoch occurred a few hundred million years after the Big Bang, when ultraviolet light from the first stars and galaxies gradually reionized neutral hydrogen into plasma. Data from Planck and the James Webb Telescope place this process roughly at redshift 6–10, completing within about a billion years of the Big Bang.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�d49af86094b4�body��两个黑洞并合时会让时空产生涟漪，即引力波，它经过地球时会把空间拉伸或压缩一点点。LIGO用两条各4公里的激光干涉臂来捕捉这种变形：引力波经过时，两臂的长度会交替变化，干涉条纹随之摆动。2015年9月，LIGO首次直接探测到约13亿光年外两个约30倍太阳质量黑洞的并合，名为GW150914。��Merging black holes send ripples through spacetime — gravitational waves — which stretch and squeeze space by a tiny amount as they pass Earth. LIGO catches that distortion with two 4-kilometre laser interferometer arms: when a wave passes, the arms' lengths alternate and the interference pattern shifts. In September 2015 LIGO made the first direct detection, GW150914, from the merger of two black holes of about 30 solar masses some 1.3 billion light-years away.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�d5b12b596856�body��在 ΛCDM 框架下，低质量暗物质晕更早坍缩、因而浓度更高，大质量晕较晚聚集、浓度偏低，形成倒挂的浓度–质量关系。这一层级成团（小结构先形成、再并合成大结构）与 N 体模拟和弱透镜观测相符。�;In ΛCDM, low-mass halos collapse earlier and are thus more concentrated, while massive halos assemble later and are less concentrated—an inverted concentration–mass relation. This hierarchical clustering (small structures first, later merging into larger ones) matches N-body simulations and weak-lensing data.�ans��src�ىNavarro, Frenk, White,《A Universal Density Profile from Hierarchical Clustering》,The Astrophysical Journal,1997 (DOI: 10.1086/304888)هNavarro, Frenk, White, 'A Universal Density Profile from Hierarchical Clustering', The Astrophysical Journal, 1997, DOI: 10.1086/304888��id�d7bb282b81e4�body���耀斑是太阳大气中磁场重联释放的瞬时电磁辐射爆发，在X射线和射电波段最为明显。日冕物质抛射则是大量带电粒子与磁场结构被抛入太空，可能引发地磁暴。�&A flare is a sudden burst of electromagnetic radiation from magnetic reconnection in the solar atmosphere, most visible in X-rays and radio waves. A coronal mass ejection is a huge cloud of charged particles and magnetic field launched into space, which can trigger geomagnetic storms on Earth.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d8216714f8b3�body�ي钱德拉塞卡极限约为1.4倍太阳质量，是白矮星依靠电子简并压力支撑自身不被引力压垮的最大质量上限。ّThe Chandrasekhar limit is about 1.4 solar masses—the maximum mass a white dwarf can support against gravity with electron degeneracy pressure.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�d86e6b664276�body��.中微子作为从相对论到非相对论过渡的轻子，其总质量会抑制小尺度物质功率谱并改变复合后的宇宙学距离。普朗克 CMB 数据与星系巡天联合拟合给出的中微子总质量上限约 0.12–0.26 eV，已成为连接粒子物理与宇宙学的关键桥梁。�8Neutrinos—leptons transitioning from relativistic to non-relativistic—suppress the small-scale matter power spectrum and alter post-recombination cosmological distances. Joint CMB and galaxy-survey fits place the summed neutrino mass upper limit around 0.12–0.26 eV, linking particle physics and cosmology.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�d885d0137007�body��?柯伊伯带是海王星轨道外侧一个盘状区域，距离太阳约30到55天文单位，包含冥王星等许多冰质小天体。奥尔特云则是一个包围整个太阳系的巨大球壳，最远可达数万天文单位，被认为是长周期彗星的来源。两者形状、距离和组成都差异显著。��The Kuiper Belt is a disk-shaped region just beyond Neptune, roughly 30 to 55 astronomical units from the Sun, containing many icy bodies including Pluto. The Oort Cloud is a vast spherical shell surrounding the entire Solar System, reaching tens of thousands of astronomical units, and is thought to be the source of long-period comets. They differ greatly in shape, distance, and composition.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�dd607e8a9d0e�body���1908年发生在西伯利亚的通古斯大爆炸没有留下陨石坑，普遍被认为是一颗约50至60米的小天体在大气中高空爆炸所致。它夷平了约2000平方公里的森林。��The 1908 Tunguska explosion in Siberia left no impact crater and is widely thought to have been a roughly 50 to 60 meter object that detonated high in the atmosphere. It flattened about 2,000 square kilometers of forest.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�de04de05d595�body�ٴ热木星是质量类似木星、却紧贴母恒星运行（轨道周期仅几天）的气态巨行星，表面温度极高，其形成机制挑战了传统的行星形成理论。ٰA hot Jupiter is a gas giant with Jupiter-like mass but orbiting extremely close to its star (periods of days), scorching hot—challenging traditional planet-formation theory.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�e230640e55ff�body��自适应光学用可变形镜面以毫秒级速度实时校正大气湍流造成的波前畸变，通常需要以亮星或激光导星作为参考。它能把地基望远镜的角分辨率提升到接近太空水平。这项技术是现代大口径地基观测不可或缺的部分。�?Adaptive optics uses a deformable mirror to correct, in milliseconds, the wavefront distortions caused by atmospheric turbulence, typically referencing a bright star or laser guide star. It pushes ground-based resolution close to space quality. The technique is indispensable for modern large ground-based observations.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�e2743adf56b4�body��2中子星是质量约1.4倍太阳以上的恒星核心坍缩后形成的超密天体，一茶匙物质就重达数十亿吨。它高速自转并拥有极强磁场，从磁极射出射电束，像灯塔一样周期性扫过地球时就被称作脉冲星。中子星是已知密度仅次于黑洞的天体。��A neutron star is an ultra-dense object formed when the core of a star more than about 1.4 solar masses collapses, packing matter so tightly that a teaspoon would weigh billions of tons. Spinning rapidly with an intense magnetic field, it beams radio waves from its poles; when this beam sweeps past Earth like a lighthouse, we call it a pulsar. Neutron stars are the densest known objects after black holes.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�e303e549ab4d�body���1987A是近代第一颗被探测到中微子的超新星，约20个中微子在光学亮起前数小时被捕获，证实了核心坍缩模型，并验证中微子几乎不受阻碍地穿出恒星。��SN 1987A was the first supernova from which neutrinos were detected; about 20 arrived hours before the optical light, confirming the core-collapse model and showing neutrinos escape the star almost unhindered.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�e3c76c7c3a97�body���2020 年，一个研究团队报告在金星大气约 50 至 60 公里高度探测到磷化氢气体，浓度约为十亿分之二十。在地球上，磷化氢主要由厌氧微生物产生，而当时未找到金星大气中能自然生成它的无机路径，因此它一度被视为候选生物标志物。但后续多个团队对原始探测信号和数据分析方法提出质疑，目前结论仍存在争议。��In 2020, a research team reported detecting phosphine at altitudes of roughly 50 to 60 km in Venus' atmosphere, at a mixing ratio of about 20 parts per billion. On Earth, phosphine is produced mainly by anaerobic microbes, and no known inorganic route could explain it in Venus' clouds at the time, so it was regarded as a candidate biosignature. However, subsequent teams questioned both the detection and the analysis methods, and the claim remains disputed.�ans��src�٘Catling, Krissansen-Totton, Kiang & Crisp,《Exoplanet Biosignatures: A Framework for Their Assessment》,Astrobiology,2018 (DOI: 10.1089/ast.2017.1737)ٖCatling, Krissansen-Totton, Kiang & Crisp, 'Exoplanet Biosignatures: A Framework for Their Assessment', Astrobiology, 2018, DOI: 10.1089/ast.2017.1737��id�e42b85f3b0c8�body��H宇宙再电离主要由首批恒星和星系的紫外光子完成，整体在红移 z ≈ 6（约大爆炸后 10 亿年）基本结束，但过程从 z ~ 15 起持续了数亿年。主要约束来自类星体光谱的 Gunn–Peterson 吸收槽、WMAP/Planck 给出的 Thomson 光学深度，以及高红移星系的发射线。��Cosmic reionization, driven mainly by ultraviolet photons from the first stars and galaxies, was essentially complete by redshift z ≈ 6 (about 1 billion years after the Big Bang), though the process began around z ~ 15 and lasted hundreds of millions of years. Key constraints come from the Gunn–Peterson troughs in quasar spectra, the Thomson optical depth measured by WMAP and Planck, and emission lines in high-redshift galaxies.�ans��src��DPlanck Collaboration 2018, A&A 641, A6；Fan 等 2006, ARA&A 44, 415�HPlanck Collaboration 2018, A&A, 641, A6; Fan et al. 2006, ARA&A, 44, 415��id�e4cce8056219�body��W当吸积盘存在强有序磁场并带走黑洞自转的角动量（Blandford–Znajek 机制）或盘内磁离心加速（Blandford–Payne 机制）时，沿两极的磁化等离子体被准直并提取磁能与转动能，加速到接近光速。喷流功率与吸积率和黑洞自旋相关，是耀变体与射电星系的高能引擎。�TWith a strong ordered magnetic field threading the disk, black-hole spin energy (Blandford–Znajek) or disk magnetic-centrifugal launching (Blandford–Payne) channels magnetized plasma along the poles, collimating and accelerating it to near light speed. Jet power scales with accretion rate and spin, powering blazars and radio galaxies.�ans��src��PBlandford & Znajek 1977, MNRAS 179, 433；Blandford & Payne 1982, MNRAS 199, 883�SBlandford & Znajek (1977), MNRAS 179, 433; Blandford & Payne (1982), MNRAS 199, 883��id�e7924efc363e�body��␀太阳占据了太阳系约99.8%的质量，却只拥有总角动量的约1%，绝大多数角动量集中在行星的轨道上。这一现象通常用吸积盘中磁场与物质的耦合（磁制动）来解释，是恒星形成研究中的经典问题。�HThe Sun holds about 99.8 percent of the solar system's mass but only roughly 1 percent of its angular momentum, with most of it locked in the planets' orbits. This is usually explained by magnetic braking, where the young star's magnetic field couples to the protoplanetary disk, and remains a classic problem in star formation.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�e7ad53e1f29d�body��B莱曼α森林是遥远类星体光谱中一系列密集的吸收线，由沿途不同红移的中性氢云对莱曼α波长的吸收造成。它像是宇宙中的“指纹”，让天文学家测绘星系际介质的密度与分布。通过分析森林的统计特性，可约束宇宙再电离历史和物质功率谱。��The Lyman-alpha forest is a series of dense absorption lines in the spectra of distant quasars, caused by intervening neutral hydrogen clouds at various redshifts absorbing at the Lyman-alpha wavelength. It acts like a cosmic fingerprint, mapping the density and distribution of the intergalactic medium. Its statistics constrain the reionization history and the matter power spectrum.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�e87ca08cd9af�body���光通过圆形口径时会发生衍射，任何一个点源都会被展成一个带光晕的小圆斑，其角半径大约为1.22乘以波长除以口径直径。口径越大，衍射斑越小，分辨本领越强，所以想看清细节就必须造更大的镜子；同时口径还决定集光能力，灵敏度随直径的平方增长。这正是天文学家不断建造更大望远镜的原因。��Light diffracts as it passes through a circular aperture, so any point source is smeared into a small haloed disc whose angular radius is roughly 1.22 times the wavelength divided by the aperture diameter. The larger the aperture, the smaller that diffraction disc and the finer the resolution, so sharper views demand bigger mirrors; the aperture also sets the collecting area, with sensitivity growing as the square of the diameter. That is why astronomers keep building ever larger telescopes.�ans��src��0《天文学概论》（望远镜分辨本领）�8An Introduction to Astronomy (telescope resolving power)��id�e8c4a92ebb53�body�ٴ北斗卫星能收发简短文字报文，让没有手机信号的海上、野外用户也能求救和联络；这需要卫星具备双向通信能力，增加了系统复杂度。��Beidou satellites can send and receive short text messages, letting users at sea or in the wild call for help without cell service; it requires two-way communication capability, adding system complexity.�ans��src��b国务院新闻办公室《2021中国的航天》白皮书：北斗短报文通信特色（2022）�`SCIO white paper 'China's Space Program: A 2021 Perspective': BeiDou short-message service, 2022��id�e8e4cc2aec8a�body��O宇宙黎明指第一批恒星和星系开始形成、向周围中性氢发出紫外辐射并启动再电离的时期，大约对应红移 z≈20–30（大爆炸后约1亿到2亿年）。它标志着宇宙黑暗时代的结束与“发光天体”时代的开端。这是连接原初宇宙与今日星系演化的关键过渡阶段。��Cosmic dawn refers to the era when the first stars and galaxies formed and began emitting ultraviolet light into the surrounding neutral hydrogen, initiating reionization—roughly z≈20–30, or about 100–200 million years after the Big Bang. It marks the end of the cosmic dark ages and the beginning of the luminous universe. It is a key transition between the primordial cosmos and today's galaxies.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�e9dd91eaaa2b�body��>史瓦西黑洞是不旋转、不带电的理想化静态黑洞，只由质量决定。克尔黑洞则描述旋转且不带电的黑洞，由质量和角动量两个参数刻画，并拥有内外两重视界以及一个能层。旋转使克尔黑洞中心的奇点不再是点，而是形成一个环（奇点环）。�^A Schwarzschild black hole is an idealized non-rotating, uncharged static black hole determined only by its mass. A Kerr black hole describes a rotating, uncharged hole, characterized by mass and angular momentum, with inner and outer horizons plus an ergosphere. Rotation turns the central singularity from a point into a ring, the ring singularity.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�eabbd274df5e�body���凌星指行星从恒星前方经过使星光轻微变暗；凌星时间变分则是多行星系统中行星间引力扰动导致凌星时刻的偏离。TTV可用来估算行星质量并发现未被直接探测到的行星。��A transit is a planet dimming its star as it passes in front; transit timing variation is the slight shift in those transit times caused by gravitational tugs from other planets. TTV lets astronomers estimate masses and reveal otherwise unseen planets.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�ebc1a06b271d�body��k脉冲星是旋转的中子星。恒星核心坍缩时，半径从数千公里（接近地球大小）缩到约十公里，转动惯量急剧变小，按角动量守恒定律自转就猛烈加快，可以高达每秒数百圈。它磁极发出的射电束像灯塔一样扫过地球，每次扫过就被我们记录成一个脉冲，周期精确得像原子钟。��Pulsars are spinning neutron stars. When a stellar core collapses, its radius shrinks from a few thousand kilometres (roughly the size of Earth) to about ten, the moment of inertia plummets, and by conservation of angular momentum the spin speeds up dramatically, reaching hundreds of revolutions per second. Radio beams from the magnetic poles sweep across Earth like a lighthouse, registering as a pulse on each pass with a timing as steady as an atomic clock.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�eccb6d2a61d4�body���行星自身不发光（或极暗），且旁边的恒星亮度高出数十亿倍，直接成像极为困难。通常需要日冕仪遮挡星光，或借助引力透镜与干涉技术，目前只对年轻、远离主星的巨行星较为可行。�Planets shine only faintly while their nearby star is billions of times brighter, making direct imaging extremely hard. It usually needs a coronagraph to block the starlight or techniques like interferometry, and so far works mainly for young, widely separated giant planets.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�ecd506c38cba�body��>大质量恒星铁核坍缩形成原中子星，释放的绝大部分引力能以中微子形式带走。停滞的吸积激波从原中子星获得中微子加热（增益区）后重新获得能量，在多维对流与 SASI 不稳定性帮助下突破束缚而爆发。该机制仍依赖数值模拟来定量验证。�fThe iron core of a massive star collapses into a proto-neutron star, releasing most gravitational energy as neutrinos. The stalled accretion shock is re-energized by neutrino heating in the gain region and, aided by multidimensional convection and SASI instability, breaks out. The mechanism still relies on numerical simulations for quantitative validation.�ans��src��YJanka 2012, Annu. Rev. Nucl. Part. Sci. 62, 407《核心坍缩超新星的爆发机制》�eJanka (2012), Annu. Rev. Nucl. Part. Sci. 62, 407, 'Explosion Mechanisms of Core-Collapse Supernovae'��id�eda81080a041�body�٨这是中子星被黑洞吞噬的事件，可同时产生引力波和（若中子星被撕裂）电磁信号，能帮助测量中子星物态并研究重元素合成。��It is an event where a black hole devours a neutron star, yielding gravitational waves and, if the star is torn apart, electromagnetic light—probing the neutron-star equation of state and heavy-element synthesis.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�ee079431023c�body���事件视界是黑洞的边界，越过它任何物质和信息都无法返回。史瓦西半径是与黑洞质量对应的视界大小，例如太阳若塌缩成黑洞，其视界半径仅约3公里。��The event horizon is the boundary of a black hole; crossing it, nothing can return. The Schwarzschild radius is the horizon's size for a given mass, about 3 kilometers for a black hole with the Sun's mass.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�ee198ab3c2c9�body��f暴胀理论假设宇宙在极早期经历了指数级的急速膨胀，能在极短时间内把一小块均匀区域拉伸成可观测宇宙。它自然解释了宇宙为何在大尺度上如此均匀且平坦，并把原初量子涨落放大为后来的密度扰动。古斯在1981年提出这一设想，此后被宇宙微波背景的涨落谱所支持。��Inflation posits that the early universe underwent a brief phase of exponential expansion, stretching a tiny homogeneous patch into the observable cosmos. It naturally explains why the universe is so uniform and flat on large scales and amplifies quantum fluctuations into the seeds of later structure. Guth proposed it in 1981, and it has since been supported by the fluctuation spectrum of the CMB.�ans��src��pGuth《The Inflationary Universe》（1981，Physical Review D）；Planck Collaboration《Planck 2018 结果》�dGuth, The Inflationary Universe (1981, Physical Review D); Planck Collaboration, Planck 2018 results��id�ee203a4b7ea7�body�ٿ中国以月亮约27.3天绕天一周来划分月站（28宿），重视月与行星的行度；西方以太阳周年路径分12段，重视太阳与黄道带，反映了各自观测重点。��China divided the sky by the Moon's ~27.3-day path (28 mansions), focusing on lunar and planetary motion; the West divided the Sun's annual path into 12, focusing on the ecliptic—reflecting different priorities.�ans��src��;Carl Sagan,《Cosmos》Random House,1980;中译《宇宙》�1C. Sagan, Cosmos, Random House, 1980; Chinese ed.��id�f0b0a3089f97�body��aRNA 世界假说认为，在 DNA 与蛋白质出现之前，RNA 既承担遗传信息存储又具备催化反应的能力（核酶），因而可同时满足复制与代谢需求。实验室已证明 RNA 能自我剪切并催化肽键形成，但仍难以解释 RNA 自身如何在无生命环境中被合成与富集，这是该假说的关键缺口。�qThe RNA world hypothesis proposes that before DNA and proteins, RNA both stored genetic information and catalyzed reactions as ribozymes, satisfying replication and metabolism at once. Experiments show RNA can self-cleave and catalyze peptide-bond formation, yet how RNA itself was synthesized and concentrated in a non-living environment remains a key gap in the idea.�ans��src�يTruman,《The RNA World Hypothesis: A Critical Reassessment of Prebiotic Plausibility》,BioCosmos,2026 (DOI: 10.2478/biocosmos-2026-0003)وTruman, 'The RNA World Hypothesis: A Critical Reassessment of Prebiotic Plausibility', BioCosmos, 2026, DOI: 10.2478/biocosmos-2026-0003��id�f108e84cefc6�body�٧两者都把氢聚变成氦，但 pp 链在像太阳这样的小质量恒星中主导，CNO 循环依靠碳氮氧作催化剂，在大质量高温恒星中占主导。��Both fuse hydrogen into helium, but the pp chain dominates in lower-mass stars like the Sun, while the CNO cycle uses carbon-nitrogen-oxygen as catalysts and dominates in massive, hotter stars.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�f24fbfbb8a08�body���大气逃逸是行星大气被恒星辐射和星风逐渐剥离的过程；被强烈辐照的近距离行星（尤其热木星）会损失氢等轻元素，决定其能否长期保有大气与液态水。��Atmospheric escape is the gradual loss of a planet's air to stellar radiation and wind; strongly irradiated close-in planets, especially hot Jupiters, lose light elements like hydrogen, deciding whether they keep an atmosphere and liquid water.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�f3c23a870a78�body���重子声学振荡是早期宇宙中声波在等离子体里留下的密度波纹，在星系分布中表现为约5亿光年的特征尺度。它被用作「标准尺」，帮助测量宇宙的膨胀历史与暗能量性质。�Baryon acoustic oscillations are density ripples left by sound waves in the early universe's plasma, showing up as a characteristic scale of about 500 million light-years in galaxy distributions. Used as a "standard ruler," they help measure cosmic expansion and dark energy.�ans��src��斯隆数字巡天（SDSS）�Sloan Digital Sky Survey (SDSS)��id�f400d2230545�body�ٜ暗物质是一种不发光、不与电磁波直接作用、却通过引力影响星系和星系团运动与成团的物质，约占宇宙总物质的85%。٧Dark matter neither emits nor absorbs light and barely interacts with normal matter, but its gravity shapes galaxies and clusters; it makes up about 85% of all matter.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�f46d25ae9f38�body�ٿ火星有稀薄大气需防热和降落伞减速，但大气又太薄无法轻柔着陆；加上地火通信延迟达十几分钟，无法实时操控，必须自动完成'恐怖七分钟'。��Mars has thin air needing heat shields and parachutes yet too thin for a soft landing; with 10+ minute light-delay, landing cannot be remote-controlled and must be fully automatic—the 'seven minutes of terror.'�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�f49939736a7f�body���造父变星脉动周期与其本征光度严格正相关（Leavitt 定律）。测得周期即可知绝对星等，再与视星等比较得到距离，误差可控制在约 5% 内。它是本地宇宙到邻近星系距离测量的关键一级阶梯。�A Cepheid's pulsation period correlates tightly with its intrinsic luminosity (Leavitt's law). Measuring the period gives absolute magnitude; comparing with apparent magnitude yields distance to ~5% precision. It is a key local rung of the distance ladder out to nearby galaxies.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�f7ce363a246e�body��;热木星质量接近木星却被发现紧贴恒星（轨道仅几天），而巨行星应在雪线外的低温区才能吸积气体形成，因此必须在远处形成后再向内迁移。主流机制包括盘迁移（与气体盘交换角动量）和偏心潮汐迁移（行星间相互作用后再被圆化）。��Hot Jupiters have Jupiter-like masses yet orbit extremely close to their stars (periods of days), but giant planets should form beyond the snow line where cold conditions allow gas accretion, so they must form far out and migrate inward. Leading mechanisms are disk migration (angular-momentum exchange with the gas disk) and eccentric tidal migration (planet–planet interactions followed by circularization).�ans��src�ٜLin、Bodenheimer 与 Richardson,《Orbital migration of the planetary companion of 51 Pegasi to its present location》,Nature,1996 (DOI: 10.1038/380606a0)ٗLin, Bodenheimer & Richardson, 'Orbital migration of the planetary companion of 51 Pegasi to its present location', Nature, 1996, DOI: 10.1038/380606a0��id�f8b63faf81dd�body�ٵ质量大于约8倍太阳的恒星在耗尽核燃料后会发生核心坍缩型超新星爆发，留下中子星或黑洞。这一过程还把大量重元素抛洒到星际空间。��Stars more than about eight times the Sun's mass end by exhausting their fuel and undergoing a core-collapse supernova, leaving behind a neutron star or black hole. The explosion also scatters heavy elements into space.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�f912bf95c0ea�body��=Ia 型由白矮星热核爆炸合成约 0.5–1 倍太阳质量的镍-56，其经镍-56 到钴-56 再到铁-56 的衰变释放的伽马射线被抛射物吸收，主导了峰值后数周的光变。II 型则部分由镍-56 加热、部分由氢包层再复合发光共同贡献，故光变形态与 Ia 明显不同。�lIn Type Ia, the thermonuclear explosion of a white dwarf synthesizes ~0.5–1 solar mass of nickel-56; its decay chain nickel-56 → cobalt-56 → iron-56 releases gamma rays absorbed by ejecta, dominating the light curve for weeks. Type II light curves are shaped both by nickel-56 heating and hydrogen-envelope recombination, giving a distinctly different shape.�ans��src��KArnett 1982, ApJ 253, 785《I 型超新星：光变曲线早期解析解》�mArnett (1982), ApJ 253, 785, 'Type I Supernovae. I. Analytic Solutions for the Early Part of the Light Curve'��id�fa88bdc924b3�body�ِ暴胀认为宇宙在大爆炸后极早期（10^-36到10^-32秒）经历了指数级暴涨，解释了宇宙的大尺度均匀性和平坦性。٩Inflation proposes the early Universe underwent exponential expansion (around 10^-36 to 10^-32 s after the Big Bang), explaining its large-scale uniformity and flatness.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�fb4f1608135c�body�ٟ中微子在飞行中会在三种味之间转换，说明它们具有非零质量，这超出了最初的标准模型预言，是粒子物理的重要发现。٬Neutrinos switch among three flavors while traveling, proving they have nonzero mass—beyond the original Standard Model prediction and a major particle-physics discovery.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�fb8ee540c9f9�body��>大爆炸核合成发生在宇宙诞生后约三分钟到二十分钟内，由高温高密度下的质子中子融合生成大部分宇宙中的氦-4、氘、氦-3和锂-7。其丰度强烈依赖于重子密度和膨胀速率。观测到的轻元素丰度与理论预言高度吻合，是标准模型的重要支柱。��Big Bang nucleosynthesis occurred in the first few minutes of the universe as protons and neutrons fused under high temperature and density, producing most of the cosmic helium-4, deuterium, helium-3, and lithium-7. Their abundances depend strongly on the baryon density and expansion rate. Observed light-element abundances match predictions closely, a key pillar of the standard model.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�ff4f7217cefa�body���类星体是宇宙中最亮的活动星系核，其光度可超过整个银河系的数百倍，能量却集中在小于太阳系尺度的区域内。其能量来自中心超大质量黑洞的吸积。��Quasars are the brightest active galactic nuclei, shining hundreds of times brighter than an entire galaxy while fitting inside a region smaller than the solar system. Their power comes from accretion onto a central supermassive black hole.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�ffd57d1306b2�body��i比铁重的元素主要通过快中子俘获过程（r过程）在极端中子流环境中合成，例如双中子星并合。伯比奇等人早在1957年就把重元素合成纳入恒星核合成框架。2017年LIGO与Virgo探测到双中子星并合引力波，同时望远镜观测到对应千新星中金、铂等元素的特征，直接证实了r过程。��Elements heavier than iron are mainly forged by the rapid neutron-capture process, or r-process, in extreme neutron-rich environments such as merging neutron stars. Burbidge and colleagues framed heavy-element synthesis within stellar nucleosynthesis as early as 1957. In 2017 LIGO and Virgo detected a neutron-star merger in gravitational waves while telescopes saw the matching kilonova rich in gold and platinum, directly confirming the r-process.�ans��src�وBurbidge 等《Synthesis of the Elements in Stars》（1957，Reviews of Modern Physics）；LIGO/Virgo 双中子星并合（GW170817）ـBurbidge et al., Synthesis of the Elements in Stars (1957, Reviews of Modern Physics); LIGO/Virgo neutron-star merger (GW170817)��id�19c88fb468db�body�ٖ光锥用光在时空中的可能路径划分事件为可影响、可被影响和永远隔绝的区域，是理解因果和相对论极限的基础。ٯLight cones use light's possible paths in spacetime to divide events into affectable, affected and forever-separated regions—the basis for causality and relativistic limits.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�1b8863bf8b34�body�ي自适应光学用可变形镜面实时抵消大气湍流造成的星像抖动，使地面望远镜也能获得接近太空的清晰度。٠Adaptive optics uses deformable mirrors to cancel the star-image wobble from atmospheric turbulence in real time, giving ground telescopes near-space sharpness.�ans��src��<Terence Dickinson,《NightWatch》第4版,Firefly Books,2006�nT. Dickinson, NightWatch: A Practical Guide to Viewing the Universe, 4th ed., Firefly Books, 2006; Chinese ed.��id�223c231a205b�body�٣旋转的大质量天体会像搅动蜂蜜一样拖拽周围的时空，使附近自由下落的陀螺自转轴缓慢进动，已被引力探测器B实验证实。٩A rotating massive body drags nearby spacetime around it like stirring honey, slowly precessing a freely falling gyroscope—confirmed by the Gravity Probe B experiment.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�23b941211fd3�body�ٷ落向致密天体的物质因角动量形成旋转盘，摩擦加热到极高温度发出强光，既释放引力能，也常常驱动喷流，是许多高能现象的能量来源。��Infailing matter forms a spinning disk due to angular momentum; friction heats it to extreme temperatures and bright emission, releasing gravitational energy and often powering jets—the engine behind many high-energy phenomena.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�2b1c363097e5�body�ي韦伯用6.5米镀金主镜和红外仪器，捕捉宇宙首批星系被红移拉长的红外光，并能穿透尘埃观察恒星诞生。ٮWebb uses a 6.5 m gold-coated mirror and infrared instruments to catch the infrared light of the first galaxies stretched by redshift, and to peer through dust at star birth.�ans��src��vGardner J. P. et al., The James Webb Space Telescope, Space Science Reviews 123 (2006), DOI: 10.1007/s11214-006-8315-7�vGardner J. P. et al., The James Webb Space Telescope, Space Science Reviews 123 (2006), DOI: 10.1007/s11214-006-8315-7��id�3c3bd44bfa3b�body�ه引力时间膨胀指处在更强引力场中的钟比远处走得更慢，已在地面高度差实验和GPS系统上被精确验证。ٷGravitational time dilation means a clock in a stronger gravitational field ticks slower than one farther away, precisely verified in height-difference experiments and the GPS system.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�4a21c8fb1e49�body�ِ蓝超巨星是温度高、光度极大的大质量恒星，处于极短而剧烈的演化阶段，因此数量稀少且很快走向超新星。ٖBlue supergiants are extremely hot, luminous massive stars in a brief, violent evolutionary phase, so they are rare and quickly head toward supernova.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�511ef2cca5c4�body�ٖ嫦娥三号实现月面软着陆，嫦娥四号首次登陆月球背面，嫦娥五号成功采样返回，为人类提供了宝贵的月壤样本。ٜChang'e 3 achieved a soft landing, Chang'e 4 first landed on the lunar far side, and Chang'e 5 returned samples—providing valuable lunar soil for science.�ans��src��G国务院新闻办公室《2021中国的航天》航天白皮书，2022�^State Council Information Office: China's Space Program: A 2021 Perspective, white paper, 2022��id�6ecca6ffac4a�body�٬沃尔夫-拉叶星是大质量恒星演化晚期的特殊类型，以极强恒星风吹走外层，暴露出炽热富氦的核心，常是超新星或伽马暴的前身。ٻA Wolf-Rayet star is a late-stage massive star blowing off its outer layers with intense winds, exposing a hot helium-rich core; it is often a precursor to a supernova or gamma-ray burst.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�8ab508a022ac�body�ٯ太阳系的边界通常认为在日球层顶——太阳风影响终止之处，再往外才是星际空间；若算上奥尔特云，边界可延伸到距太阳约1光年。ٲThe boundary is usually the heliopause where the solar wind stops; beyond lies interstellar space. Including the Oort Cloud, the edge may reach about one light-year from the Sun.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�95997de49096�body�ف这是首次同时探测到引力波和电磁波的事件，确认了千新星与重元素起源，并独立测出哈勃常数。٢It was the first event seen in both gravitational waves and light, confirming kilonovae and heavy-element origins and independently measuring the Hubble constant.�ans��src��Abbott et al.《Multi-messenger Observations of a Binary Neutron Star Merger》(ApJL 848, L12, 2017);LIGO-Virgo 科学合作组نAbbott et al., Multi-messenger Observations of a Binary Neutron Star Merger (ApJL 848, L12, 2017); LIGO-Virgo Scientific Collaboration��id�9abdba9080ae�body�ٗTRAPPIST-1是一颗极冷的红矮星，拥有七颗地球大小的岩石行星，其中多颗位于宜居带，是搜寻地外生命的重点目标。ٛTRAPPIST-1 is an ultra-cool red dwarf with seven Earth-sized rocky planets, several in the habitable zone, making it a prime target in the search for life.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�9d166b5b7e1f�body�ٱ大质量恒星核心燃料耗尽后无法支撑自身引力，核心坍缩成中子星或黑洞，外层猛烈反弹形成核心坍缩超新星，并向太空抛射重元素。��When a massive star exhausts its fuel it can no longer support itself; the core collapses into a neutron star or black hole, and the rebounding outer layers explode as a core-collapse supernova, dispersing heavy elements.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�a7570a0a7134�body��某些近地小行星富含铁、镍、铂族金属甚至水冰，水可分解成火箭燃料、金属可用于太空建造。相比从地球发射物资，利用太空就地资源能大幅降低深空任务成本。它被视为未来太空经济和长期驻留的关键。�5Some near-Earth asteroids are rich in iron, nickel, platinum-group metals and even water ice, which can be split into rocket fuel while metals build in space. Using space resources is far cheaper than launching supplies from Earth for deep missions. It is seen as key to a future space economy and long stays.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�b35ba749acf7�body��V韦伯的中红外仪器（MIRI 与 NIRSpec）覆盖 3–5 微米的分子吸收带，其中 4.3 微米的强 CO2 振动带受云层影响较小。通过分析凌星过程中恒星光在窄波段上的微弱减弱，韦伯在 WASP-39b 等热木星大气中明确识别出 CO2 的特征吸收，这是系外行星大气首次确证该分子。��Webb's mid-infrared instruments, MIRI and NIRSpec, cover the 3–5 micrometer molecular bands where the strong CO2 vibration band near 4.3 micrometers is comparatively less affected by clouds. By measuring the tiny wavelength-dependent dimming during transit, Webb unambiguously identified the CO2 absorption signature in the atmosphere of hot Jupiters such as WASP-39b, the first confirmed detection of the molecule in an exoplanet atmosphere.�ans��src��7Chaisson & McMillan,《Astronomy Today》Pearson 多版�GE. Chaisson and S. McMillan, Astronomy Today, Pearson, various editions��id�bb2f5b8afedf�body�ٙ柯伊伯带是海王星轨道以外、布满冰质小天体的环状区域，冥王星等矮行星就位于其中，是许多短周期彗星的来源。ٓThe Kuiper Belt is a ring of icy bodies beyond Neptune's orbit where dwarf planets like Pluto reside; it is the source of many short-period comets.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�d8ab17f9843c�body��E费米 GBM 在引力波到达后约 1.7 秒探测到短伽马射线暴 GRB 170817A，确立了双中子星并合与短伽马暴的因果联系；INTEGRAL 则给出严格的伽马射线非探测上限，排除了明亮的普通短暴。两者共同表明该并合喷流相对地球观测者偏向较宽角度或能量偏低。�~Fermi's GBM detected the short gamma-ray burst GRB 170817A only about 1.7 seconds after the gravitational waves, establishing the causal link between binary neutron star mergers and short gamma-ray bursts. INTEGRAL supplied a stringent non-detection upper limit, ruling out a bright ordinary short burst and indicating that the jet was viewed far off-axis or was intrinsically weak.�ans��src��;Abbott 等 2017, ApJ 848, L12（GW170817 引力波发现）�wAbbott et al. (2017), ApJL 848, L12, 'GW170817: Observation of Gravitational Waves from a Binary Neutron Star Inspiral'��id�e27109f68bac�body���帕克探测器借助金星引力反复减速并压低近日点，用碳复合材料隔热盾承受上千万度高温（实际是周围粒子温度），成为首个触碰日冕的航天器。��Parker uses repeated Venus gravity assists to lower its perihelion and a carbon-composite heat shield to endure millions of degrees (particle temperature), becoming the first craft to touch the corona.�ans��src��nParker《Dynamics of the interplanetary gas》（1958，ApJ）；NASA 帕克太阳探测器（2018年发射）�_Parker, Dynamics of the interplanetary gas (1958, ApJ); NASA Parker Solar Probe (launched 2018)��id�ed18ec89c1c1�body�٩他采用更精确的圭表测影与多次冬至观测，并废除复杂的'上元积年'推算，直接用实测数据定朔，使回归年长度精确到365.2425天。��He used more precise gnomon shadow measurements and multiple winter-solstice observations, abandoned the cumbersome epoch reckoning, and set the calendar directly from data, fixing the tropical year at 365.2425 days.�ans��src��TZeilik,《Astronomy: The Evolving Universe》第9版,Cambridge University Press,2002�VM. Zeilik, Astronomy: The Evolving Universe, 9th ed., Cambridge University Press, 2002��id�eded140995b5�body�ّLIGO用两条数公里长的垂直激光臂，当引力波经过使空间极微小拉伸与压缩时，测量两臂长度差异来捕捉信号。��LIGO uses two perpendicular laser arms several kilometers long; as a gravitational wave slightly stretches and squeezes space, it measures the tiny difference in arm lengths to capture the signal.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�astro_26_012�body��膝被视为银河系内加速器加速能力的上限:扩散激波加速所能达到的最高能量随磁场增强而抬高,若遗迹只握有微高斯级的普通星际磁场,质子远够不到膝部;观测却显示年轻遗迹的强激波能把磁场放大至上百微高斯,使质子恰好抵达三千万亿电子伏附近并率先挣脱银河系,能谱随之变陡。膝之上重核渐占上风,各元素的截断能量大致按电荷数成倍抬升,与理论预言吻合,这正是超新星遗迹主导银河系宇宙线的关键证据。��The knee marks the practical ceiling of accelerators inside our Galaxy. In diffusive shock acceleration the maximum reachable energy climbs with magnetic-field strength: holding only ordinary microgauss interstellar fields, remnant shocks would fall well short of it. Observations show that strong shocks in young remnants amplify their fields to hundreds of microgauss, letting protons just reach a few quadrillion electronvolts and break free first, which steepens the spectrum there. Above the knee heavier nuclei take over, with cutoff energies rising roughly in proportion to charge, matching theory and anchoring the case that supernova remnants dominate Galactic cosmic rays.�ans��src���P. Blasi,2013年,Astronomy & Astrophysics Review,21卷70号:银河系宇宙线的起源;T. Antoni 等人(KASCADE 合作组),2005年,Astroparticle Physics,24卷1页:KASCADE 对各元素组宇宙线能谱的测量与膝部成分��P. Blasi 2013, Astronomy & Astrophysics Review, 21, 70 - The origin of Galactic cosmic rays; T. Antoni et al. (KASCADE Collaboration) 2005, Astroparticle Physics, 24, 1 - KASCADE measurements of energy spectra for elemental groups of cosmic rays��id�astro_26_020�body��失真源于本动速度:星系除哈勃退行外还有自身运动,星系团成员的速度可达每秒上千公里,被误折算成额外的距离差,于是指向观测者的成员在图上拖出长长的“手指”。更大尺度上,引力内聚让物质朝密集区涌动,沿视线方向的结构被压扁,即 Kaiser 效应。这类畸变并非噪声:压扁程度由结构增长率决定,配合功率谱分析可以称量暗物质、检验引力甚至约束中微子质量,已是大型巡天的标准产出。��The distortion comes from peculiar velocities: besides the Hubble recession, galaxies move on their own, cluster members reaching well over a thousand kilometres per second, which gets misread as extra distance offsets, so members pointing at the observer drag out long fingers on the map. On larger scales gravity pulls material toward overdensities, flattening structures along the line of sight - the Kaiser effect. Such distortions are not noise: their strength tracks the growth rate of structure, and combined with power-spectrum analysis they weigh dark matter, test gravity and even bound neutrino masses, becoming a standard science product of major surveys.�ans��src���N. Kaiser,1987年,Monthly Notices of the Royal Astronomical Society,227卷1页:Clustering in Real Space and in Redshift Space;M. A. Strauss 与 J. A. Willick,1995年,Physics Reports,261卷271页:The Density and Velocity Field of the Local Universe��N. Kaiser 1987, MNRAS, 227, 1 - Clustering in real space and in redshift space; M. A. Strauss & J. A. Willick 1995, Physics Reports, 261, 271 - The density and velocity field of the local universe��id�af2f22d5d04d�body���在太空站里，因为没有重力，宇航员会飘起来，睡觉要把自己固定在睡袋里。他们吃特制的脱水或压缩食品，喝水也要小心不让水珠乱飘。每天还要做运动，防止骨头和肌肉在失重下变弱。�6In a space station there is no gravity, so astronauts float, and they must strap themselves into sleeping bags to rest. They eat special dried or compressed food and drink carefully so water droplets do not float around. Every day they exercise to keep their bones and muscles from weakening in weightlessness.�ans��src��6苏宜,《天文学新概论》第5版,科学出版社�8Su Yi, Introduction to Astronomy, 5th ed., Science Press��id�f2ac1ccf6afb�body���是的，科学家发现宇宙现在不仅在变大，而且变大的速度还在加快。这可能是因为一种叫做暗能量的神秘力量在把空间往外推。如果暗能量不变，宇宙会一直膨胀下去，星系会越来越分散。�Yes, scientists have found that the universe is not only expanding but speeding up as it does. This may be due to a mysterious force called dark energy pushing space outward. If dark energy stays the same, the universe will keep expanding and galaxies will drift ever farther apart.�ans��src��dCarroll & Ostlie,《An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics》第2版,Cambridge University Press,2017�qB. W. Carroll and D. A. Ostlie, An Introduction to Modern Astrophysics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2017��id�01000bd3e38a�body�ٍ半岛是三面环水、一面与大陆相连的地块，如阿拉伯半岛和朝鲜半岛。它的气候和生态常受海洋显著影响。ٹA peninsula is a piece of land nearly surrounded by water but connected to the mainland on one side, like Arabia or Korea. Its climate and ecology are strongly shaped by the nearby sea.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�011ddda946a3�body��u碳汇是能从大气吸收并储存二氧化碳的自然系统，如森林、土壤、海洋，帮助减缓变暖。�A carbon sink is a natural system that absorbs and stores CO2 from the air, like forests, soils and the ocean, slowing warming.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�04b2f65a7868�body���墨西哥湾流是北大西洋一条强大的暖流，从墨西哥湾沿北美东岸流向北大西洋。它把热带的热量输送到高纬度地区，显著影响北欧的气候。它是全球大洋环流的重要组成部分。�BThe Gulf Stream is a powerful warm current in the North Atlantic that flows from the Gulf of Mexico along the east coast of North America into the North Atlantic. It carries tropical heat toward high latitudes and strongly influences the climate of Northern Europe. It is a major component of the global ocean circulation.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�057c63a2c6f4�body�ٴ峡谷是河流长期下切侵蚀在坚硬岩层中刻出的深而窄的谷地，两侧常为陡崖。美国科罗拉多大峡谷就是由科罗拉多河数百万年切割而成。��A canyon is a deep, narrow valley cut by a river into resistant rock over long time, usually with steep cliffs on both sides. Arizona's Grand Canyon was carved by the Colorado River over millions of years.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�07b026176888�body��f风把能量传给海面，海水以圆圈方式上下起伏向前传，浪就一波波涌向岸边。�{Wind transfers energy to the sea surface, and water moves in rolling circles that travel forward as waves toward the shore.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�090c09cd7485�body���地球主要有七大板块：太平洋板块、北美板块、欧亚板块、非洲板块、南极洲板块、印度-澳大利亚板块和南美板块。此外还有若干较小的板块，如阿拉伯板块和加勒比板块。��Earth has seven major plates: the Pacific, North American, Eurasian, African, Antarctic, Indo-Australian, and South American plates. Several smaller plates also exist, such as the Arabian and Caribbean plates.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�0b4595029938�body�ٷ在室内，蹲下、掩护头部并抓牢坚固的桌子是常用避险法，可挡住坠落物。应远离窗户和易倒家具，待晃动停止再有序撤离，不要乘电梯。��Indoors, drop, cover your head and hold under a sturdy table is a common method that shields you from falling objects. Stay away from windows and tall furniture, evacuate in order after shaking stops, and do not use elevators.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�0c693a776e13�body��f月球引力把正对和背对它的两侧海水拉高，地球自转就形成了每天两次涨落。�cThe Moon's gravity bulges the ocean on both near and far sides; Earth's spin makes two tides daily.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�0cac59295ed7�body��f山坡上的土石沿着一个滑动面整体向下滑，就叫滑坡，常由暴雨或地震触发。�]A landslide is rock and soil sliding downslope on a slip surface, often after rain or quakes.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�10b3601c3db2�body���全球变暖指近一个多世纪以来地球地表平均气温持续上升的趋势。主要由人类燃烧化石燃料排放二氧化碳等温室气体造成。它带来冰川退缩、海平面上升和极端天气增多等一系列影响。�,Global warming refers to the sustained rise in Earth's average surface temperature over the past century or more. It is mainly caused by human emissions of greenhouse gases such as carbon dioxide from burning fossil fuels. It brings glacier retreat, sea level rise, and more frequent extreme weather.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�1129fe70e922�body��y地球按经度每15°划一个时区，全球约24个。中国横跨5个地理时区，但全国统一用北京时间。هThe world is split into about 24 zones of 15° each. China spans five geographic zones but uses a single “Beijing Time” nationwide.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�136db366dcb5�body���按高度和形态，云可分为高云、中云、低云和直展云。高云如卷云，中云如高积云，低云如层云和雨层云，直展云如积雨云。观察云的形态有助于粗略判断天气变化。�By height and shape, clouds are grouped into high, middle, low, and vertical clouds. High clouds include cirrus, middle include altocumulus, low include stratus and nimbostratus, and vertical include cumulonimbus. Watching cloud forms helps roughly judge coming weather.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�14cd9f2ca9ae�body�ٱ大多数板块以每年约1到10厘米的速度缓慢移动，大致相当于指甲生长的速度。尽管很慢，经过数百万年就能使大陆位置发生巨大变化。ټMost plates move at about 1 to 10 centimeters per year, roughly the speed at which human fingernails grow. Though slow, over millions of years this shifts continents by enormous distances.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�189e2eb2bfbe�body��x北极升温比全球平均快，海冰早早融化，北极熊捕猎海豹的“平台”变小，觅食越来越难。ٍThe Arctic warms faster than the global average; earlier sea-ice loss shrinks the platform polar bears use to hunt seals, making food scarce.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�1affd88b0700�body�ٴ石英是由二氧化硅组成的矿物，是地壳中含量最丰富的矿物之一。它硬度较高、常见六方柱状晶体，广泛用作电子元件原料和装饰石材。��Quartz is a mineral made of silicon dioxide and is among the most abundant in Earth's crust. It is fairly hard, often forms six-sided prismatic crystals, and is widely used in electronics and as ornamental stone.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�1c30914b4fbb�body���会。化肥、农药、污水和工业废液可随下渗进入含水层，使地下水含有害物质。地下水流动缓慢、更新周期长，一旦污染很难治理。保护水源地和合理处理废物是关键。�$Yes. Fertilizers, pesticides, sewage, and industrial waste can infiltrate and enter aquifers, contaminating groundwater. Because groundwater moves slowly and renews over long periods, pollution is hard to clean up once it occurs. Protecting recharge areas and managing waste properly are key.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�1daeb1c5ad16�body���震级衡量地震释放能量的大小，如里氏震级，每增加1级能量约增32倍。烈度描述某地实际感受到的破坏程度，与距离震中和地质条件有关，同一地震不同地点烈度不同。�0Magnitude measures the energy released, as in the Richter scale, where each step up means about 32 times more energy. Intensity describes the actual felt shaking and damage at a place, depending on distance from the epicenter and local geology, so one quake has different intensities in different places.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�20965b08b165�body��=天气是某一时刻、某一地点的大气瞬时状态（如今天是否下雨、气温多少）。气候则是某个地区天气在较长时间（世界气象组织以30年为一标准时段）里的平均状况和变率。简单说：天气是“你今天穿什么”，气候是“你衣橱里常备什么”。�8Weather is the atmosphere's state at a specific time and place (whether it rains today, the temperature now). Climate is the long-term average and variability of weather in a region—the WMO uses a standard 30-year period. Simply put: weather is what you wear today; climate is what your wardrobe usually needs.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�227d850dbf54�body���宝石是具有美观、耐久和稀有特性的矿物或有机材料，经琢磨后可作装饰，如钻石、红宝石。普通矿物不一定具备这些商业品质，用途多在工业而非装饰。��A gemstone is a mineral or organic material prized for beauty, durability and rarity that can be cut for ornament, like diamond or ruby. Ordinary minerals lack these commercial qualities and are used mainly in industry rather than decoration.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�277731f6d1ae�body���黄铜矿和黄铁矿都有金属光泽和金黄色调，常被误认成金，故称「愚人金」。但它们更脆、条痕非金黄，密度也远低于真金，可用简单方法区分。��Chalcopyrite and pyrite both have metallic luster and golden hues, often mistaken for gold and called 'fool's gold'. But they are brittle, leave non-gold streaks and are far less dense than real gold, distinguishable by simple tests.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�281ee40e6055�body��T海平面是海洋的平均高度，随冰川消融、海水增温膨胀而变化。�YSea level is the average ocean height; it rises as ice melts and water warms and expands.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�2a146835b152�body�ٞ科学家通过放射性定年法测得地球的年龄约为46亿年。这是通过对最古老的陨石和地球岩石进行同位素测年得到的结论。ٺUsing radiometric dating, scientists estimate the Earth is about 4.6 billion years old. This figure comes from dating the oldest meteorites and Earth rocks by their radioactive isotopes.�ans��src��+放射性同位素测年（如铀-铅法）�.Radiometric dating (e.g., uranium-lead method)��id�2f69b9107f28�body��x暖湿的空气碰到还冰凉的墙壁和地板，水汽遇冷凝结成水珠，所以表面看起来“出水”了。ْWarm, moist air meets still-cold walls and floors, and the water vapor condenses into droplets on the surface, making it look like it is sweating.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�2fcd5a3be82c�body�ٓ蚯蚓粪富含有机质和多种植物可吸收的养分，且结构疏松、保水透气。它温和不易烧苗，是天然的优质有机肥。��Worm cast is rich in organic matter and many plant-available nutrients, loose in structure and good at holding water and air. Gentle and non-burning, it is a natural high-quality organic fertilizer.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�335fffb5e1ef�body�ٴ风是空气因温度差异造成的气压差而发生的水平流动。当某地空气受热上升、气压降低，周围高压空气就会流过来填补，于是形成了风。��Wind is the horizontal movement of air caused by pressure differences that arise from temperature variations. When air heats and rises, lowering pressure in one place, surrounding higher-pressure air flows in to fill the gap, creating wind.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�34bb6cacea24�body���火山喷发会喷出熔岩、火山灰、火山气体（主要是水蒸气和二氧化碳）以及火山碎屑。冷却后还会形成玄武岩、安山岩等火山岩。火山灰若飘散很广，会短暂影响气候。��Eruptions eject lava, volcanic ash, volcanic gases (mainly water vapor and carbon dioxide), and tephra. After cooling, they form volcanic rocks such as basalt and andesite. Widely dispersed ash can briefly affect climate.�ans��src��B西古德松主编《火山百科全书》，Academic Press，2015�JSigurdsson, H. (ed.) (2015), The Encyclopedia of Volcanoes, Academic Press��id�35a21437dda6�body�ٓ下渗是地表水渗入土壤和岩石孔隙、补给地下水的过程。土壤的透水性、坡度和降雨强度都会影响下渗的多少。��Infiltration is the process by which surface water soaks into the pores of soil and rock to recharge groundwater. Soil permeability, slope, and rainfall intensity all affect how much infiltrates.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�35b883b37dca�body���大气压是地球大气因重力作用而对地表单位面积施加的压力，海平面平均约为1013百帕。气压的高低变化与天气系统密切相关，低压常带来阴雨，高压多对应晴朗。�Atmospheric pressure is the force exerted by the weight of the air on a unit area of the surface, averaging about 1013 hPa at sea level. Pressure variations link closely to weather: low pressure often brings clouds and rain, while high pressure usually means fair weather.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�37d9cf63f87c�body��{河流把陆地岩石中的盐类（如氯化钠）带入海洋，水分蒸发后盐分不断积累，海水就变咸了。فRivers carry salts like sodium chloride from rocks into the sea; as water evaporates the salts accumulate, making seawater salty.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�3cce63351455�body�ٓ那是加氯消毒后留下的微量余氯，用来防止水在管道里二次污染，一般量少、烧开或放置后会散掉，通常安全。ٯIt is a trace of leftover chlorine from disinfection, which prevents re-contamination in pipes; the small amount dissipates when boiled or left standing and is generally safe.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�3e5b75c1eb5c�body���海水中的盐分主要来自陆地岩石风化后被河流带入海洋，以及海底热液活动。盐度指每千克海水中溶解盐类的总克数，全球平均约35。海水蒸发只带走淡水，盐分长期积累，使海洋保持咸味。�4The salt in seawater mainly comes from rock weathering on land carried by rivers and from seafloor hydrothermal activity. Salinity is the total grams of dissolved salts per kilogram of seawater, averaging about 35 globally. Evaporation removes only fresh water, so salt accumulates and the ocean stays salty.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�433c47a0302f�body���北大西洋暖流把墨西哥湾流带来的暖水继续输往欧洲西北岸。它使同纬度的西北欧比加拿大东部温暖得多，冬季港口不易结冰。没有它，欧洲气候会接近严寒的大陆性气候。�>The North Atlantic Current carries the warm water of the Gulf Stream onward to the northwestern shores of Europe. It makes northwestern Europe much warmer than eastern Canada at the same latitude, and keeps its winter ports largely ice-free. Without it, Europe's climate would be far closer to a harsh continental one.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�47b41446ddfd�body�ل地下水从岩缝自然涌出地面就是泉。若水流过地下炽热的岩层被加热，涌出时温度高，就成了温泉。ْA spring is groundwater that naturally emerges from rock cracks. If the water passes hot underground rock it warms up and emerges as a hot spring.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�490f82a1b550�body�ٮ当地下岩浆因压力增大或地壳出现裂缝而向上涌出地表时，便形成了火山。多数火山分布在板块边界，尤其是俯冲带和洋中脊一带。��A volcano forms when underground magma rises to the surface because of increased pressure or cracks in the crust. Most volcanoes occur at plate boundaries, especially subduction zones and mid-ocean ridges.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�49c2946999f0�body���蒸发是水面和土壤中的液态水变为水汽进入大气的过程。蒸腾是植物通过叶片把体内水分释放到空气中的过程。两者合称蒸散，是水循环中返回大气的主要途径。�Evaporation is the process by which liquid water from surfaces and soil becomes vapor and enters the atmosphere. Transpiration is how plants release water from their leaves into the air. Together called evapotranspiration, they are the main pathway returning water to the atmosphere.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�4ae6d99c6766�body�و红色是最高级，表示3小时可能下100毫米以上。应尽量不出门，远离河道、低洼和山坡，关注当地通知。ـRed is the top level, meaning over 100 mm in 3 hours. Stay indoors, avoid rivers, low areas and slopes, and follow local alerts.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�4b9fa830333b�body��x树木和草能固定土壤、降低风速，像“挡风墙”和“地毯”一样，让沙子不容易被吹起来。�kTrees and grass hold the soil and slow the wind, acting like a wall and a carpet so sand is harder to lift.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�4bf76a1768d0�body���煤是一种可燃有机岩，由远古植物遗体在沼泽中堆积，经长期压实、缺氧和煤化作用形成。它属沉积岩的特殊类型，记录了古植被和古气候信息。��Coal is a combustible organic rock formed from ancient plant remains accumulating in swamps and undergoing long compaction, oxygen-poor conditions and coalification. It is a special type of sedimentary rock recording past vegetation and climate.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�4c0f29a94ce8�body���是。食盐的主要成分是石盐（氯化钠），是天然形成、有固定成分和立方晶体结构的无机固体，符合矿物定义。它常在干涸盐湖或蒸发岩中成层出现。��Yes. Table salt's main component is halite (sodium chloride), a naturally formed inorganic solid with a fixed composition and cubic crystal structure, fitting the definition of a mineral. It often appears in layers in dried salt lakes or evaporites.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�4fc6f9a8c47d�body���许多沙漠位于副热带高压带，下沉气流抑制降水，加之远离海洋、水汽难以到达。还有一些沙漠处于山脉背风坡，湿润气流翻山后水分耗尽，形成雨影区。��Many deserts lie in subtropical high-pressure belts where sinking air suppresses rainfall, and far from oceans so moisture cannot arrive. Others sit in the rain shadow on the lee side of mountains, where air loses its moisture after crossing the peaks.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�502c6fcffbc9�body��u强风会把花盆、杂物吹落砸伤路人，也可能打碎玻璃。收好重物、关紧门窗能减少伤害。�Strong wind can blow pots and clutter down onto people or smash windows. Securing heavy items and closing windows reduces harm.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�554820c3468f�body���雷暴云内冰晶和雨滴碰撞使电荷分离，云顶积累正电、云底积累负电。当电荷差足够大时，空气被击穿，形成明亮的放电通道即闪电。闪电加热空气产生冲击波，就是我们听到的雷声。�eInside a thundercloud, collisions between ice crystals and raindrops separate electric charges, with positive charge building at the top and negative charge at the bottom. When the charge difference is large enough the air breaks down and a bright discharge channel, lightning, forms. The lightning heats the air and creates a shock wave we hear as thunder.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�558bcafc1cf5�body���地球内部温度很高，岩石部分熔化形成岩浆。当岩浆中的气体和压力在地下越积越多，就会沿着地壳的薄弱裂缝向上冲出地表，形成喷发。喷发的剧烈程度取决于岩浆黏度和气体含量。�.Deep inside the Earth, high temperatures partly melt rock into magma. As gas and pressure build up underground, the magma forces its way up through weak cracks in the crust and bursts onto the surface, producing an eruption. How violent the eruption is depends on the magma's viscosity and gas content.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�5c1df3bd2f93�body�ٍ雪融化时要吸收周围的热量（熔化吸热），加上融雪后地面潮湿、夜间辐射降温快，所以常觉得化雪更冷。نMelting snow absorbs heat from its surroundings, and the wet ground then cools quickly at night, so it often feels colder during thaw.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�5dc3cfdc2ca8�body���海冰是海水直接在低温下冻结形成的冰，漂浮在海面并随季节消长。冰山则是陆地冰川或冰盖断裂后滑入海中漂浮的淡水冰块。冰山体积可非常巨大，是航海中的潜在危险。�Sea ice forms by the direct freezing of seawater and floats on the surface, growing and melting with the seasons. An iceberg is a chunk of fresh water broken off a land glacier or ice sheet that floats in the ocean. Icebergs can be enormous and pose a hazard to navigation.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�5fba1120f305�body���冰雹是强雷暴中形成的冰粒，被上升气流反复托起、在过冷云水中层层包裹增大，直到太重而降落。它多见于春夏季节的对流旺盛地区。较大的冰雹会砸伤作物和损坏车辆。�Hail is ice pellets formed in severe thunderstorms, repeatedly lifted by updrafts and coated with supercooled cloud water until they grow too heavy and fall. It is common in convective regions during spring and summer. Large hail can damage crops and vehicles.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�5fcd0663db8e�body��8岩石按成因分为火成岩（由岩浆冷却凝固形成，如花岗岩、玄武岩）、沉积岩（由碎屑或化学沉淀经压实胶结形成，如砂岩、石灰岩）和变质岩（原有岩石在高温高压下改变而成，如大理岩、片岩）。这三类通过“岩石循环”相互转化。�gRocks are classified by origin into igneous (formed by cooling of magma, e.g., granite, basalt), sedimentary (formed by compaction and cementation of fragments or chemical precipitates, e.g., sandstone, limestone), and metamorphic (altered from existing rock by heat and pressure, e.g., marble, schist). They transform into one another through the rock cycle.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�632197e4b143�body�ل洋是广阔连续的主体水域，海是洋的边缘部分，多被大陆或岛屿包围，如地中海是海、太平洋是洋。٣An ocean is the vast continuous body of water; a sea is its marginal part often enclosed by land or islands, e.g. the Mediterranean is a sea, the Pacific an ocean.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�64844b3b367b�body���地震预警利用地震波中速度快但破坏小的P波先到达、再抢在破坏性S波之前发出警报。虽然无法预测地震何时发生，但可在震后数秒到数十秒内向远处发出预警。��Earthquake early warning uses the fact that fast but less damaging P-waves arrive before destructive S-waves to issue alerts. It cannot predict when a quake will strike, but can warn distant areas seconds to tens of seconds after one begins.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�6cfda6115bc4�body�ٮ地下水温受地温影响，随深度变化很小，常年稳定在十几摄氏度。相比地表气温的季节大幅波动，抽取上来的井水就显得冬暖夏凉。��Groundwater temperature tracks the stable geothermal gradient and varies little with depth, staying around a steady teens of degrees Celsius. Compared with large seasonal swings at the surface, pumped well water feels warm in winter and cool in summer.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�6f828e0c791d�body�ٓ月球引力把正对和背对它的海水微微抬起，地球自转让各地每天经过这两处“鼓包”，所以一天通常两涨两落。ًThe Moon's gravity bulges the ocean on the near and far sides; Earth's spin carries each place through both bulges, giving two tides daily.�ans��src��)加里森《海洋学》，Cengage，2015�JGarrison, T., Oceanography: An Invitation to Marine Science, Cengage, 2015��id�70752840bc69�body��{往高处跑，如楼上、山坡或指定的避难场所，别往地下室或低洼处躲，也不要蹚陌生的浑水。يMove to high ground—upper floors, a hillside or a designated shelter. Avoid basements, low spots and wading through unknown murky water.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�713b5637ef6c�body�ٷ科学家通过冰芯、树木年轮、湖泊沉积和珊瑚等自然档案重建古气候。这些载体记录了温度、降水和大气成分的变化，像一本本自然日记。��Scientists reconstruct past climates from natural archives like ice cores, tree rings, lake sediments and corals. These record changes in temperature, precipitation and atmospheric composition, acting like natural diaries.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�731be1bac442�body��{植被被破坏、土壤变松后，大风一吹就把干土和沙卷上天；地表越光秃，能飞的沙尘就越多。�vWhen plants vanish and soil loosens, wind lifts dry dust and sand; the barer the land, the more dust becomes airborne.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�74db998f4b15�body���煤、石油和天然气在燃烧时释放大量二氧化碳，这是最主要的温室气体。工业革命以来其用量猛增，使大气二氧化碳浓度显著升高。增强的温室效应导致全球气温上升。�Burning coal, oil, and natural gas releases large amounts of carbon dioxide, the chief greenhouse gas. Use has surged since the Industrial Revolution, raising atmospheric carbon dioxide concentration markedly. The strengthened greenhouse effect drives global temperature rise.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�7836a5275cce�body���岩石主要分为火成岩、沉积岩和变质岩三大类。火成岩由岩浆冷却形成，沉积岩由碎屑或化学沉淀堆积而成，变质岩则是原有岩石在高温高压下改变而成。�Rocks are mainly divided into three groups: igneous, sedimentary, and metamorphic. Igneous rocks form from cooled magma, sedimentary rocks from accumulated debris or chemical precipitates, and metamorphic rocks from existing rocks altered by heat and pressure.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�7ba0c6ed6695�body��m当高空和近地面气温都降到0℃以下，云里的水汽会直接凝结成冰晶飘落，就是雪。�xWhen temperatures aloft and near the ground fall below 0°C, cloud moisture freezes into ice crystals that fall as snow.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�7bbe4b184f6e�body��{矿物是天然形成、成分固定、有规则晶体结构的无机固体，如石英、方解石、食盐都是矿物。كA mineral is a natural, inorganic solid with a fixed composition and ordered crystal structure, like quartz, calcite or table salt.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�7e9a02035798�body���火山喷发前常出现地表膨胀隆起、频繁的小地震、气体排放量异常增加和温度升高等现象。科学家利用这些监测数据来评估喷发风险并发出预警。��Before an eruption, volcanoes often show ground swelling, frequent small earthquakes, unusual increases in gas emission, and rising temperatures. Scientists use this monitoring data to assess eruption risk and issue warnings.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�7ebc7101e82a�body�٫雾和云本质上都是悬浮在近地面或高空的小水滴或冰晶集合。区别在于雾贴近地表、使能见度明显下降，而云悬浮在较高的空中。��Fog and clouds are essentially both collections of tiny water droplets or ice crystals suspended in the air. The difference is that fog hugs the ground and sharply reduces visibility, while clouds float higher up.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�8086138049bc�body��o黄河流经黄土高原，裹走大量疏松的黄土泥沙，水因此发黄，下游还常淤积、改道。ٍThe Yellow River crosses the Loess Plateau and carries huge amounts of loose yellow silt, tinting its water and building sediment downstream.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�80f2b2222845�body���非鸟类恐龙在约6600万年前的白垩纪-古近纪界线大灭绝中消失，很可能由小行星撞击和大规模火山活动共同触发。鸟类是恐龙的直系后代，延续至今。��Non-avian dinosaurs vanished about 66 million years ago at the Cretaceous–Paleogene boundary, likely triggered by an asteroid impact together with massive volcanism. Birds are their direct descendants and survive today.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�80f30e2e3f0c�body���空气中的水汽在凝结核上凝结成云滴，云滴通过碰撞合并不断增大。当水滴重到上升气流托不住时，便降落成为雨。地形抬升、对流和锋面活动都能促使水汽凝结成雨。�Water vapor in the air condenses onto tiny particles to form cloud droplets, which grow by colliding and merging. When a droplet becomes too heavy for the updraft to support, it falls as rain. Orographic lift, convection, and frontal activity all help condense vapor into rain.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�83317eeece28�body���湿地是地表常年或季节性积水的过渡地带，如沼泽、滩涂和红树林。它能调蓄洪水、净化水质，并为众多动植物提供栖息地。湿地因此被称为地球之肾。�Wetlands are transitional zones that are flooded year-round or seasonally, such as marshes, mudflats, and mangroves. They store floodwater, purify water quality, and provide habitat for many plants and animals. That is why wetlands are called the kidneys of the Earth.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�834e28c119c1�body���珊瑚礁是由珊瑚虫分泌的碳酸钙骨骼长期堆积形成的水下结构，常见于温暖清澈的热带浅海。它们只占海洋面积的一小部分，却养育了极高比例的海洋物种。�A coral reef is an underwater structure built from the calcium-carbonate skeletons secreted by coral polyps over time, common in warm, clear tropical shallows. Though covering only a small fraction of the ocean, reefs support a very high proportion of marine species.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�85d545e3c02d�body��]太阳加热不均使空气温度密度不同，高压空气流向低压，就形成了风。�wUneven solar heating makes air differ in temperature and density, so air flows from high to low pressure, forming wind.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�8966777d1dd0�body�ٸ流动的河水以冲刷、磨蚀和搬运泥沙的方式切割河床和岸坡，天长日久把地表刻出V形谷。洪水期侵蚀更强，平原区则易摆动形成弯曲河道。��Flowing water cuts beds and banks by scouring, abrasion and carrying sediment, carving V-shaped valleys over time. Erosion is stronger in floods, and on plains rivers meander and shift their courses.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�905caf04e1c5�body��y海拔是某点高出平均海平面的垂直距离。珠峰高度以黄海平均海平面为基准测算，约8849米。وElevation is the vertical distance above mean sea level. Everest's height is measured from the Yellow Sea mean sea level, about 8,849 m.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�96c07287bde9�body���海平面上升主要源于两方面：全球变暖使海水受热膨胀，以及陆地冰川和冰盖融化把更多水注入海洋。这对沿海低地和岛屿构成淹没与风暴潮加剧的威胁。��Sea-level rise mainly comes from two effects: warming oceans expand in volume, and melting land ice and ice sheets add water to the sea. This threatens low-lying coasts and islands with inundation and stronger storm surges.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�9cb428306a62�body�ٴ在地质年代表中，「代」比「纪」更大一级：一个代包含若干个纪。例如显生宙分为古生代、中生代和新生代，每个代又细分为多个纪。��In the geologic time scale, an era is a larger unit than a period: one era contains several periods. For example, the Phanerozoic Eon is divided into Paleozoic, Mesozoic and Cenozoic eras, each further split into periods.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�9d0a7d35a352�body���按高度和形态，云主要分为卷云、积云和层云三大类，再细分为更多类型。例如蓬松像棉花糖的是积云，高空纤细如丝的是卷云，均匀铺满天空的是层云。��By height and shape, clouds are mainly grouped as cirrus, cumulus, and stratus, with many subtypes. For example, puffy cotton-like clouds are cumulus, wispy high-altitude ones are cirrus, and uniform sheets covering the sky are stratus.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�9dbfef028d3f�body��~臭氧洞是南极春季平流层臭氧被人为化学物质消耗后出现的稀薄区域，使更多紫外线到达地面。ُThe ozone hole is a thin patch of stratospheric ozone over Antarctica in spring, caused by man-made chemicals letting more UV reach the ground.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�9e003bb170c4�body��{桑拿天指高温高湿、闷热无风的天气。湿度大时汗水难蒸发，身体散不掉热，所以特别难受。ِ“Sauna weather” means hot, humid and still air. High humidity stops sweat from evaporating, so the body cannot shed heat and it feels awful.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�9e22cc34ad96�body��{风化是岩石在原地被温度、水、植物等破坏分解；侵蚀是风、水流等把这些碎屑搬运到别处。�sWeathering breaks rock in place by temperature, water and plants; erosion carries the debris away by wind or water.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�a0ec07968a4b�body���水循环靠太阳能量驱动，海洋和陆面的水蒸发成水汽进入大气。水汽随气流运动，遇冷凝结成云并降水回到地面。降水流经河流、湖泊和地下，最终又回大海，循环不息。�LThe water cycle is driven by solar energy: water from oceans and land surfaces evaporates into vapor and enters the atmosphere. The vapor moves with air currents, condenses into clouds, and returns to the surface as precipitation. The water then flows through rivers, lakes, and groundwater before eventually reaching the sea again.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�aa65499ea59b�body��大洋地壳以玄武岩为主，密度较大（约2.9–3.0 g/cm³）、较薄（约7公里），且年龄普遍较年轻。大陆地壳以花岗岩类岩石为主，密度较小（约2.7 g/cm³）、较厚（约30–50公里），并可保存数十亿年的古老岩石。�Oceanic crust is mostly basaltic, denser (about 2.9–3.0 g/cm³), thinner (about 7 km), and geologically young. Continental crust is richer in granitic rocks, less dense (about 2.7 g/cm³), thicker (about 30–50 km), and can preserve rocks billions of years old.�ans��src��eTarbuck & Lutgens《地球：物理地质学导论》（Earth: An Introduction to Physical Geology）�?Tarbuck & Lutgens, 'Earth: An Introduction to Physical Geology'��id�ab83c5af9a7d�body�ه风眼是台风中心，空气在这里下沉而不是上升，云少风小；但风眼墙壁（眼墙）却是风雨最猛的地方。ٛThe eye is the typhoon's center where air sinks rather than rises, so it is clear and calm, while the surrounding eyewall has the strongest winds and rain.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�ae1202659cc3�body���冰期是地球长期寒冷、冰川大规模扩展的时期。我们目前处于约260万年前开始的第四纪大冰期中，只是处在其内部的间冰期（较暖阶段），冰川仍覆盖南极和格陵兰。��An ice age is a long cold period with large glacier expansion. We are within the Quaternary ice age that began about 2.6 million years ago, currently in a warmer interglacial phase, with ice still covering Antarctica and Greenland.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�ae3511110b67�body�ف岩石圈是地球最外层由岩石组成的坚硬外壳，包括地壳和上地幔顶部。板块就在岩石圈之上漂移。ٌThe lithosphere is Earth's rigid outer shell made of rock, including the crust and the top of the mantle. Tectonic plates move on top of it.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�b02ce39b1e8c�body��c室内温暖的空气含较多水汽，碰到冰冷的玻璃变冷，水汽就凝结成小水珠。�yWarm indoor air holds more moisture; when it touches the cold glass it cools, and the vapor condenses into tiny droplets.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�b1c9cae65541�body��s约6600万年前白垩纪末，一次小行星撞击和火山等活动导致大规模灭绝，非鸟恐龙消失。ٔAround 66 million years ago at the end of the Cretaceous, an asteroid impact and volcanism caused a mass extinction that killed non-avian dinosaurs.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�b1e06c3748cb�body�ه有。无数空调外机、汽车和建筑材料把热量排到室外，再加上绿地少，城市中心往往比郊区热好几度。٣Yes. Countless AC units, cars and building materials dump heat outdoors, and with little greenery the city center is often several degrees hotter than the suburbs.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�b285ccae7a02�body���海浪主要由风刮过海面、把能量传给海水而形成，风越大、吹得越久越远，浪就越高。海啸等巨浪则多由海底地震或火山引起，与日常风浪成因不同。��Ocean waves are mainly generated when wind blows across the surface and transfers energy to the water; stronger, longer, and farther winds make bigger waves. Giant waves like tsunamis, however, are caused by undersea earthquakes or volcanoes, not wind.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�b3022f241688�body���注意报（watch）表示某地区气象条件有利于龙卷风生成，需保持警惕；预警（warning）则表示龙卷风已被雷达或目击确认，已实际发生，应立即避险。��A watch means conditions in an area favor tornado formation, so stay alert; a warning means a tornado has been confirmed by radar or sight and is actually occurring, so take shelter immediately.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�b414670c3424�body���热浪指某一地区出现持续异常高温的天气过程，通常伴随晴朗少雨和静稳大气。它会增加中暑和心脑血管疾病的死亡风险，并加重电力负荷。城市热岛效应会使热浪影响更明显。�A heat wave is a period of abnormally and persistently high temperatures in a region, usually with clear, dry, and stagnant air. It raises the risk of heat stroke and cardiovascular death and strains the power grid. The urban heat island effect makes heat waves more pronounced.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�b45fcde0ebb0�body�ٓ它表示某个地区在预报时段内下雨（或雪）的可能性，比如60%是指相似天气下有六成会降水，并不保证一定下。٪It is the chance that rain or snow will fall in the area during the forecast period; 60% means precipitation occurs in six out of ten similar situations, not a guarantee.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�b4c3bcbbfb3d�body���海洋按光照和温度大致分为透光层、弱光层（中层）和无光层（深层），深层又包括黑暗寒冷的深层与海底。不同水层光照、温度和生物群落差异显著。��By light and temperature the ocean is roughly split into the sunlit epipelagic, the dim mesopelagic (twilight), and the dark bathypelagic (deep), down to the seafloor. These layers differ sharply in light, temperature, and the life they host.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�b73a1731be50�body���海平面上升会加剧风暴潮和海岸侵蚀，使低洼城区更易被淹没。它还会让咸水侵入地下淡水和农田，影响饮水与农业。许多沿海大城市因此被迫投资海堤和排水系统。�2Sea level rise worsens storm surges and coastal erosion, making low-lying districts more prone to flooding. It also lets salt water intrude into underground fresh water and farmland, affecting drinking water and agriculture. Many coastal megacities are therefore investing in seawalls and drainage systems.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�b92367d260fd�body��c死海盐度极高，湖水比普通海水重很多，浮力大，人躺在水面很难沉下去。�VThe Dead Sea is extremely salty and dense, so its buoyancy keeps people afloat easily.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�bb4d1439f54d�body��c太阳晒热海洋和湖泊使水蒸发成云，降水落回地面，再汇成河流流回大海。�ZThe sun evaporates water into clouds; rain falls and flows through rivers back to the sea.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�bc0ec1c1d0a5�body���火成岩由岩浆冷却凝固形成；沉积岩由碎屑或化学沉淀经压实胶结而成；变质岩则是已有岩石在高温高压下改变结构矿物形成。三类岩石可经地质循环相互转化。�Igneous rocks form by cooling and solidifying magma; sedimentary rocks by compaction and cementation of fragments or chemical precipitates; metamorphic rocks by alteration of existing rock under heat and pressure. The three transform into each other through the rock cycle.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�bc42cf59676d�body���冰雹在强对流云（积雨云）中形成，云内强烈上升气流把水滴反复带到高空冻结、裹上冰层。当冰粒重到上升气流托不住时便落向地面，体积可大可小。��Hail forms inside strong convective clouds (cumulonimbus), where powerful updrafts carry water droplets high into freezing air, adding layers of ice. When the pellet grows too heavy for the updraft, it falls to the ground, varying greatly in size.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�bf44a56f0c11�body��全球海平面上升主要有两个原因：海水因变暖而膨胀，以及陆地冰川和冰盖融化把更多水注入海洋。工业化以来人类活动导致气候变暖，使这两方面都在加剧。海平面上升会威胁沿海城市和岛国。�Global sea level rise has two main causes: seawater expands as it warms, and melting land ice and ice sheets add more water to the ocean. Since industrialization, human activity has driven warming that worsens both effects. Rising seas threaten coastal cities and island nations.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�c09acd4d2261�body���当云中温度足够低、水汽直接在冰晶上凝华时，便形成六角形的雪花。冰晶在下落过程中不断生长、相互碰撞，聚成雪片。气温接近0摄氏度时雪花容易黏结成湿雪。��When clouds are cold enough for water vapor to deposit directly onto ice crystals, six-sided snowflakes form. The crystals grow and collide as they fall, clumping into snowflakes. Near 0 degrees Celsius the flakes tend to stick together as wet snow.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�c0fda23322ae�body�ٍ碳足迹是你日常活动排放的温室气体总量。少开车多公交、节约用电、减少浪费，就能降低自己的碳足迹。يYour carbon footprint is the total greenhouse gas from your daily life. Less driving, saving electricity and reducing waste all shrink it.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�c2630ca533d3�body���天气是某地短时间的冷热阴晴，可能几小时就变；气候则是该地区几十年的平均天气状况。简单说，天气是你每天穿什么，气候是你衣橱里该准备什么。��Weather is the short-term state of the atmosphere in one place, changing within hours; climate is the average weather of a region over decades. Put simply, weather is what you wear today, climate is what your wardrobe should contain.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�c40d53d1835f�body���河流通常发源于山地或高原，源头多为冰川融水、山泉或降水汇集的溪流。水流沿地势向下汇合，逐渐形成更大的河道。源头的水量虽小，却决定了河流的基本性质。��Rivers usually begin in mountains or plateaus, where the source is often glacier melt, springs, or streams fed by rainfall. The water flows downhill and merges to form larger channels. Though small at the source, it sets the river's basic character.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�c55b249304b9�body�ٴ地球从外到内主要分为地壳、地幔和地核三层。地壳是薄薄的最外层，地幔占地球体积的大部分，而地核又可分为液态外核和固态内核。�From the outside in, the Earth is mainly divided into three layers: the crust, the mantle, and the core. The crust is a thin outermost shell, the mantle makes up most of the Earth's volume, and the core is split into a liquid outer core and a solid inner core.�ans��src��3地球物理标准分层模型（地震波研究）�5Standard geophysical Earth model from seismic studies��id�c6670d594f2e�body���最高的大型火山是夏威夷的冒纳罗亚，从洋底算高度超过9000米，比珠峰还高，但大部分没入海中。若按陆地高度，阿根廷的奥霍斯-德尔萨拉多约6900米最高。��The tallest volcano is Mauna Loa in Hawaii, over 9,000 m from its base on the ocean floor, taller than Everest but mostly submerged. By land height, Argentina's Ojos del Salado at about 6,900 m is highest.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�c67faa501ded�body���泉水是地下水在自然出露点涌出地表形成的水流。当地下水位高于地面或遇到断层、不透水层阻挡时，水便从孔隙或裂隙中流出。许多名泉既是水源也具有景观价值。��A spring is groundwater that emerges naturally at the surface. When the water table rises above ground or meets a fault or impermeable layer, water flows out through pores or fractures. Many famous springs serve as water sources and scenic attractions.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�c6ac2eab9d2c�body���地质学家把地球约46亿年历史按重大事件分成宙、代、纪、世等层级。划分依据包括化石变化、地层界限和同位素测年，越近的时间单位划分越细。��Geologists divide Earth's ~4.6 billion years into eons, eras, periods and epochs by major events. The basis includes fossil changes, stratigraphic boundaries and isotopic dating, with finer divisions nearer the present.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�c7eadb70750e�body�ٖ我国常用蓝、黄、橙、红四级，颜色越深风越强：蓝色注意、黄色加强、橙色停课停工、红色最高级需特别防范。ٲChina uses blue, yellow, orange and red; darker means stronger wind: blue means beware, yellow stronger, orange close schools and work, red is the top level needing special care.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�c9a4fe00c4ce�body���夏季陆地比海洋升温快，形成低压，把海洋上潮湿的空气吸引过来。这些饱含水汽的气流登陆后抬升、冷却，形成大量降水，所以季风区夏季常多雨。��In summer the land heats faster than the ocean and forms low pressure, pulling in moist air from the sea. That vapor-laden air rises and cools after reaching land, producing heavy rainfall, so monsoon regions are typically rainy in summer.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�ca74c8df6361�body�ٷ是的，冰川和冰盖储存了地球约三分之二以上的淡水资源，主要集中在南极和格陵兰。它们在调节全球水循环和海平面方面起着关键作用。ټYes, glaciers and ice sheets store more than two-thirds of Earth's fresh water, mainly in Antarctica and Greenland. They play a key role in regulating the global water cycle and sea level.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�cb707bdb645d�body�ٷ风化是岩石在地表因温度、水、空气和生物作用而破碎分解的过程，但不移动位置。它把坚硬岩石变成土壤和碎屑，是地貌塑造的第一步。��Weathering is the breaking and decomposition of rock at the surface by temperature, water, air and living things, without moving the material. It turns hard rock into soil and debris, the first step in shaping landforms.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�ccb75a3fb74b�body�ٺ臭氧层位于平流层中，由臭氧分子组成，能吸收大部分有害的太阳紫外线。它的损耗曾因氟利昂等人造物质而加剧，后经国际协议得到保护。��The ozone layer sits in the stratosphere and absorbs most harmful solar ultraviolet radiation. Its depletion was worsened by human-made substances like CFCs but is now recovering under international agreements.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�cd81e65f0f77�body�ټ水结冰体积膨胀约9%，在岩石缝隙中产生的压力可达很高，反复冻融像楔子一样把裂缝撑大，最终使石块崩落。这种作用在高山和寒区最常见。��Water expands about 9% when freezing, exerting high pressure in rock cracks; repeated freeze-thaw acts like a wedge widening fractures until chunks break off. This is most common in mountains and cold regions.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�cda37dcbbd4b�body���雾本质上就是贴近地面的云，由水汽在低温下凝结成悬浮小水滴形成。与高空云不同，雾出现在地表，会降低能见度。辐射雾常见于晴朗静风的夜晚，平流雾多见于暖湿空气流经冷海面。�9Fog is essentially a cloud that touches the ground, formed when water vapor condenses into suspended droplets in cool air. Unlike high clouds, fog occurs at the surface and reduces visibility. Radiation fog forms on clear calm nights, while advection fog appears when warm moist air flows over a cold sea surface.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�cdc3c4d216c6�body���自然条件下土壤形成极其缓慢，通常每形成1厘米表土需要数十年到上百年，取决于气候、母岩和生物活动。因此土壤被视为不可再生的珍贵资源。��Under natural conditions soil forms very slowly; one centimeter of topsoil often takes decades to centuries, depending on climate, parent rock and living activity. Soil is thus treated as a precious, nearly non-renewable resource.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�ce5c5e6f3776�body�ل主要来自干旱区裸露的戈壁、荒漠和干涸湖床，强风把疏松的沙尘卷上高空，一路吹到很远的地方。�hMainly from bare gobi, desert and dried lake beds; strong wind lofts loose dust high and carries it far.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�ce8c933a475d�body�ٜ沙丘是风把松散沙粒搬运、堆积成的小山丘，常见于沙漠和海岸。它的迎风坡缓、背风坡陡，形状会随风向缓慢移动。��A sand dune is a mound of loose sand transported and piled up by wind, common in deserts and along coasts. It has a gentle windward slope and a steep lee slope, and its shape slowly migrates with the wind.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�d5534e313485�body���地下水主要来自降水渗入土壤和岩层空隙，在重力作用下向下汇集。它储存在含水层里，是重要的淡水资源，全球可用的淡水很大一部分是地下水。��Groundwater mainly comes from precipitation seeping into soil and rock voids, collecting downward under gravity. Stored in aquifers, it is a vital freshwater resource, making up a large share of usable global freshwater.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�d64f7caf8c3c�body���地球大气约78%是氮气、21%是氧气，其余为氩、二氧化碳和少量其他气体。二氧化碳虽只占约0.04%，却是关键的温室气体。水蒸气含量随地点和天气变化很大。�Earth's atmosphere is about 78 percent nitrogen and 21 percent oxygen, with the rest made up of argon, carbon dioxide, and trace gases. Although carbon dioxide is only about 0.04 percent, it is a crucial greenhouse gas. Water vapor varies greatly by location and weather.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�da91bc039da1�body��w泥石流是暴雨或融雪把山坡上的土石、泥沙和水混成一股洪流,迅猛冲下山谷,破坏力很强。�|A debris flow is a fast river of mud, rock and water set loose by heavy rain or melt, rushing down valleys with great force.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�de3b8567bb48�body�ف一般先取水，再混凝沉淀去掉泥沙，过滤，最后加氯消毒杀菌，合格后才通过管道送到每家每户。ْTypically water is drawn, then coagulated and settled to remove silt, filtered, and finally disinfected with chlorine before being piped to homes.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�df8add160fe2�body�ٍ备上饮用水、压缩食品、手电、哨子、创可贴、常用药和充电宝，装在一个好拿的包里，灾难时能撑几天。ٖPack water, compact food, a flashlight, whistle, band-aids, regular medicine and a power bank in an easy-to-grab bag so you can cope for several days.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�e0c540da5aa4�body���地球由外向内依次是地壳、地幔、外核和内核。地壳最薄，地幔最厚（占体积最大），外核为液态金属、内核为固态金属，地核主要由铁和镍组成。�From outside in, Earth consists of the crust, the mantle, the outer core, and the inner core. The crust is thinnest, the mantle is thickest (largest by volume), the outer core is liquid metal, the inner core is solid metal, and the core is composed mainly of iron and nickel.�ans��src��<Press & Siever,《Understanding Earth》W. H. Freeman 多版�LF. Press and R. Siever, Understanding Earth, W. H. Freeman, various editions��id�e214c09ad539�body���当动植物死亡后被泥沙迅速掩埋，其硬体部分在地下经过漫长岁月被矿物替换，便形成化石。化石记录了远古生命的形态，是了解地球生命历史的重要证据。�When plants or animals die and are quickly buried by sediment, their hard parts can be slowly replaced by minerals underground over long periods, forming fossils. Fossils record the shapes of ancient life and are key evidence for understanding the history of life on Earth.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�e41630240cdc�body�ٱ会。化肥农药下渗、生活污水和工业废水渗漏、垃圾填埋场渗滤液都可污染含水层。地下水流动慢、自净弱，一旦污染往往很难恢复。��Yes. Fertilizer and pesticide infiltration, leaking sewage and industrial wastewater, and landfill leachate can all pollute aquifers. Groundwater flows slowly and self-purifies poorly, so once contaminated it is hard to restore.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�e44bee0d7498�body�ٷ土壤是矿物质颗粒、有机质、水分和空气的混合物。矿物质来自岩石风化，有机质来自腐烂的植物动物，三者比例决定土壤的肥力和结构。��Soil is a mixture of mineral particles, organic matter, water and air. Minerals come from weathered rock, organic matter from decayed plants and animals, and their proportions decide the soil's fertility and structure.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�e55ab1a97cec�body���侵蚀是外力把岩石土壤剥落并搬走的过程，如流水冲刷；堆积是搬运的物质因速度减慢而沉积下来的过程，如河口成陆。二者此消彼长塑造地形。��Erosion is the removal and transport of rock and soil by agents like flowing water; deposition is the settling of carried material when speed drops, as at river mouths. Their balance shapes terrain.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�e63bf66078a2�body���地球自转轴相对公转轨道面倾斜约23.5度，使不同季节里太阳直射点在南北回归线之间移动。夏季半球接收到的阳光更集中、白昼更长，冬季则相反。这种日照差异带来了春夏秋冬的循环。�KEarth's rotation axis is tilted about 23.5 degrees relative to its orbital plane, so the subsolar point moves between the tropics over the year. The summer hemisphere receives more concentrated sunlight and has longer days, while the winter hemisphere gets the opposite. This difference in insolation produces the cycle of seasons.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�e7052f8e2ab7�body�٫高原是海拔较高、顶面相对平坦广阔的抬升地形，边缘常以陡坡与低地相接。它可由火山熔岩覆盖或构造抬升形成，如青藏高原。��A plateau is an elevated area with a broad, relatively flat top, often bounded by steep slopes dropping to lower land. It can form from lava flows or tectonic uplift, as with the Tibetan Plateau.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�ea571ec4790a�body���雷暴云内电荷分离，当电位差足够大时空气被击穿放电形成闪电，瞬间加热空气使其急剧膨胀发出轰鸣，这就是雷。因为光比声快，我们总是先见闪电后闻雷声。�Inside a storm cloud, separated charges discharge through the air as lightning when the voltage is high enough, and the flash instantly heats the air so it expands explosively into the rumble we call thunder. Light travels faster than sound, so we see lightning before we hear thunder.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�earth_24_002�body���不是一回事。火山灰是被气体猛烈喷射撕碎的微小玻璃质岩石与矿物颗粒,硬度高、熔点低(约800–1200摄氏度即软化)。喷气发动机涡轮前温度恰好落在这个区间:灰粒吸入后被部分熔成黏稠玻璃体,黏附在涡轮叶片上冷却结垢,轻则推力骤降喘振,重则四台发动机空中全停——1982年英航9号航班与1989年KLM867都因此险坠。所以航路一旦发现火山灰云,管制部门宁可大面积绕飞。�
Not the same thing at all. Volcanic ash consists of jagged glassy rock and mineral fragments shattered by expanding gas, hard and low-melting (softening near 800–1200 °C). Turbine inlet temperatures sit right in that range: ingested ash partially melts into sticky glass that coats turbine blades and solidifies, causing surges, thrust loss — even all four engines flaming out in flight, as in the 1982 British Airways Flight 9 and 1989 KLM 867 incidents. That is why air traffic reroutes widely around any ash cloud.�ans��src��KFrancis 与 Oppenheimer,《Volcanoes》第2版,Oxford University Press,2004�PP. Francis and C. Oppenheimer, Volcanoes, 2nd ed., Oxford University Press, 2004��id�earth_24_004�body��三场赛跑同时进行。第一场与破坏性S波赛跑:P波以约6–7公里每秒先行,S波与面波速度慢一半以上、才是晃动主力,两者时间差随距离拉大,离震中越远预警窗口越长。第二场与电波赛跑:无线电比地震波快数万倍,台网数秒内定位定级后,警报可抢在强震动前送达上百公里外。第三场与自己赛跑:最初几秒P波信息有限,系统须权衡快报与误报——墨西哥城与东京的实践证明,几十秒足够让高铁减速、电梯平层。�Three races at once. First, against destructive S waves: primary P waves race ahead at six to seven kilometers per second while S and surface waves lag by half or more, so cities far from the epicenter get longer warning windows. Second, against radio: signals travel tens of thousands of times faster than seismic waves, letting networks locate the event within seconds and alert places a hundred kilometers away before strong motion arrives. Third, against itself: early P waves carry limited information, so systems trade speed against false alarms. Mexico City and Tokyo show tens of seconds suffice to slow trains and level elevators.�ans��src��nKanamori,《地震预警的理念(日本)》,Seismological Research Letters,2004年,第75卷第3期,361-368页�}H. Kanamori, The idea of earthquake early warning in Japan, Seismological Research Letters, 2004, vol. 75, no. 3, pp. 361-368��id�earth_24_016�body��三个条件缺一不可:海表温度超过26.5摄氏度并提供蒸发潜热;一定的初始旋转扰动;以及足够的科氏力让气流开始螺旋汇聚。赤道恰恰是科氏力为零的地带,扰动在那里无法组织成旋涡,所以台风生成区分布在南北纬5度以上;西太平洋的暖水池最大最持久,因此西北太平洋贡献了全球三分之一的台风,也是唯一能出现超强台风级别的海域。登陆后切断水汽补给、摩擦增大,风暴便迅速衰竭——这就是台风怕陆地的原理。��Three ingredients must coexist: sea surface above 26.5 degrees Celsius feeding evaporation, some initial spin disturbance, and enough Coriolis force to organize inflow into a vortex. The equator itself has zero Coriolis force, so no cyclone organizes there — genesis zones sit beyond five degrees latitude. The western Pacific warm pool is largest and longest-lived, spawning a third of all typhoons including the strongest superstorms. Landfall cuts moisture and raises friction, so storms decay fast ashore.�ans��src�ـEmanuel,《Tropical Cyclones》,Annual Review of Earth and Planetary Sciences,2003 (DOI: 10.1146/annurev.earth.31.100901.141259)فK. Emanuel, 'Tropical Cyclones', Annual Review of Earth and Planetary Sciences, 2003, DOI: 10.1146/annurev.earth.31.100901.141259��id�earth_26_003�body��x直答:河口水面展宽、流速骤降,水流挟带的泥沙超出其输送能力而落淤,长期加积并向海推进便成三角洲。机理:粗颗粒先行沉降,细颗粒遇咸淡水混合发生絮凝而加速下沉;泥沙持续堆积迫使河道分汊改道,塑成鸟足状、扇状等形态;波浪与潮汐越强,泥沙沿岸搬走越多,三角洲轮廓也越平直。��At the mouth the current spreads out and slows sharply, so it can no longer carry its load: coarse grains settle first, while clays flocculate on meeting salty water and drop out faster. Sediment keeps accumulating, pushing the shoreline seaward and forcing channels to split and swing, which shapes birdfoot or arcuate plains. The stronger the waves and tides, the more material is swept alongshore and the straighter the resulting coast.�ans��src��wWright,《Sediment transport and deposition at river mouths: A synthesis》,Geological Society of America Bulletin,1977�vWright, 'Sediment transport and deposition at river mouths: A synthesis', Geological Society of America Bulletin, 1977��id�earth_26_005�body���直答:根本驱动力是海陆热力差异的季节性反转。机理:夏季陆地比海洋增温快,大陆低空形成热低压,青藏高原的强烈地表加热进一步增强低压并把空气抬升至高空;印度洋和南海的暖湿气流随西南季风向北推进,雨带沿副热带高压边缘依次带来华南前汛期、江淮梅雨与华北雨季;冬季热力差异反转,盛行干冷的偏北风。��The engine is the seasonal reversal of land-sea thermal contrast. In summer the continent heats faster than the ocean, setting up surface low pressure over Asia that plateau heating intensifies while pumping air aloft. Warm moist flow from the Indian Ocean and the South China Sea pushes north along the subtropical high margin, marching the rain belt through south China rains, Meiyu over the Yangtze valley, and North China rains. In winter the contrast flips and dry northerlies take over.�ans��src�ي丁一汇, Chan,《The East Asian summer monsoon: an overview》,Meteorology and Atmospheric Physics,2005 (DOI: 10.1007/s00703-005-0125-z)كDing, Chan, 'The East Asian summer monsoon: an overview', Meteorology and Atmospheric Physics, 2005, DOI: 10.1007/s00703-005-0125-z��id�earth_26_007�body���直答:取决于河流输入、波浪改造与潮汐搬运三种动力的相对强弱。机理:河流作用占优时,泥沙沿分汊河道快速向海推进,形成外凸的鸟足状,如密西西比三角洲;强波浪把河口沙体沿岸再分配,塑成平滑弧形,如尼日尔和圣弗朗西斯科河三角洲;强潮流往复冲刷分流水道,则造就漏斗状河口与线状沙脊,如恒河—布拉马普特拉河三角洲。��Delta outline records which of three processes prevails: river supply, wave reworking, or tidal transport. River-dominated systems push sediment seaward through branching distributaries into protruding lobes, like the birdfoot Mississippi. Strong waves redistribute mouth sands alongshore into smooth arcs, as at the Niger and São Francisco. Vigorous tides scour channels back and forth, carving funnel mouths fringed with linear ridges, as at the Ganges-Brahmaputra.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�earth_26_014�body���风是主要搬运工：冰期时西北戈壁沙漠中的细粉砂被冬季季风卷起搬运数千公里后沉降堆积形成厚50至80米的黄土覆盖层。黄土中古土壤标记了温暖间冰期使剖面成为古气候档案。��Wind lofted glacial silt from inland deserts settling layer by layer building fifty-to-eighty-meter profiles over two million years. Buried paleosols mark warm intervals making the profile a continuous archive.�ans��src��3刘东生,《黄土与环境》科学出版社,1985�6T. Liu, Loess and the Environment, Science Press, 1985��id�earth_26_020�body���抽水使含水层水头下降，孔隙水压力减小，上覆地层的有效应力随之增大，土体骨架被压密，地表便整体下沉。砂砾层近似弹性，水位回升尚可部分回弹；黏土隔水层的压密是塑性且基本不可逆的，因此停采后大部分沉降也无法恢复。华北平原局部累计沉降已逾两米，沿海还伴生海水入侵，控采、人工回灌与外调水源由此成为治理核心。�Pumping lowers hydraulic heads, pore-water pressure drops, effective stress on the grain skeleton rises, and the aquifer system compacts until the land surface sinks. Sandy layers behave nearly elastically and rebound somewhat when levels recover, but clays compact plastically and irreversibly, so most subsidence persists even after pumping stops. Parts of the North China Plain have subsided more than two meters, with seawater intrusion along the coast, making abstraction limits, artificial recharge and imported water the core remedies.�ans��src�ٗGalloway & Burbey,《Review: Regional land subsidence accompanying groundwater extraction》,Hydrogeology Journal,2011 (DOI: 10.1007/s10040-011-0775-5)ٕGalloway & Burbey, 'Review: Regional land subsidence accompanying groundwater extraction', Hydrogeology Journal, 2011, DOI: 10.1007/s10040-011-0775-5��id�f1f3dd731eb8�body���火山灰和风化后的火山岩富含钾、磷等植物养分，且质地疏松利于保水透气。经过漫长风化，这些矿物质释放到土壤里，使火山周边成为天然的高产农业区。��Volcanic ash and weathered volcanic rock are rich in plant nutrients like potassium and phosphorus and are loose, helping retain water and air. Over long weathering, these minerals enter the soil, making volcanic regions naturally productive farmland.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�f3f0148b0750�body�ٯ恐龙主要繁盛于中生代，包括三叠纪、侏罗纪和白垩纪，约从2.5亿年前到6600万年前。白垩纪末的一次大灭绝结束了非鸟恐龙的统治。��Dinosaurs thrived mainly in the Mesozoic Era, spanning the Triassic, Jurassic and Cretaceous, from about 250 to 66 million years ago. A mass extinction at the Cretaceous end ended non-avian dinosaur dominance.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�f637f58fc41e�body���含水层是能储存并让水顺畅流动的岩层或土层，如砂砾层、裂隙发育的石灰岩。相对地，隔水层（如黏土）几乎不让水通过，可保护或限制地下水。��An aquifer is a rock or soil layer that stores and transmits water readily, like sand-gravel beds or fractured limestone. In contrast, an aquitard such as clay barely lets water pass, protecting or confining groundwater.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�f70ad2ae9099�body��o地震可能断电或让电梯卡住，困在里头更危险；而且余震可能损坏电梯。应走楼梯。�nQuakes can cut power or jam the elevator, trapping you, and aftershocks may damage it. Use the stairs instead.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�f78b9fcf8050�body��l雨后河水暴涨、水流急，还混着垃圾和污水，容易抽筋、被冲走或感染，很危险。فAfter rain the river swells and runs fast, mixed with debris and sewage; cramps, being swept away or infection make it dangerous.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�f842c909ee51�body��~通常分为六大主要板块：太平洋、欧亚、印度洋、非洲、美洲和南极洲板块，还有许多小板块。�vUsually six major plates: Pacific, Eurasian, Indo-Australian, African, American and Antarctic, plus many smaller ones.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�fea62026834a�body�ٖ亿万年前这里曾是温暖浅海，大量浮游生物沉积成富含有机质的岩层，后来被埋藏并转化成石油，储层又好又厚。ٛMillions of years ago it was a warm shallow sea whose plankton formed organic-rich rock that was buried and turned to oil, with excellent thick reservoirs.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�0f11815d269f�body��Y暴洪是强降雨在数小时内使小河与干谷水位骤涨的现象，常见于城市硬化地面和陡峭峡谷，因为下渗少、汇流快。它留给人员的撤离时间极短，破坏力主要来自高速水流与携带的碎屑。美国海洋大气管理局的气象服务与地质调查局都把山区与城市列为高风险区。�iA flash flood is a rapid rise in small streams and dry washes within hours of heavy rain, common in cities with impervious ground and steep canyons where infiltration is low and runoff is fast. It leaves little time to evacuate, and its danger comes from fast water and debris. NOAA's Weather Service and USGS both flag mountainous and urban areas as high risk.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�1121430f03c5�body��{洋流是海洋中大规模定向流动的水体，受风、地球自转和海水密度差驱动，影响气候与渔业。َOcean currents are large-scale directed water flows driven by wind, Earth's rotation and density differences, affecting climate and fisheries.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�2321abcbf742�body��c地幔深处有固定上升的热柱，岩浆穿过板块喷出形成火山，如夏威夷群岛。�[A fixed plume of hot mantle rises and erupts through plates, forming volcanoes like Hawaii.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�3b99478b7c24�body���水循环包括蒸发、植物蒸腾、水汽输送、凝结成云，以及降水与径流回到海洋的过程。太阳能驱动蒸发，重力则引导地表与地下径流汇流。这一循环不断更新淡水资源，是水文系统研究的核心。�4The water cycle includes evaporation, plant transpiration, water-vapor transport, condensation into clouds, and precipitation and runoff back to the ocean. Solar energy drives evaporation while gravity guides surface and subsurface flow. This cycle continually renews freshwater and is the core of hydrology.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�3c3b89ed2c67�body��l海洋热浪是某片海区水温异常偏高并持续多日的事件，会让珊瑚白化、鱼群迁移。�rA marine heatwave is when part of the ocean stays unusually warm for days, bleaching corals and driving fish away.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�3d983cff4316�body��o对流层是最贴近地面的大气层，集中了大部分水汽，风雨雷电等天气都发生在这里。�TThe troposphere is the lowest layer with most water vapor; all weather happens here.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�52d7ac08a16a�body��u月球和太阳对地球的引力使海水周期性涨落，月球影响最大，形成一天两次的潮起潮落。�yThe Moon and Sun's gravity makes seawater rise and fall periodically; the Moon dominates, giving roughly two tides a day.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�54b25ea626af�body��h海拔每升高约1000米气温下降约6℃，因空气稀薄、保温差且上升空气膨胀降温。�zTemperature drops about 6°C per 1000 m of altitude because thin air retains less heat and rising air cools as it expands.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�61d21473fb6a�body��Z气压是空气重量压在地面上的力，越往高处空气越薄，气压就越低。�dAir pressure is the weight of air on the surface; higher up the air is thinner so pressure is lower.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�6d3b06af6311�body��x蓝碳是红树林、海草床和盐沼等海岸植物固定的碳，它们把二氧化碳存在沉积物和根系里。�zBlue carbon is carbon captured by coastal plants like mangroves, seagrass and salt marshes, stored in sediments and roots.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�6f55bac723b5�body�ف地面附近空气被晒得过热，上下层密度差很大，光线弯曲把远处景物折射到眼前，就看到了蜃景。�zHot air near the ground bends light because of sharp density differences, refracting distant scenes into view as a mirage.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�70fb312bd3f3�body��r河流入海入湖时流速减慢，携带的泥沙沉积下来，久而久之形成扇形或三角形的平地。�~Where a river meets the sea or lake its speed drops and deposits sediment, building a fan- or triangle-shaped plain over time.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�8ab0bd578c41�body��{黄土是风力搬运堆积的细粒粉砂，常见于干旱区下风向，如中国黄土高原，土质疏松易侵蚀。�~Loess is fine wind-blown silt deposited downwind of dry regions, such as China's Loess Plateau; it is loose and easily eroded.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�8fd2483f53ae�body�ٍ龙卷风中心气压极低，房屋内外形成巨大压力差，再加上高速旋转的狂风，就可能把屋顶甚至整栋房掀翻。ٰA tornado's center has very low pressure, creating a huge pressure difference across a house, and its fast spinning winds can rip off roofs or even overturn the whole building.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a4520f0552d8�body��o最多是水蒸气，还有二氧化碳、二氧化硫等，二氧化硫多了会形成酸雨并遮挡阳光。�gMostly water vapor, plus carbon dioxide and sulfur dioxide, which can cause acid rain and dim sunlight.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�aa5cf74c1622�body�ل海山是海底隆起、顶部不到海面的死火山，常由板块经过热点时喷发堆积而成，是海洋生物聚集地。�A seamount is a submarine volcano whose top stays below the surface, often built over a hotspot, and a hotspot for marine life.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�b663da48a502�body��月球引力是潮汐的主要成因，它在地球近月侧和背月侧都拉起隆起，形成两个潮汐峰。地球自转使大多数海岸每天经过这两个峰，于是出现约两次涨落。太阳引力叠加则会放大或削弱这些潮汐，形成大潮与小潮。�6The Moon's gravity is the main cause of tides, raising bulges on both the near and far sides of Earth and forming two tidal peaks. Earth's rotation carries most coasts past both bulges each day, giving roughly two rises and falls. The Sun's gravity adds to or subtracts from them, making spring and neap tides.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�bbf661245ff8�body��]城市里水泥路面和建筑吸热多、绿化少，气温常比周围郊区高出几度。�QCities with pavement and little greenery get several degrees warmer than suburbs.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�c923271d6feb�body��_它用10种标准矿物互相刻画比较软硬，从最软的滑石1到最硬的金刚石10。�FIt ranks minerals 1 (talc) to 10 (diamond) by which can scratch which.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�d3610018ff0e�body��`主震之后同一地区发生的一系列较小地震叫余震，可能持续几天到几年。�ZAftershocks are smaller quakes in the same area after a main shock, lasting days to years.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�e28f41b2be05�body��/花岗岩是浅色、富含石英和长石的深成岩，形成于地壳较厚的大陆环境，冷却缓慢故晶粒粗大。玄武岩是深色、贫硅富铁镁的喷出岩，多分布于洋壳，冷却快而常见细粒或玻璃质。两者成分与产出的差异反映了不同板块构造背景。�lGranite is a light-colored, quartz- and feldspar-rich intrusive rock formed in thicker continental crust, cooling slowly so its grains are coarse. Basalt is a dark, silica-poor, iron- and magnesium-rich extrusive rock common in oceanic crust, cooling fast into fine-grained or glassy texture. Their compositional and tectonic differences reflect distinct settings.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�e45e836bda48�body��r黑色沙多来自火山附近的玄武岩，经风化破碎后含铁镁矿物呈黑色，如夏威夷黑沙滩。نBlack sand often comes from basalt near volcanoes; weathered iron-magnesium minerals make it black, as on Hawaiian black-sand beaches.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�earth_24_017�body��+达尔文在贝格尔号航行中提出优雅解释:珊瑚礁贴着缓慢下沉的火山岛生长,岛屿逐渐没入海面,珊瑚为追光持续向上建造,最终留下环绕潟湖的一圈礁环。这一沉降理论预测钻探会在环礁底部打到玄武岩——1952年美国在埃尼威托克的钻孔于千米深处证实了浅水珊瑚化石叠在火山岩上,百年预言应验。如今叠加了冰期海平面波动的修正版本更加精细,但核心逻辑未变:造礁珊瑚对水深苛刻,只能用不间断的生长追平下沉的海底。�>Aboard the Beagle, Darwin proposed elegantly: reefs cling to slowly subsiding volcanoes, corals building upward to keep in sunlight as islands drown, leaving a ring around a lagoon. Subsidence theory predicted drilling would hit basalt beneath atolls — the 1952 Enewetak borehole confirmed shallow-water coral fossils stacked on volcano at kilometer depth, validating a century-old prophecy. Ice-age sea-level swings refined the model later, but the core logic stands: reef corals tolerate only shallow light water, so they must outgrow the sinking seafloor without pause.�ans��src��VDarwin,《The Structure and Distribution of Coral Reefs»,Smith Elder & Co London,1842�XC. Darwin, The Structure and Distribution of Coral Reefs, Smith Elder & Co, London, 1842��id�ef7429d1fb86�body�ف大气河流是天空中一条又长又窄、水汽极多的气流带，像空中输水管，能给沿岸带来暴雨和洪水。ـAn atmospheric river is a long narrow band of very moist air, like a sky pipeline that can dump heavy rain and floods on coasts.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�f9a9a66f308f�body��#物理风化只把岩石机械破碎成更小颗粒，不改变其矿物成分，如冻融、盐结晶和热胀冷缩。化学风化则通过水、氧和酸与矿物反应，生成新矿物或溶解物质，如长石变为黏土。两者常共同作用，决定土壤与沉积物的形成。�bPhysical weathering only breaks rock into smaller pieces without changing its minerals, through freezing, salt crystal growth, or thermal expansion. Chemical weathering reacts minerals with water, oxygen, and acids to form new or dissolved material, such as feldspar turning to clay. The two usually act together, controlling soil and sediment formation.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�fdd0fc25c6b9�body��u岩浆是地下高温熔融的岩石，喷出地表后称为熔岩；成分和气体含量决定喷发猛烈程度。ٖMagma is molten rock underground; once erupted onto the surface it is called lava. Its composition and gas content decide how violent the eruption is.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�0250ff534f76�body��o石英是常见的二氧化硅矿物，硬度大、有玻璃光泽，在沙子和许多岩石里都能找到。�YQuartz is common silica mineral, hard with a glassy luster, found in sand and many rocks.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�06aaa7951790�body�ف地下深厚的盐层比上覆岩石轻，受挤压会像软泥一样向上穿刺，拱起地表形成盐丘，常伴生油气。ٓThick buried salt is lighter than the rock above, so it pierces upward under pressure, arching the surface into a salt dome often with oil and gas.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�0b5a8ce2fad3�body�٥宝石的颜色来自石头里极少量的金属杂质，比如铁让石头发红、铬让它发绿。晶体结构也会改变光的方式，让宝石闪闪发亮。٧A gem's color comes from trace metals in the stone, such as iron making it red or chromium making it green. The crystal structure also bends light so the gem sparkles.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�1118fc030903�body�ل会。像塔克拉玛干这样的大沙漠，冬天夜里气温可降到零度以下，遇到冷空气和水汽就能飘起雪花。�uYes. Deserts like Taklamakan can drop below freezing on winter nights, and with cold air and moisture, snow can fall.�ans��src��=普雷斯、西弗尔《理解地球》，W.H. Freeman，2001�?Press, F. & Siever, R., Understanding Earth, W.H. Freeman, 2001��id�18e0ff465682�body�ٓ枯叶和死去的动植物被细菌和蚯蚓分解，里面的矿物质重回泥土，供新植物吸收。这个循环让土壤一直有养分。ٛFallen leaves and dead creatures are broken down by bacteria and worms, returning minerals to the soil for new plants. This cycle keeps the ground fertile.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�3f561710385e�body�ل遥感是用卫星、飞机或无人机从远处感知地表，通过拍摄不同波段的影像来观察土地、海洋和大气。ُRemote sensing uses satellites, planes or drones to observe the surface from afar, imaging land, ocean and atmosphere in different wavelengths.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�46549c15c3b7�body�ِ风、水和冰不断搬走岩石碎屑，把山削低、把土运走，再堆成新的平原和三角洲。侵蚀让大地面貌慢慢改写。٬Wind, water, and ice constantly carry away rock fragments, lowering mountains and moving soil to build new plains and deltas. Erosion slowly rewrites the shape of the land.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�46b726e998b8�body�ٓ湿地里的水流变慢，泥沙沉底，芦苇等植物和微生物还能吸走污染物和多余养分。湿地就像大地的天然净水器。ٞIn wetlands water slows down so silt settles and reeds, microbes, and soil soak up pollutants and extra nutrients. A wetland works like nature's water filter.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�4d7f41f4fd97�body��v有。像非洲的乞力马扎罗山，虽然在赤道，但海拔近6000米，山顶太冷，终年积着雪和冰。�Yes. Mount Kilimanjaro sits on the equator yet rises nearly 6,000 m, so its peak stays cold enough for year-round snow and ice.�ans��src��N黑斯滕拉特《东非赤道冰川》，University of Wisconsin Press，1984�\Hastenrath, S. (1984), The Glaciers of Equatorial East Africa, University of Wisconsin Press��id�59a84cd73d7c�body��u当河流流经软硬不同的岩层，软岩被冲刷快、硬岩留下，形成陡坎，水流跌落即成瀑布。نWhere a river crosses layers of different hardness, soft rock erodes faster leaving a ledge, and water plunges over it as a waterfall.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�5c458488d330�body���泛大陆是约3亿年前由当时几乎所有大陆拼合而成的一块超级大陆，后来逐渐裂解漂移成今天的各大洲。魏格纳的大陆漂移说最早系统描述了这一假说。��Pangaea was a supercontinent about 300 million years ago that assembled nearly all of Earth's landmasses before breaking apart and drifting into today's continents. Wegener's continental drift theory first described this systematically.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�64413c1224e9�body�ٖ地球自转轴是歪的，极地半年对着太阳、半年背着，于是出现极昼和极夜。夏天太阳不落山，冬天几乎不见太阳。��Earth's axis is tilted, so the poles face the Sun for half the year and away for the other half, creating midnight sun and polar night. In summer the Sun never sets; in winter it barely rises.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�856c9a890e04�body�ٙ河水带着沙石不断磨刷河床和两岸，软岩被切深、硬岩留成台阶，时间久了就刻出山谷。河流是大地缓慢的雕刻刀。پA river carries sand and pebbles that grind the bed and banks, cutting deep through soft rock and leaving hard rock as steps, slowly carving a valley. The river is a slow chisel of the land.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�8f391b00c9ef�body�٢板块漂移经过地幔里固定的热点，熔岩一次次冲破地壳堆成火山，板块移动就留下一排火山。夏威夷群岛就是这样排成的。ٻAs a plate drifts over a fixed hot spot in the mantle, lava breaks through and stacks into a volcano, leaving a chain as the plate moves. The Hawaiian Islands formed in exactly this line.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�95318570ec9c�body��~这些岩层曾是古代海底，后来板块挤压把海底抬升成高山，海洋生物的化石也就被带到了山顶。هThose rocks were once ancient seabeds; plate collisions later lifted the seafloor into mountains, carrying marine fossils to the peaks.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�98ba359af7dd�body��`起名字便于播报和预警，避免混淆，让大家更容易记住和防范某个风暴。�SNames make warnings clear and memorable so people can prepare for a specific storm.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�b46173cace07�body�ٟ海底地震或火山把大块海床猛地抬起，立刻推动上面整层海水形成长长的高浪。浪到浅海时堆得很高，冲上岸就很危险。��An undersea quake or volcano jerks the seafloor upward and shoves the whole water layer above it into a long, fast wave. As it reaches shallow water the wave piles up and becomes dangerous onshore.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�b928ae9bc9da�body��v晴朗无风的夜里地面散热快，贴近物体的温度降到0℃以下，水汽就在上面凝成一层白霜。�hOn clear calm nights the ground cools fast; surfaces below 0°C let water vapor freeze into white frost.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�ba58e2c4160a�body�ٜ夏天陆地比海洋升温快，热空气上升，海上的湿润空气被吸进来下雨，形成季风。冬天方向相反，风从陆地吹向海洋。��In summer the land heats faster than the ocean, warm air rises, and moist sea air is pulled inland bringing rain; that is the monsoon. In winter the pattern reverses and wind blows from land to sea.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�bbef17fe3540�body�ه岩石经风化碎成细粒，再混进枯叶和微小生物，慢慢变成能种东西的土壤。这个过程要花成千上万年。٢Rock breaks into fine grains through weathering and mixes with dead leaves and tiny creatures, slowly becoming fertile soil. The process takes thousands of years.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�bc214928c4ed�body��~在副热带高压带或大山背风处，空气下沉、少雨，加上蒸发强，长期下来就变成了干旱的沙漠。كUnder subtropical highs or behind mountains, air sinks and rains little while evaporation is high, gradually creating arid deserts.�ans��src��D卢特根斯、塔巴克《大气：科学导论》，Pearson，2011�\Lutgens, F.K. & Tarbuck, E.J., The Atmosphere: An Introduction to Meteorology, Pearson, 2011��id�bdd94bb7d999�body�ٟ南北极的巨厚冰盖把大量太阳光反射回太空，帮地球保持凉爽，还存着全球大部分淡水。冰一旦融化，海平面就会上升。٢The thick polar ice sheets reflect sunlight back to space and help keep Earth cool, and they hold most of the planet's fresh water. If they melt, sea level rises.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�c0a73a9ac9f4�body�ٜ阳光在水滴里折射、反射后分散成七色，而每个角度相同的光点连起来恰好是个圆，我们常只看见地平线以上的半边。ٙSunlight refracts and reflects in droplets into colors; points at the same angle form a circle, and we usually see only the upper half above the horizon.�ans��src��D卢特根斯、塔巴克《大气：科学导论》，Pearson，2011�\Lutgens, F.K. & Tarbuck, E.J., The Atmosphere: An Introduction to Meteorology, Pearson, 2011��id�c0ff345014a2�body�٫地下通道里的水被岩浆烤热，底部的水太烫却因压力煮不沸，一旦压力松动就猛地炸成蒸汽喷出来。间歇泉就是这样定时喷热水。��Water in underground channels is heated by magma; deep water gets very hot but cannot boil under pressure, then suddenly bursts as steam when pressure drops. That is why a geyser erupts on schedule.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�c42a67e9d64d�body�ٓ地球从外到内是地壳、地幔和地核，那是按温度和密度自然分层的。沉重的铁镍沉到中心，较轻岩石浮在外层。٬Earth is layered from outside in as crust, mantle, and core, sorted by temperature and density. Heavy iron and nickel sank to the center while lighter rock floated outward.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�c443543f242a�body�٨月球引力把正对和背对它的两边海水微微拉高，地球自转让各地依次经过这两处高水位。太阳也会帮忙，所以潮水跟着月亮走。ٴThe Moon's gravity lifts the ocean slightly on the near and far sides, and Earth's spin carries each coast past those bulges. The Sun adds a smaller pull, so tides follow the Moon.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�c4f564e51dcc�body��x北方降水少、冬季冷，适合耐旱的小麦；南方高温多雨、水田多，正适合喜水喜热的水稻。�zThe dry, cold north suits drought-tolerant wheat; the hot, rainy south with its paddies suits water- and heat-loving rice.�ans��src��$中国气象局《农业气象学》�:China Meteorological Administration (CMA), Agrometeorology��id�c960ea42961c�body�ٟ沙漠空气干、云少，白天太阳直晒升温快，夜里热量很快散到天上，所以昼夜温差极大。有些沙漠白天烫脚、半夜结霜。��Deserts have dry air and few clouds, so days heat up fast under direct sun while nights lose heat quickly to the sky, giving huge day-night swings. Some deserts are scorching by day and frosty at midnight.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�d6f4fda6f58f�body�ٍ含水层是地下能存水的砂石层，雨水渗下去被孔隙留住，像天然水库。人们打井就能取出这些藏起来的水。ٓAn aquifer is a buried layer of sand and rock that stores water in its pores, acting like a natural tank fed by rain. Wells tap this hidden supply.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�db7974515a5b�body��c赤道两侧常年稳定吹向赤道的东风，古代帆船靠它跨洋贸易，所以叫信风。�RSteady easterly winds near the equator that helped old trading ships cross oceans.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�dc62ee5782c1�body�ٟ闪电是一道强大电流穿过空气，温度能冲到约三万摄氏度，比太阳表面还热约五倍。空气被瞬间加热猛胀，就发出雷声。��Lightning is a powerful electric current through the air that reaches about 30,000°C, roughly five times hotter than the Sun's surface. The air heats and expands so fast that it booms as thunder.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�dc6776ab1130�body�ٺ雷暴里上升气流很强，把小冰粒反复托回冰冷的高空，每次都裹上一层新冰。冰粒在云里上下翻滚多次，越长越大，直到风托不住才砸下来。��Inside a thunderstorm the updraft is so strong it carries small ice pellets back into freezing heights, adding a new ice layer each time. The pellet tumbles up and down many times, growing until the wind can no longer hold it.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�de9dbd0e9632�body�ٟ冰川是陆地上多年积累、在自身重力作用下缓慢流动的大体量冰体。它既塑造山谷与海岸，也是全球淡水的重要储存库。��A glacier is a large body of ice on land that has built up over years and moves slowly under its own weight. It both sculpts valleys and coasts and stores a large share of the world's freshwater.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�e5f0188b927c�body��~地磁极是地球磁场近似像一根大磁棒时，磁感线垂直出入地表的两点，和地理南北极并不重合。ٛGeomagnetic poles are where Earth's field lines enter and leave the surface vertically, like a giant bar magnet, and they differ from the geographic poles.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�f4210a58c4f3�body�٫一个地方的气候由纬度、山海位置和离海远近决定，阳光多少和风向都不同。靠近赤道更热，靠海更湿润，所以各地气候不一样。��A place's climate is shaped by its latitude, its mountains and oceans, and its distance from the sea, which change how much sun and wind it gets. The equator is hotter and coasts are wetter, so climates vary.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�f6d99c2ad866�body�ٜ当强冷空气遇上潮湿空气，大量雪花被狂风卷起，能见度变得很低，就成了暴风雪。暴风雪常带来低温和危险的积雪。ٵWhen bitter cold air meets moist air, huge amounts of snow are whipped by fierce wind with very low visibility; that is a blizzard. Blizzards bring freezing cold and dangerous snow.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�fa21f3659c63�body�ِ阴天时厚云把阳光挡住并散射成白光，加上空气中的灰尘和水珠，天空就显得灰白。城市污染也会让天更灰。ٲOn overcast days thick clouds block sunlight and scatter it into white while dust and water drops fill the air, making the sky look gray. City pollution can make it grayer still.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�024800d38e41�body���矿物是天然形成、成分固定、有规则晶体结构的单质或化合物，如石英；岩石则是由一种或多种矿物组成的集合体，如花岗岩。简单说，矿物是零件，岩石是由零件拼成的整体。��A mineral is a naturally formed substance with a fixed composition and ordered crystal structure, like quartz; a rock is an aggregate of one or more minerals, like granite. Simply put, minerals are the parts and rocks are the assemblies built from them.�ans��src��-Nesse《矿物学导论》第3版（Oxford）�JNesse, W.D., Introduction to Mineralogy (3rd ed., Oxford University Press)��id�02d731320cc7�body��|微塑料是小于5毫米的塑料碎片，来自大塑料破碎和日化用品，已遍布海洋、土壤甚至饮用水。كMicroplastics are plastic bits smaller than 5 mm, from broken-up waste and cosmetics, now found in oceans, soil and drinking water.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�045e56716cb0�body�ٍ太阳把地球不同地方晒得冷热不同，空气和水汽到处流动，就带来了各种天气。天气就是大气每天的变化。ٛThe Sun heats different parts of Earth unevenly, and moving air and water vapor create all kinds of weather. Weather is the daily change in the atmosphere.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�135ef305650f�body��~闪电划过时把空气瞬间烧得火热，空气猛地膨胀发出巨响，就是雷声。雷声总是跟在闪电后面。مLightning heats the air in a flash, and the sudden expansion makes a loud boom we call thunder. Thunder always follows the lightning.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�1de68c4e5584�body�ِ地壳分成几块大板块，底下软软的岩流带着它们慢慢漂移，所以地壳一直在动。板块移动也造成地震和火山。٩Earth's crust is split into big plates that float on soft rock below and drift slowly, so the crust is always moving. Their motion also causes earthquakes and volcanoes.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�22eec744c034�body�ل越往高处空气越稀薄，因为大部分空气压在低处，山顶能呼吸的氧气就变少。爬山的人常要慢慢走。ًHigher up the air gets thinner because most of it is pressed down low, leaving less oxygen on the peak. Climbers often move slowly to cope.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�264ead0d896b�body��~它把长江丰富的水，沿着东、中、西三条线路调往缺水的华北和西北，缓解北方“渴”的问题。�nIt transfers abundant Yangtze water via east, middle and west routes to water-short North and Northwest China.�ans��src��'中国水利部《南水北调工程》�OChina Ministry of Water Resources (MWR), South-to-North Water Diversion Project��id�2d4a6861c97e�body�ٖ因为信风把暖水和湿热空气堆在西边，西边空气上升常下雨；东边空气下沉，又干又晴，所以两边天气很不一样。ٝTrade winds pile warm moist air on the west, where it rises and rains; the east has sinking dry air, so it stays clear—making the two sides very different.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�2fdd0177b095�body��u云里正负电越积越多，最后一下子打通放出强光，就是闪电。闪电其实是巨大的电火花。�tClouds build up opposite electric charges until they snap together in a bright flash; that giant spark is lightning.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�3191212314f3�body��i湖泊是陆地低洼处蓄积起来的静止水体，四周被陆地包围，不与海洋直接相连。�IA lake is a body of still water in a land depression, surrounded by land.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�3b2f283f0098�body�ٍ它用透水砖、下凹绿地、蓄水池等，让雨水就地渗入或暂存，下暴雨时不积水、干旱时还能慢慢放出来用。كPermeable pavement, sunken green spaces and tanks let rain soak in or be stored, reducing floods and releasing water in dry spells.�ans��src��C住房和城乡建设部《海绵城市建设技术指南》，2014�hMinistry of Housing and Urban-Rural Development (MOHURD), Sponge City Construction Technical Guide, 2014��id�3cd1bc38dd0e�body��~太阳带电粒子被地球磁场引到南北两极，撞击高空大气发出彩光，所以在极区最容易看到极光。ٜThe solar wind's charged particles are funneled by Earth's magnetic field to the poles, hitting the upper atmosphere to glow—hence auroras near the poles.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�3d0f9da6af14�body��{远古树木流出的树脂把路过的小虫粘住包住，千万年石化成琥珀，虫子就被原样保存了下来。�{Sticky tree resin trapped passing insects and hardened into amber over millions of years, preserving them perfectly inside.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�3eddd279971c�body��u雨水或河水积在低洼的盆地里，水排不出去，就汇成了湖泊。有些湖是冰川挖出来的坑。�Rain or river water collects in low basins where it cannot drain away, forming lakes. Some lakes fill holes carved by glaciers.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�4f100992fca3�body��r雨水带着微弱酸性渗入石灰岩缝隙，一点点把石头溶掉，时间久了就掏出大大的洞穴。قRainwater with a weak acid seeps into cracks in limestone and slowly dissolves the rock, hollowing out big caves over a long time.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�54d6f387f8fc�body�ٖ我国在西北、华北、东北风沙危害大的地方大规模造林，形成一道长长的林带，像长城一样挡住风沙、保护农田。�}Massive tree planting across the windy north builds a long forest belt that blocks sand and shields farms, like a green wall.�ans��src��?国家林业和草原局《三北防护林体系建设工程》�VNational Forestry and Grassland Administration (NFGA), Three-North Shelterbelt Program��id�599edf5a1e6b�body��`云是空气中无数微小的水滴或冰晶聚在一起，飘在高空被人看见的白团。�UA cloud is a visible mass of tiny water droplets or ice crystals floating in the sky.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�5a591023cc5d�body�٥季风就是随季节反转的大风。夏天陆地热得快、空气上升，海上的湿润空气吹来下雨；冬天陆地冷、风从干冷的内陆吹向海。٨A monsoon is a wind that reverses with seasons. In summer the land heats up, drawing moist sea air that brings rain; in winter cold dry inland air blows toward the sea.�ans��src��*王斌《亚洲季风》，Springer，2006�+Wang, B., The Asian Monsoon, Springer, 2006��id�5c4d37436cf0�body��&三种边界分别是：分离型（张裂，板块相互远离，常形成洋中脊）、汇聚型（碰撞或俯冲，板块相互挤压）和转换型（平行错动，如圣安德烈斯断层）。不同类型的边界对应着不同的地质活动，如地震、火山和山脉的形成。�nThe three types are divergent boundaries (plates pull apart, often forming mid-ocean ridges), convergent boundaries (plates collide or one subducts beneath another), and transform boundaries (plates slide past each other horizontally, such as the San Andreas Fault). Each type produces distinct geologic activity such as earthquakes, volcanoes, or mountain building.�ans��src��<Press & Siever,《Understanding Earth》W. H. Freeman 多版�LF. Press and R. Siever, Understanding Earth, W. H. Freeman, various editions��id�630ce5beec30�body�ه下雨前土壤里的细菌会放出一种清香味道，雨点一砸开就把香味散发出来。很多人觉得这味道很好闻。�sTiny soil bacteria release a fresh scent, and raindrops splash it into the air. Many people enjoy that rainy smell.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�647ec5834382�body�٪地球大气约由78%的氮气、21%的氧气和约1%的氩气组成，另有微量的二氧化碳和水汽。氧气供生物呼吸，二氧化碳则参与温室效应。��Earth's atmosphere is about 78% nitrogen, 21% oxygen, and roughly 1% argon, with trace carbon dioxide and water vapor. Oxygen supports respiration, while carbon dioxide drives the greenhouse effect.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�720be85f78eb�body�ي雨水渗进地下存进岩石缝里，成了地下水，平时我们打的井水就来自它。地下水还悄悄补给河流和湿地。ّRain soaks into the ground and is stored in rock cracks as groundwater, which is what wells draw from. It also quietly feeds rivers and wetlands.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�737a2b3426b5�body��~生物死后被泥沙迅速掩埋，硬体里的矿物被地下水慢慢替换成石头，形状和纹路却保留了下来。�yAfter a creature is buried in sediment, groundwater slowly replaces its minerals with rock, keeping the shape and detail.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�755a1c90c85b�body��Q泥土是细碎的土壤和黏土混合水后的可塑状物，干了会变硬。�@Mud is fine soil and clay mixed with water; it hardens when dry.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�75aaeaf84dba�body�ٽ潮汐是海面周期性的升降，主要由月球引力对地球两侧海水的拉伸造成，太阳引力也有贡献。农历初一、十五的大潮便是日月引力叠加的结果。�Tides are the regular rise and fall of the sea surface, caused mainly by the Moon's gravitational pull stretching Earth's oceans, with the Sun adding a smaller effect. Spring tides near new and full moon occur when the Sun and Moon align and reinforce each other.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�78b17bb1310d�body�ِ太阳让海河湖的水蒸发成云，云下雨落回地面，再流回大海，这就是水循环。水就这样在天上地下不停旅行。ٽThe Sun evaporates water from seas and lakes into clouds, the clouds rain down, and the water flows back to the ocean; that is the water cycle. Water keeps traveling between sky and ground.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�7eb36addd531�body��r厄尔尼诺没有固定日历，通常每隔两到七年出现一次，每次可能持续几个月到一年多。�~El Niño has no fixed schedule; it typically appears every two to seven years and can last from several months to over a year.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�7fcc9d50721c�body�ٍ蓝洞是海里下沉的圆形深坑，坑壁陡峭、水极深，阳光中红光被吸收、蓝光散射回来，看起来就蓝得发亮。�~A blue hole is a deep round sea pit with steep walls; red light is absorbed and blue light scatters back, making it glow blue.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�85bc24217c78�body�ِ它被高山四面围住，又离海洋几千公里，湿润海风翻不过山也走不到这里，于是成了我国最干旱的地方之一。قSurrounded by high mountains and thousands of km from the sea, moist winds can't reach it, making it one of China's driest places.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�8f6cdd426028�body�ٮ板块是地球岩石圈被分割成的大块坚硬岩板，浮在塑性流动的上地幔软流圈之上。它们缓慢移动，塑造着大陆、海洋和山脉的分布。��Tectonic plates are the large, rigid slabs into which Earth's lithosphere is broken; they float on the slowly flowing asthenosphere beneath. Their slow motion shapes the distribution of continents, oceans, and mountains.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�9060ed10e845�body�ٱ露点是空气水汽开始凝结的温度，气温越接近露点，相对湿度越高，汗液越难蒸发散热，所以体感闷热。两者差值越小，潮湿感越强。�The dew point is the temperature at which air becomes saturated; the closer the air temperature is to the dew point, the higher the relative humidity and the harder sweat evaporates, so the body feels muggy. A small gap between the two signals strong stickiness.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�920c1e47ddc4�body��u多来自干旱区的戈壁、干涸湖盆和退化土地，强风把细尘卷上高空，能飘到很远的地方。�pMostly from dry gobi, dried lake beds and degraded land; strong winds lift fine dust high and carry it far away.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�96668afe1a3a�body�ً熔岩慢慢冷却收缩时，会沿能量最省的裂缝均匀裂开，自然形成近似六边形的柱状节理，像 Giants Causeway。نAs lava cools and contracts, it cracks along the most efficient pattern, forming near-hexagonal columns like those at Giants Causeway.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�9776408279c7�body��i阳光只能穿透海面上百米，再往下光线几乎全被水吸收，深海便常年漆黑一片。�ySunlight only penetrates the top hundred meters or so; deeper down it is absorbed, leaving the deep sea perpetually dark.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�993fb548919d�body��{高山冰雪融水渗到地下，在沙漠低处冒出泉或汇聚成河，有水的地方草木生长，就成了绿洲。هMeltwater from mountains seeps underground and surfaces as springs or rivers in low spots; where water appears, plants grow—an oasis.�ans��src��3丁曼《物理水文学》，Waveland Press，2015�7Dingman, S.L., Physical Hydrology, Waveland Press, 2015��id�9a2d2522122b�body��{太阳把水面晒热，水分子变成看不见的水汽飘上天空，就是蒸发。晒衣服变干也是这个原因。�wThe Sun warms the water and its molecules rise as invisible vapor; that is evaporation. It is also why wet clothes dry.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�9b124fc66d99�body��{海洋上暖湿空气快速旋转上升，卷成巨大的风暴圈，就形成了飓风。飓风会带来强风和暴雨。ٌWarm, moist ocean air spins upward into a huge rotating storm, and that becomes a hurricane. Hurricanes bring powerful winds and heavy rain.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�9bac65c0b7a8�body��i海底的火山喷发堆出岩石，露出海面就成了岛屿。也有沙子和珊瑚堆出来的岛。�Undersea volcanoes pile up rock until it rises above the sea, forming islands. Some islands are also built from sand and coral.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�9e5bbfcd2111�body��~小行星或彗星高速撞上地表，巨大的冲击力把岩石炸飞、挖出一个碗状凹坑，就形成了陨石坑。ـAn asteroid or comet slamming into the ground at high speed blasts rock away and digs a bowl-shaped pit called an impact crater.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�9f5ab532e22b�body��~科罗拉多河用了几百万年，一点点把高原上的岩石切开，冲出又深又宽的峡谷。这就是大峡谷。�~Over millions of years the Colorado River cut down through high rock and carved the deep, wide gorge we call the Grand Canyon.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�a4ec78f978fa�body��~风、地球自转和海水冷热不同，推动海水在大洋里循环流动，形成洋流。洋流像海洋里的河流。ٔWind, Earth's spin, and differences in water temperature push the sea into looping flows called currents. Currents are like rivers inside the ocean.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�ab5a601844fb�body�ل冰芯是从冰川或冰盖中钻出的长圆柱冰样，一层层冰里封着古代的雪、气泡和灰尘，像地球的日记。يAn ice core is a long cylinder drilled from a glacier or ice sheet; each layer traps old snow, air bubbles and dust like a diary of Earth.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�b07864f3987a�body�٨一部分二氧化碳几年就被植物和海洋吸收，但很大一部分会在大气里停留上百年，甚至更久，所以排出去的碳会“赖着不走”。ٛSome CO2 is absorbed by plants and oceans within years, but a large share lingers in the atmosphere for centuries or more, so emitted carbon sticks around.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�b343b684be8f�body�ٍ岩石有的由冷却的岩浆变来，有的由泥沙压实变来，还有的被高温高压变形。形成方式不同，样子就不同。ْSome rocks come from cooled lava, some from squeezed mud and sand, and others from heat and pressure. Different origins give them different looks.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�b497f6008524�body��{云、冰、雪和地面加起来大约把照到地球的阳光反射掉三成，剩下的才被吸收用来加热地球。�}Clouds, ice, snow, and the ground together reflect about 30% of incoming sunlight; the rest is absorbed and warms the planet.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�b503cb41d371�body�ٍ节气按太阳在天上的位置划分，标出气温、光照的变化节点，农民据此知道何时播种、插秧、收割最合适。قThe terms mark the sun's position and thus shifts in temperature and daylight, telling farmers when to sow, transplant or harvest.�ans��src��K美国海军天文台《天文年历》（太阳黄经与二十四节气）�WUS Naval Observatory, The Astronomical Almanac (solar longitude and the 24 solar terms)��id�b6adc843e713�body���从地面向上依次为对流层（天气发生处）、平流层（含臭氧层、气温随高度上升）、中间层、热层和外层（散逸层）。绝大多数天气现象都发生在最底部的对流层。�From the surface upward they are the troposphere (where weather happens), the stratosphere (contains the ozone layer and warms with height), the mesosphere, the thermosphere, and the exosphere. Almost all weather occurs in the lowest layer, the troposphere.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�b7f3f6caca43�body��u夏天太阳照射角度高、白天长，地面接收热量多；冬天太阳低斜、白天短，接收热量少。مIn summer the sun is high and days are long, so the ground gets more heat; in winter the sun is low and days short, giving less heat.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�b97e44fc02c7�body�ٴ开阔大洋海水的平均盐度约为千分之35，也就是约3.5%的溶解盐分，以氯化钠为主。不同海域因蒸发、降水和径流差异，盐度会有所不同。��Open ocean seawater averages about 35 parts per thousand, roughly 3.5% dissolved salts, mostly sodium chloride. Salinity varies by region because of differences in evaporation, rainfall, and river input.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�bc1c0f28a4b5�body�ٖ动物或植物死后沉到泥沙里，硬部分被矿物慢慢替换，就变成了石头里的化石。化石帮我们认识很久以前的生物。ٝAfter a plant or animal dies and sinks into mud, its hard parts are slowly replaced by minerals and turn to stone. Fossils help us learn about life long ago.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�bf62a16ad96b�body���环太平洋火环是环绕太平洋边缘的一条带状区域，集中了大量板块边界，因此火山和地震极为频繁。美国地质调查局指出，地球上约75%的活火山和约90%的地震都发生在这一区域。�The Ring of Fire is a horseshoe-shaped belt around the edges of the Pacific Ocean where many plate boundaries meet, making volcanoes and earthquakes extremely frequent. The USGS notes that about 75% of the world's active volcanoes and about 90% of its earthquakes occur there.�ans��src��<Press & Siever,《Understanding Earth》W. H. Freeman 多版�LF. Press and R. Siever, Understanding Earth, W. H. Freeman, various editions��id�c09a50bf01d7�body��`主要来自海水晒盐和地下盐矿，海水蒸发后留下氯化钠结晶，就是食盐。نMainly from evaporating seawater and underground salt mines; after seawater evaporates, sodium chloride crystals remain as table salt.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�c1929e7a4076�body��r含碳酸钙的水从洞顶滴下，水分蒸发后石灰质一点点淀积，向下长成冰锥状的石钟乳。ٍWater rich in calcium carbonate drips from the ceiling; as it evaporates the mineral builds up, growing downward into spike-like stalactites.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�c745a693862c�body�ف因为地球在自转，会让运动的物体发生偏转，北半球的偏转方向是向右，所以洋流和风都向右拐。هBecause Earth rotates, which deflects moving things to the right in the Northern Hemisphere, so both winds and currents bend rightward.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�c7ec3104272f�body��f云在空中，雾贴近地面，其实都是悬浮的小水滴，只是出现的位置高低不同。�vClouds are in the sky and fog is near the ground, but both are suspended tiny water droplets differing only in height.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�ccfa96aba11e�body��~大量抽取地下水或油气，会让地下空隙塌陷，地面就一点点下沉，雅加达、墨西哥城都很明显。وPumping out too much groundwater or oil leaves empty space underground that collapses, so the land sinks, as in Jakarta and Mexico City.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�cea693e553ed�body��{夜里草叶表面变很冷，空气里的水汽直接冻成小冰晶，就是霜。霜常在晴朗寒冷的早晨出现。٠At night the grass gets very cold and the water vapor in the air freezes straight into tiny ice crystals; that is frost. Frost shows up on clear, cold mornings.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�d011fc9081e7�body��u土壤颜色取决于矿物成分和含水量，比如富铁的红土、含腐殖质的黑土、缺氧的蓝灰土。�{Soil color depends on minerals and moisture, e.g. iron-rich red soil, organic black soil, and oxygen-poor bluish-grey soil.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�df0e48159999�body��臭氧层位于平流层中（约15–35公里高），能吸收大部分有害的太阳紫外线（UV-B）。它像一把“防晒伞”保护地面生物免受晒伤、皮肤癌和生态系统损害；1987年《蒙特利尔议定书》正是为了限制消耗臭氧的物质。�9The ozone layer lies in the stratosphere (about 15–35 km up) and absorbs most of the Sun's harmful ultraviolet (UV-B) radiation. It acts like a 'sunscreen' protecting life on the surface from sunburn, skin cancer, and ecosystem damage; the 1987 Montreal Protocol was created to limit ozone-depleting substances.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�e0fa58aa6a56�body��c白天热晚上冷、水结冰膨胀、植物根钻缝和酸雨都会让岩石裂开变成碎屑。�_Daily heating and cooling, freezing water, plant roots and acid rain crack rock into fragments.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�e5c6c158fbff�body��龙卷风是小尺度、生命周期短（几分钟到一小时）、由强雷暴生成的猛烈旋转气柱，常出现在陆地上。飓风（热带气旋）是大尺度、可持续数日、在温暖海面上形成的旋转风暴系统，直径可达数百公里。�A tornado is a small, short-lived (minutes to an hour) violent spinning column spawned by severe thunderstorms, usually over land. A hurricane (tropical cyclone) is a large, long-lasting (days) rotating storm system that forms over warm ocean waters and can span hundreds of kilometers.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�e69191609a20�body�ٴ蒸发是太阳加热使江河湖海的水变成水汽升入空气的过程。水汽随后凝结成云、以降水返回地面，再流回水体，构成不断循环的水循环。�Evaporation is the process by which the Sun's heat turns water from rivers, lakes, and oceans into vapor that rises into the air. The vapor later condenses into clouds, falls as precipitation, and flows back to the water bodies, completing the cycling of water.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�earth_25_006�body��2恰恰相反,光和雷声同时出发,只是速度天差地别:光每秒约跑三十万公里,声音每秒只走约三百四十米。看到闪电就数秒,数出的秒数乘以三百四十米,大约就是雷电离你的距离。记住:只要能听见雷声,雷电就可能伤到你,要尽快进屋躲避。��Quite the opposite — flash and thunder start together but race at wildly different speeds: light covers about three hundred thousand kilometers per second while sound manages only about three hundred forty meters. Count seconds after the flash and multiply by three hundred forty to gauge how far away the storm is. Remember: if you can hear thunder, lightning is close enough to hurt you — get indoors fast.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版地球分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�VTen Thousand Whys: Earth volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�earth_25_010�body��地下的岩浆就像天然大锅炉:雨水和地下水渗进岩缝,被热的岩石加热后顺着裂隙涌回地面,就成了温泉。有的温泉能煮熟鸡蛋,水里还溶解着矿物质,泡完皮肤滑滑的。火山多的地方温泉也多,因为地下锅炉更近。�Underground magma works like a natural boiler: rain seeps down cracks, gets heated by hot rock and rises back up as hot springs. Some can boil eggs, carrying dissolved minerals that leave skin silky. Volcanic regions bubble with springs because their furnaces sit nearer.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版地球分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�VTen Thousand Whys: Earth volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�edf45495ecef�body�ف秋天变冷变干，树把叶子里的养分收回，叶子失去绿素就脱落，好省水过冬。这是树的过冬办法。٢In cold, dry autumn the tree pulls nutrients back from its leaves, the green fades, and the leaves drop to save water for winter. It is the tree's way to survive.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�ee92d107c388�body��Z沙子是岩石被风和流水磨碎成的细小颗粒，主要成分是坚硬的石英。�9Sand is rock ground into tiny grains, mostly hard quartz.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�ef6852c0e710�body�ف白云亮亮的，会把一部分太阳光直接弹回天上，地面接收到的阳光变少，所以云底下会凉快一些。�wBright white clouds bounce part of the sunlight back to space, so the ground gets less sun and feels cooler underneath.�ans��src��D卢特根斯、塔巴克《大气：科学导论》，Pearson，2011�\Lutgens, F.K. & Tarbuck, E.J., The Atmosphere: An Introduction to Meteorology, Pearson, 2011��id�f30a5053684b�body��f土壤是岩石风化后的碎屑混上枯枝落叶变成的黑色疏松表层，植物靠它生长。�WSoil is weathered rock mixed with decayed plants, a loose dark layer where plants grow.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�f93369f1ba91�body��o雨水雪水渗入地下，积存在岩石和沙土的空隙里，就是地下水，井和水泉都来自它。ـRain and snow soak into the ground and collect in spaces in rock and soil; that is groundwater, the source of wells and springs.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�fd483aaf6131�body�ه白天太阳光把整片天空照亮，星星的光太弱就被盖住了，所以我们白天看不见星。其实星星一直都在。وDaytime sunlight brightens the whole sky and drowns out the faint starlight, so we cannot see stars. The stars are actually still there.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997